  ('cebuano-a2-practical-7', 'cebuano-a2-practical-7-070-sakto-ang-timpla', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Dziękuję, to jest bardzo smaczne. Przyprawy są w sam raz.', '63bda96817a0588ed3980cb4994f86c30ac8ee8ae40e7459bb02c62b93655b6f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-7', 'cebuano-a2-practical-7-070-sakto-ang-timpla', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Obrigado, isso está muito saboroso. O tempero está na medida certa.', '63bda96817a0588ed3980cb4994f86c30ac8ee8ae40e7459bb02c62b93655b6f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-7', 'cebuano-a2-practical-7-070-sakto-ang-timpla', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Спасибо, это очень вкусно. Приправа в самый раз.', '63bda96817a0588ed3980cb4994f86c30ac8ee8ae40e7459bb02c62b93655b6f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-7', 'cebuano-a2-practical-7-070-sakto-ang-timpla', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Gracias, esto está muy sabroso. El sazón está justo.', '63bda96817a0588ed3980cb4994f86c30ac8ee8ae40e7459bb02c62b93655b6f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-071-nindot-kaayo-uy', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Mao ba? Nindot kaayo na, uy! Maayo gyud para nimo.', 'f1e45fb1138a2abac6875bbaff0a2b46bb2501ef336627b074c84e42331e6100'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-071-nindot-kaayo-uy', 'bright', 'English', 'Really? That is great news! That is very good for you.', 'f1e45fb1138a2abac6875bbaff0a2b46bb2501ef336627b074c84e42331e6100'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-071-nindot-kaayo-uy', 'bright', 'French', 'Vraiment ? C''est une excellente nouvelle ! C''est très bien pour vous.', 'f1e45fb1138a2abac6875bbaff0a2b46bb2501ef336627b074c84e42331e6100'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-071-nindot-kaayo-uy', 'bright', 'German', 'Wirklich? Das sind tolle Neuigkeiten! Das ist wirklich gut für dich.', 'f1e45fb1138a2abac6875bbaff0a2b46bb2501ef336627b074c84e42331e6100'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-071-nindot-kaayo-uy', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Benarkah? Itu berita bagus! Itu sangat baik untukmu.', 'f1e45fb1138a2abac6875bbaff0a2b46bb2501ef336627b074c84e42331e6100'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-071-nindot-kaayo-uy', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Davvero? Questa è un''ottima notizia! È molto bello per te.', 'f1e45fb1138a2abac6875bbaff0a2b46bb2501ef336627b074c84e42331e6100'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-071-nindot-kaayo-uy', 'bright', 'Japanese', '本当ですか？それは素晴らしいニュースです！あなたにとってとても良いことです。', 'f1e45fb1138a2abac6875bbaff0a2b46bb2501ef336627b074c84e42331e6100'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-071-nindot-kaayo-uy', 'bright', 'Korean', '정말요? 정말 좋은 소식이네요! 당신에게 정말 잘 됐어요.', 'f1e45fb1138a2abac6875bbaff0a2b46bb2501ef336627b074c84e42331e6100'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-071-nindot-kaayo-uy', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Naprawdę? To wspaniała wiadomość! To bardzo dobrze dla Ciebie.', 'f1e45fb1138a2abac6875bbaff0a2b46bb2501ef336627b074c84e42331e6100'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-071-nindot-kaayo-uy', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Sério? Essa é uma ótima notícia! Isso é muito bom para você.', 'f1e45fb1138a2abac6875bbaff0a2b46bb2501ef336627b074c84e42331e6100'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-071-nindot-kaayo-uy', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Правда? Это отличная новость! Это очень хорошо для тебя.', 'f1e45fb1138a2abac6875bbaff0a2b46bb2501ef336627b074c84e42331e6100'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-071-nindot-kaayo-uy', 'bright', 'Spanish', '¿De verdad? ¡Esa es una gran noticia! Eso es muy bueno para ti.', 'f1e45fb1138a2abac6875bbaff0a2b46bb2501ef336627b074c84e42331e6100'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-072-init-lagi-bugnaw-tubig', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Init lagi kaayo karon. Kinahanglan ko og bugnaw nga tubig.', '68286d78748c2ca26f1eea186d68c7ab8f55e2589ec2aa445dcc46dbec1e4d3f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-072-init-lagi-bugnaw-tubig', 'bright', 'English', 'It really is hot today. I need cold water.', '68286d78748c2ca26f1eea186d68c7ab8f55e2589ec2aa445dcc46dbec1e4d3f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-072-init-lagi-bugnaw-tubig', 'bright', 'French', 'Il fait vraiment très chaud aujourd''hui. J''ai besoin d''eau froide.', '68286d78748c2ca26f1eea186d68c7ab8f55e2589ec2aa445dcc46dbec1e4d3f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-072-init-lagi-bugnaw-tubig', 'bright', 'German', 'Es ist heute wirklich heiß. Ich brauche kaltes Wasser.', '68286d78748c2ca26f1eea186d68c7ab8f55e2589ec2aa445dcc46dbec1e4d3f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-072-init-lagi-bugnaw-tubig', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Hari ini benar-benar panas. Saya butuh air dingin.', '68286d78748c2ca26f1eea186d68c7ab8f55e2589ec2aa445dcc46dbec1e4d3f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-072-init-lagi-bugnaw-tubig', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Fa davvero molto caldo oggi. Ho bisogno di acqua fredda.', '68286d78748c2ca26f1eea186d68c7ab8f55e2589ec2aa445dcc46dbec1e4d3f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-072-init-lagi-bugnaw-tubig', 'bright', 'Japanese', '今日は本当に暑いです。冷たい水が必要です。', '68286d78748c2ca26f1eea186d68c7ab8f55e2589ec2aa445dcc46dbec1e4d3f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-072-init-lagi-bugnaw-tubig', 'bright', 'Korean', '오늘 정말 덥네요. 시원한 물이 필요해요.', '68286d78748c2ca26f1eea186d68c7ab8f55e2589ec2aa445dcc46dbec1e4d3f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-072-init-lagi-bugnaw-tubig', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Naprawdę jest dziś gorąco. Potrzebuję zimnej wody.', '68286d78748c2ca26f1eea186d68c7ab8f55e2589ec2aa445dcc46dbec1e4d3f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-072-init-lagi-bugnaw-tubig', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Está realmente muito quente hoje. Preciso de água fria.', '68286d78748c2ca26f1eea186d68c7ab8f55e2589ec2aa445dcc46dbec1e4d3f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-072-init-lagi-bugnaw-tubig', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Сегодня действительно очень жарко. Мне нужна холодная вода.', '68286d78748c2ca26f1eea186d68c7ab8f55e2589ec2aa445dcc46dbec1e4d3f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-072-init-lagi-bugnaw-tubig', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Realmente hace mucho calor hoy. Necesito agua fría.', '68286d78748c2ca26f1eea186d68c7ab8f55e2589ec2aa445dcc46dbec1e4d3f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-073-wala-katulog-katulgon', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Wala ko katulog og maayo kagabii. Katulgon kaayo ko karon.', '7bb21579dabfea2eb52fd1fed6b9496be75e10536d3eba17105b599f4b988c90'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-073-wala-katulog-katulgon', 'bright', 'English', 'I did not sleep well last night. I am very sleepy today.', '7bb21579dabfea2eb52fd1fed6b9496be75e10536d3eba17105b599f4b988c90'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-073-wala-katulog-katulgon', 'bright', 'French', 'Je n''ai pas bien dormi la nuit dernière. Je suis très fatigué aujourd''hui.', '7bb21579dabfea2eb52fd1fed6b9496be75e10536d3eba17105b599f4b988c90'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-073-wala-katulog-katulgon', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe letzte Nacht nicht gut geschlafen. Heute bin ich sehr schläfrig.', '7bb21579dabfea2eb52fd1fed6b9496be75e10536d3eba17105b599f4b988c90'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-073-wala-katulog-katulgon', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Aku tidak tidur nyenyak tadi malam. Aku sangat mengantuk hari ini.', '7bb21579dabfea2eb52fd1fed6b9496be75e10536d3eba17105b599f4b988c90'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-073-wala-katulog-katulgon', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Non ho dormito bene la scorsa notte. Oggi ho molta sonnolenza.', '7bb21579dabfea2eb52fd1fed6b9496be75e10536d3eba17105b599f4b988c90'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-073-wala-katulog-katulgon', 'bright', 'Japanese', '昨夜はよく眠れませんでした。今日はとても眠いです。', '7bb21579dabfea2eb52fd1fed6b9496be75e10536d3eba17105b599f4b988c90'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-073-wala-katulog-katulgon', 'bright', 'Korean', '어젯밤에 잠을 잘 못 잤어요. 오늘 너무 졸려요.', '7bb21579dabfea2eb52fd1fed6b9496be75e10536d3eba17105b599f4b988c90'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-073-wala-katulog-katulgon', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Nie spałem dobrze zeszłej nocy. Jestem bardzo senny dzisiaj.', '7bb21579dabfea2eb52fd1fed6b9496be75e10536d3eba17105b599f4b988c90'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-073-wala-katulog-katulgon', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Não dormi bem noite passada. Estou com muito sono hoje.', '7bb21579dabfea2eb52fd1fed6b9496be75e10536d3eba17105b599f4b988c90'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-073-wala-katulog-katulgon', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я плохо спал прошлой ночью. Сегодня я очень сонный.', '7bb21579dabfea2eb52fd1fed6b9496be75e10536d3eba17105b599f4b988c90'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-073-wala-katulog-katulgon', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'No dormí bien anoche. Tengo mucho sueño hoy.', '7bb21579dabfea2eb52fd1fed6b9496be75e10536d3eba17105b599f4b988c90'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-074-daghang-trabaho-kaya-ra', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Daghan kaayo kog trabaho karong semanaha, pero kaya ra.', 'e1a0dbb13340d7bd7dd6fd4a267a99079c3dd04178458d94e6e7a3ac1dc28da7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-074-daghang-trabaho-kaya-ra', 'bright', 'English', 'I have a lot of work this week, but I can manage.', 'e1a0dbb13340d7bd7dd6fd4a267a99079c3dd04178458d94e6e7a3ac1dc28da7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-074-daghang-trabaho-kaya-ra', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai beaucoup de travail cette semaine, mais je peux gérer.', 'e1a0dbb13340d7bd7dd6fd4a267a99079c3dd04178458d94e6e7a3ac1dc28da7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-074-daghang-trabaho-kaya-ra', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe diese Woche sehr viel Arbeit, aber ich komme zurecht.', 'e1a0dbb13340d7bd7dd6fd4a267a99079c3dd04178458d94e6e7a3ac1dc28da7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-074-daghang-trabaho-kaya-ra', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya punya banyak pekerjaan minggu ini, tetapi saya bisa mengatasinya.', 'e1a0dbb13340d7bd7dd6fd4a267a99079c3dd04178458d94e6e7a3ac1dc28da7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-074-daghang-trabaho-kaya-ra', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho molto lavoro questa settimana, ma riesco a gestirlo.', 'e1a0dbb13340d7bd7dd6fd4a267a99079c3dd04178458d94e6e7a3ac1dc28da7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-074-daghang-trabaho-kaya-ra', 'bright', 'Japanese', '今週は仕事がたくさんありますが、なんとかこなせます。', 'e1a0dbb13340d7bd7dd6fd4a267a99079c3dd04178458d94e6e7a3ac1dc28da7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-074-daghang-trabaho-kaya-ra', 'bright', 'Korean', '이번 주에 일이 많지만, 관리할 수 있어요.', 'e1a0dbb13340d7bd7dd6fd4a267a99079c3dd04178458d94e6e7a3ac1dc28da7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-074-daghang-trabaho-kaya-ra', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Mam dużo pracy w tym tygodniu, ale sobie poradzę.', 'e1a0dbb13340d7bd7dd6fd4a267a99079c3dd04178458d94e6e7a3ac1dc28da7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-074-daghang-trabaho-kaya-ra', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Tenho muito trabalho esta semana, mas consigo dar conta.', 'e1a0dbb13340d7bd7dd6fd4a267a99079c3dd04178458d94e6e7a3ac1dc28da7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-074-daghang-trabaho-kaya-ra', 'bright', 'Russian', 'У меня много работы на этой неделе, но я справлюсь.', 'e1a0dbb13340d7bd7dd6fd4a267a99079c3dd04178458d94e6e7a3ac1dc28da7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-074-daghang-trabaho-kaya-ra', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Tengo mucho trabajo esta semana, pero puedo con ello.', 'e1a0dbb13340d7bd7dd6fd4a267a99079c3dd04178458d94e6e7a3ac1dc28da7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-075-ulan-na-pud-bitaw', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Bitaw, ulan na pud. Magdala ko og payong unya.', '9bbce65a9b6ceebea5e3ab012f53aa674f3ab8bc0f91328ecf79b685ede24ee8'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-075-ulan-na-pud-bitaw', 'bright', 'English', 'It really is raining again. I will bring an umbrella later.', '9bbce65a9b6ceebea5e3ab012f53aa674f3ab8bc0f91328ecf79b685ede24ee8'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-075-ulan-na-pud-bitaw', 'bright', 'French', 'Il pleut vraiment encore. J''apporterai un parapluie plus tard.', '9bbce65a9b6ceebea5e3ab012f53aa674f3ab8bc0f91328ecf79b685ede24ee8'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-075-ulan-na-pud-bitaw', 'bright', 'German', 'Stimmt, es regnet schon wieder. Ich nehme später einen Schirm mit.', '9bbce65a9b6ceebea5e3ab012f53aa674f3ab8bc0f91328ecf79b685ede24ee8'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-075-ulan-na-pud-bitaw', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Benar-benar hujan lagi. Nanti aku akan membawa payung.', '9bbce65a9b6ceebea5e3ab012f53aa674f3ab8bc0f91328ecf79b685ede24ee8'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-075-ulan-na-pud-bitaw', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Sta davvero piovendo di nuovo. Porterò un ombrello più tardi.', '9bbce65a9b6ceebea5e3ab012f53aa674f3ab8bc0f91328ecf79b685ede24ee8'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-075-ulan-na-pud-bitaw', 'bright', 'Japanese', '本当にまた雨が降っています。後で傘を持って行きます。', '9bbce65a9b6ceebea5e3ab012f53aa674f3ab8bc0f91328ecf79b685ede24ee8'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-075-ulan-na-pud-bitaw', 'bright', 'Korean', '정말 또 비가 오네요. 나중에 우산을 가져올게요.', '9bbce65a9b6ceebea5e3ab012f53aa674f3ab8bc0f91328ecf79b685ede24ee8'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-075-ulan-na-pud-bitaw', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Naprawdę znowu pada deszcz. Później przyniosę parasol.', '9bbce65a9b6ceebea5e3ab012f53aa674f3ab8bc0f91328ecf79b685ede24ee8'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-075-ulan-na-pud-bitaw', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Está chovendo de novo mesmo. Vou trazer um guarda-chuva mais tarde.', '9bbce65a9b6ceebea5e3ab012f53aa674f3ab8bc0f91328ecf79b685ede24ee8'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-075-ulan-na-pud-bitaw', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Действительно, снова идет дождь. Я принесу зонт позже.', '9bbce65a9b6ceebea5e3ab012f53aa674f3ab8bc0f91328ecf79b685ede24ee8'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-075-ulan-na-pud-bitaw', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Realmente está lloviendo de nuevo. Traeré un paraguas más tarde.', '9bbce65a9b6ceebea5e3ab012f53aa674f3ab8bc0f91328ecf79b685ede24ee8'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-kaayo', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Sayang kaayo. Maayo ra unta ang tanan.', '302108a843776668c67fcf01f6111c4f55ebdb3987f0f153c54e6d4e9ace3ffd'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-kaayo', 'bright', 'English', 'What a shame. I hope everything else is all right.', '302108a843776668c67fcf01f6111c4f55ebdb3987f0f153c54e6d4e9ace3ffd'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-kaayo', 'bright', 'French', 'Quel dommage. J''espère que tout le reste va bien.', '302108a843776668c67fcf01f6111c4f55ebdb3987f0f153c54e6d4e9ace3ffd'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-kaayo', 'bright', 'German', 'Wie schade. Hoffentlich ist sonst alles in Ordnung.', '302108a843776668c67fcf01f6111c4f55ebdb3987f0f153c54e6d4e9ace3ffd'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-kaayo', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Sayang sekali. Semoga semuanya baik-baik saja.', '302108a843776668c67fcf01f6111c4f55ebdb3987f0f153c54e6d4e9ace3ffd'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-kaayo', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Che peccato. Spero che tutto il resto vada bene.', '302108a843776668c67fcf01f6111c4f55ebdb3987f0f153c54e6d4e9ace3ffd'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-kaayo', 'bright', 'Japanese', '残念です。他のことはすべて大丈夫だといいのですが。', '302108a843776668c67fcf01f6111c4f55ebdb3987f0f153c54e6d4e9ace3ffd'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-kaayo', 'bright', 'Korean', '정말 안됐네요. 다른 모든 것은 괜찮기를 바랍니다.', '302108a843776668c67fcf01f6111c4f55ebdb3987f0f153c54e6d4e9ace3ffd'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-kaayo', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Szkoda. Mam nadzieję, że wszystko inne jest w porządku.', '302108a843776668c67fcf01f6111c4f55ebdb3987f0f153c54e6d4e9ace3ffd'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-kaayo', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Que pena. Espero que todo o resto esteja bem.', '302108a843776668c67fcf01f6111c4f55ebdb3987f0f153c54e6d4e9ace3ffd'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-kaayo', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Какая жалость. Надеюсь, все остальное в порядке.', '302108a843776668c67fcf01f6111c4f55ebdb3987f0f153c54e6d4e9ace3ffd'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-kaayo', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Qué lástima. Espero que todo lo demás esté bien.', '302108a843776668c67fcf01f6111c4f55ebdb3987f0f153c54e6d4e9ace3ffd'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-077-lingaw-ang-mga-adlaw', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Maayo ra kaayo. Lingaw kaayo ko karon.', '451ca47acda67f0f10b4aa7ff1370ce504e0ad0ba61a0b3e01c7542fa748994f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-077-lingaw-ang-mga-adlaw', 'bright', 'English', 'I am doing pretty well. I am having a lot of fun now.', '451ca47acda67f0f10b4aa7ff1370ce504e0ad0ba61a0b3e01c7542fa748994f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-077-lingaw-ang-mga-adlaw', 'bright', 'French', 'Je vais plutôt bien. Je m''amuse beaucoup maintenant.', '451ca47acda67f0f10b4aa7ff1370ce504e0ad0ba61a0b3e01c7542fa748994f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-077-lingaw-ang-mga-adlaw', 'bright', 'German', 'Mir geht es ziemlich gut. Ich habe gerade viel Spaß.', '451ca47acda67f0f10b4aa7ff1370ce504e0ad0ba61a0b3e01c7542fa748994f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-077-lingaw-ang-mga-adlaw', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya baik-baik saja. Saya sangat bersenang-senang sekarang.', '451ca47acda67f0f10b4aa7ff1370ce504e0ad0ba61a0b3e01c7542fa748994f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-077-lingaw-ang-mga-adlaw', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Sto abbastanza bene. Mi sto divertendo molto ora.', '451ca47acda67f0f10b4aa7ff1370ce504e0ad0ba61a0b3e01c7542fa748994f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-077-lingaw-ang-mga-adlaw', 'bright', 'Japanese', '私はかなり元気です。今、とても楽しんでいます。', '451ca47acda67f0f10b4aa7ff1370ce504e0ad0ba61a0b3e01c7542fa748994f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-077-lingaw-ang-mga-adlaw', 'bright', 'Korean', '저는 꽤 잘 지내고 있어요. 지금 아주 즐겁게 지내고 있어요.', '451ca47acda67f0f10b4aa7ff1370ce504e0ad0ba61a0b3e01c7542fa748994f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-077-lingaw-ang-mga-adlaw', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Mam się całkiem dobrze. Teraz świetnie się bawię.', '451ca47acda67f0f10b4aa7ff1370ce504e0ad0ba61a0b3e01c7542fa748994f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-077-lingaw-ang-mga-adlaw', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Estou indo muito bem. Estou me divertindo muito agora.', '451ca47acda67f0f10b4aa7ff1370ce504e0ad0ba61a0b3e01c7542fa748994f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-077-lingaw-ang-mga-adlaw', 'bright', 'Russian', 'У меня все довольно хорошо. Мне сейчас очень весело.', '451ca47acda67f0f10b4aa7ff1370ce504e0ad0ba61a0b3e01c7542fa748994f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-077-lingaw-ang-mga-adlaw', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Estoy bastante bien. Me estoy divirtiendo mucho ahora.', '451ca47acda67f0f10b4aa7ff1370ce504e0ad0ba61a0b3e01c7542fa748994f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-078-bitaw-lipay-ko', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Bitaw, maayo kaayo! Lipay gyud ko para nimo.', '87c268bbdd3092cc86cc52ad3e29bb99d530176791af8fdc047fe3f62922652d'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-078-bitaw-lipay-ko', 'bright', 'English', 'Really, that is wonderful! I am very happy for you.', '87c268bbdd3092cc86cc52ad3e29bb99d530176791af8fdc047fe3f62922652d'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-078-bitaw-lipay-ko', 'bright', 'French', 'Vraiment, c''est merveilleux ! Je suis très heureux pour vous.', '87c268bbdd3092cc86cc52ad3e29bb99d530176791af8fdc047fe3f62922652d'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-078-bitaw-lipay-ko', 'bright', 'German', 'Wirklich, das ist großartig! Ich freue mich sehr für dich.', '87c268bbdd3092cc86cc52ad3e29bb99d530176791af8fdc047fe3f62922652d'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-078-bitaw-lipay-ko', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Benar, itu luar biasa! Aku sangat senang untukmu.', '87c268bbdd3092cc86cc52ad3e29bb99d530176791af8fdc047fe3f62922652d'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-078-bitaw-lipay-ko', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Davvero, è meraviglioso! Sono molto felice per te.', '87c268bbdd3092cc86cc52ad3e29bb99d530176791af8fdc047fe3f62922652d'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-078-bitaw-lipay-ko', 'bright', 'Japanese', '本当に、それは素晴らしいです！あなたのためにとても嬉しいです。', '87c268bbdd3092cc86cc52ad3e29bb99d530176791af8fdc047fe3f62922652d'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-078-bitaw-lipay-ko', 'bright', 'Korean', '정말 멋지네요! 정말 기뻐요.', '87c268bbdd3092cc86cc52ad3e29bb99d530176791af8fdc047fe3f62922652d'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-078-bitaw-lipay-ko', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Naprawdę, to wspaniale! Bardzo się cieszę z Twojego powodu.', '87c268bbdd3092cc86cc52ad3e29bb99d530176791af8fdc047fe3f62922652d'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-078-bitaw-lipay-ko', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Realmente, isso é maravilhoso! Fico muito feliz por você.', '87c268bbdd3092cc86cc52ad3e29bb99d530176791af8fdc047fe3f62922652d'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-078-bitaw-lipay-ko', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Действительно, это замечательно! Я очень рад за вас.', '87c268bbdd3092cc86cc52ad3e29bb99d530176791af8fdc047fe3f62922652d'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-078-bitaw-lipay-ko', 'bright', 'Spanish', '¡Realmente, eso es maravilloso! Me alegro mucho por ti.', '87c268bbdd3092cc86cc52ad3e29bb99d530176791af8fdc047fe3f62922652d'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-079-bugnaw-ulan-buntag', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Bugnaw ug ulan karong buntag. Kinahanglan kog init nga kape.', 'a644d1ccc294a15d4ad8a915bf812b14dfc4987212ff82f9b7e6f5a010d7c3c6'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-079-bugnaw-ulan-buntag', 'bright', 'English', 'It is cold and rainy this morning. I need hot coffee.', 'a644d1ccc294a15d4ad8a915bf812b14dfc4987212ff82f9b7e6f5a010d7c3c6'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-079-bugnaw-ulan-buntag', 'bright', 'French', 'Il fait froid et il pleut ce matin. J''ai besoin de café chaud.', 'a644d1ccc294a15d4ad8a915bf812b14dfc4987212ff82f9b7e6f5a010d7c3c6'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-079-bugnaw-ulan-buntag', 'bright', 'German', 'Heute Morgen ist es kalt und regnerisch. Ich brauche heißen Kaffee.', 'a644d1ccc294a15d4ad8a915bf812b14dfc4987212ff82f9b7e6f5a010d7c3c6'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-079-bugnaw-ulan-buntag', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Pagi ini dingin dan hujan. Saya butuh kopi panas.', 'a644d1ccc294a15d4ad8a915bf812b14dfc4987212ff82f9b7e6f5a010d7c3c6'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-079-bugnaw-ulan-buntag', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Stamattina fa freddo e piove. Ho bisogno di caffè caldo.', 'a644d1ccc294a15d4ad8a915bf812b14dfc4987212ff82f9b7e6f5a010d7c3c6'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-079-bugnaw-ulan-buntag', 'bright', 'Japanese', '今朝は寒くて雨が降っています。熱いコーヒーが必要です。', 'a644d1ccc294a15d4ad8a915bf812b14dfc4987212ff82f9b7e6f5a010d7c3c6'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-079-bugnaw-ulan-buntag', 'bright', 'Korean', '오늘 아침은 춥고 비가 와요. 따뜻한 커피가 필요해요.', 'a644d1ccc294a15d4ad8a915bf812b14dfc4987212ff82f9b7e6f5a010d7c3c6'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-079-bugnaw-ulan-buntag', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Jest zimno i pada deszcz dzisiejszego ranka. Potrzebuję gorącej kawy.', 'a644d1ccc294a15d4ad8a915bf812b14dfc4987212ff82f9b7e6f5a010d7c3c6'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-079-bugnaw-ulan-buntag', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Está frio e chuvoso esta manhã. Preciso de café quente.', 'a644d1ccc294a15d4ad8a915bf812b14dfc4987212ff82f9b7e6f5a010d7c3c6'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-079-bugnaw-ulan-buntag', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Сегодня утром холодно и дождливо. Мне нужен горячий кофе.', 'a644d1ccc294a15d4ad8a915bf812b14dfc4987212ff82f9b7e6f5a010d7c3c6'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-079-bugnaw-ulan-buntag', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Está frío y lluvioso esta mañana. Necesito café caliente.', 'a644d1ccc294a15d4ad8a915bf812b14dfc4987212ff82f9b7e6f5a010d7c3c6'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-080-nindot-adlaw-istorya', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nindot nga adlaw karon, no? Lingaw kaayo ang istorya.', '2b0836c57206be9e91f378c6418c72f4cbb349366557b65e32045d234583358f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-080-nindot-adlaw-istorya', 'bright', 'English', 'It is a lovely day today, right? The conversation is very enjoyable.', '2b0836c57206be9e91f378c6418c72f4cbb349366557b65e32045d234583358f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-080-nindot-adlaw-istorya', 'bright', 'French', 'C''est une belle journée aujourd''hui, n''est-ce pas ? La conversation est très agréable.', '2b0836c57206be9e91f378c6418c72f4cbb349366557b65e32045d234583358f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-080-nindot-adlaw-istorya', 'bright', 'German', 'Heute ist ein schöner Tag, oder? Das Gespräch ist sehr unterhaltsam.', '2b0836c57206be9e91f378c6418c72f4cbb349366557b65e32045d234583358f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-080-nindot-adlaw-istorya', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Hari ini hari yang indah, bukan? Percakapannya sangat menyenangkan.', '2b0836c57206be9e91f378c6418c72f4cbb349366557b65e32045d234583358f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-080-nindot-adlaw-istorya', 'bright', 'Italian', 'È una bella giornata oggi, vero? La conversazione è molto piacevole.', '2b0836c57206be9e91f378c6418c72f4cbb349366557b65e32045d234583358f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-080-nindot-adlaw-istorya', 'bright', 'Japanese', '今日は素敵な日ですね？会話はとても楽しいです。', '2b0836c57206be9e91f378c6418c72f4cbb349366557b65e32045d234583358f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-080-nindot-adlaw-istorya', 'bright', 'Korean', '오늘 정말 좋은 날씨죠? 대화가 아주 즐거워요.', '2b0836c57206be9e91f378c6418c72f4cbb349366557b65e32045d234583358f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-080-nindot-adlaw-istorya', 'bright', 'Polish', 'To piękny dzień dzisiaj, prawda? Rozmowa jest bardzo przyjemna.', '2b0836c57206be9e91f378c6418c72f4cbb349366557b65e32045d234583358f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-080-nindot-adlaw-istorya', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'É um dia adorável hoje, né? A conversa é muito agradável.', '2b0836c57206be9e91f378c6418c72f4cbb349366557b65e32045d234583358f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-080-nindot-adlaw-istorya', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Сегодня прекрасный день, не так ли? Разговор очень приятный.', '2b0836c57206be9e91f378c6418c72f4cbb349366557b65e32045d234583358f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-8', 'cebuano-a2-practical-8-080-nindot-adlaw-istorya', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Es un día precioso hoy, ¿verdad? La conversación es muy agradable.', '2b0836c57206be9e91f378c6418c72f4cbb349366557b65e32045d234583358f'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-081-shower-dili-mogana', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Dili mogana ang shower. Nitawag na ko sa reception, palihug ayoha.', 'ea9612ccc700591842e294e261dfc46b13f1cae5489edeb145bc47982c7d0181'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-081-shower-dili-mogana', 'bright', 'English', 'The shower does not work. I already called reception; please repair it.', 'ea9612ccc700591842e294e261dfc46b13f1cae5489edeb145bc47982c7d0181'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-081-shower-dili-mogana', 'bright', 'French', 'La douche ne fonctionne pas. J''ai déjà appelé la réception ; veuillez la réparer.', 'ea9612ccc700591842e294e261dfc46b13f1cae5489edeb145bc47982c7d0181'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-081-shower-dili-mogana', 'bright', 'German', 'Die Dusche funktioniert nicht. Ich habe bereits an der Rezeption angerufen; bitte reparieren Sie sie.', 'ea9612ccc700591842e294e261dfc46b13f1cae5489edeb145bc47982c7d0181'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-081-shower-dili-mogana', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Shower tidak berfungsi. Saya sudah menelepon resepsionis; tolong perbaiki.', 'ea9612ccc700591842e294e261dfc46b13f1cae5489edeb145bc47982c7d0181'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-081-shower-dili-mogana', 'bright', 'Italian', 'La doccia non funziona. Ho già chiamato la reception; per favore, riparala.', 'ea9612ccc700591842e294e261dfc46b13f1cae5489edeb145bc47982c7d0181'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-081-shower-dili-mogana', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'シャワーが使えません。すでに受付に電話しましたが、修理してください。', 'ea9612ccc700591842e294e261dfc46b13f1cae5489edeb145bc47982c7d0181'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-081-shower-dili-mogana', 'bright', 'Korean', '샤워기가 작동하지 않습니다. 이미 접수처에 전화했습니다. 수리해 주세요.', 'ea9612ccc700591842e294e261dfc46b13f1cae5489edeb145bc47982c7d0181'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-081-shower-dili-mogana', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Prysznic nie działa. Już dzwoniłem do recepcji; proszę o naprawę.', 'ea9612ccc700591842e294e261dfc46b13f1cae5489edeb145bc47982c7d0181'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-081-shower-dili-mogana', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'O chuveiro não funciona. Já liguei para a recepção; por favor, conserte.', 'ea9612ccc700591842e294e261dfc46b13f1cae5489edeb145bc47982c7d0181'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-081-shower-dili-mogana', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Душ не работает. Я уже звонил на ресепшн; пожалуйста, почините.', 'ea9612ccc700591842e294e261dfc46b13f1cae5489edeb145bc47982c7d0181'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-081-shower-dili-mogana', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'La ducha no funciona. Ya llamé a recepción; por favor, repárala.', 'ea9612ccc700591842e294e261dfc46b13f1cae5489edeb145bc47982c7d0181'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-082-sabaw-wala-pa-moabot', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Niabot na ang ubang pagkaon, pero wala pa moabot ang sabaw. Palihug susiha.', 'a7ea1dbb664b816bbfc2ec8829170b5ca12cf0fb1b3db4b03584502df12395c0'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-082-sabaw-wala-pa-moabot', 'bright', 'English', 'The rest of the food has arrived, but the soup has not come yet. Please check.', 'a7ea1dbb664b816bbfc2ec8829170b5ca12cf0fb1b3db4b03584502df12395c0'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-082-sabaw-wala-pa-moabot', 'bright', 'French', 'Le reste de la nourriture est arrivé, mais la soupe n''est pas encore venue. Veuillez vérifier.', 'a7ea1dbb664b816bbfc2ec8829170b5ca12cf0fb1b3db4b03584502df12395c0'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-082-sabaw-wala-pa-moabot', 'bright', 'German', 'Das übrige Essen ist schon da, aber die Suppe ist noch nicht gekommen. Bitte sehen Sie nach.', 'a7ea1dbb664b816bbfc2ec8829170b5ca12cf0fb1b3db4b03584502df12395c0'),
