  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-082-sabaw-wala-pa-moabot', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Il resto del cibo è arrivato, ma la zuppa non è ancora arrivata. Per favore, controlla.', 'a7ea1dbb664b816bbfc2ec8829170b5ca12cf0fb1b3db4b03584502df12395c0'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-082-sabaw-wala-pa-moabot', 'bright', 'Japanese', '他の料理は届きましたが、スープはまだ来ていません。確認してください。', 'a7ea1dbb664b816bbfc2ec8829170b5ca12cf0fb1b3db4b03584502df12395c0'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-082-sabaw-wala-pa-moabot', 'bright', 'Korean', '나머지 음식은 도착했지만 수프는 아직 오지 않았습니다. 확인해 주세요.', 'a7ea1dbb664b816bbfc2ec8829170b5ca12cf0fb1b3db4b03584502df12395c0'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-082-sabaw-wala-pa-moabot', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Reszta jedzenia dotarła, ale zupa jeszcze nie. Proszę sprawdzić.', 'a7ea1dbb664b816bbfc2ec8829170b5ca12cf0fb1b3db4b03584502df12395c0'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-082-sabaw-wala-pa-moabot', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'O resto da comida chegou, mas a sopa ainda não veio. Por favor, verifique.', 'a7ea1dbb664b816bbfc2ec8829170b5ca12cf0fb1b3db4b03584502df12395c0'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-082-sabaw-wala-pa-moabot', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Остальная еда прибыла, но суп еще не принесли. Пожалуйста, проверьте.', 'a7ea1dbb664b816bbfc2ec8829170b5ca12cf0fb1b3db4b03584502df12395c0'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-082-sabaw-wala-pa-moabot', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'El resto de la comida ha llegado, pero la sopa aún no ha llegado. Por favor, compruébelo.', 'a7ea1dbb664b816bbfc2ec8829170b5ca12cf0fb1b3db4b03584502df12395c0'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-083-wifi-walay-sinyal', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nitawag na ko gikan sa kwarto, pero walay sinyal gihapon ang wifi. Palihug susiha.', '058bf372c44d8cde9ab2f824ff02a85fa452436caf704e8394074d3e266ca839'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-083-wifi-walay-sinyal', 'bright', 'English', 'I already called from the room, but the wifi still has no signal. Please check.', '058bf372c44d8cde9ab2f824ff02a85fa452436caf704e8394074d3e266ca839'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-083-wifi-walay-sinyal', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai déjà appelé depuis la chambre, mais le wifi n''a toujours pas de signal. Veuillez vérifier.', '058bf372c44d8cde9ab2f824ff02a85fa452436caf704e8394074d3e266ca839'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-083-wifi-walay-sinyal', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe schon aus dem Zimmer angerufen, aber das WLAN hat immer noch kein Signal. Bitte sehen Sie nach.', '058bf372c44d8cde9ab2f824ff02a85fa452436caf704e8394074d3e266ca839'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-083-wifi-walay-sinyal', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya sudah menelepon dari kamar, tetapi wifi masih belum ada sinyal. Tolong periksa.', '058bf372c44d8cde9ab2f824ff02a85fa452436caf704e8394074d3e266ca839'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-083-wifi-walay-sinyal', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho già chiamato dalla stanza, ma il wifi non ha ancora segnale. Per favore, controlla.', '058bf372c44d8cde9ab2f824ff02a85fa452436caf704e8394074d3e266ca839'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-083-wifi-walay-sinyal', 'bright', 'Japanese', '部屋から電話しましたが、Wi-Fiはまだ電波がありません。確認してください。', '058bf372c44d8cde9ab2f824ff02a85fa452436caf704e8394074d3e266ca839'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-083-wifi-walay-sinyal', 'bright', 'Korean', '이미 방에서 전화했지만 와이파이에 여전히 신호가 없습니다. 확인해 주세요.', '058bf372c44d8cde9ab2f824ff02a85fa452436caf704e8394074d3e266ca839'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-083-wifi-walay-sinyal', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Już dzwoniłem z pokoju, ale wifi nadal nie ma sygnału. Proszę sprawdzić.', '058bf372c44d8cde9ab2f824ff02a85fa452436caf704e8394074d3e266ca839'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-083-wifi-walay-sinyal', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Já liguei do quarto, mas o wifi ainda não tem sinal. Por favor, verifique.', '058bf372c44d8cde9ab2f824ff02a85fa452436caf704e8394074d3e266ca839'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-083-wifi-walay-sinyal', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я уже звонил из номера, но Wi-Fi по-прежнему не имеет сигнала. Пожалуйста, проверьте.', '058bf372c44d8cde9ab2f824ff02a85fa452436caf704e8394074d3e266ca839'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-083-wifi-walay-sinyal', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Ya llamé desde la habitación, pero el wifi todavía no tiene señal. Por favor, compruébelo.', '058bf372c44d8cde9ab2f824ff02a85fa452436caf704e8394074d3e266ca839'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-084-nawala-ang-yabi', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nawala nako ang yabi. Dili ko makasulod; palihug tabangi ko.', '4a492ed189a0be773d0cc35697089904ba8d58b3bd931df69798ac32e01ce43c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-084-nawala-ang-yabi', 'bright', 'English', 'I lost my key. I cannot get in; please help me.', '4a492ed189a0be773d0cc35697089904ba8d58b3bd931df69798ac32e01ce43c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-084-nawala-ang-yabi', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai perdu ma clé. Je ne peux pas entrer ; aidez-moi s''il vous plaît.', '4a492ed189a0be773d0cc35697089904ba8d58b3bd931df69798ac32e01ce43c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-084-nawala-ang-yabi', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe meinen Schlüssel verloren. Ich komme nicht hinein; bitte helfen Sie mir.', '4a492ed189a0be773d0cc35697089904ba8d58b3bd931df69798ac32e01ce43c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-084-nawala-ang-yabi', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya kehilangan kunci saya. Saya tidak bisa masuk; tolong bantu saya.', '4a492ed189a0be773d0cc35697089904ba8d58b3bd931df69798ac32e01ce43c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-084-nawala-ang-yabi', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho perso la chiave. Non posso entrare; per favore, aiutami.', '4a492ed189a0be773d0cc35697089904ba8d58b3bd931df69798ac32e01ce43c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-084-nawala-ang-yabi', 'bright', 'Japanese', '鍵をなくしました。入れないので、助けてください。', '4a492ed189a0be773d0cc35697089904ba8d58b3bd931df69798ac32e01ce43c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-084-nawala-ang-yabi', 'bright', 'Korean', '열쇠를 잃어버렸습니다. 들어갈 수 없습니다. 도와주세요.', '4a492ed189a0be773d0cc35697089904ba8d58b3bd931df69798ac32e01ce43c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-084-nawala-ang-yabi', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Zgubiłem klucz. Nie mogę wejść; proszę mi pomóc.', '4a492ed189a0be773d0cc35697089904ba8d58b3bd931df69798ac32e01ce43c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-084-nawala-ang-yabi', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Perdi minha chave. Não consigo entrar; por favor, me ajude.', '4a492ed189a0be773d0cc35697089904ba8d58b3bd931df69798ac32e01ce43c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-084-nawala-ang-yabi', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я потерял ключ. Я не могу войти; пожалуйста, помогите мне.', '4a492ed189a0be773d0cc35697089904ba8d58b3bd931df69798ac32e01ce43c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-084-nawala-ang-yabi', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Perdí mi llave. No puedo entrar; por favor, ayúdame.', '4a492ed189a0be773d0cc35697089904ba8d58b3bd931df69798ac32e01ce43c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-wala-pa', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nibayad na ko; wala pa ang taksi. Palihug pangita og lain.', 'e86ea36e3489ca8b8af8d95ac481d676a796c27f5bd502f94e320944ba39a911'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-wala-pa', 'bright', 'English', 'I already paid; the taxi is not here yet. Please find another one.', 'e86ea36e3489ca8b8af8d95ac481d676a796c27f5bd502f94e320944ba39a911'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-wala-pa', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai déjà payé ; le taxi n''est pas encore là. Veuillez en trouver un autre.', 'e86ea36e3489ca8b8af8d95ac481d676a796c27f5bd502f94e320944ba39a911'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-wala-pa', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe bereits bezahlt; das Taxi ist noch nicht da. Bitte suchen Sie ein anderes.', 'e86ea36e3489ca8b8af8d95ac481d676a796c27f5bd502f94e320944ba39a911'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-wala-pa', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya sudah membayar; taksi belum ada di sini. Tolong cari yang lain.', 'e86ea36e3489ca8b8af8d95ac481d676a796c27f5bd502f94e320944ba39a911'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-wala-pa', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho già pagato; il taxi non è ancora qui. Per favore, trovanne un altro.', 'e86ea36e3489ca8b8af8d95ac481d676a796c27f5bd502f94e320944ba39a911'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-wala-pa', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すでに支払いましたが、タクシーはまだ来ていません。別のタクシーを探してください。', 'e86ea36e3489ca8b8af8d95ac481d676a796c27f5bd502f94e320944ba39a911'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-wala-pa', 'bright', 'Korean', '이미 지불했습니다. 택시가 아직 오지 않았습니다. 다른 것을 찾아주세요.', 'e86ea36e3489ca8b8af8d95ac481d676a796c27f5bd502f94e320944ba39a911'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-wala-pa', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Już zapłaciłem; taksówka jeszcze nie przyjechała. Proszę znaleźć inną.', 'e86ea36e3489ca8b8af8d95ac481d676a796c27f5bd502f94e320944ba39a911'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-wala-pa', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Já paguei; o táxi ainda não chegou. Por favor, encontre outro.', 'e86ea36e3489ca8b8af8d95ac481d676a796c27f5bd502f94e320944ba39a911'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-wala-pa', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я уже заплатил; такси еще не здесь. Пожалуйста, найдите другое.', 'e86ea36e3489ca8b8af8d95ac481d676a796c27f5bd502f94e320944ba39a911'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-wala-pa', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Ya pagué; el taxi aún no está aquí. Por favor, busca otro.', 'e86ea36e3489ca8b8af8d95ac481d676a796c27f5bd502f94e320944ba39a911'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-086-kulang-ang-sukli', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nibayad na ko, pero kulang og singko pesos ang sukli. Palihug susiha.', 'c1b3f11fa3cd712c685fb1b6fbf0c6e21f0d82989ba5f2387aa929619ca86dd7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-086-kulang-ang-sukli', 'bright', 'English', 'I already paid, but the change is five pesos short. Please check it.', 'c1b3f11fa3cd712c685fb1b6fbf0c6e21f0d82989ba5f2387aa929619ca86dd7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-086-kulang-ang-sukli', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai déjà payé, mais il manque cinq pesos de monnaie. Veuillez vérifier.', 'c1b3f11fa3cd712c685fb1b6fbf0c6e21f0d82989ba5f2387aa929619ca86dd7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-086-kulang-ang-sukli', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe bereits bezahlt, aber beim Wechselgeld fehlen fünf Pesos. Bitte prüfen Sie es.', 'c1b3f11fa3cd712c685fb1b6fbf0c6e21f0d82989ba5f2387aa929619ca86dd7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-086-kulang-ang-sukli', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya sudah membayar, tetapi kembaliannya kurang lima peso. Tolong periksa.', 'c1b3f11fa3cd712c685fb1b6fbf0c6e21f0d82989ba5f2387aa929619ca86dd7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-086-kulang-ang-sukli', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho già pagato, ma il resto è di cinque pesos in meno. Per favore, controlla.', 'c1b3f11fa3cd712c685fb1b6fbf0c6e21f0d82989ba5f2387aa929619ca86dd7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-086-kulang-ang-sukli', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すでに支払いましたが、お釣りが5ペソ足りません。確認してください。', 'c1b3f11fa3cd712c685fb1b6fbf0c6e21f0d82989ba5f2387aa929619ca86dd7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-086-kulang-ang-sukli', 'bright', 'Korean', '이미 지불했지만 잔돈이 5페소 부족합니다. 확인해 주세요.', 'c1b3f11fa3cd712c685fb1b6fbf0c6e21f0d82989ba5f2387aa929619ca86dd7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-086-kulang-ang-sukli', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Już zapłaciłem, ale brakuje pięciu peso reszty. Proszę to sprawdzić.', 'c1b3f11fa3cd712c685fb1b6fbf0c6e21f0d82989ba5f2387aa929619ca86dd7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-086-kulang-ang-sukli', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Já paguei, mas o troco está cinco pesos a menos. Por favor, verifique.', 'c1b3f11fa3cd712c685fb1b6fbf0c6e21f0d82989ba5f2387aa929619ca86dd7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-086-kulang-ang-sukli', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я уже заплатил, но сдачи не хватает пять песо. Пожалуйста, проверьте.', 'c1b3f11fa3cd712c685fb1b6fbf0c6e21f0d82989ba5f2387aa929619ca86dd7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-086-kulang-ang-sukli', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Ya pagué, pero el cambio son cinco pesos menos. Por favor, compruébelo.', 'c1b3f11fa3cd712c685fb1b6fbf0c6e21f0d82989ba5f2387aa929619ca86dd7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-087-nipalit-pero-guba', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nipalit ko niini karon, pero guba ug dili mogana. Palihug ilisi.', '9a36abe586950763cb69fcb3850c1c1d7817be2e109b35f22144754e154e66f7'),
