  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-087-nipalit-pero-guba', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai acheté ceci aujourd''hui, mais c''est cassé et ça ne fonctionne pas. Veuillez le remplacer.', '9a36abe586950763cb69fcb3850c1c1d7817be2e109b35f22144754e154e66f7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-087-nipalit-pero-guba', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe das heute gekauft, aber es ist kaputt und funktioniert nicht. Bitte tauschen Sie es um.', '9a36abe586950763cb69fcb3850c1c1d7817be2e109b35f22144754e154e66f7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-087-nipalit-pero-guba', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya membeli ini hari ini, tetapi rusak dan tidak berfungsi. Tolong ganti.', '9a36abe586950763cb69fcb3850c1c1d7817be2e109b35f22144754e154e66f7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-087-nipalit-pero-guba', 'bright', 'Italian', 'L''ho comprato oggi, ma è rotto e non funziona. Per favore, sostituiscilo.', '9a36abe586950763cb69fcb3850c1c1d7817be2e109b35f22144754e154e66f7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-087-nipalit-pero-guba', 'bright', 'Japanese', '今日買ったものですが、壊れていて動きません。交換してください。', '9a36abe586950763cb69fcb3850c1c1d7817be2e109b35f22144754e154e66f7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-087-nipalit-pero-guba', 'bright', 'Korean', '오늘 이걸 샀는데 고장 나서 작동하지 않습니다. 교체해 주세요.', '9a36abe586950763cb69fcb3850c1c1d7817be2e109b35f22144754e154e66f7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-087-nipalit-pero-guba', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Kupiłem to dzisiaj, ale jest zepsute i nie działa. Proszę o wymianę.', '9a36abe586950763cb69fcb3850c1c1d7817be2e109b35f22144754e154e66f7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-087-nipalit-pero-guba', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Comprei isto hoje, mas está quebrado e não funciona. Por favor, substitua.', '9a36abe586950763cb69fcb3850c1c1d7817be2e109b35f22144754e154e66f7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-087-nipalit-pero-guba', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я купил это сегодня, но оно сломано и не работает. Пожалуйста, замените.', '9a36abe586950763cb69fcb3850c1c1d7817be2e109b35f22144754e154e66f7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-087-nipalit-pero-guba', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Compré esto hoy, pero está roto y no funciona. Por favor, reemplázalo.', '9a36abe586950763cb69fcb3850c1c1d7817be2e109b35f22144754e154e66f7'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-088-bugnaw-ang-sabaw', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nikaon na ko og gamay, pero bugnaw ang sabaw. Palihug inita.', '711bf1792bcf9426aadd21eb1f2835b326bc717e3e2968a125127f95a01683c5'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-088-bugnaw-ang-sabaw', 'bright', 'English', 'I already ate a little, but the soup is cold. Please warm it.', '711bf1792bcf9426aadd21eb1f2835b326bc717e3e2968a125127f95a01683c5'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-088-bugnaw-ang-sabaw', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai déjà mangé un peu, mais la soupe est froide. Veuillez la réchauffer.', '711bf1792bcf9426aadd21eb1f2835b326bc717e3e2968a125127f95a01683c5'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-088-bugnaw-ang-sabaw', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe schon ein wenig gegessen, aber die Suppe ist kalt. Bitte wärmen Sie sie auf.', '711bf1792bcf9426aadd21eb1f2835b326bc717e3e2968a125127f95a01683c5'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-088-bugnaw-ang-sabaw', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya sudah makan sedikit, tetapi supnya dingin. Tolong hangatkan.', '711bf1792bcf9426aadd21eb1f2835b326bc717e3e2968a125127f95a01683c5'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-088-bugnaw-ang-sabaw', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho già mangiato un po'', ma la zuppa è fredda. Per favore, scaldala.', '711bf1792bcf9426aadd21eb1f2835b326bc717e3e2968a125127f95a01683c5'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-088-bugnaw-ang-sabaw', 'bright', 'Japanese', '少し食べましたが、スープが冷たいです。温めてください。', '711bf1792bcf9426aadd21eb1f2835b326bc717e3e2968a125127f95a01683c5'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-088-bugnaw-ang-sabaw', 'bright', 'Korean', '조금 먹었지만 수프가 차갑습니다. 데워 주세요.', '711bf1792bcf9426aadd21eb1f2835b326bc717e3e2968a125127f95a01683c5'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-088-bugnaw-ang-sabaw', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Zjadłem już trochę, ale zupa jest zimna. Proszę ją podgrzać.', '711bf1792bcf9426aadd21eb1f2835b326bc717e3e2968a125127f95a01683c5'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-088-bugnaw-ang-sabaw', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Já comi um pouco, mas a sopa está fria. Por favor, esquente.', '711bf1792bcf9426aadd21eb1f2835b326bc717e3e2968a125127f95a01683c5'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-088-bugnaw-ang-sabaw', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я уже немного поел, но суп холодный. Пожалуйста, подогрейте.', '711bf1792bcf9426aadd21eb1f2835b326bc717e3e2968a125127f95a01683c5'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-088-bugnaw-ang-sabaw', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Ya comí un poco, pero la sopa está fría. Por favor, caliéntala.', '711bf1792bcf9426aadd21eb1f2835b326bc717e3e2968a125127f95a01683c5'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-089-natulog-pero-saba', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Natulog ko, pero dili maayo. Saba gihapon ang kwarto; palihug ilisi.', '9ae02e239b4cf805fa026ef3a8f14de424d889bc00b9ab626a099ab509022c25'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-089-natulog-pero-saba', 'bright', 'English', 'I slept, but not well. The room is still noisy; please change it.', '9ae02e239b4cf805fa026ef3a8f14de424d889bc00b9ab626a099ab509022c25'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-089-natulog-pero-saba', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai dormi, mais pas bien. La chambre est toujours bruyante ; veuillez la changer.', '9ae02e239b4cf805fa026ef3a8f14de424d889bc00b9ab626a099ab509022c25'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-089-natulog-pero-saba', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe geschlafen, aber nicht gut. Das Zimmer ist immer noch laut; bitte wechseln Sie es.', '9ae02e239b4cf805fa026ef3a8f14de424d889bc00b9ab626a099ab509022c25'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-089-natulog-pero-saba', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya tidur, tetapi tidak nyenyak. Kamar masih berisik; tolong pindah kamar.', '9ae02e239b4cf805fa026ef3a8f14de424d889bc00b9ab626a099ab509022c25'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-089-natulog-pero-saba', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho dormito, ma non bene. La stanza è ancora rumorosa; per favore, cambiala.', '9ae02e239b4cf805fa026ef3a8f14de424d889bc00b9ab626a099ab509022c25'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-089-natulog-pero-saba', 'bright', 'Japanese', '眠りましたが、よく眠れませんでした。部屋はまだうるさいので、部屋を変えてください。', '9ae02e239b4cf805fa026ef3a8f14de424d889bc00b9ab626a099ab509022c25'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-089-natulog-pero-saba', 'bright', 'Korean', '잤지만 잘 못 잤습니다. 방이 여전히 시끄럽습니다. 바꿔 주세요.', '9ae02e239b4cf805fa026ef3a8f14de424d889bc00b9ab626a099ab509022c25'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-089-natulog-pero-saba', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Spałem, ale nie dobrze. W pokoju nadal jest głośno; proszę o zmianę.', '9ae02e239b4cf805fa026ef3a8f14de424d889bc00b9ab626a099ab509022c25'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-089-natulog-pero-saba', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Dormi, mas não bem. O quarto ainda está barulhento; por favor, troque.', '9ae02e239b4cf805fa026ef3a8f14de424d889bc00b9ab626a099ab509022c25'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-089-natulog-pero-saba', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я спал, но не очень хорошо. В номере все еще шумно; пожалуйста, смените его.', '9ae02e239b4cf805fa026ef3a8f14de424d889bc00b9ab626a099ab509022c25'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-089-natulog-pero-saba', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Dormí, pero no bien. La habitación sigue ruidosa; por favor, cámbiala.', '9ae02e239b4cf805fa026ef3a8f14de424d889bc00b9ab626a099ab509022c25'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-090-nahuman-na-pag-ayo', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nahuman na ang pag-ayo; mogana na ang tanan. Daghang salamat sa tabang.', '3769335d7683489850851d9229912a79046f7bc566892d8d54726a144782e61c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-090-nahuman-na-pag-ayo', 'bright', 'English', 'The repair is complete; everything works now. Thank you very much for your help.', '3769335d7683489850851d9229912a79046f7bc566892d8d54726a144782e61c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-090-nahuman-na-pag-ayo', 'bright', 'French', 'La réparation est terminée ; tout fonctionne maintenant. Merci beaucoup pour votre aide.', '3769335d7683489850851d9229912a79046f7bc566892d8d54726a144782e61c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-090-nahuman-na-pag-ayo', 'bright', 'German', 'Die Reparatur ist abgeschlossen; jetzt funktioniert alles. Vielen Dank für Ihre Hilfe.', '3769335d7683489850851d9229912a79046f7bc566892d8d54726a144782e61c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-090-nahuman-na-pag-ayo', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Perbaikannya sudah selesai; semuanya berfungsi sekarang. Terima kasih banyak atas bantuan Anda.', '3769335d7683489850851d9229912a79046f7bc566892d8d54726a144782e61c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-090-nahuman-na-pag-ayo', 'bright', 'Italian', 'La riparazione è completa; ora funziona tutto. Grazie mille per il tuo aiuto.', '3769335d7683489850851d9229912a79046f7bc566892d8d54726a144782e61c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-090-nahuman-na-pag-ayo', 'bright', 'Japanese', '修理は完了しました。すべて正常に動作しています。ご協力いただきありがとうございました。', '3769335d7683489850851d9229912a79046f7bc566892d8d54726a144782e61c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-090-nahuman-na-pag-ayo', 'bright', 'Korean', '수리가 완료되었습니다. 이제 모든 것이 작동합니다. 도와주셔서 정말 감사합니다.', '3769335d7683489850851d9229912a79046f7bc566892d8d54726a144782e61c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-090-nahuman-na-pag-ayo', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Naprawa jest zakończona; wszystko teraz działa. Dziękuję bardzo za pomoc.', '3769335d7683489850851d9229912a79046f7bc566892d8d54726a144782e61c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-090-nahuman-na-pag-ayo', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'O conserto está completo; tudo funciona agora. Muito obrigado pela sua ajuda.', '3769335d7683489850851d9229912a79046f7bc566892d8d54726a144782e61c'),
  ('cebuano-a2-practical-9', 'cebuano-a2-practical-9-090-nahuman-na-pag-ayo', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Ремонт завершён; теперь всё работает. Большое спасибо за вашу помощь.', '3769335d7683489850851d9229912a79046f7bc566892d8d54726a144782e61c'),
