  ('english-a2-practical-9', 'english-a2-practical-9-084-i-lost-my-key-but-the-door-is-open-now-thank-you', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya kehilangan kunci saya, tetapi pintunya sekarang terbuka. Terima kasih.', '599c97142ebb7d2a979320427b0faea4e993c7fc640316cbf93548035c0fe253'),
  ('english-a2-practical-9', 'english-a2-practical-9-084-i-lost-my-key-but-the-door-is-open-now-thank-you', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho perso la chiave, ma la porta è aperta ora. Grazie.', '599c97142ebb7d2a979320427b0faea4e993c7fc640316cbf93548035c0fe253'),
  ('english-a2-practical-9', 'english-a2-practical-9-084-i-lost-my-key-but-the-door-is-open-now-thank-you', 'bright', 'Japanese', '鍵をなくしましたが、ドアは今開いています。ありがとうございます。', '599c97142ebb7d2a979320427b0faea4e993c7fc640316cbf93548035c0fe253'),
  ('english-a2-practical-9', 'english-a2-practical-9-084-i-lost-my-key-but-the-door-is-open-now-thank-you', 'bright', 'Korean', '열쇠를 잃어버렸지만, 문은 이제 열려 있습니다. 감사합니다.', '599c97142ebb7d2a979320427b0faea4e993c7fc640316cbf93548035c0fe253'),
  ('english-a2-practical-9', 'english-a2-practical-9-084-i-lost-my-key-but-the-door-is-open-now-thank-you', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Zgubiłem klucz, ale drzwi są teraz otwarte. Dziękuję.', '599c97142ebb7d2a979320427b0faea4e993c7fc640316cbf93548035c0fe253'),
  ('english-a2-practical-9', 'english-a2-practical-9-084-i-lost-my-key-but-the-door-is-open-now-thank-you', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Perdi minha chave, mas a porta está aberta agora. Obrigado.', '599c97142ebb7d2a979320427b0faea4e993c7fc640316cbf93548035c0fe253'),
