  ('english-a2-practical-9', 'english-a2-practical-9-088-the-soup-is-cold-i-ordered-it-hot-could-you-heat-it-up', 'bright', 'Italian', 'La zuppa è fredda, ma l''ho ordinata calda. Potrebbe riscaldarla?', '0fdc1ac7d21b1aafedbc41a2f0fecac71739baa66fa92f11a88baf19cb8f77ed'),
  ('english-a2-practical-9', 'english-a2-practical-9-088-the-soup-is-cold-i-ordered-it-hot-could-you-heat-it-up', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'スープは冷たいですが、熱く注文しました。温めていただけますか？', '0fdc1ac7d21b1aafedbc41a2f0fecac71739baa66fa92f11a88baf19cb8f77ed'),
  ('english-a2-practical-9', 'english-a2-practical-9-088-the-soup-is-cold-i-ordered-it-hot-could-you-heat-it-up', 'bright', 'Korean', '수프가 차가운데 뜨겁게 주문했어요. 데워주시겠어요?', '0fdc1ac7d21b1aafedbc41a2f0fecac71739baa66fa92f11a88baf19cb8f77ed'),
  ('english-a2-practical-9', 'english-a2-practical-9-088-the-soup-is-cold-i-ordered-it-hot-could-you-heat-it-up', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Zupa jest zimna, ale zamówiłem ją gorącą. Czy mógłbyś ją podgrzać?', '0fdc1ac7d21b1aafedbc41a2f0fecac71739baa66fa92f11a88baf19cb8f77ed'),
  ('english-a2-practical-9', 'english-a2-practical-9-088-the-soup-is-cold-i-ordered-it-hot-could-you-heat-it-up', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'A sopa está fria, mas eu pedi quente. Você poderia esquentá-la?', '0fdc1ac7d21b1aafedbc41a2f0fecac71739baa66fa92f11a88baf19cb8f77ed'),
  ('english-a2-practical-9', 'english-a2-practical-9-088-the-soup-is-cold-i-ordered-it-hot-could-you-heat-it-up', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Суп холодный, но я заказывал его горячим. Не могли бы вы его подогреть?', '0fdc1ac7d21b1aafedbc41a2f0fecac71739baa66fa92f11a88baf19cb8f77ed'),
  ('english-a2-practical-9', 'english-a2-practical-9-088-the-soup-is-cold-i-ordered-it-hot-could-you-heat-it-up', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'La sopa está fría, pero la pedí caliente. ¿Podría calentarla?', '0fdc1ac7d21b1aafedbc41a2f0fecac71739baa66fa92f11a88baf19cb8f77ed'),
  ('english-a2-practical-9', 'english-a2-practical-9-089-i-slept-badly-because-the-room-is-too-loud-could-you-change-it', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Wala ko makatulog og tarong tungod kay saba kaayo ang lawak. Mahimo ba nimo kini nga ilisan?', '0ccb1a66ee4c9b01e819642781cdefbcc479755a1ff63cd2e1b6f480b778e92f'),
