  ('french-a2-practical-4', 'french-a2-practical-4-039-donc-samedi-a-huit-heures-devant-le-cinema-cest-bien-ca', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Więc, sobota o ósmej przed kinem, zgadza się?', 'bc906241890b178d502c5bbf063339d82beb153c56287b2372bc92a50bc39e1b'),
  ('french-a2-practical-4', 'french-a2-practical-4-039-donc-samedi-a-huit-heures-devant-le-cinema-cest-bien-ca', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Então, sábado às oito em frente ao cinema, está certo?', 'bc906241890b178d502c5bbf063339d82beb153c56287b2372bc92a50bc39e1b'),
  ('french-a2-practical-4', 'french-a2-practical-4-039-donc-samedi-a-huit-heures-devant-le-cinema-cest-bien-ca', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Итак, суббота в восемь перед кинотеатром, верно?', 'bc906241890b178d502c5bbf063339d82beb153c56287b2372bc92a50bc39e1b'),
  ('french-a2-practical-4', 'french-a2-practical-4-039-donc-samedi-a-huit-heures-devant-le-cinema-cest-bien-ca', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Entonces, ¿sábado a las ocho delante del cine, es correcto?', 'bc906241890b178d502c5bbf063339d82beb153c56287b2372bc92a50bc39e1b'),
  ('french-a2-practical-4', 'french-a2-practical-4-040-ce-week-end-je-vais-me-reposer-pres-de-la-mer', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Karong katapusan sa semana mopahulay ako duol sa dagat.', 'b3eb7362f56fe2086d525484fd51c346cf3f20209829373abecada53f16152fe'),
  ('french-a2-practical-4', 'french-a2-practical-4-040-ce-week-end-je-vais-me-reposer-pres-de-la-mer', 'bright', 'English', 'This weekend I am going to rest near the sea.', 'b3eb7362f56fe2086d525484fd51c346cf3f20209829373abecada53f16152fe'),
  ('french-a2-practical-4', 'french-a2-practical-4-040-ce-week-end-je-vais-me-reposer-pres-de-la-mer', 'bright', 'French', 'Ce week-end, je vais me reposer près de la mer.', 'b3eb7362f56fe2086d525484fd51c346cf3f20209829373abecada53f16152fe'),
  ('french-a2-practical-4', 'french-a2-practical-4-040-ce-week-end-je-vais-me-reposer-pres-de-la-mer', 'bright', 'German', 'Dieses Wochenende werde ich mich nahe am Meer ausruhen.', 'b3eb7362f56fe2086d525484fd51c346cf3f20209829373abecada53f16152fe'),
  ('french-a2-practical-4', 'french-a2-practical-4-040-ce-week-end-je-vais-me-reposer-pres-de-la-mer', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Akhir pekan ini saya akan beristirahat di dekat laut.', 'b3eb7362f56fe2086d525484fd51c346cf3f20209829373abecada53f16152fe'),
  ('french-a2-practical-4', 'french-a2-practical-4-040-ce-week-end-je-vais-me-reposer-pres-de-la-mer', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Questo fine settimana mi riposerò vicino al mare.', 'b3eb7362f56fe2086d525484fd51c346cf3f20209829373abecada53f16152fe'),
  ('french-a2-practical-4', 'french-a2-practical-4-040-ce-week-end-je-vais-me-reposer-pres-de-la-mer', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'この週末は海辺で休むつもりです。', 'b3eb7362f56fe2086d525484fd51c346cf3f20209829373abecada53f16152fe'),
  ('french-a2-practical-4', 'french-a2-practical-4-040-ce-week-end-je-vais-me-reposer-pres-de-la-mer', 'bright', 'Korean', '이번 주말에는 바닷가 근처에서 쉴 거예요.', 'b3eb7362f56fe2086d525484fd51c346cf3f20209829373abecada53f16152fe'),
  ('french-a2-practical-4', 'french-a2-practical-4-040-ce-week-end-je-vais-me-reposer-pres-de-la-mer', 'bright', 'Polish', 'W ten weekend zamierzam odpoczywać nad morzem.', 'b3eb7362f56fe2086d525484fd51c346cf3f20209829373abecada53f16152fe'),
  ('french-a2-practical-4', 'french-a2-practical-4-040-ce-week-end-je-vais-me-reposer-pres-de-la-mer', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Este fim de semana vou descansar perto do mar.', 'b3eb7362f56fe2086d525484fd51c346cf3f20209829373abecada53f16152fe'),
  ('french-a2-practical-4', 'french-a2-practical-4-040-ce-week-end-je-vais-me-reposer-pres-de-la-mer', 'bright', 'Russian', 'На этих выходных я собираюсь отдохнуть у моря.', 'b3eb7362f56fe2086d525484fd51c346cf3f20209829373abecada53f16152fe'),
  ('french-a2-practical-4', 'french-a2-practical-4-040-ce-week-end-je-vais-me-reposer-pres-de-la-mer', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Este fin de semana voy a descansar cerca del mar.', 'b3eb7362f56fe2086d525484fd51c346cf3f20209829373abecada53f16152fe'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-041-excusez-moi-il-y-a-une-erreur-jai-commande-un-the-pas-un-cafe', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa ko, adunay sayop: tsa ang akong gi-order, dili kape.', '4f03af09ba637cea0603c63c10bdf2082e39d268bd24366d554e59b3903b0295'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-041-excusez-moi-il-y-a-une-erreur-jai-commande-un-the-pas-un-cafe', 'bright', 'English', 'Excuse me, there is a mistake: I ordered tea, not coffee.', '4f03af09ba637cea0603c63c10bdf2082e39d268bd24366d554e59b3903b0295'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-041-excusez-moi-il-y-a-une-erreur-jai-commande-un-the-pas-un-cafe', 'bright', 'French', 'Excusez-moi, il y a une erreur : j''ai commandé un thé, pas un café.', '4f03af09ba637cea0603c63c10bdf2082e39d268bd24366d554e59b3903b0295'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-041-excusez-moi-il-y-a-une-erreur-jai-commande-un-the-pas-un-cafe', 'bright', 'German', 'Entschuldigen Sie, es gibt einen Fehler: Ich habe einen Tee bestellt, keinen Kaffee.', '4f03af09ba637cea0603c63c10bdf2082e39d268bd24366d554e59b3903b0295'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-041-excusez-moi-il-y-a-une-erreur-jai-commande-un-the-pas-un-cafe', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Permisi, ada kesalahan: saya memesan teh, bukan kopi.', '4f03af09ba637cea0603c63c10bdf2082e39d268bd24366d554e59b3903b0295'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-041-excusez-moi-il-y-a-une-erreur-jai-commande-un-the-pas-un-cafe', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi scusi, c''è un errore: ho ordinato un tè, non un caffè.', '4f03af09ba637cea0603c63c10bdf2082e39d268bd24366d554e59b3903b0295'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-041-excusez-moi-il-y-a-une-erreur-jai-commande-un-the-pas-un-cafe', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すみません、間違いがあります。コーヒーではなく紅茶を注文しました。', '4f03af09ba637cea0603c63c10bdf2082e39d268bd24366d554e59b3903b0295'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-041-excusez-moi-il-y-a-une-erreur-jai-commande-un-the-pas-un-cafe', 'bright', 'Korean', '실례합니다, 잘못되었습니다. 커피가 아니라 차를 주문했습니다.', '4f03af09ba637cea0603c63c10bdf2082e39d268bd24366d554e59b3903b0295'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-041-excusez-moi-il-y-a-une-erreur-jai-commande-un-the-pas-un-cafe', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, jest błąd: zamówiłem herbatę, nie kawę.', '4f03af09ba637cea0603c63c10bdf2082e39d268bd24366d554e59b3903b0295'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-041-excusez-moi-il-y-a-une-erreur-jai-commande-un-the-pas-un-cafe', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Com licença, há um erro: pedi um chá, não um café.', '4f03af09ba637cea0603c63c10bdf2082e39d268bd24366d554e59b3903b0295'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-041-excusez-moi-il-y-a-une-erreur-jai-commande-un-the-pas-un-cafe', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, есть ошибка: я заказал чай, а не кофе.', '4f03af09ba637cea0603c63c10bdf2082e39d268bd24366d554e59b3903b0295'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-041-excusez-moi-il-y-a-une-erreur-jai-commande-un-the-pas-un-cafe', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Disculpe, hay un error: pedí té, no café.', '4f03af09ba637cea0603c63c10bdf2082e39d268bd24366d554e59b3903b0295'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-042-non-elle-est-trop-petite-vous-avez-la-taille-au-dessus', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Dili, gamay ra kaayo kini. Aduna ba kamo sa sunod nga gidak-on?', '71731c7b5000b7ecdcc91bd56219762469176693aef4c4f183d737416a0d6f67'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-042-non-elle-est-trop-petite-vous-avez-la-taille-au-dessus', 'bright', 'English', 'No, it is too small. Do you have the next size up?', '71731c7b5000b7ecdcc91bd56219762469176693aef4c4f183d737416a0d6f67'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-042-non-elle-est-trop-petite-vous-avez-la-taille-au-dessus', 'bright', 'French', 'Non, elle est trop petite. Vous avez la taille au-dessus ?', '71731c7b5000b7ecdcc91bd56219762469176693aef4c4f183d737416a0d6f67'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-042-non-elle-est-trop-petite-vous-avez-la-taille-au-dessus', 'bright', 'German', 'Nein, sie ist zu klein. Haben Sie die nächstgrößere Größe?', '71731c7b5000b7ecdcc91bd56219762469176693aef4c4f183d737416a0d6f67'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-042-non-elle-est-trop-petite-vous-avez-la-taille-au-dessus', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Tidak, ukurannya terlalu kecil. Apakah Anda punya ukuran di atasnya?', '71731c7b5000b7ecdcc91bd56219762469176693aef4c4f183d737416a0d6f67'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-042-non-elle-est-trop-petite-vous-avez-la-taille-au-dessus', 'bright', 'Italian', 'No, è troppo piccola. Avete la taglia più grande?', '71731c7b5000b7ecdcc91bd56219762469176693aef4c4f183d737416a0d6f67'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-042-non-elle-est-trop-petite-vous-avez-la-taille-au-dessus', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'いいえ、小さすぎます。ワンサイズ大きいものはありますか？', '71731c7b5000b7ecdcc91bd56219762469176693aef4c4f183d737416a0d6f67'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-042-non-elle-est-trop-petite-vous-avez-la-taille-au-dessus', 'bright', 'Korean', '아니요, 너무 작아요. 다음 사이즈로 더 큰 것 있나요?', '71731c7b5000b7ecdcc91bd56219762469176693aef4c4f183d737416a0d6f67'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-042-non-elle-est-trop-petite-vous-avez-la-taille-au-dessus', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Nie, jest za małe. Czy masz następny rozmiar?', '71731c7b5000b7ecdcc91bd56219762469176693aef4c4f183d737416a0d6f67'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-042-non-elle-est-trop-petite-vous-avez-la-taille-au-dessus', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Não, é muito pequeno. Você tem o próximo tamanho acima?', '71731c7b5000b7ecdcc91bd56219762469176693aef4c4f183d737416a0d6f67'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-042-non-elle-est-trop-petite-vous-avez-la-taille-au-dessus', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Нет, она слишком мала. У вас есть следующий размер?', '71731c7b5000b7ecdcc91bd56219762469176693aef4c4f183d737416a0d6f67'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-042-non-elle-est-trop-petite-vous-avez-la-taille-au-dessus', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'No, es demasiado pequeña. ¿Tiene la talla siguiente?', '71731c7b5000b7ecdcc91bd56219762469176693aef4c4f183d737416a0d6f67'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-043-je-voudrais-de-leau-plate-a-la-place-sil-vous-plait', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Gusto unta nako og plain nga tubig hinuon, palihog.', '466291b00000e9dc70c02e78365ee4e1684cc54d513383dcf0451d3295caa822'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-043-je-voudrais-de-leau-plate-a-la-place-sil-vous-plait', 'bright', 'English', 'I would like still water instead, please.', '466291b00000e9dc70c02e78365ee4e1684cc54d513383dcf0451d3295caa822'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-043-je-voudrais-de-leau-plate-a-la-place-sil-vous-plait', 'bright', 'French', 'Je voudrais de l''eau plate à la place, s''il vous plaît.', '466291b00000e9dc70c02e78365ee4e1684cc54d513383dcf0451d3295caa822'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-043-je-voudrais-de-leau-plate-a-la-place-sil-vous-plait', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich hätte gern stattdessen stilles Wasser, bitte.', '466291b00000e9dc70c02e78365ee4e1684cc54d513383dcf0451d3295caa822'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-043-je-voudrais-de-leau-plate-a-la-place-sil-vous-plait', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya ingin air putih saja, tolong.', '466291b00000e9dc70c02e78365ee4e1684cc54d513383dcf0451d3295caa822'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-043-je-voudrais-de-leau-plate-a-la-place-sil-vous-plait', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Vorrei acqua naturale invece, per favore.', '466291b00000e9dc70c02e78365ee4e1684cc54d513383dcf0451d3295caa822'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-043-je-voudrais-de-leau-plate-a-la-place-sil-vous-plait', 'bright', 'Japanese', '代わりに普通の水をください、お願いします。', '466291b00000e9dc70c02e78365ee4e1684cc54d513383dcf0451d3295caa822'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-043-je-voudrais-de-leau-plate-a-la-place-sil-vous-plait', 'bright', 'Korean', '대신 물을 주세요.', '466291b00000e9dc70c02e78365ee4e1684cc54d513383dcf0451d3295caa822'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-043-je-voudrais-de-leau-plate-a-la-place-sil-vous-plait', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Poproszę zamiast tego wodę niegazowaną, proszę.', '466291b00000e9dc70c02e78365ee4e1684cc54d513383dcf0451d3295caa822'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-043-je-voudrais-de-leau-plate-a-la-place-sil-vous-plait', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu gostaria de água sem gás em vez disso, por favor.', '466291b00000e9dc70c02e78365ee4e1684cc54d513383dcf0451d3295caa822'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-043-je-voudrais-de-leau-plate-a-la-place-sil-vous-plait', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я бы хотел воду без газа вместо этого, пожалуйста.', '466291b00000e9dc70c02e78365ee4e1684cc54d513383dcf0451d3295caa822'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-043-je-voudrais-de-leau-plate-a-la-place-sil-vous-plait', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Quisiera agua sin gas en su lugar, por favor.', '466291b00000e9dc70c02e78365ee4e1684cc54d513383dcf0451d3295caa822'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-044-non-merci-je-prefere-les-pommes-rouges-pas-les-vertes', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Dili salamat, mas gusto nako ang pula nga mga mansanas, dili ang berde.', 'efe1fc6db4f565d7e261f16d412835f1e77956a8abb0c38b8774deb31a08c225'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-044-non-merci-je-prefere-les-pommes-rouges-pas-les-vertes', 'bright', 'English', 'No thank you, I prefer the red apples, not the green ones.', 'efe1fc6db4f565d7e261f16d412835f1e77956a8abb0c38b8774deb31a08c225'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-044-non-merci-je-prefere-les-pommes-rouges-pas-les-vertes', 'bright', 'French', 'Non merci, je préfère les pommes rouges, pas les vertes.', 'efe1fc6db4f565d7e261f16d412835f1e77956a8abb0c38b8774deb31a08c225'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-044-non-merci-je-prefere-les-pommes-rouges-pas-les-vertes', 'bright', 'German', 'Nein danke, ich bevorzuge die roten Äpfel, nicht die grünen.', 'efe1fc6db4f565d7e261f16d412835f1e77956a8abb0c38b8774deb31a08c225'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-044-non-merci-je-prefere-les-pommes-rouges-pas-les-vertes', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Tidak terima kasih, saya lebih suka apel merah, bukan yang hijau.', 'efe1fc6db4f565d7e261f16d412835f1e77956a8abb0c38b8774deb31a08c225'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-044-non-merci-je-prefere-les-pommes-rouges-pas-les-vertes', 'bright', 'Italian', 'No grazie, preferisco le mele rosse, non quelle verdi.', 'efe1fc6db4f565d7e261f16d412835f1e77956a8abb0c38b8774deb31a08c225'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-044-non-merci-je-prefere-les-pommes-rouges-pas-les-vertes', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'いいえ、結構です。赤いリンゴの方が好きです。青いリンゴは嫌です。', 'efe1fc6db4f565d7e261f16d412835f1e77956a8abb0c38b8774deb31a08c225'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-044-non-merci-je-prefere-les-pommes-rouges-pas-les-vertes', 'bright', 'Korean', '아니요, 감사합니다. 녹색 사과 말고 붉은 사과를 원해요.', 'efe1fc6db4f565d7e261f16d412835f1e77956a8abb0c38b8774deb31a08c225'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-044-non-merci-je-prefere-les-pommes-rouges-pas-les-vertes', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Nie dziękuję, wolę czerwone jabłka, nie zielone.', 'efe1fc6db4f565d7e261f16d412835f1e77956a8abb0c38b8774deb31a08c225'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-044-non-merci-je-prefere-les-pommes-rouges-pas-les-vertes', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Não obrigado, prefiro as maçãs vermelhas, não as verdes.', 'efe1fc6db4f565d7e261f16d412835f1e77956a8abb0c38b8774deb31a08c225'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-044-non-merci-je-prefere-les-pommes-rouges-pas-les-vertes', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Нет, спасибо, я предпочитаю красные яблоки, а не зеленые.', 'efe1fc6db4f565d7e261f16d412835f1e77956a8abb0c38b8774deb31a08c225'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-044-non-merci-je-prefere-les-pommes-rouges-pas-les-vertes', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'No, gracias, prefiero las manzanas rojas, no las verdes.', 'efe1fc6db4f565d7e261f16d412835f1e77956a8abb0c38b8774deb31a08c225'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-045-excusez-moi-il-y-a-trop-de-bruit-vous-pouvez-me-changer-de-chambre', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa ko, saba kaayo. Mahimo ba nimo akong ibalhin sa laing lawak?', 'ecc10bcdad7d8fbe4990e63673dd221b066572721f7397b17271f9fc0fd7f18e'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-045-excusez-moi-il-y-a-trop-de-bruit-vous-pouvez-me-changer-de-chambre', 'bright', 'English', 'Excuse me, there is too much noise. Can you move me to another room?', 'ecc10bcdad7d8fbe4990e63673dd221b066572721f7397b17271f9fc0fd7f18e'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-045-excusez-moi-il-y-a-trop-de-bruit-vous-pouvez-me-changer-de-chambre', 'bright', 'French', 'Excusez-moi, il y a trop de bruit. Vous pouvez me changer de chambre ?', 'ecc10bcdad7d8fbe4990e63673dd221b066572721f7397b17271f9fc0fd7f18e'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-045-excusez-moi-il-y-a-trop-de-bruit-vous-pouvez-me-changer-de-chambre', 'bright', 'German', 'Entschuldigen Sie, es ist zu laut. Können Sie mir ein anderes Zimmer geben?', 'ecc10bcdad7d8fbe4990e63673dd221b066572721f7397b17271f9fc0fd7f18e'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-045-excusez-moi-il-y-a-trop-de-bruit-vous-pouvez-me-changer-de-chambre', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Permisi, terlalu berisik. Bisakah Anda memindahkan saya ke kamar lain?', 'ecc10bcdad7d8fbe4990e63673dd221b066572721f7397b17271f9fc0fd7f18e'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-045-excusez-moi-il-y-a-trop-de-bruit-vous-pouvez-me-changer-de-chambre', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi scusi, c''è troppo rumore. Può cambiarmi stanza?', 'ecc10bcdad7d8fbe4990e63673dd221b066572721f7397b17271f9fc0fd7f18e'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-045-excusez-moi-il-y-a-trop-de-bruit-vous-pouvez-me-changer-de-chambre', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すみません、うるさすぎます。別の部屋に移してもらえますか？', 'ecc10bcdad7d8fbe4990e63673dd221b066572721f7397b17271f9fc0fd7f18e'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-045-excusez-moi-il-y-a-trop-de-bruit-vous-pouvez-me-changer-de-chambre', 'bright', 'Korean', '실례합니다, 너무 시끄러워요. 다른 방으로 옮겨 주실 수 있나요?', 'ecc10bcdad7d8fbe4990e63673dd221b066572721f7397b17271f9fc0fd7f18e'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-045-excusez-moi-il-y-a-trop-de-bruit-vous-pouvez-me-changer-de-chambre', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, jest za głośno. Czy może mnie Pan przenieść do innego pokoju?', 'ecc10bcdad7d8fbe4990e63673dd221b066572721f7397b17271f9fc0fd7f18e'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-045-excusez-moi-il-y-a-trop-de-bruit-vous-pouvez-me-changer-de-chambre', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Com licença, há muito barulho. Você pode me mudar para outro quarto?', 'ecc10bcdad7d8fbe4990e63673dd221b066572721f7397b17271f9fc0fd7f18e'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-045-excusez-moi-il-y-a-trop-de-bruit-vous-pouvez-me-changer-de-chambre', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, слишком шумно. Вы можете переселить меня в другую комнату?', 'ecc10bcdad7d8fbe4990e63673dd221b066572721f7397b17271f9fc0fd7f18e'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-045-excusez-moi-il-y-a-trop-de-bruit-vous-pouvez-me-changer-de-chambre', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Disculpe, hay demasiado ruido. ¿Puede cambiarme de habitación?', 'ecc10bcdad7d8fbe4990e63673dd221b066572721f7397b17271f9fc0fd7f18e'),
  ('french-a2-practical-5', 'french-a2-practical-5-046-non-merci-je-voudrais-seulement-ceci-sil-vous-plait', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Dili salamat, gusto unta nako kini lang, palihog.', '710fd4ac6c917d93b8435b48d6459878d1ff26206141f801f6fe63549fe3335a'),
