  ('french-a2-practical-9', 'french-a2-practical-9-081-la-douche-ne-marche-pas-jai-appele-la-reception-pouvez-vous-envoyer-quelquun', 'bright', 'Italian', 'La doccia non funziona. Ho chiamato la reception. Potete mandare qualcuno?', 'eef761d7f5beb1e7674a62e7f9dff6225ee9f4ba78ccb59be2a3b1171d8bfb1a'),
  ('french-a2-practical-9', 'french-a2-practical-9-081-la-douche-ne-marche-pas-jai-appele-la-reception-pouvez-vous-envoyer-quelquun', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'シャワーが機能しません。受付に電話しました。誰か送ってもらえますか？', 'eef761d7f5beb1e7674a62e7f9dff6225ee9f4ba78ccb59be2a3b1171d8bfb1a'),
  ('french-a2-practical-9', 'french-a2-practical-9-081-la-douche-ne-marche-pas-jai-appele-la-reception-pouvez-vous-envoyer-quelquun', 'bright', 'Korean', '샤워기가 작동하지 않습니다. 리셉션에 전화했습니다. 사람을 보내주실 수 있나요?', 'eef761d7f5beb1e7674a62e7f9dff6225ee9f4ba78ccb59be2a3b1171d8bfb1a'),
