  ('french-a2-practical-9', 'french-a2-practical-9-082-jai-commande-une-soupe-mais-elle-nest-pas-encore-la-pouvez-vous-verifier', 'bright', 'Korean', '수프를 주문했는데 아직 나오지 않았습니다. 확인해 주시겠어요?', '45196c5ca0ad180b363ebefc47acbef6af880b59de47236eff065c8385006bb7'),
