  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-001-seperti-biasa-kopi-susu', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Oo, ang naandan, usa ka kape nga may gatas, palihog.', '442b1d8e4806f1ccf92ae2952a06990a38fd8c62f8251b118c5149f041976416'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-001-seperti-biasa-kopi-susu', 'bright', 'English', 'Yes, the usual, one milk coffee, please.', '442b1d8e4806f1ccf92ae2952a06990a38fd8c62f8251b118c5149f041976416'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-001-seperti-biasa-kopi-susu', 'bright', 'French', 'Oui, l''habituel, un café au lait, s''il vous plaît.', '442b1d8e4806f1ccf92ae2952a06990a38fd8c62f8251b118c5149f041976416'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-001-seperti-biasa-kopi-susu', 'bright', 'German', 'Ja, wie üblich einen Milchkaffee, bitte.', '442b1d8e4806f1ccf92ae2952a06990a38fd8c62f8251b118c5149f041976416'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-001-seperti-biasa-kopi-susu', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Ya, seperti biasa, satu kopi susu, Bu.', '442b1d8e4806f1ccf92ae2952a06990a38fd8c62f8251b118c5149f041976416'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-001-seperti-biasa-kopi-susu', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Sì, il solito, un caffè latte, per favore.', '442b1d8e4806f1ccf92ae2952a06990a38fd8c62f8251b118c5149f041976416'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-001-seperti-biasa-kopi-susu', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'はい、いつものミルクコーヒーを一つお願いします。', '442b1d8e4806f1ccf92ae2952a06990a38fd8c62f8251b118c5149f041976416'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-001-seperti-biasa-kopi-susu', 'bright', 'Korean', '네, 평소처럼 우유 커피 한 잔 주세요, 부인.', '442b1d8e4806f1ccf92ae2952a06990a38fd8c62f8251b118c5149f041976416'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-001-seperti-biasa-kopi-susu', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Tak, jak zwykle, jedna kawa z mlekiem, proszę.', '442b1d8e4806f1ccf92ae2952a06990a38fd8c62f8251b118c5149f041976416'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-001-seperti-biasa-kopi-susu', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Sim, o de sempre, um café com leite, por favor.', '442b1d8e4806f1ccf92ae2952a06990a38fd8c62f8251b118c5149f041976416'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-001-seperti-biasa-kopi-susu', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Да, как обычно, один молочный кофе, пожалуйста.', '442b1d8e4806f1ccf92ae2952a06990a38fd8c62f8251b118c5149f041976416'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-001-seperti-biasa-kopi-susu', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Sí, lo de siempre, un café con leche, por favor.', '442b1d8e4806f1ccf92ae2952a06990a38fd8c62f8251b118c5149f041976416'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-002-kopi-susu-dibungkus', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Ang kape nga may gatas i-takeout lang, palihug. Pila tanan ang bayranan?', 'd29fcfa9bb34f7c8d84d82271ac68ca9ad02c9393721aa3fdad7be1247059c94'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-002-kopi-susu-dibungkus', 'bright', 'English', 'The milk coffee to go, please. How much is everything altogether?', 'd29fcfa9bb34f7c8d84d82271ac68ca9ad02c9393721aa3fdad7be1247059c94'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-002-kopi-susu-dibungkus', 'bright', 'French', 'Le café au lait à emporter, s''il vous plaît. Combien le tout ?', 'd29fcfa9bb34f7c8d84d82271ac68ca9ad02c9393721aa3fdad7be1247059c94'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-002-kopi-susu-dibungkus', 'bright', 'German', 'Den Milchkaffee bitte zum Mitnehmen. Wie viel kostet alles zusammen?', 'd29fcfa9bb34f7c8d84d82271ac68ca9ad02c9393721aa3fdad7be1247059c94'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-002-kopi-susu-dibungkus', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Tolong kopi susunya dibungkus, Bu. Berapa semuanya?', 'd29fcfa9bb34f7c8d84d82271ac68ca9ad02c9393721aa3fdad7be1247059c94'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-002-kopi-susu-dibungkus', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Il caffè latte da asporto, per favore. Quanto viene tutto in totale?', 'd29fcfa9bb34f7c8d84d82271ac68ca9ad02c9393721aa3fdad7be1247059c94'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-002-kopi-susu-dibungkus', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'ミルクコーヒーをテイクアウトでお願いします。全部でいくらですか？', 'd29fcfa9bb34f7c8d84d82271ac68ca9ad02c9393721aa3fdad7be1247059c94'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-002-kopi-susu-dibungkus', 'bright', 'Korean', '커피 우유 테이크아웃 해주세요. 전부 얼마인가요?', 'd29fcfa9bb34f7c8d84d82271ac68ca9ad02c9393721aa3fdad7be1247059c94'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-002-kopi-susu-dibungkus', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Poproszę kawę z mlekiem na wynos. Ile to wszystko razem?', 'd29fcfa9bb34f7c8d84d82271ac68ca9ad02c9393721aa3fdad7be1247059c94'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-002-kopi-susu-dibungkus', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'O café com leite para levar, por favor. Quanto fica tudo junto?', 'd29fcfa9bb34f7c8d84d82271ac68ca9ad02c9393721aa3fdad7be1247059c94'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-002-kopi-susu-dibungkus', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Кофе с молоком навынос, пожалуйста. Сколько всего?', 'd29fcfa9bb34f7c8d84d82271ac68ca9ad02c9393721aa3fdad7be1247059c94'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-002-kopi-susu-dibungkus', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'El café con leche para llevar, por favor. ¿Cuánto es todo junto?', 'd29fcfa9bb34f7c8d84d82271ac68ca9ad02c9393721aa3fdad7be1247059c94'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-003-mencari-sim-dan-pulsa', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa, nangita ko og SIM card ug load sa telepono. Naa ba mo ana, Sir?', '77ed341cfea49ebb41740765e05871e91c446efb0234b790e0682f4a3e9bce78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-003-mencari-sim-dan-pulsa', 'bright', 'English', 'Excuse me, I am looking for a SIM card and phone credit. Do you carry both?', '77ed341cfea49ebb41740765e05871e91c446efb0234b790e0682f4a3e9bce78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-003-mencari-sim-dan-pulsa', 'bright', 'French', 'Excusez-moi, je cherche une carte SIM et du crédit téléphonique. Avez-vous les deux ?', '77ed341cfea49ebb41740765e05871e91c446efb0234b790e0682f4a3e9bce78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-003-mencari-sim-dan-pulsa', 'bright', 'German', 'Entschuldigen Sie, ich suche eine SIM-Karte und Guthaben. Führen Sie beides?', '77ed341cfea49ebb41740765e05871e91c446efb0234b790e0682f4a3e9bce78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-003-mencari-sim-dan-pulsa', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Permisi, saya cari kartu SIM dan pulsa. Ada, Pak?', '77ed341cfea49ebb41740765e05871e91c446efb0234b790e0682f4a3e9bce78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-003-mencari-sim-dan-pulsa', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi scusi, sto cercando una SIM card e credito telefonico. Avete entrambi?', '77ed341cfea49ebb41740765e05871e91c446efb0234b790e0682f4a3e9bce78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-003-mencari-sim-dan-pulsa', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すみません、SIMカードと電話代を探しています。両方とも扱っていますか？', '77ed341cfea49ebb41740765e05871e91c446efb0234b790e0682f4a3e9bce78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-003-mencari-sim-dan-pulsa', 'bright', 'Korean', '실례합니다, SIM 카드와 휴대폰 충전기를 찾고 있습니다. 둘 다 가지고 계신가요?', '77ed341cfea49ebb41740765e05871e91c446efb0234b790e0682f4a3e9bce78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-003-mencari-sim-dan-pulsa', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, szukam karty SIM i doładowania telefonu. Czy macie Państwo oba?', '77ed341cfea49ebb41740765e05871e91c446efb0234b790e0682f4a3e9bce78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-003-mencari-sim-dan-pulsa', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Com licença, estou procurando um cartão SIM e crédito para celular. Vocês têm ambos?', '77ed341cfea49ebb41740765e05871e91c446efb0234b790e0682f4a3e9bce78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-003-mencari-sim-dan-pulsa', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, я ищу SIM-карту и пополнение счета. У вас есть оба?', '77ed341cfea49ebb41740765e05871e91c446efb0234b790e0682f4a3e9bce78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-003-mencari-sim-dan-pulsa', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Disculpe, busco una tarjeta SIM y crédito para el teléfono. ¿Tienen ambos?', '77ed341cfea49ebb41740765e05871e91c446efb0234b790e0682f4a3e9bce78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-004-jalan-kaki-berapa-menit', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Sir, pila ka minuto ang lakawon gikan dinhi?', '484c85f80e295a46c4fc52d763acb9e75cf4a85bfe580b1db1ac7dc2338263c8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-004-jalan-kaki-berapa-menit', 'bright', 'English', 'Sir, how many minutes is it on foot from here?', '484c85f80e295a46c4fc52d763acb9e75cf4a85bfe580b1db1ac7dc2338263c8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-004-jalan-kaki-berapa-menit', 'bright', 'French', 'Monsieur, combien de minutes à pied d''ici ?', '484c85f80e295a46c4fc52d763acb9e75cf4a85bfe580b1db1ac7dc2338263c8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-004-jalan-kaki-berapa-menit', 'bright', 'German', 'Wie viele Minuten sind es von hier zu Fuß?', '484c85f80e295a46c4fc52d763acb9e75cf4a85bfe580b1db1ac7dc2338263c8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-004-jalan-kaki-berapa-menit', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Pak, dari sini jalan kaki berapa menit?', '484c85f80e295a46c4fc52d763acb9e75cf4a85bfe580b1db1ac7dc2338263c8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-004-jalan-kaki-berapa-menit', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Signore, quanti minuti a piedi da qui?', '484c85f80e295a46c4fc52d763acb9e75cf4a85bfe580b1db1ac7dc2338263c8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-004-jalan-kaki-berapa-menit', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'お客様、ここから徒歩何分ですか？', '484c85f80e295a46c4fc52d763acb9e75cf4a85bfe580b1db1ac7dc2338263c8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-004-jalan-kaki-berapa-menit', 'bright', 'Korean', '선생님, 여기서 걸어서 몇 분인가요?', '484c85f80e295a46c4fc52d763acb9e75cf4a85bfe580b1db1ac7dc2338263c8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-004-jalan-kaki-berapa-menit', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Panie, ile minut stąd pieszo?', '484c85f80e295a46c4fc52d763acb9e75cf4a85bfe580b1db1ac7dc2338263c8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-004-jalan-kaki-berapa-menit', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Senhor, quantos minutos leva a pé daqui?', '484c85f80e295a46c4fc52d763acb9e75cf4a85bfe580b1db1ac7dc2338263c8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-004-jalan-kaki-berapa-menit', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Сэр, сколько минут пешком отсюда?', '484c85f80e295a46c4fc52d763acb9e75cf4a85bfe580b1db1ac7dc2338263c8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-004-jalan-kaki-berapa-menit', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Señor, ¿cuántos minutos se tarda a pie desde aquí?', '484c85f80e295a46c4fc52d763acb9e75cf4a85bfe580b1db1ac7dc2338263c8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-005-boleh-minta-bon', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Oo, lami ang pagkaon. Pwede mangayo sa bayranan, Ma''am?', '8405c4a7c1860537459a356300b88347abf1668f7e024f521d06c8aabee9bb75'),
