  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-005-boleh-minta-bon', 'bright', 'French', 'Oui, c''est délicieux. Puis-je avoir l''addition, Madame ?', '8405c4a7c1860537459a356300b88347abf1668f7e024f521d06c8aabee9bb75'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-005-boleh-minta-bon', 'bright', 'German', 'Ja, das Essen schmeckt. Könnte ich bitte die Rechnung haben?', '8405c4a7c1860537459a356300b88347abf1668f7e024f521d06c8aabee9bb75'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-005-boleh-minta-bon', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Ya, makanannya enak. Boleh minta bonnya, Bu?', '8405c4a7c1860537459a356300b88347abf1668f7e024f521d06c8aabee9bb75'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-005-boleh-minta-bon', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Sì, il cibo è delizioso. Posso avere il conto, per favore?', '8405c4a7c1860537459a356300b88347abf1668f7e024f521d06c8aabee9bb75'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-005-boleh-minta-bon', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'はい、料理は美味しいです。お会計をお願いできますか？', '8405c4a7c1860537459a356300b88347abf1668f7e024f521d06c8aabee9bb75'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-005-boleh-minta-bon', 'bright', 'Korean', '네, 음식이 맛있습니다. 계산서 좀 주시겠어요, 부인?', '8405c4a7c1860537459a356300b88347abf1668f7e024f521d06c8aabee9bb75'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-005-boleh-minta-bon', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Tak, jedzenie jest pyszne. Czy mogę prosić o rachunek, proszę pani?', '8405c4a7c1860537459a356300b88347abf1668f7e024f521d06c8aabee9bb75'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-005-boleh-minta-bon', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Sim, a comida está deliciosa. Posso ter a conta, por favor?', '8405c4a7c1860537459a356300b88347abf1668f7e024f521d06c8aabee9bb75'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-005-boleh-minta-bon', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Да, еда вкусная. Можно счет, пожалуйста?', '8405c4a7c1860537459a356300b88347abf1668f7e024f521d06c8aabee9bb75'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-005-boleh-minta-bon', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Sí, la comida está deliciosa. ¿Me puede dar la cuenta, por favor?', '8405c4a7c1860537459a356300b88347abf1668f7e024f521d06c8aabee9bb75'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-006-reservasi-atas-nama-martin', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa, duna koy reservation ubos sa ngalan nga Martin, Ma''am.', 'd71ecdd071b52d30cb197abad455bce4f4e1c2f25de619970881c91a635e635d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-006-reservasi-atas-nama-martin', 'bright', 'English', 'Excuse me, I have a reservation under the name Martin, ma’am.', 'd71ecdd071b52d30cb197abad455bce4f4e1c2f25de619970881c91a635e635d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-006-reservasi-atas-nama-martin', 'bright', 'French', 'Excusez-moi, j''ai une réservation au nom de Martin, Madame.', 'd71ecdd071b52d30cb197abad455bce4f4e1c2f25de619970881c91a635e635d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-006-reservasi-atas-nama-martin', 'bright', 'German', 'Entschuldigen Sie, ich habe eine Reservierung auf den Namen Martin.', 'd71ecdd071b52d30cb197abad455bce4f4e1c2f25de619970881c91a635e635d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-006-reservasi-atas-nama-martin', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Permisi, saya ada reservasi atas nama Martin, Bu.', 'd71ecdd071b52d30cb197abad455bce4f4e1c2f25de619970881c91a635e635d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-006-reservasi-atas-nama-martin', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi scusi, ho una prenotazione a nome Martin, signora.', 'd71ecdd071b52d30cb197abad455bce4f4e1c2f25de619970881c91a635e635d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-006-reservasi-atas-nama-martin', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すみません、マーティンという名前で予約しています。', 'd71ecdd071b52d30cb197abad455bce4f4e1c2f25de619970881c91a635e635d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-006-reservasi-atas-nama-martin', 'bright', 'Korean', '실례합니다, Martin이라는 이름으로 예약했습니다, 부인.', 'd71ecdd071b52d30cb197abad455bce4f4e1c2f25de619970881c91a635e635d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-006-reservasi-atas-nama-martin', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, mam rezerwację na nazwisko Martin, proszę pani.', 'd71ecdd071b52d30cb197abad455bce4f4e1c2f25de619970881c91a635e635d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-006-reservasi-atas-nama-martin', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Com licença, tenho uma reserva em nome de Martin, senhora.', 'd71ecdd071b52d30cb197abad455bce4f4e1c2f25de619970881c91a635e635d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-006-reservasi-atas-nama-martin', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, у меня бронирование на имя Мартин, мадам.', 'd71ecdd071b52d30cb197abad455bce4f4e1c2f25de619970881c91a635e635d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-006-reservasi-atas-nama-martin', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Disculpe, tengo una reserva a nombre de Martin, señora.', 'd71ecdd071b52d30cb197abad455bce4f4e1c2f25de619970881c91a635e635d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-007-jadi-berapa-semuanya', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Wala na, ma’am. So, pila man ang tanan?', 'fa20b8364ebf064c4a8ca8c3e28f6f66f2182ed3d2fa764c1a4325fa09f8b713'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-007-jadi-berapa-semuanya', 'bright', 'English', 'Nothing else, ma’am. So, how much is everything?', 'fa20b8364ebf064c4a8ca8c3e28f6f66f2182ed3d2fa764c1a4325fa09f8b713'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-007-jadi-berapa-semuanya', 'bright', 'French', 'Rien d''autre, Madame. Alors, combien le tout ?', 'fa20b8364ebf064c4a8ca8c3e28f6f66f2182ed3d2fa764c1a4325fa09f8b713'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-007-jadi-berapa-semuanya', 'bright', 'German', 'Sonst nichts, danke. Wie viel kostet dann alles zusammen?', 'fa20b8364ebf064c4a8ca8c3e28f6f66f2182ed3d2fa764c1a4325fa09f8b713'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-007-jadi-berapa-semuanya', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Tidak ada lagi, Bu. Jadi, berapa semuanya?', 'fa20b8364ebf064c4a8ca8c3e28f6f66f2182ed3d2fa764c1a4325fa09f8b713'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-007-jadi-berapa-semuanya', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Nient''altro, signora. Quindi, quanto viene tutto?', 'fa20b8364ebf064c4a8ca8c3e28f6f66f2182ed3d2fa764c1a4325fa09f8b713'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-007-jadi-berapa-semuanya', 'bright', 'Japanese', '他に何もありません。それで、全部でいくらですか？', 'fa20b8364ebf064c4a8ca8c3e28f6f66f2182ed3d2fa764c1a4325fa09f8b713'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-007-jadi-berapa-semuanya', 'bright', 'Korean', '더 이상 없습니다, 부인. 그럼, 전부 얼마인가요?', 'fa20b8364ebf064c4a8ca8c3e28f6f66f2182ed3d2fa764c1a4325fa09f8b713'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-007-jadi-berapa-semuanya', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Nic więcej, proszę pani. Więc, ile to wszystko razem?', 'fa20b8364ebf064c4a8ca8c3e28f6f66f2182ed3d2fa764c1a4325fa09f8b713'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-007-jadi-berapa-semuanya', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Nada mais, senhora. Então, quanto fica tudo?', 'fa20b8364ebf064c4a8ca8c3e28f6f66f2182ed3d2fa764c1a4325fa09f8b713'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-007-jadi-berapa-semuanya', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Ничего больше, мадам. Итак, сколько всего?', 'fa20b8364ebf064c4a8ca8c3e28f6f66f2182ed3d2fa764c1a4325fa09f8b713'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-007-jadi-berapa-semuanya', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Nada más, señora. Entonces, ¿cuánto es todo?', 'fa20b8364ebf064c4a8ca8c3e28f6f66f2182ed3d2fa764c1a4325fa09f8b713'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-008-halte-di-ujung-jalan', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Ang hunonganan sa bus anaa sa tumoy niini nga dalan, sir.', '8f2286764196e30de8b3f107ebabcd8bd122bac1f722e01415474394f80cc872'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-008-halte-di-ujung-jalan', 'bright', 'English', 'The bus stop is at the end of this street, sir.', '8f2286764196e30de8b3f107ebabcd8bd122bac1f722e01415474394f80cc872'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-008-halte-di-ujung-jalan', 'bright', 'French', 'L''arrêt de bus est au bout de cette rue, Monsieur.', '8f2286764196e30de8b3f107ebabcd8bd122bac1f722e01415474394f80cc872'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-008-halte-di-ujung-jalan', 'bright', 'German', 'Die Bushaltestelle ist am Ende dieser Straße.', '8f2286764196e30de8b3f107ebabcd8bd122bac1f722e01415474394f80cc872'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-008-halte-di-ujung-jalan', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Halte bus ada di ujung jalan ini, Pak.', '8f2286764196e30de8b3f107ebabcd8bd122bac1f722e01415474394f80cc872'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-008-halte-di-ujung-jalan', 'bright', 'Italian', 'La fermata dell''autobus è alla fine di questa strada, signore.', '8f2286764196e30de8b3f107ebabcd8bd122bac1f722e01415474394f80cc872'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-008-halte-di-ujung-jalan', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'バス停はここの通りの終わりにあります。', '8f2286764196e30de8b3f107ebabcd8bd122bac1f722e01415474394f80cc872'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-008-halte-di-ujung-jalan', 'bright', 'Korean', '버스 정류장은 이 길 끝에 있습니다, 선생님.', '8f2286764196e30de8b3f107ebabcd8bd122bac1f722e01415474394f80cc872'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-008-halte-di-ujung-jalan', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przystanek autobusowy jest na końcu tej ulicy, proszę pana.', '8f2286764196e30de8b3f107ebabcd8bd122bac1f722e01415474394f80cc872'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-008-halte-di-ujung-jalan', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'O ponto de ônibus fica no final desta rua, senhor.', '8f2286764196e30de8b3f107ebabcd8bd122bac1f722e01415474394f80cc872'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-008-halte-di-ujung-jalan', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Автобусная остановка находится в конце этой улицы, сэр.', '8f2286764196e30de8b3f107ebabcd8bd122bac1f722e01415474394f80cc872'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-008-halte-di-ujung-jalan', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'La parada de autobús está al final de esta calle, señor.', '8f2286764196e30de8b3f107ebabcd8bd122bac1f722e01415474394f80cc872'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-009-setengah-kilo-jeruk', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Tunga sa kilo nga orange, ma’am. Duha usab ka mangga.', 'ba21a7c10768b5a15f4d8a0d3c808420ce649507d218cd08c9aceb4309b17ae3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-009-setengah-kilo-jeruk', 'bright', 'English', 'Half a kilo of oranges, ma’am. Two mangoes as well.', 'ba21a7c10768b5a15f4d8a0d3c808420ce649507d218cd08c9aceb4309b17ae3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-009-setengah-kilo-jeruk', 'bright', 'French', 'Un demi-kilo d''oranges, Madame. Deux mangues aussi.', 'ba21a7c10768b5a15f4d8a0d3c808420ce649507d218cd08c9aceb4309b17ae3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-009-setengah-kilo-jeruk', 'bright', 'German', 'Ein halbes Kilo Orangen, bitte. Dazu zwei Mangos.', 'ba21a7c10768b5a15f4d8a0d3c808420ce649507d218cd08c9aceb4309b17ae3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-009-setengah-kilo-jeruk', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Setengah kilo jeruk, Bu. Dua mangga juga.', 'ba21a7c10768b5a15f4d8a0d3c808420ce649507d218cd08c9aceb4309b17ae3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-009-setengah-kilo-jeruk', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mezzo chilo di arance, signora. Due manghi anche.', 'ba21a7c10768b5a15f4d8a0d3c808420ce649507d218cd08c9aceb4309b17ae3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-009-setengah-kilo-jeruk', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'オレンジを半キロ、奥様。マンゴーも2つ。', 'ba21a7c10768b5a15f4d8a0d3c808420ce649507d218cd08c9aceb4309b17ae3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-009-setengah-kilo-jeruk', 'bright', 'Korean', '오렌지 반 킬로그램 주세요, 부인. 망고 두 개도요.', 'ba21a7c10768b5a15f4d8a0d3c808420ce649507d218cd08c9aceb4309b17ae3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-009-setengah-kilo-jeruk', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Pół kilo pomarańczy, proszę pani. Dwa mango też.', 'ba21a7c10768b5a15f4d8a0d3c808420ce649507d218cd08c9aceb4309b17ae3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-009-setengah-kilo-jeruk', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Meio quilo de laranjas, senhora. Duas mangas também.', 'ba21a7c10768b5a15f4d8a0d3c808420ce649507d218cd08c9aceb4309b17ae3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-009-setengah-kilo-jeruk', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Половина килограмма апельсинов, мадам. Два манго тоже.', 'ba21a7c10768b5a15f4d8a0d3c808420ce649507d218cd08c9aceb4309b17ae3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-009-setengah-kilo-jeruk', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Medio kilo de naranjas, señora. Dos mangos también.', 'ba21a7c10768b5a15f4d8a0d3c808420ce649507d218cd08c9aceb4309b17ae3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-010-mulai-kenal-daerah', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Maayo, sir. Nagsugod na ko nga makaila niini nga lugar.', 'b64d7ffaea9b16e2bd7089f2c4f7a25ca1eb73773bf214b1b27c5993d206c489'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-010-mulai-kenal-daerah', 'bright', 'English', 'Good, sir. I am starting to know this area.', 'b64d7ffaea9b16e2bd7089f2c4f7a25ca1eb73773bf214b1b27c5993d206c489'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-010-mulai-kenal-daerah', 'bright', 'French', 'Bien, monsieur. Je commence à connaître ce quartier.', 'b64d7ffaea9b16e2bd7089f2c4f7a25ca1eb73773bf214b1b27c5993d206c489'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-010-mulai-kenal-daerah', 'bright', 'German', 'Gut, danke. Ich lerne diese Gegend langsam kennen.', 'b64d7ffaea9b16e2bd7089f2c4f7a25ca1eb73773bf214b1b27c5993d206c489'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-010-mulai-kenal-daerah', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Baik, Pak. Saya mulai kenal daerah ini.', 'b64d7ffaea9b16e2bd7089f2c4f7a25ca1eb73773bf214b1b27c5993d206c489'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-010-mulai-kenal-daerah', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Bene, signore. Sto iniziando a conoscere questa zona.', 'b64d7ffaea9b16e2bd7089f2c4f7a25ca1eb73773bf214b1b27c5993d206c489'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-010-mulai-kenal-daerah', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'はい、お客様。この辺りに詳しくなってきました。', 'b64d7ffaea9b16e2bd7089f2c4f7a25ca1eb73773bf214b1b27c5993d206c489'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-010-mulai-kenal-daerah', 'bright', 'Korean', '네, 선생님. 이 지역을 알기 시작했어요.', 'b64d7ffaea9b16e2bd7089f2c4f7a25ca1eb73773bf214b1b27c5993d206c489'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-010-mulai-kenal-daerah', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Dobrze, proszę pana. Zaczynam znać tę okolicę.', 'b64d7ffaea9b16e2bd7089f2c4f7a25ca1eb73773bf214b1b27c5993d206c489'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-010-mulai-kenal-daerah', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Bom, senhor. Estou começando a conhecer esta área.', 'b64d7ffaea9b16e2bd7089f2c4f7a25ca1eb73773bf214b1b27c5993d206c489'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-010-mulai-kenal-daerah', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Хорошо, сэр. Я начинаю узнавать этот район.', 'b64d7ffaea9b16e2bd7089f2c4f7a25ca1eb73773bf214b1b27c5993d206c489'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-1', 'indonesian-a2-practical-1-010-mulai-kenal-daerah', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Bien, señor. Estoy empezando a conocer esta zona.', 'b64d7ffaea9b16e2bd7089f2c4f7a25ca1eb73773bf214b1b27c5993d206c489'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-091-dari-jerman-tinggal-di-sini', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Gikan ko sa Germany ug nagpuyo na dinhi karon. Taga-dinhi ka ba nga siyudad?', '924c856ff501446539a490b2765a453f59694bb995fd4811dd9b40ac12e4d9a5'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-091-dari-jerman-tinggal-di-sini', 'bright', 'English', 'I am from Germany and live here now. Are you from this city?', '924c856ff501446539a490b2765a453f59694bb995fd4811dd9b40ac12e4d9a5'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-091-dari-jerman-tinggal-di-sini', 'bright', 'French', 'Je viens d''Allemagne et je vis ici maintenant. Es-tu de cette ville ?', '924c856ff501446539a490b2765a453f59694bb995fd4811dd9b40ac12e4d9a5'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-091-dari-jerman-tinggal-di-sini', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich komme aus Deutschland und wohne jetzt hier. Kommst du aus dieser Stadt?', '924c856ff501446539a490b2765a453f59694bb995fd4811dd9b40ac12e4d9a5'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-091-dari-jerman-tinggal-di-sini', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya dari Jerman dan sekarang tinggal di sini. Kamu dari kota ini?', '924c856ff501446539a490b2765a453f59694bb995fd4811dd9b40ac12e4d9a5'),
