  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-097-bekerja-pagi-belajar-malam', 'bright', 'English', 'I work in the morning and study Indonesian at night. How about you?', 'ac986330d7c4c865653438a4ef3487298a0d905d6eccfe36b9337b83ad5f66c6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-097-bekerja-pagi-belajar-malam', 'bright', 'French', 'Je travaille le matin et j''étudie l''indonésien le soir. Et toi ?', 'ac986330d7c4c865653438a4ef3487298a0d905d6eccfe36b9337b83ad5f66c6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-097-bekerja-pagi-belajar-malam', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich arbeite morgens und lerne abends Indonesisch. Und du?', 'ac986330d7c4c865653438a4ef3487298a0d905d6eccfe36b9337b83ad5f66c6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-097-bekerja-pagi-belajar-malam', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya bekerja pagi hari dan belajar bahasa Indonesia malam hari. Kamu juga?', 'ac986330d7c4c865653438a4ef3487298a0d905d6eccfe36b9337b83ad5f66c6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-097-bekerja-pagi-belajar-malam', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Lavoro la mattina e studio l''indonesiano la sera. E tu?', 'ac986330d7c4c865653438a4ef3487298a0d905d6eccfe36b9337b83ad5f66c6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-097-bekerja-pagi-belajar-malam', 'bright', 'Japanese', '私は午前中に働き、夜にインドネシア語を勉強します。あなたは？', 'ac986330d7c4c865653438a4ef3487298a0d905d6eccfe36b9337b83ad5f66c6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-097-bekerja-pagi-belajar-malam', 'bright', 'Korean', '저는 아침에 일하고 밤에 인도네시아어를 공부합니다. 당신은요?', 'ac986330d7c4c865653438a4ef3487298a0d905d6eccfe36b9337b83ad5f66c6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-097-bekerja-pagi-belajar-malam', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Pracuję rano i uczę się indonezyjskiego wieczorem. A Ty?', 'ac986330d7c4c865653438a4ef3487298a0d905d6eccfe36b9337b83ad5f66c6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-097-bekerja-pagi-belajar-malam', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu trabalho de manhã e estudo indonésio à noite. E você?', 'ac986330d7c4c865653438a4ef3487298a0d905d6eccfe36b9337b83ad5f66c6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-097-bekerja-pagi-belajar-malam', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я работаю утром и учу индонезийский вечером. А ты?', 'ac986330d7c4c865653438a4ef3487298a0d905d6eccfe36b9337b83ad5f66c6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-097-bekerja-pagi-belajar-malam', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Trabajo por la mañana y estudio indonesio por la noche. ¿Y tú?', 'ac986330d7c4c865653438a4ef3487298a0d905d6eccfe36b9337b83ad5f66c6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-098-hampir-mengerti-bicara-pelan', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nakasabot ko sa halos tanan, pero hinay pa gihapon ko mosulti. Nakasabot ba ka nako?', '14b8d7d96ff2ebad6c222ed4479aaa1ca2eb7fd1eb489198fcc0e37a10d409dc'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-098-hampir-mengerti-bicara-pelan', 'bright', 'English', 'I understand almost everything, but I still speak slowly. Do you understand me?', '14b8d7d96ff2ebad6c222ed4479aaa1ca2eb7fd1eb489198fcc0e37a10d409dc'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-098-hampir-mengerti-bicara-pelan', 'bright', 'French', 'Je comprends presque tout, mais je parle encore lentement. Me comprends-tu ?', '14b8d7d96ff2ebad6c222ed4479aaa1ca2eb7fd1eb489198fcc0e37a10d409dc'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-098-hampir-mengerti-bicara-pelan', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich verstehe fast alles, aber ich spreche noch langsam. Verstehst du mich?', '14b8d7d96ff2ebad6c222ed4479aaa1ca2eb7fd1eb489198fcc0e37a10d409dc'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-098-hampir-mengerti-bicara-pelan', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya mengerti hampir semuanya, tetapi saya masih bicara pelan. Kamu mengerti?', '14b8d7d96ff2ebad6c222ed4479aaa1ca2eb7fd1eb489198fcc0e37a10d409dc'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-098-hampir-mengerti-bicara-pelan', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Capisco quasi tutto, ma parlo ancora lentamente. Mi capisci?', '14b8d7d96ff2ebad6c222ed4479aaa1ca2eb7fd1eb489198fcc0e37a10d409dc'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-098-hampir-mengerti-bicara-pelan', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'ほとんどすべてを理解していますが、まだゆっくり話します。私の言っていることはわかりますか？', '14b8d7d96ff2ebad6c222ed4479aaa1ca2eb7fd1eb489198fcc0e37a10d409dc'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-098-hampir-mengerti-bicara-pelan', 'bright', 'Korean', '거의 모든 것을 이해하지만, 아직도 말하는 속도가 느립니다. 제 말을 이해하시겠어요?', '14b8d7d96ff2ebad6c222ed4479aaa1ca2eb7fd1eb489198fcc0e37a10d409dc'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-098-hampir-mengerti-bicara-pelan', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Rozumiem prawie wszystko, ale nadal mówię powoli. Czy mnie rozumiesz?', '14b8d7d96ff2ebad6c222ed4479aaa1ca2eb7fd1eb489198fcc0e37a10d409dc'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-098-hampir-mengerti-bicara-pelan', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu entendo quase tudo, mas ainda falo devagar. Você me entende?', '14b8d7d96ff2ebad6c222ed4479aaa1ca2eb7fd1eb489198fcc0e37a10d409dc'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-098-hampir-mengerti-bicara-pelan', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я понимаю почти всё, но все еще говорю медленно. Ты меня понимаешь?', '14b8d7d96ff2ebad6c222ed4479aaa1ca2eb7fd1eb489198fcc0e37a10d409dc'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-098-hampir-mengerti-bicara-pelan', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Entiendo casi todo, pero todavía hablo despacio. ¿Me entiendes?', '14b8d7d96ff2ebad6c222ed4479aaa1ca2eb7fd1eb489198fcc0e37a10d409dc'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-099-tahun-depan-datang-lagi', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Mobalik ko sa sunod tuig. Nalipay ba ka nga makadungog niini nga balita?', '57ef605fdb7c8d625e2e60f25cfaf2359848e8e395c4aa1ffb636e6bfa4ca435'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-099-tahun-depan-datang-lagi', 'bright', 'English', 'I am coming back next year. Are you happy to hear this news?', '57ef605fdb7c8d625e2e60f25cfaf2359848e8e395c4aa1ffb636e6bfa4ca435'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-099-tahun-depan-datang-lagi', 'bright', 'French', 'Je reviens l''année prochaine. Es-tu content(e) d''apprendre cette nouvelle ?', '57ef605fdb7c8d625e2e60f25cfaf2359848e8e395c4aa1ffb636e6bfa4ca435'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-099-tahun-depan-datang-lagi', 'bright', 'German', 'Nächstes Jahr komme ich wieder. Freust du dich über diese Nachricht?', '57ef605fdb7c8d625e2e60f25cfaf2359848e8e395c4aa1ffb636e6bfa4ca435'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-099-tahun-depan-datang-lagi', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Tahun depan saya datang lagi. Kamu senang mendengar kabar ini?', '57ef605fdb7c8d625e2e60f25cfaf2359848e8e395c4aa1ffb636e6bfa4ca435'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-099-tahun-depan-datang-lagi', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Torno l''anno prossimo. Sei felice di sentire questa notizia?', '57ef605fdb7c8d625e2e60f25cfaf2359848e8e395c4aa1ffb636e6bfa4ca435'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-099-tahun-depan-datang-lagi', 'bright', 'Japanese', '来年も来ます。この知らせを聞いて嬉しいですか？', '57ef605fdb7c8d625e2e60f25cfaf2359848e8e395c4aa1ffb636e6bfa4ca435'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-099-tahun-depan-datang-lagi', 'bright', 'Korean', '내년에 다시 올 거예요. 이 소식을 듣고 기쁘신가요?', '57ef605fdb7c8d625e2e60f25cfaf2359848e8e395c4aa1ffb636e6bfa4ca435'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-099-tahun-depan-datang-lagi', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Wracam w przyszłym roku. Cieszysz się na tę wiadomość?', '57ef605fdb7c8d625e2e60f25cfaf2359848e8e395c4aa1ffb636e6bfa4ca435'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-099-tahun-depan-datang-lagi', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu volto no ano que vem. Você fica feliz em ouvir esta notícia?', '57ef605fdb7c8d625e2e60f25cfaf2359848e8e395c4aa1ffb636e6bfa4ca435'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-099-tahun-depan-datang-lagi', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я вернусь в следующем году. Вы рады услышать эту новость?', '57ef605fdb7c8d625e2e60f25cfaf2359848e8e395c4aa1ffb636e6bfa4ca435'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-099-tahun-depan-datang-lagi', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Vuelvo el año que viene. ¿Te alegra oír esta noticia?', '57ef605fdb7c8d625e2e60f25cfaf2359848e8e395c4aa1ffb636e6bfa4ca435'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-100-terima-kasih-semua-cerita', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Salamat sa tanang mga istorya. Nakat-on na ko og daghan gikan nimo. Kita-kita ta puhon.', '9a1b7b3b8d4da12673d3b60e943d41533d37ccc107a04ebc5089012646a1ed40'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-100-terima-kasih-semua-cerita', 'bright', 'English', 'Thank you for all the stories. I have already learned a lot from you. See you.', '9a1b7b3b8d4da12673d3b60e943d41533d37ccc107a04ebc5089012646a1ed40'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-100-terima-kasih-semua-cerita', 'bright', 'French', 'Merci pour toutes ces histoires. J''ai déjà beaucoup appris de vous. À bientôt.', '9a1b7b3b8d4da12673d3b60e943d41533d37ccc107a04ebc5089012646a1ed40'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-100-terima-kasih-semua-cerita', 'bright', 'German', 'Danke für all die Geschichten. Ich habe schon viel von dir gelernt. Bis bald.', '9a1b7b3b8d4da12673d3b60e943d41533d37ccc107a04ebc5089012646a1ed40'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-100-terima-kasih-semua-cerita', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Terima kasih untuk semua cerita. Saya sudah belajar banyak dari kamu. Sampai jumpa.', '9a1b7b3b8d4da12673d3b60e943d41533d37ccc107a04ebc5089012646a1ed40'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-100-terima-kasih-semua-cerita', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Grazie per tutte le storie. Ho già imparato molto da te. Ci vediamo.', '9a1b7b3b8d4da12673d3b60e943d41533d37ccc107a04ebc5089012646a1ed40'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-100-terima-kasih-semua-cerita', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'お話を聞かせてくれてありがとう。あなたからたくさん学びました。またね。', '9a1b7b3b8d4da12673d3b60e943d41533d37ccc107a04ebc5089012646a1ed40'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-100-terima-kasih-semua-cerita', 'bright', 'Korean', '모든 이야기에 감사드립니다. 당신에게서 이미 많은 것을 배웠습니다. 또 봐요.', '9a1b7b3b8d4da12673d3b60e943d41533d37ccc107a04ebc5089012646a1ed40'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-100-terima-kasih-semua-cerita', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Dziękuję za wszystkie historie. Wiele się już od Ciebie nauczyłem. Do zobaczenia.', '9a1b7b3b8d4da12673d3b60e943d41533d37ccc107a04ebc5089012646a1ed40'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-100-terima-kasih-semua-cerita', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Obrigado por todas as histórias. Já aprendi muito com você. Até mais.', '9a1b7b3b8d4da12673d3b60e943d41533d37ccc107a04ebc5089012646a1ed40'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-100-terima-kasih-semua-cerita', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Спасибо за все истории. Я уже многому у вас научился. До свидания.', '9a1b7b3b8d4da12673d3b60e943d41533d37ccc107a04ebc5089012646a1ed40'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-10', 'indonesian-a2-practical-10-100-terima-kasih-semua-cerita', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Gracias por todas las historias. Ya he aprendido mucho de ti. Hasta luego.', '9a1b7b3b8d4da12673d3b60e943d41533d37ccc107a04ebc5089012646a1ed40'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-011-yang-ini-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Kini lang, ma’am, tungod kay mas ubos ang presyo.', '1f0342c4994683439579dd09069434fb0af2fa872a27e3ffacdd4d674c89c483'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-011-yang-ini-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'English', 'Just these, ma’am, because the price is lower.', '1f0342c4994683439579dd09069434fb0af2fa872a27e3ffacdd4d674c89c483'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-011-yang-ini-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'French', 'Juste ceux-ci, madame, parce que le prix est plus bas.', '1f0342c4994683439579dd09069434fb0af2fa872a27e3ffacdd4d674c89c483'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-011-yang-ini-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'German', 'Nur diese hier, bitte, weil der Preis günstiger ist.', '1f0342c4994683439579dd09069434fb0af2fa872a27e3ffacdd4d674c89c483'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-011-yang-ini-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Yang ini saja, Bu, karena harganya lebih murah.', '1f0342c4994683439579dd09069434fb0af2fa872a27e3ffacdd4d674c89c483'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-011-yang-ini-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Solo questi, signora, perché il prezzo è più basso.', '1f0342c4994683439579dd09069434fb0af2fa872a27e3ffacdd4d674c89c483'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-011-yang-ini-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'こちらでお願いします、奥様。値段が安いので。', '1f0342c4994683439579dd09069434fb0af2fa872a27e3ffacdd4d674c89c483'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-011-yang-ini-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Korean', '이것으로 주세요, 아주머니, 가격이 더 저렴하니까요.', '1f0342c4994683439579dd09069434fb0af2fa872a27e3ffacdd4d674c89c483'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-011-yang-ini-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Tylko te, proszę pani, bo cena jest niższa.', '1f0342c4994683439579dd09069434fb0af2fa872a27e3ffacdd4d674c89c483'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-011-yang-ini-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Só estes, senhora, porque o preço é mais baixo.', '1f0342c4994683439579dd09069434fb0af2fa872a27e3ffacdd4d674c89c483'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-011-yang-ini-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Только эти, мадам, потому что цена ниже.', '1f0342c4994683439579dd09069434fb0af2fa872a27e3ffacdd4d674c89c483'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-011-yang-ini-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Solo estos, señora, porque el precio es más bajo.', '1f0342c4994683439579dd09069434fb0af2fa872a27e3ffacdd4d674c89c483'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-012-es-teh-lebih-dingin', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Karon nagpili ko og iced tea, sir, tungod kay mas bugnaw kini.', 'f04e9d2d29240d0f7b41027f80fc7bb2748bbb57f9d545d68ad6abd3bab33a2b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-012-es-teh-lebih-dingin', 'bright', 'English', 'Today I choose iced tea, sir, because it is colder.', 'f04e9d2d29240d0f7b41027f80fc7bb2748bbb57f9d545d68ad6abd3bab33a2b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-012-es-teh-lebih-dingin', 'bright', 'French', 'Aujourd''hui, je choisis du thé glacé, monsieur, parce qu''il fait plus froid.', 'f04e9d2d29240d0f7b41027f80fc7bb2748bbb57f9d545d68ad6abd3bab33a2b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-012-es-teh-lebih-dingin', 'bright', 'German', 'Heute wähle ich Eistee, weil er kälter ist.', 'f04e9d2d29240d0f7b41027f80fc7bb2748bbb57f9d545d68ad6abd3bab33a2b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-012-es-teh-lebih-dingin', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Hari ini saya pilih es teh, Pak, karena lebih dingin.', 'f04e9d2d29240d0f7b41027f80fc7bb2748bbb57f9d545d68ad6abd3bab33a2b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-012-es-teh-lebih-dingin', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Oggi scelgo il tè freddo, signore, perché è più freddo.', 'f04e9d2d29240d0f7b41027f80fc7bb2748bbb57f9d545d68ad6abd3bab33a2b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-012-es-teh-lebih-dingin', 'bright', 'Japanese', '今日はアイスティーを選びます、お客様。冷たいので。', 'f04e9d2d29240d0f7b41027f80fc7bb2748bbb57f9d545d68ad6abd3bab33a2b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-012-es-teh-lebih-dingin', 'bright', 'Korean', '오늘은 아이스 티를 선택할게요, 선생님, 더 차가우니까요.', 'f04e9d2d29240d0f7b41027f80fc7bb2748bbb57f9d545d68ad6abd3bab33a2b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-012-es-teh-lebih-dingin', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Dziś wybieram mrożoną herbatę, proszę pana, bo jest zimniejsza.', 'f04e9d2d29240d0f7b41027f80fc7bb2748bbb57f9d545d68ad6abd3bab33a2b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-012-es-teh-lebih-dingin', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Hoje escolho chá gelado, senhor, porque está mais frio.', 'f04e9d2d29240d0f7b41027f80fc7bb2748bbb57f9d545d68ad6abd3bab33a2b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-012-es-teh-lebih-dingin', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Сегодня я выбираю холодный чай, сэр, потому что он холоднее.', 'f04e9d2d29240d0f7b41027f80fc7bb2748bbb57f9d545d68ad6abd3bab33a2b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-012-es-teh-lebih-dingin', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Hoy elijo té helado, señor, porque está más frío.', 'f04e9d2d29240d0f7b41027f80fc7bb2748bbb57f9d545d68ad6abd3bab33a2b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-013-baju-biru-lebih-pas', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Ma’am, gipili nako ang asul nga kamisad tungod kay mas haum ang gidak-on.', 'bcd7410d883c2332be3b3a2984f07cccce6a3627bcf7dbf706e5836e2aaaa9a7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-013-baju-biru-lebih-pas', 'bright', 'English', 'Ma’am, I choose the blue shirt because the size fits better.', 'bcd7410d883c2332be3b3a2984f07cccce6a3627bcf7dbf706e5836e2aaaa9a7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-013-baju-biru-lebih-pas', 'bright', 'French', 'Madame, je choisis la chemise bleue parce que la taille va mieux.', 'bcd7410d883c2332be3b3a2984f07cccce6a3627bcf7dbf706e5836e2aaaa9a7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-013-baju-biru-lebih-pas', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich wähle das blaue Hemd, weil die Größe besser passt.', 'bcd7410d883c2332be3b3a2984f07cccce6a3627bcf7dbf706e5836e2aaaa9a7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-013-baju-biru-lebih-pas', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Bu, saya pilih baju biru karena ukurannya lebih pas.', 'bcd7410d883c2332be3b3a2984f07cccce6a3627bcf7dbf706e5836e2aaaa9a7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-013-baju-biru-lebih-pas', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Signora, scelgo la camicia blu perché la taglia veste meglio.', 'bcd7410d883c2332be3b3a2984f07cccce6a3627bcf7dbf706e5836e2aaaa9a7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-013-baju-biru-lebih-pas', 'bright', 'Japanese', '奥様、青いシャツを選びます。サイズがより合うので。', 'bcd7410d883c2332be3b3a2984f07cccce6a3627bcf7dbf706e5836e2aaaa9a7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-013-baju-biru-lebih-pas', 'bright', 'Korean', '아주머니, 파란 셔츠를 고를게요. 사이즈가 더 잘 맞으니까요.', 'bcd7410d883c2332be3b3a2984f07cccce6a3627bcf7dbf706e5836e2aaaa9a7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-013-baju-biru-lebih-pas', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Proszę pani, wybieram niebieską koszulę, ponieważ rozmiar lepiej pasuje.', 'bcd7410d883c2332be3b3a2984f07cccce6a3627bcf7dbf706e5836e2aaaa9a7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-013-baju-biru-lebih-pas', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Senhora, eu escolho a camisa azul porque o tamanho veste melhor.', 'bcd7410d883c2332be3b3a2984f07cccce6a3627bcf7dbf706e5836e2aaaa9a7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-013-baju-biru-lebih-pas', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Мадам, я выбираю синюю рубашку, потому что размер лучше подходит.', 'bcd7410d883c2332be3b3a2984f07cccce6a3627bcf7dbf706e5836e2aaaa9a7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-013-baju-biru-lebih-pas', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Señora, elijo la camisa azul porque la talla queda mejor.', 'bcd7410d883c2332be3b3a2984f07cccce6a3627bcf7dbf706e5836e2aaaa9a7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-014-soto-lebih-ringan', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Ma’am, gipili nako ang soto tungod kay mas gaan kini ug dili halang.', '79fb1a7fbd9b72367069e7813945e4a40d76cfb58e963d33ef79e5c9d07af5ee'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-014-soto-lebih-ringan', 'bright', 'English', 'Ma’am, I choose soto because it is lighter and not spicy.', '79fb1a7fbd9b72367069e7813945e4a40d76cfb58e963d33ef79e5c9d07af5ee'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-014-soto-lebih-ringan', 'bright', 'French', 'Madame, je choisis le soto parce qu''il est plus léger et pas épicé.', '79fb1a7fbd9b72367069e7813945e4a40d76cfb58e963d33ef79e5c9d07af5ee'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-014-soto-lebih-ringan', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich wähle Soto, weil es leichter und nicht scharf ist.', '79fb1a7fbd9b72367069e7813945e4a40d76cfb58e963d33ef79e5c9d07af5ee'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-014-soto-lebih-ringan', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Bu, saya pilih soto karena lebih ringan dan tidak pedas.', '79fb1a7fbd9b72367069e7813945e4a40d76cfb58e963d33ef79e5c9d07af5ee'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-014-soto-lebih-ringan', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Signora, scelgo il soto perché è più leggero e non piccante.', '79fb1a7fbd9b72367069e7813945e4a40d76cfb58e963d33ef79e5c9d07af5ee'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-014-soto-lebih-ringan', 'bright', 'Japanese', '奥様、ソトを選びます。より軽く、辛くないので。', '79fb1a7fbd9b72367069e7813945e4a40d76cfb58e963d33ef79e5c9d07af5ee'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-014-soto-lebih-ringan', 'bright', 'Korean', '아주머니, 소토를 고를게요. 더 가볍고 맵지 않으니까요.', '79fb1a7fbd9b72367069e7813945e4a40d76cfb58e963d33ef79e5c9d07af5ee'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-014-soto-lebih-ringan', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Proszę pani, wybieram soto, ponieważ jest lżejsze i nie pikantne.', '79fb1a7fbd9b72367069e7813945e4a40d76cfb58e963d33ef79e5c9d07af5ee'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-014-soto-lebih-ringan', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Senhora, eu escolho soto porque é mais leve e não apimentado.', '79fb1a7fbd9b72367069e7813945e4a40d76cfb58e963d33ef79e5c9d07af5ee'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-014-soto-lebih-ringan', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Мадам, я выбираю сото, потому что оно легче и не острое.', '79fb1a7fbd9b72367069e7813945e4a40d76cfb58e963d33ef79e5c9d07af5ee'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-014-soto-lebih-ringan', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Señora, elijo soto porque es más ligero y no picante.', '79fb1a7fbd9b72367069e7813945e4a40d76cfb58e963d33ef79e5c9d07af5ee'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-015-roti-lebih-segar', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Kini lang, sir, kay mas presko ang pan karong adlawa.', 'aa84ad4bc73f8cf4b2e81101942439debc778ec1cdd392148ad0cbefc57cb527'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-015-roti-lebih-segar', 'bright', 'English', 'Just this one, sir, because the bread is fresher today.', 'aa84ad4bc73f8cf4b2e81101942439debc778ec1cdd392148ad0cbefc57cb527'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-015-roti-lebih-segar', 'bright', 'French', 'Juste celui-ci, monsieur, parce que le pain est plus frais aujourd''hui.', 'aa84ad4bc73f8cf4b2e81101942439debc778ec1cdd392148ad0cbefc57cb527'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-015-roti-lebih-segar', 'bright', 'German', 'Nur dieses hier, bitte, weil das Brot heute frischer ist.', 'aa84ad4bc73f8cf4b2e81101942439debc778ec1cdd392148ad0cbefc57cb527'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-015-roti-lebih-segar', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Yang ini saja, Pak, karena rotinya lebih segar hari ini.', 'aa84ad4bc73f8cf4b2e81101942439debc778ec1cdd392148ad0cbefc57cb527'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-015-roti-lebih-segar', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Solo questo, signore, perché il pane è più fresco oggi.', 'aa84ad4bc73f8cf4b2e81101942439debc778ec1cdd392148ad0cbefc57cb527'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-015-roti-lebih-segar', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'こちらでお願いします、お客様。パンが今日より新鮮なので。', 'aa84ad4bc73f8cf4b2e81101942439debc778ec1cdd392148ad0cbefc57cb527'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-015-roti-lebih-segar', 'bright', 'Korean', '이것으로 주세요, 선생님, 빵이 오늘 더 신선하니까요.', 'aa84ad4bc73f8cf4b2e81101942439debc778ec1cdd392148ad0cbefc57cb527'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-015-roti-lebih-segar', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Tylko ten, proszę pana, bo chleb jest dziś świeższy.', 'aa84ad4bc73f8cf4b2e81101942439debc778ec1cdd392148ad0cbefc57cb527'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-015-roti-lebih-segar', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Só este, senhor, porque o pão está mais fresco hoje.', 'aa84ad4bc73f8cf4b2e81101942439debc778ec1cdd392148ad0cbefc57cb527'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-015-roti-lebih-segar', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Только этот, сэр, потому что хлеб сегодня свежее.', 'aa84ad4bc73f8cf4b2e81101942439debc778ec1cdd392148ad0cbefc57cb527'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-015-roti-lebih-segar', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Solo este, señor, porque el pan está más fresco hoy.', 'aa84ad4bc73f8cf4b2e81101942439debc778ec1cdd392148ad0cbefc57cb527'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-016-ojek-lebih-cepat', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Gipili nako ang ojek, sir, kay mas paspas kini karon.', 'b553033a85b4ec9a0c01271520c8c718c9064dbae0628f356b1a2af1436cfb7b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-016-ojek-lebih-cepat', 'bright', 'English', 'I choose the ojek, sir, because it is faster right now.', 'b553033a85b4ec9a0c01271520c8c718c9064dbae0628f356b1a2af1436cfb7b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-016-ojek-lebih-cepat', 'bright', 'French', 'Je choisis l''ojek, monsieur, parce que c''est plus rapide maintenant.', 'b553033a85b4ec9a0c01271520c8c718c9064dbae0628f356b1a2af1436cfb7b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-016-ojek-lebih-cepat', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich nehme das Motorradtaxi, weil es jetzt schneller ist.', 'b553033a85b4ec9a0c01271520c8c718c9064dbae0628f356b1a2af1436cfb7b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-016-ojek-lebih-cepat', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya pilih ojek, Pak, karena sekarang lebih cepat.', 'b553033a85b4ec9a0c01271520c8c718c9064dbae0628f356b1a2af1436cfb7b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-016-ojek-lebih-cepat', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Scelgo l''ojek, signore, perché ora è più veloce.', 'b553033a85b4ec9a0c01271520c8c718c9064dbae0628f356b1a2af1436cfb7b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-016-ojek-lebih-cepat', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'バイクタクシーを選びます、お客様。今の方が速いので。', 'b553033a85b4ec9a0c01271520c8c718c9064dbae0628f356b1a2af1436cfb7b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-016-ojek-lebih-cepat', 'bright', 'Korean', '오젝을 탈게요, 선생님, 지금 더 빠르니까요.', 'b553033a85b4ec9a0c01271520c8c718c9064dbae0628f356b1a2af1436cfb7b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-016-ojek-lebih-cepat', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Wybieram ojek, proszę pana, bo teraz jest szybciej.', 'b553033a85b4ec9a0c01271520c8c718c9064dbae0628f356b1a2af1436cfb7b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-016-ojek-lebih-cepat', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu escolho o ojek, senhor, porque é mais rápido agora.', 'b553033a85b4ec9a0c01271520c8c718c9064dbae0628f356b1a2af1436cfb7b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-016-ojek-lebih-cepat', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я выбираю оjek, сэр, потому что сейчас он быстрее.', 'b553033a85b4ec9a0c01271520c8c718c9064dbae0628f356b1a2af1436cfb7b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-016-ojek-lebih-cepat', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Elijo el ojek, señor, porque ahora es más rápido.', 'b553033a85b4ec9a0c01271520c8c718c9064dbae0628f356b1a2af1436cfb7b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-017-kamar-belakang-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Gipili nako ang lawak sa luyo, ma’am, kay mas hilom kini alang sa pagkatulog.', '9cce551d7c97dcd9098b499f74f9179309f942de5ef2491806c26c6ef08efe69'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-017-kamar-belakang-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'English', 'I choose the back room, ma’am, because it is quieter for sleeping.', '9cce551d7c97dcd9098b499f74f9179309f942de5ef2491806c26c6ef08efe69'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-017-kamar-belakang-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'French', 'Je choisis la chambre arrière, madame, parce qu''elle est plus calme pour dormir.', '9cce551d7c97dcd9098b499f74f9179309f942de5ef2491806c26c6ef08efe69'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-017-kamar-belakang-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich wähle das hintere Zimmer, weil es zum Schlafen ruhiger ist.', '9cce551d7c97dcd9098b499f74f9179309f942de5ef2491806c26c6ef08efe69'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-017-kamar-belakang-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya pilih kamar belakang, Bu, karena lebih tenang untuk tidur.', '9cce551d7c97dcd9098b499f74f9179309f942de5ef2491806c26c6ef08efe69'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-017-kamar-belakang-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Scelgo la stanza sul retro, signora, perché è più tranquilla per dormire.', '9cce551d7c97dcd9098b499f74f9179309f942de5ef2491806c26c6ef08efe69'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-017-kamar-belakang-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Japanese', '奥様、奥の部屋を選びます。睡眠のために、より静かなので。', '9cce551d7c97dcd9098b499f74f9179309f942de5ef2491806c26c6ef08efe69'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-017-kamar-belakang-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Korean', '뒷방을 선택할게요, 아주머니, 잠자기에는 더 조용하니까요.', '9cce551d7c97dcd9098b499f74f9179309f942de5ef2491806c26c6ef08efe69'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-017-kamar-belakang-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Wybieram pokój z tyłu, proszę pani, ponieważ jest cichszy do spania.', '9cce551d7c97dcd9098b499f74f9179309f942de5ef2491806c26c6ef08efe69'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-017-kamar-belakang-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu escolho o quarto dos fundos, senhora, porque é mais silencioso para dormir.', '9cce551d7c97dcd9098b499f74f9179309f942de5ef2491806c26c6ef08efe69'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-017-kamar-belakang-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я выбираю комнату во дворе, мадам, потому что она тише для сна.', '9cce551d7c97dcd9098b499f74f9179309f942de5ef2491806c26c6ef08efe69'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-017-kamar-belakang-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Elijo la habitación trasera, señora, porque es más tranquila para dormir.', '9cce551d7c97dcd9098b499f74f9179309f942de5ef2491806c26c6ef08efe69'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-018-sandal-lebih-nyaman', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Gipili nako kini nga mga sandalyas, sir, kay mas komportable kini sa tiil.', 'c968e1ad8a1d3904bc6cd4010ddbaea9238a59ff2105fbc1326a3d31865ccd87'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-018-sandal-lebih-nyaman', 'bright', 'English', 'I choose these sandals, sir, because they feel more comfortable.', 'c968e1ad8a1d3904bc6cd4010ddbaea9238a59ff2105fbc1326a3d31865ccd87'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-018-sandal-lebih-nyaman', 'bright', 'French', 'Je choisis ces sandales, monsieur, car elles sont plus confortables.', 'c968e1ad8a1d3904bc6cd4010ddbaea9238a59ff2105fbc1326a3d31865ccd87'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-018-sandal-lebih-nyaman', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich wähle diese Sandalen, weil sie sich bequemer anfühlen.', 'c968e1ad8a1d3904bc6cd4010ddbaea9238a59ff2105fbc1326a3d31865ccd87'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-018-sandal-lebih-nyaman', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya pilih sandal ini, Pak, karena rasanya lebih nyaman.', 'c968e1ad8a1d3904bc6cd4010ddbaea9238a59ff2105fbc1326a3d31865ccd87'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-018-sandal-lebih-nyaman', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Scelgo questi sandali, signore, perché li trovo più comodi.', 'c968e1ad8a1d3904bc6cd4010ddbaea9238a59ff2105fbc1326a3d31865ccd87'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-018-sandal-lebih-nyaman', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'こちらのサンダルを選びます、お客様。履き心地が良いからです。', 'c968e1ad8a1d3904bc6cd4010ddbaea9238a59ff2105fbc1326a3d31865ccd87'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-018-sandal-lebih-nyaman', 'bright', 'Korean', '이 샌들은 제가 더 편안하게 느껴져서 고르겠습니다, 손님.', 'c968e1ad8a1d3904bc6cd4010ddbaea9238a59ff2105fbc1326a3d31865ccd87'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-018-sandal-lebih-nyaman', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Wybieram te sandały, proszę pana, ponieważ są wygodniejsze.', 'c968e1ad8a1d3904bc6cd4010ddbaea9238a59ff2105fbc1326a3d31865ccd87'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-018-sandal-lebih-nyaman', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu escolho estas sandálias, senhor, porque elas parecem mais confortáveis.', 'c968e1ad8a1d3904bc6cd4010ddbaea9238a59ff2105fbc1326a3d31865ccd87'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-018-sandal-lebih-nyaman', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я выбираю эти сандалии, сэр, потому что они кажутся более удобными.', 'c968e1ad8a1d3904bc6cd4010ddbaea9238a59ff2105fbc1326a3d31865ccd87'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-018-sandal-lebih-nyaman', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Elijo estas sandalias, señor, porque se sienten más cómodas.', 'c968e1ad8a1d3904bc6cd4010ddbaea9238a59ff2105fbc1326a3d31865ccd87'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-019-botol-kecil-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Gipili nako ang gamay nga botelya, ma’am, kay mas barato ang presyo niini.', 'd24e4e1204bd63bf86344022894c5d34fd2a983ad1bd60490cbf75d02ba0bb30'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-019-botol-kecil-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'English', 'I choose the small bottle, ma’am, because its price is lower.', 'd24e4e1204bd63bf86344022894c5d34fd2a983ad1bd60490cbf75d02ba0bb30'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-019-botol-kecil-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'French', 'Je choisis la petite bouteille, madame, car son prix est plus bas.', 'd24e4e1204bd63bf86344022894c5d34fd2a983ad1bd60490cbf75d02ba0bb30'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-019-botol-kecil-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich wähle die kleine Flasche, weil ihr Preis niedriger ist.', 'd24e4e1204bd63bf86344022894c5d34fd2a983ad1bd60490cbf75d02ba0bb30'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-019-botol-kecil-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya pilih botol kecil, Bu, karena harganya lebih murah.', 'd24e4e1204bd63bf86344022894c5d34fd2a983ad1bd60490cbf75d02ba0bb30'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-019-botol-kecil-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Scelgo la bottiglia piccola, signora, perché il suo prezzo è più basso.', 'd24e4e1204bd63bf86344022894c5d34fd2a983ad1bd60490cbf75d02ba0bb30'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-019-botol-kecil-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Japanese', '小さい方のボトルを選びます、奥様。値段が安いからです。', 'd24e4e1204bd63bf86344022894c5d34fd2a983ad1bd60490cbf75d02ba0bb30'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-019-botol-kecil-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Korean', '저는 이 작은 병을 고르겠습니다, 부인, 가격이 더 저렴하기 때문입니다.', 'd24e4e1204bd63bf86344022894c5d34fd2a983ad1bd60490cbf75d02ba0bb30'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-019-botol-kecil-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Wybieram małą butelkę, proszę pani, ponieważ jej cena jest niższa.', 'd24e4e1204bd63bf86344022894c5d34fd2a983ad1bd60490cbf75d02ba0bb30'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-019-botol-kecil-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu escolho a garrafa pequena, senhora, porque o preço dela é menor.', 'd24e4e1204bd63bf86344022894c5d34fd2a983ad1bd60490cbf75d02ba0bb30'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-019-botol-kecil-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я выбираю маленькую бутылку, мэм, потому что ее цена ниже.', 'd24e4e1204bd63bf86344022894c5d34fd2a983ad1bd60490cbf75d02ba0bb30'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-019-botol-kecil-lebih-murah', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Elijo la botella pequeña, señora, porque su precio es más bajo.', 'd24e4e1204bd63bf86344022894c5d34fd2a983ad1bd60490cbf75d02ba0bb30'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-020-kafe-dekat-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Ganahan ko niini nga cafe, sir, kay duol kini ug mas hilom.', '9388598845657818a46c3d912eac702207c28cf30d5b06541af6269bdf7334c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-020-kafe-dekat-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'English', 'I like this cafe, sir, because it is close and quieter.', '9388598845657818a46c3d912eac702207c28cf30d5b06541af6269bdf7334c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-020-kafe-dekat-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'French', 'J''aime ce café, monsieur, car il est proche et plus calme.', '9388598845657818a46c3d912eac702207c28cf30d5b06541af6269bdf7334c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-020-kafe-dekat-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich mag dieses Café, weil es nah und ruhiger ist.', '9388598845657818a46c3d912eac702207c28cf30d5b06541af6269bdf7334c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-020-kafe-dekat-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya suka kafe ini, Pak, karena dekat dan lebih tenang.', '9388598845657818a46c3d912eac702207c28cf30d5b06541af6269bdf7334c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-020-kafe-dekat-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi piace questo caffè, signore, perché è vicino e più tranquillo.', '9388598845657818a46c3d912eac702207c28cf30d5b06541af6269bdf7334c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-020-kafe-dekat-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'このカフェが好きです、お客様。近くて静かだからです。', '9388598845657818a46c3d912eac702207c28cf30d5b06541af6269bdf7334c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-020-kafe-dekat-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Korean', '저는 이 카페를 좋아합니다, 손님, 가깝고 더 조용하기 때문입니다.', '9388598845657818a46c3d912eac702207c28cf30d5b06541af6269bdf7334c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-020-kafe-dekat-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Lubię tę kawiarnię, proszę pana, ponieważ jest blisko i jest spokojniejsza.', '9388598845657818a46c3d912eac702207c28cf30d5b06541af6269bdf7334c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-020-kafe-dekat-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu gosto deste café, senhor, porque é perto e mais silencioso.', '9388598845657818a46c3d912eac702207c28cf30d5b06541af6269bdf7334c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-020-kafe-dekat-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Мне нравится это кафе, сэр, потому что оно близко и тише.', '9388598845657818a46c3d912eac702207c28cf30d5b06541af6269bdf7334c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-2', 'indonesian-a2-practical-2-020-kafe-dekat-lebih-tenang', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Me gusta esta cafetería, señor, porque está cerca y es más tranquila.', '9388598845657818a46c3d912eac702207c28cf30d5b06541af6269bdf7334c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-021-saya-sudah-bayar', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nabayaran ko na, ma’am. Kini ang resibo.', 'd2b5e911fb43c3263542e15f27c526087bdb3a0926105be857428614d2bfd587'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-021-saya-sudah-bayar', 'bright', 'English', 'I have already paid, ma’am. Here is the receipt.', 'd2b5e911fb43c3263542e15f27c526087bdb3a0926105be857428614d2bfd587'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-021-saya-sudah-bayar', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai déjà payé, madame. Voici le reçu.', 'd2b5e911fb43c3263542e15f27c526087bdb3a0926105be857428614d2bfd587'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-021-saya-sudah-bayar', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe schon bezahlt. Hier ist der Kassenbon.', 'd2b5e911fb43c3263542e15f27c526087bdb3a0926105be857428614d2bfd587'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-021-saya-sudah-bayar', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya sudah bayar, Bu. Ini struknya.', 'd2b5e911fb43c3263542e15f27c526087bdb3a0926105be857428614d2bfd587'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-021-saya-sudah-bayar', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho già pagato, signora. Ecco la ricevuta.', 'd2b5e911fb43c3263542e15f27c526087bdb3a0926105be857428614d2bfd587'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-021-saya-sudah-bayar', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すでに支払いました、奥様。こちらがレシートです。', 'd2b5e911fb43c3263542e15f27c526087bdb3a0926105be857428614d2bfd587'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-021-saya-sudah-bayar', 'bright', 'Korean', '이미 지불했습니다, 부인. 여기 영수증입니다.', 'd2b5e911fb43c3263542e15f27c526087bdb3a0926105be857428614d2bfd587'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-021-saya-sudah-bayar', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Już zapłaciłem, proszę pani. Oto paragon.', 'd2b5e911fb43c3263542e15f27c526087bdb3a0926105be857428614d2bfd587'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-021-saya-sudah-bayar', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu já paguei, senhora. Aqui está o recibo.', 'd2b5e911fb43c3263542e15f27c526087bdb3a0926105be857428614d2bfd587'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-021-saya-sudah-bayar', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я уже заплатил, мэм. Вот чек.', 'd2b5e911fb43c3263542e15f27c526087bdb3a0926105be857428614d2bfd587'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-021-saya-sudah-bayar', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Ya he pagado, señora. Aquí tiene el recibo.', 'd2b5e911fb43c3263542e15f27c526087bdb3a0926105be857428614d2bfd587'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-022-tiba-kemarin-malam', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Miabot ko kagabii mga alas otso, ma’am.', 'eaea34790fe15fe8d6e08cf1a23656f1edde55875ea72bac7616007312e89e6f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-022-tiba-kemarin-malam', 'bright', 'English', 'I arrived last night at around eight, ma’am.', 'eaea34790fe15fe8d6e08cf1a23656f1edde55875ea72bac7616007312e89e6f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-022-tiba-kemarin-malam', 'bright', 'French', 'Je suis arrivé hier soir vers huit heures, madame.', 'eaea34790fe15fe8d6e08cf1a23656f1edde55875ea72bac7616007312e89e6f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-022-tiba-kemarin-malam', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich bin gestern Abend gegen acht Uhr angekommen.', 'eaea34790fe15fe8d6e08cf1a23656f1edde55875ea72bac7616007312e89e6f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-022-tiba-kemarin-malam', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya tiba kemarin malam, Bu, sekitar jam delapan.', 'eaea34790fe15fe8d6e08cf1a23656f1edde55875ea72bac7616007312e89e6f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-022-tiba-kemarin-malam', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Sono arrivato ieri sera verso le otto, signora.', 'eaea34790fe15fe8d6e08cf1a23656f1edde55875ea72bac7616007312e89e6f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-022-tiba-kemarin-malam', 'bright', 'Japanese', '昨夜8時頃に到着しました、奥様。', 'eaea34790fe15fe8d6e08cf1a23656f1edde55875ea72bac7616007312e89e6f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-022-tiba-kemarin-malam', 'bright', 'Korean', '어젯밤 8시경에 도착했습니다, 부인.', 'eaea34790fe15fe8d6e08cf1a23656f1edde55875ea72bac7616007312e89e6f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-022-tiba-kemarin-malam', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przyjechałem wczoraj wieczorem, około ósmej, proszę pani.', 'eaea34790fe15fe8d6e08cf1a23656f1edde55875ea72bac7616007312e89e6f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-022-tiba-kemarin-malam', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Cheguei ontem à noite por volta das oito, senhora.', 'eaea34790fe15fe8d6e08cf1a23656f1edde55875ea72bac7616007312e89e6f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-022-tiba-kemarin-malam', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я прибыл прошлой ночью около восьми, мэм.', 'eaea34790fe15fe8d6e08cf1a23656f1edde55875ea72bac7616007312e89e6f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-022-tiba-kemarin-malam', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Llegué anoche alrededor de las ocho, señora.', 'eaea34790fe15fe8d6e08cf1a23656f1edde55875ea72bac7616007312e89e6f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-023-sudah-pesan-nasi-goreng', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Bag-o lang ko nag-order og fried rice nga walay sambal, Ma''am.', '4eeaeadd19899c6a71da70b10b69119ab412fda1ca23bf543910818442509ca7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-023-sudah-pesan-nasi-goreng', 'bright', 'English', 'I just ordered fried rice without sambal, ma’am.', '4eeaeadd19899c6a71da70b10b69119ab412fda1ca23bf543910818442509ca7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-023-sudah-pesan-nasi-goreng', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai juste commandé du riz frit sans sambal, madame.', '4eeaeadd19899c6a71da70b10b69119ab412fda1ca23bf543910818442509ca7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-023-sudah-pesan-nasi-goreng', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe gerade gebratenen Reis ohne Sambal bestellt.', '4eeaeadd19899c6a71da70b10b69119ab412fda1ca23bf543910818442509ca7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-023-sudah-pesan-nasi-goreng', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya baru saja pesan nasi goreng, Bu, tanpa sambal.', '4eeaeadd19899c6a71da70b10b69119ab412fda1ca23bf543910818442509ca7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-023-sudah-pesan-nasi-goreng', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho appena ordinato riso fritto senza sambal, signora.', '4eeaeadd19899c6a71da70b10b69119ab412fda1ca23bf543910818442509ca7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-023-sudah-pesan-nasi-goreng', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'サンバルなしの焼き飯を注文しました、奥様。', '4eeaeadd19899c6a71da70b10b69119ab412fda1ca23bf543910818442509ca7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-023-sudah-pesan-nasi-goreng', 'bright', 'Korean', '삼발 없는 볶음밥을 방금 주문했습니다, 부인.', '4eeaeadd19899c6a71da70b10b69119ab412fda1ca23bf543910818442509ca7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-023-sudah-pesan-nasi-goreng', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Właśnie zamówiłem smażony ryż bez sambalu, proszę pani.', '4eeaeadd19899c6a71da70b10b69119ab412fda1ca23bf543910818442509ca7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-023-sudah-pesan-nasi-goreng', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu acabei de pedir arroz frito sem sambal, senhora.', '4eeaeadd19899c6a71da70b10b69119ab412fda1ca23bf543910818442509ca7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-023-sudah-pesan-nasi-goreng', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я только что заказал жареный рис без самбала, мэм.', '4eeaeadd19899c6a71da70b10b69119ab412fda1ca23bf543910818442509ca7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-023-sudah-pesan-nasi-goreng', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Acabo de pedir arroz frito sin sambal, señora.', '4eeaeadd19899c6a71da70b10b69119ab412fda1ca23bf543910818442509ca7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-024-tadi-pagi-beli-buah', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Namalit ko og prutas sa merkado karong buntaga, Ma''am.', 'e477b6bec55d6efde5d12cfcc08469724b630a3465946a72962e9bcc48517d16'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-024-tadi-pagi-beli-buah', 'bright', 'English', 'I bought fruit at the market this morning, ma’am.', 'e477b6bec55d6efde5d12cfcc08469724b630a3465946a72962e9bcc48517d16'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-024-tadi-pagi-beli-buah', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai acheté des fruits au marché ce matin, madame.', 'e477b6bec55d6efde5d12cfcc08469724b630a3465946a72962e9bcc48517d16'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-024-tadi-pagi-beli-buah', 'bright', 'German', 'Heute Morgen habe ich auf dem Markt Obst gekauft.', 'e477b6bec55d6efde5d12cfcc08469724b630a3465946a72962e9bcc48517d16'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-024-tadi-pagi-beli-buah', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Tadi pagi saya beli buah di pasar, Bu.', 'e477b6bec55d6efde5d12cfcc08469724b630a3465946a72962e9bcc48517d16'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-024-tadi-pagi-beli-buah', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho comprato frutta al mercato stamattina, signora.', 'e477b6bec55d6efde5d12cfcc08469724b630a3465946a72962e9bcc48517d16'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-024-tadi-pagi-beli-buah', 'bright', 'Japanese', '今朝市場で果物を買いました、奥様。', 'e477b6bec55d6efde5d12cfcc08469724b630a3465946a72962e9bcc48517d16'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-024-tadi-pagi-beli-buah', 'bright', 'Korean', '오늘 아침 시장에서 과일을 샀습니다, 부인.', 'e477b6bec55d6efde5d12cfcc08469724b630a3465946a72962e9bcc48517d16'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-024-tadi-pagi-beli-buah', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Kupiłem owoce na targu dziś rano, proszę pani.', 'e477b6bec55d6efde5d12cfcc08469724b630a3465946a72962e9bcc48517d16'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-024-tadi-pagi-beli-buah', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Comprei frutas no mercado esta manhã, senhora.', 'e477b6bec55d6efde5d12cfcc08469724b630a3465946a72962e9bcc48517d16'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-024-tadi-pagi-beli-buah', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я купил фрукты на рынке сегодня утром, мэм.', 'e477b6bec55d6efde5d12cfcc08469724b630a3465946a72962e9bcc48517d16'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-024-tadi-pagi-beli-buah', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Compré fruta en el mercado esta mañana, señora.', 'e477b6bec55d6efde5d12cfcc08469724b630a3465946a72962e9bcc48517d16'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-025-tadi-belanja-di-pasar', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Namalit ko sa merkado ganina, Ma''am. Karon nagtan-aw-tan-aw lang ko.', '8797854369b15a2637ce2236d265a85b92ca83884180bebe7894d45015a3332a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-025-tadi-belanja-di-pasar', 'bright', 'English', 'I shopped at the market earlier, ma’am. Now I am just looking around.', '8797854369b15a2637ce2236d265a85b92ca83884180bebe7894d45015a3332a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-025-tadi-belanja-di-pasar', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai fait des courses au marché plus tôt, madame. Maintenant, je regarde seulement.', '8797854369b15a2637ce2236d265a85b92ca83884180bebe7894d45015a3332a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-025-tadi-belanja-di-pasar', 'bright', 'German', 'Vorhin habe ich auf dem Markt eingekauft. Jetzt schaue ich mich nur um.', '8797854369b15a2637ce2236d265a85b92ca83884180bebe7894d45015a3332a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-025-tadi-belanja-di-pasar', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Tadi saya belanja di pasar, Bu. Sekarang saya hanya lihat-lihat.', '8797854369b15a2637ce2236d265a85b92ca83884180bebe7894d45015a3332a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-025-tadi-belanja-di-pasar', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho fatto acquisti al mercato prima, signora. Ora sto solo guardando.', '8797854369b15a2637ce2236d265a85b92ca83884180bebe7894d45015a3332a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-025-tadi-belanja-di-pasar', 'bright', 'Japanese', '以前市場で買い物をしました、奥様。今はただ見て回っています。', '8797854369b15a2637ce2236d265a85b92ca83884180bebe7894d45015a3332a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-025-tadi-belanja-di-pasar', 'bright', 'Korean', '이전에 시장에서 쇼핑했습니다, 부인. 지금은 그냥 둘러보고 있습니다.', '8797854369b15a2637ce2236d265a85b92ca83884180bebe7894d45015a3332a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-025-tadi-belanja-di-pasar', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Kupowałem wcześniej na targu, proszę pani. Teraz tylko oglądam.', '8797854369b15a2637ce2236d265a85b92ca83884180bebe7894d45015a3332a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-025-tadi-belanja-di-pasar', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Comprei no mercado mais cedo, senhora. Agora estou apenas olhando.', '8797854369b15a2637ce2236d265a85b92ca83884180bebe7894d45015a3332a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-025-tadi-belanja-di-pasar', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я уже покупал на рынке, мэм. Теперь я просто смотрю.', '8797854369b15a2637ce2236d265a85b92ca83884180bebe7894d45015a3332a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-025-tadi-belanja-di-pasar', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Compré en el mercado antes, señora. Ahora solo estoy mirando.', '8797854369b15a2637ce2236d265a85b92ca83884180bebe7894d45015a3332a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-026-tadi-malam-kurang-tidur', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Wala ko makatulog og maayo kagabii, Ma''am, pero karong adlawa mas maayo na ang akong pamati.', 'c5445e8be79d688356fb61cec4a6f2c11bd4ec831ba2467472b647bbf163af63'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-026-tadi-malam-kurang-tidur', 'bright', 'English', 'I did not get enough sleep last night, ma’am, but today I feel better.', 'c5445e8be79d688356fb61cec4a6f2c11bd4ec831ba2467472b647bbf163af63'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-026-tadi-malam-kurang-tidur', 'bright', 'French', 'Je n''ai pas assez dormi la nuit dernière, madame, mais aujourd''hui je me sens mieux.', 'c5445e8be79d688356fb61cec4a6f2c11bd4ec831ba2467472b647bbf163af63'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-026-tadi-malam-kurang-tidur', 'bright', 'German', 'Letzte Nacht habe ich zu wenig geschlafen, aber heute geht es mir besser.', 'c5445e8be79d688356fb61cec4a6f2c11bd4ec831ba2467472b647bbf163af63'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-026-tadi-malam-kurang-tidur', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya kurang tidur tadi malam, Bu, tetapi hari ini saya merasa lebih baik.', 'c5445e8be79d688356fb61cec4a6f2c11bd4ec831ba2467472b647bbf163af63'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-026-tadi-malam-kurang-tidur', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Non ho dormito abbastanza la scorsa notte, signora, ma oggi mi sento meglio.', 'c5445e8be79d688356fb61cec4a6f2c11bd4ec831ba2467472b647bbf163af63'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-026-tadi-malam-kurang-tidur', 'bright', 'Japanese', '昨夜はあまり眠れませんでしたが、今日は気分が良いです。', 'c5445e8be79d688356fb61cec4a6f2c11bd4ec831ba2467472b647bbf163af63'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-026-tadi-malam-kurang-tidur', 'bright', 'Korean', '어젯밤에 잠을 충분히 못 잤어요, 부인, 하지만 오늘은 기분이 나아졌어요.', 'c5445e8be79d688356fb61cec4a6f2c11bd4ec831ba2467472b647bbf163af63'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-026-tadi-malam-kurang-tidur', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Nie wyspałem się wczoraj, proszę pani, ale dzisiaj czuję się lepiej.', 'c5445e8be79d688356fb61cec4a6f2c11bd4ec831ba2467472b647bbf163af63'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-026-tadi-malam-kurang-tidur', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu não dormi o suficiente ontem à noite, senhora, mas hoje me sinto melhor.', 'c5445e8be79d688356fb61cec4a6f2c11bd4ec831ba2467472b647bbf163af63'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-026-tadi-malam-kurang-tidur', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я не выспался прошлой ночью, мэм, но сегодня чувствую себя лучше.', 'c5445e8be79d688356fb61cec4a6f2c11bd4ec831ba2467472b647bbf163af63'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-026-tadi-malam-kurang-tidur', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'No dormí lo suficiente anoche, señora, pero hoy me siento mejor.', 'c5445e8be79d688356fb61cec4a6f2c11bd4ec831ba2467472b647bbf163af63'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-027-sudah-coba-soto-betawi', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Gisulayan na nako ang soto Betawi, Sir. Lami kini.', 'f59ce4393c39dafd656d126a6a6ac66205388a775508e44c12344d3f4b8beecb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-027-sudah-coba-soto-betawi', 'bright', 'English', 'I have already tried Soto Betawi, sir. It tastes good.', 'f59ce4393c39dafd656d126a6a6ac66205388a775508e44c12344d3f4b8beecb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-027-sudah-coba-soto-betawi', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai déjà essayé le Soto Betawi, monsieur. C''est bon.', 'f59ce4393c39dafd656d126a6a6ac66205388a775508e44c12344d3f4b8beecb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-027-sudah-coba-soto-betawi', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe Soto Betawi schon probiert. Es schmeckt gut.', 'f59ce4393c39dafd656d126a6a6ac66205388a775508e44c12344d3f4b8beecb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-027-sudah-coba-soto-betawi', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya sudah coba soto Betawi, Pak. Rasanya enak.', 'f59ce4393c39dafd656d126a6a6ac66205388a775508e44c12344d3f4b8beecb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-027-sudah-coba-soto-betawi', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho già provato il Soto Betawi, signore. Ha un buon sapore.', 'f59ce4393c39dafd656d126a6a6ac66205388a775508e44c12344d3f4b8beecb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-027-sudah-coba-soto-betawi', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'もうソト・ベタウィは試しました、旦那様。美味しいです。', 'f59ce4393c39dafd656d126a6a6ac66205388a775508e44c12344d3f4b8beecb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-027-sudah-coba-soto-betawi', 'bright', 'Korean', '이미 소토 베타위를 먹어봤어요, 선생님. 맛이 좋아요.', 'f59ce4393c39dafd656d126a6a6ac66205388a775508e44c12344d3f4b8beecb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-027-sudah-coba-soto-betawi', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Już próbowałem soto Betawi, proszę pana. Smakuje dobrze.', 'f59ce4393c39dafd656d126a6a6ac66205388a775508e44c12344d3f4b8beecb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-027-sudah-coba-soto-betawi', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu já experimentei Soto Betawi, senhor. Tem um gosto bom.', 'f59ce4393c39dafd656d126a6a6ac66205388a775508e44c12344d3f4b8beecb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-027-sudah-coba-soto-betawi', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я уже пробовал Сото Бетави, сэр. Оно вкусное.', 'f59ce4393c39dafd656d126a6a6ac66205388a775508e44c12344d3f4b8beecb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-027-sudah-coba-soto-betawi', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Ya probé el Soto Betawi, señor. Sabe bien.', 'f59ce4393c39dafd656d126a6a6ac66205388a775508e44c12344d3f4b8beecb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-028-belum-lihat-kota-tua', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Wala pa ko makakita sa karaang lungsod, Ma''am, pero gusto ko moadto didto.', '01de59df57f514897dd7f0c5286f6b0df98028d8f09ec420bb9725b3c3da9e72'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-028-belum-lihat-kota-tua', 'bright', 'English', 'I have not seen the old town yet, ma’am, but I want to go there.', '01de59df57f514897dd7f0c5286f6b0df98028d8f09ec420bb9725b3c3da9e72'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-028-belum-lihat-kota-tua', 'bright', 'French', 'Je n''ai pas encore vu la vieille ville, madame, mais je veux y aller.', '01de59df57f514897dd7f0c5286f6b0df98028d8f09ec420bb9725b3c3da9e72'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-028-belum-lihat-kota-tua', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe die Altstadt noch nicht gesehen, möchte aber dorthin.', '01de59df57f514897dd7f0c5286f6b0df98028d8f09ec420bb9725b3c3da9e72'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-028-belum-lihat-kota-tua', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya belum lihat kota tua, Bu, tetapi ingin ke sana.', '01de59df57f514897dd7f0c5286f6b0df98028d8f09ec420bb9725b3c3da9e72'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-028-belum-lihat-kota-tua', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Non ho ancora visto la città vecchia, signora, ma voglio andarci.', '01de59df57f514897dd7f0c5286f6b0df98028d8f09ec420bb9725b3c3da9e72'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-028-belum-lihat-kota-tua', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'まだ旧市街を見ていませんが、そこに行きたいです。', '01de59df57f514897dd7f0c5286f6b0df98028d8f09ec420bb9725b3c3da9e72'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-028-belum-lihat-kota-tua', 'bright', 'Korean', '아직 구시가지를 보지 못했어요, 부인, 하지만 거기에 가고 싶어요.', '01de59df57f514897dd7f0c5286f6b0df98028d8f09ec420bb9725b3c3da9e72'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-028-belum-lihat-kota-tua', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Jeszcze nie widziałem starego miasta, proszę pani, ale chcę tam pojechać.', '01de59df57f514897dd7f0c5286f6b0df98028d8f09ec420bb9725b3c3da9e72'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-028-belum-lihat-kota-tua', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Ainda não vi a cidade velha, senhora, mas quero ir para lá.', '01de59df57f514897dd7f0c5286f6b0df98028d8f09ec420bb9725b3c3da9e72'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-028-belum-lihat-kota-tua', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я еще не видел старый город, мэм, но хочу туда поехать.', '01de59df57f514897dd7f0c5286f6b0df98028d8f09ec420bb9725b3c3da9e72'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-028-belum-lihat-kota-tua', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Aún no he visto el casco antiguo, señora, pero quiero ir allí.', '01de59df57f514897dd7f0c5286f6b0df98028d8f09ec420bb9725b3c3da9e72'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-029-kemarin-ke-museum', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Sir, didto ko sa museyo gikan sa buntag hangtod sa udto kagahapon.', '4819db6c18040b75f9b240b8c7337e4c5731b90910628591c933ee8bb259b3f6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-029-kemarin-ke-museum', 'bright', 'English', 'Sir, I was at the museum from morning until noon yesterday.', '4819db6c18040b75f9b240b8c7337e4c5731b90910628591c933ee8bb259b3f6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-029-kemarin-ke-museum', 'bright', 'French', 'Monsieur, j''étais au musée hier de ce matin jusqu''à midi.', '4819db6c18040b75f9b240b8c7337e4c5731b90910628591c933ee8bb259b3f6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-029-kemarin-ke-museum', 'bright', 'German', 'Gestern war ich vom Morgen bis zum Mittag im Museum.', '4819db6c18040b75f9b240b8c7337e4c5731b90910628591c933ee8bb259b3f6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-029-kemarin-ke-museum', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Pak, kemarin saya ke museum dari pagi sampai siang.', '4819db6c18040b75f9b240b8c7337e4c5731b90910628591c933ee8bb259b3f6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-029-kemarin-ke-museum', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Signore, ieri sono stato al museo dalla mattina fino a mezzogiorno.', '4819db6c18040b75f9b240b8c7337e4c5731b90910628591c933ee8bb259b3f6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-029-kemarin-ke-museum', 'bright', 'Japanese', '旦那様、昨日は朝から昼まで美術館にいました。', '4819db6c18040b75f9b240b8c7337e4c5731b90910628591c933ee8bb259b3f6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-3', 'indonesian-a2-practical-3-029-kemarin-ke-museum', 'bright', 'Korean', '선생님, 어제 박물관에 아침부터 정오까지 있었습니다.', '4819db6c18040b75f9b240b8c7337e4c5731b90910628591c933ee8bb259b3f6'),
