  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-035-ganti-rencana-ke-sabtu', 'bright', 'Korean', '내일 약속을 토요일로 변경할 수 있을까요? 동의하시나요?', 'e33d14e3798921ee74b039bd5ff3c59f67dc19bd5115557a5619637d89ad7653'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-035-ganti-rencana-ke-sabtu', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Czy możemy przełożyć jutrzejsze spotkanie na sobotę? Zgadzasz się?', 'e33d14e3798921ee74b039bd5ff3c59f67dc19bd5115557a5619637d89ad7653'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-035-ganti-rencana-ke-sabtu', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Podemos mudar o compromisso de amanhã para sábado? Você concorda?', 'e33d14e3798921ee74b039bd5ff3c59f67dc19bd5115557a5619637d89ad7653'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-035-ganti-rencana-ke-sabtu', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Можем ли мы перенести завтрашнюю встречу на субботу? Вы согласны?', 'e33d14e3798921ee74b039bd5ff3c59f67dc19bd5115557a5619637d89ad7653'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-035-ganti-rencana-ke-sabtu', 'bright', 'Spanish', '¿Podemos cambiar la cita de mañana al sábado? ¿Estás de acuerdo?', 'e33d14e3798921ee74b039bd5ff3c59f67dc19bd5115557a5619637d89ad7653'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-036-tidak-bisa-nanti-malam', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa, dili ko makaabot karong gabii kay kinahanglan kong motrabaho. Nakasabot ka ba?', '8d4b3445c8db87ed53b2262b639c79701528475e19989d5a5a1db774ff6b187a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-036-tidak-bisa-nanti-malam', 'bright', 'English', 'Sorry, I cannot come tonight because I have to work. Do you understand?', '8d4b3445c8db87ed53b2262b639c79701528475e19989d5a5a1db774ff6b187a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-036-tidak-bisa-nanti-malam', 'bright', 'French', 'Désolé, je ne peux pas venir ce soir car je dois travailler. Comprends-tu ?', '8d4b3445c8db87ed53b2262b639c79701528475e19989d5a5a1db774ff6b187a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-036-tidak-bisa-nanti-malam', 'bright', 'German', 'Tut mir leid, ich kann heute Abend nicht kommen, weil ich arbeiten muss. Verstehst du?', '8d4b3445c8db87ed53b2262b639c79701528475e19989d5a5a1db774ff6b187a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-036-tidak-bisa-nanti-malam', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Maaf, saya tidak bisa datang nanti malam karena harus bekerja. Kamu mengerti?', '8d4b3445c8db87ed53b2262b639c79701528475e19989d5a5a1db774ff6b187a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-036-tidak-bisa-nanti-malam', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi dispiace, non posso venire stasera perché devo lavorare. Capisci?', '8d4b3445c8db87ed53b2262b639c79701528475e19989d5a5a1db774ff6b187a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-036-tidak-bisa-nanti-malam', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'ごめんなさい、仕事があるので今夜は行けません。わかりますか？', '8d4b3445c8db87ed53b2262b639c79701528475e19989d5a5a1db774ff6b187a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-036-tidak-bisa-nanti-malam', 'bright', 'Korean', '죄송하지만, 일 때문에 오늘 밤은 갈 수 없어요. 이해하시나요?', '8d4b3445c8db87ed53b2262b639c79701528475e19989d5a5a1db774ff6b187a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-036-tidak-bisa-nanti-malam', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, nie mogę dziś wieczorem przyjść, bo muszę pracować. Rozumiesz?', '8d4b3445c8db87ed53b2262b639c79701528475e19989d5a5a1db774ff6b187a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-036-tidak-bisa-nanti-malam', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Desculpe, não posso ir hoje à noite porque tenho que trabalhar. Você entende?', '8d4b3445c8db87ed53b2262b639c79701528475e19989d5a5a1db774ff6b187a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-036-tidak-bisa-nanti-malam', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, я не могу прийти сегодня вечером, потому что мне нужно работать. Вы понимаете?', '8d4b3445c8db87ed53b2262b639c79701528475e19989d5a5a1db774ff6b187a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-036-tidak-bisa-nanti-malam', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Lo siento, no puedo ir esta noche porque tengo que trabajar. ¿Entiendes?', '8d4b3445c8db87ed53b2262b639c79701528475e19989d5a5a1db774ff6b187a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-037-ayo-makan-malam-besok', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Manihapon ta ugma. Ikaw ang mopili sa dapit, ug ako ang mobayad.', '52b9c47073ac6b398f673dbe566a24916a9ec96db75930d51b222ba2955ab3a4'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-037-ayo-makan-malam-besok', 'bright', 'English', 'Let’s have dinner tomorrow. You choose the place, and I will pay.', '52b9c47073ac6b398f673dbe566a24916a9ec96db75930d51b222ba2955ab3a4'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-037-ayo-makan-malam-besok', 'bright', 'French', 'Dînons demain. Tu choisis l''endroit, et je paierai.', '52b9c47073ac6b398f673dbe566a24916a9ec96db75930d51b222ba2955ab3a4'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-037-ayo-makan-malam-besok', 'bright', 'German', 'Lass uns morgen Abend essen gehen. Du wählst den Ort aus, ich bezahle.', '52b9c47073ac6b398f673dbe566a24916a9ec96db75930d51b222ba2955ab3a4'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-037-ayo-makan-malam-besok', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Ayo makan malam besok. Kamu pilih tempatnya, saya yang bayar.', '52b9c47073ac6b398f673dbe566a24916a9ec96db75930d51b222ba2955ab3a4'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-037-ayo-makan-malam-besok', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ceniamo domani. Scegli tu il posto e io pago.', '52b9c47073ac6b398f673dbe566a24916a9ec96db75930d51b222ba2955ab3a4'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-037-ayo-makan-malam-besok', 'bright', 'Japanese', '明日、夕食にしましょう。場所はあなたが選んで、私が払います。', '52b9c47073ac6b398f673dbe566a24916a9ec96db75930d51b222ba2955ab3a4'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-037-ayo-makan-malam-besok', 'bright', 'Korean', '내일 저녁 먹자. 장소는 네가 고르고, 내가 낼게.', '52b9c47073ac6b398f673dbe566a24916a9ec96db75930d51b222ba2955ab3a4'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-037-ayo-makan-malam-besok', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Chodźmy jutro na kolację. Ty wybierasz miejsce, a ja zapłacę.', '52b9c47073ac6b398f673dbe566a24916a9ec96db75930d51b222ba2955ab3a4'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-037-ayo-makan-malam-besok', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Vamos jantar amanhã. Você escolhe o lugar, e eu pago.', '52b9c47073ac6b398f673dbe566a24916a9ec96db75930d51b222ba2955ab3a4'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-037-ayo-makan-malam-besok', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Давайте поужинаем завтра. Вы выбираете место, а я плачу.', '52b9c47073ac6b398f673dbe566a24916a9ec96db75930d51b222ba2955ab3a4'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-037-ayo-makan-malam-besok', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Vamos a cenar mañana. Tú eliges el lugar y yo pago.', '52b9c47073ac6b398f673dbe566a24916a9ec96db75930d51b222ba2955ab3a4'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-038-akan-terlambat-sepuluh-menit', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa, maulahi ko og napulo ka minuto. Paghulat lang sa cafe, okay?', 'a448112355bc9f9b9f87bb4b14ab6d8957006073d3b2ef05cd856a5d01dade93'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-038-akan-terlambat-sepuluh-menit', 'bright', 'English', 'Sorry, I will be ten minutes late. Wait at the cafe, okay?', 'a448112355bc9f9b9f87bb4b14ab6d8957006073d3b2ef05cd856a5d01dade93'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-038-akan-terlambat-sepuluh-menit', 'bright', 'French', 'Désolé, je serai en retard de dix minutes. Attends au café, d''accord ?', 'a448112355bc9f9b9f87bb4b14ab6d8957006073d3b2ef05cd856a5d01dade93'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-038-akan-terlambat-sepuluh-menit', 'bright', 'German', 'Tut mir leid, ich werde zehn Minuten zu spät sein. Warte bitte im Café, ja?', 'a448112355bc9f9b9f87bb4b14ab6d8957006073d3b2ef05cd856a5d01dade93'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-038-akan-terlambat-sepuluh-menit', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Maaf, saya akan terlambat sepuluh menit. Kamu tunggu di kafe, ya?', 'a448112355bc9f9b9f87bb4b14ab6d8957006073d3b2ef05cd856a5d01dade93'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-038-akan-terlambat-sepuluh-menit', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi dispiace, sarò in ritardo di dieci minuti. Aspetta al bar, ok?', 'a448112355bc9f9b9f87bb4b14ab6d8957006073d3b2ef05cd856a5d01dade93'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-038-akan-terlambat-sepuluh-menit', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'ごめんなさい、10分遅れます。カフェで待っていてくれますか？', 'a448112355bc9f9b9f87bb4b14ab6d8957006073d3b2ef05cd856a5d01dade93'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-038-akan-terlambat-sepuluh-menit', 'bright', 'Korean', '죄송해요, 십 분 늦을 거예요. 카페에서 기다려 줄래요, 네?', 'a448112355bc9f9b9f87bb4b14ab6d8957006073d3b2ef05cd856a5d01dade93'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-038-akan-terlambat-sepuluh-menit', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, będę dziesięć minut później. Poczekaj w kawiarni, dobrze?', 'a448112355bc9f9b9f87bb4b14ab6d8957006073d3b2ef05cd856a5d01dade93'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-038-akan-terlambat-sepuluh-menit', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Desculpe, vou me atrasar dez minutos. Espere no café, ok?', 'a448112355bc9f9b9f87bb4b14ab6d8957006073d3b2ef05cd856a5d01dade93'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-038-akan-terlambat-sepuluh-menit', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, я опоздаю на десять минут. Подождите в кафе, хорошо?', 'a448112355bc9f9b9f87bb4b14ab6d8957006073d3b2ef05cd856a5d01dade93'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-038-akan-terlambat-sepuluh-menit', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Lo siento, llegaré diez minutos tarde. Espera en la cafetería, ¿vale?', 'a448112355bc9f9b9f87bb4b14ab6d8957006073d3b2ef05cd856a5d01dade93'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-039-besok-bertemu-di-sini', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Busa, magkita ta diri ugma sa alas siyete, okay? Nahinumdom ka ba?', '92fc0d54c2e96192dd6cdcb0ebce277b6d6881a94134e7ff3a48457f9f3f5091'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-039-besok-bertemu-di-sini', 'bright', 'English', 'So, we meet here tomorrow at seven, okay? Do you remember?', '92fc0d54c2e96192dd6cdcb0ebce277b6d6881a94134e7ff3a48457f9f3f5091'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-039-besok-bertemu-di-sini', 'bright', 'French', 'Alors, on se retrouve ici demain à sept heures, d''accord ? Tu te souviens ?', '92fc0d54c2e96192dd6cdcb0ebce277b6d6881a94134e7ff3a48457f9f3f5091'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-039-besok-bertemu-di-sini', 'bright', 'German', 'Also, morgen treffen wir uns um sieben hier, ja? Erinnerst du dich?', '92fc0d54c2e96192dd6cdcb0ebce277b6d6881a94134e7ff3a48457f9f3f5091'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-039-besok-bertemu-di-sini', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Jadi, besok kita bertemu jam tujuh di sini, ya? Kamu ingat?', '92fc0d54c2e96192dd6cdcb0ebce277b6d6881a94134e7ff3a48457f9f3f5091'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-039-besok-bertemu-di-sini', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Quindi, ci incontriamo qui domani alle sette, ok? Ti ricordi?', '92fc0d54c2e96192dd6cdcb0ebce277b6d6881a94134e7ff3a48457f9f3f5091'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-039-besok-bertemu-di-sini', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'じゃあ、明日ここで7時に会いましょう、いい？覚えてる？', '92fc0d54c2e96192dd6cdcb0ebce277b6d6881a94134e7ff3a48457f9f3f5091'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-039-besok-bertemu-di-sini', 'bright', 'Korean', '그럼, 내일 일곱 시에 여기서 만나자, 알았지? 기억나?', '92fc0d54c2e96192dd6cdcb0ebce277b6d6881a94134e7ff3a48457f9f3f5091'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-039-besok-bertemu-di-sini', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Więc, spotykamy się tutaj jutro o siódmej, dobrze? Pamiętasz?', '92fc0d54c2e96192dd6cdcb0ebce277b6d6881a94134e7ff3a48457f9f3f5091'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-039-besok-bertemu-di-sini', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Então, nos encontramos aqui amanhã às sete, ok? Você se lembra?', '92fc0d54c2e96192dd6cdcb0ebce277b6d6881a94134e7ff3a48457f9f3f5091'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-039-besok-bertemu-di-sini', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Итак, мы встречаемся здесь завтра в семь, хорошо? Вы помните?', '92fc0d54c2e96192dd6cdcb0ebce277b6d6881a94134e7ff3a48457f9f3f5091'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-039-besok-bertemu-di-sini', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Entonces, ¿nos vemos aquí mañana a las siete, vale? ¿Recuerdas?', '92fc0d54c2e96192dd6cdcb0ebce277b6d6881a94134e7ff3a48457f9f3f5091'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-040-minggu-depan-ke-bogor', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Moadto ko sa Bogor sunod semana. Gusto ka bang mokuyog?', 'b0441bfe8222b5ed9631c6951b3266c2b9e218bc59e588d3a1fcc3ac5b345571'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-040-minggu-depan-ke-bogor', 'bright', 'English', 'I am going to Bogor next week. Do you want to come along?', 'b0441bfe8222b5ed9631c6951b3266c2b9e218bc59e588d3a1fcc3ac5b345571'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-040-minggu-depan-ke-bogor', 'bright', 'French', 'Je vais à Bogor la semaine prochaine. Veux-tu venir avec moi ?', 'b0441bfe8222b5ed9631c6951b3266c2b9e218bc59e588d3a1fcc3ac5b345571'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-040-minggu-depan-ke-bogor', 'bright', 'German', 'Nächste Woche möchte ich nach Bogor fahren. Möchtest du mitkommen?', 'b0441bfe8222b5ed9631c6951b3266c2b9e218bc59e588d3a1fcc3ac5b345571'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-040-minggu-depan-ke-bogor', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Minggu depan saya mau pergi ke Bogor. Kamu mau ikut?', 'b0441bfe8222b5ed9631c6951b3266c2b9e218bc59e588d3a1fcc3ac5b345571'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-040-minggu-depan-ke-bogor', 'bright', 'Italian', 'La prossima settimana andrò a Bogor. Vuoi venire?', 'b0441bfe8222b5ed9631c6951b3266c2b9e218bc59e588d3a1fcc3ac5b345571'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-040-minggu-depan-ke-bogor', 'bright', 'Japanese', '来週ボゴールに行きます。一緒に行きませんか？', 'b0441bfe8222b5ed9631c6951b3266c2b9e218bc59e588d3a1fcc3ac5b345571'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-040-minggu-depan-ke-bogor', 'bright', 'Korean', '다음 주에 보고로 갈 거예요. 같이 갈래요?', 'b0441bfe8222b5ed9631c6951b3266c2b9e218bc59e588d3a1fcc3ac5b345571'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-040-minggu-depan-ke-bogor', 'bright', 'Polish', 'W przyszłym tygodniu jadę do Bogor. Chcesz iść?', 'b0441bfe8222b5ed9631c6951b3266c2b9e218bc59e588d3a1fcc3ac5b345571'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-040-minggu-depan-ke-bogor', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Vou para Bogor na próxima semana. Você quer vir junto?', 'b0441bfe8222b5ed9631c6951b3266c2b9e218bc59e588d3a1fcc3ac5b345571'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-040-minggu-depan-ke-bogor', 'bright', 'Russian', 'На следующей неделе я собираюсь в Богор. Хотите поехать со мной?', 'b0441bfe8222b5ed9631c6951b3266c2b9e218bc59e588d3a1fcc3ac5b345571'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-4', 'indonesian-a2-practical-4-040-minggu-depan-ke-bogor', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'La próxima semana voy a Bogor. ¿Quieres venir conmigo?', 'b0441bfe8222b5ed9631c6951b3266c2b9e218bc59e588d3a1fcc3ac5b345571'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-041-tadi-pesan-teh-bukan-kopi', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nag-order ko og tsaa ganina, dili kape, Ma''am.', 'd86680ad7f0e567726c9733c095f89ed8bb3811841557af4aa1e7dfdc6ae969b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-041-tadi-pesan-teh-bukan-kopi', 'bright', 'English', 'I ordered tea earlier, not coffee, ma’am.', 'd86680ad7f0e567726c9733c095f89ed8bb3811841557af4aa1e7dfdc6ae969b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-041-tadi-pesan-teh-bukan-kopi', 'bright', 'French', 'J''avais commandé du thé tout à l''heure, pas du café, Madame.', 'd86680ad7f0e567726c9733c095f89ed8bb3811841557af4aa1e7dfdc6ae969b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-041-tadi-pesan-teh-bukan-kopi', 'bright', 'German', 'Vorhin habe ich Tee bestellt, nicht Kaffee.', 'd86680ad7f0e567726c9733c095f89ed8bb3811841557af4aa1e7dfdc6ae969b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-041-tadi-pesan-teh-bukan-kopi', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Tadi saya pesan teh, bukan kopi, Bu.', 'd86680ad7f0e567726c9733c095f89ed8bb3811841557af4aa1e7dfdc6ae969b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-041-tadi-pesan-teh-bukan-kopi', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Prima ho ordinato il tè, non il caffè, signora.', 'd86680ad7f0e567726c9733c095f89ed8bb3811841557af4aa1e7dfdc6ae969b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-041-tadi-pesan-teh-bukan-kopi', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'さっき紅茶を注文したのですが、コーヒーではありません、奥さん。', 'd86680ad7f0e567726c9733c095f89ed8bb3811841557af4aa1e7dfdc6ae969b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-041-tadi-pesan-teh-bukan-kopi', 'bright', 'Korean', '아까 차를 주문했는데, 커피가 아니라 차였어요, 부인.', 'd86680ad7f0e567726c9733c095f89ed8bb3811841557af4aa1e7dfdc6ae969b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-041-tadi-pesan-teh-bukan-kopi', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Zamówiłem wcześniej herbatę, nie kawę, proszę Pani.', 'd86680ad7f0e567726c9733c095f89ed8bb3811841557af4aa1e7dfdc6ae969b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-041-tadi-pesan-teh-bukan-kopi', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu pedi chá antes, não café, senhora.', 'd86680ad7f0e567726c9733c095f89ed8bb3811841557af4aa1e7dfdc6ae969b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-041-tadi-pesan-teh-bukan-kopi', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я заказывал чай раньше, а не кофе, мадам.', 'd86680ad7f0e567726c9733c095f89ed8bb3811841557af4aa1e7dfdc6ae969b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-041-tadi-pesan-teh-bukan-kopi', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Pedí té antes, no café, señora.', 'd86680ad7f0e567726c9733c095f89ed8bb3811841557af4aa1e7dfdc6ae969b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-042-boleh-ganti-ukuran', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa, kining kamisadentro gamay ra kaayo. Pwede ba nako kini ilisan og lahi nga gidak-on, Ma''am?', 'db23f3c7caf85dab3d38e6526b5fb166ca40864db2970e52e012cf685d140020'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-042-boleh-ganti-ukuran', 'bright', 'English', 'Excuse me, this shirt is too small. Could I exchange it for another size, ma’am?', 'db23f3c7caf85dab3d38e6526b5fb166ca40864db2970e52e012cf685d140020'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-042-boleh-ganti-ukuran', 'bright', 'French', 'Excusez-moi, cette chemise est trop petite. Pourrais-je l''échanger contre une autre taille, Madame ?', 'db23f3c7caf85dab3d38e6526b5fb166ca40864db2970e52e012cf685d140020'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-042-boleh-ganti-ukuran', 'bright', 'German', 'Entschuldigung, dieses Hemd ist zu klein. Kann ich es gegen eine andere Größe umtauschen?', 'db23f3c7caf85dab3d38e6526b5fb166ca40864db2970e52e012cf685d140020'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-042-boleh-ganti-ukuran', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Maaf, baju ini terlalu kecil. Boleh ganti ukuran, Bu?', 'db23f3c7caf85dab3d38e6526b5fb166ca40864db2970e52e012cf685d140020'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-042-boleh-ganti-ukuran', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi scusi, questa maglietta è troppo piccola. Potrei cambiarla con un''altra taglia, signora?', 'db23f3c7caf85dab3d38e6526b5fb166ca40864db2970e52e012cf685d140020'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-042-boleh-ganti-ukuran', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すみません、このシャツは小さすぎます。サイズ交換はできますか？', 'db23f3c7caf85dab3d38e6526b5fb166ca40864db2970e52e012cf685d140020'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-042-boleh-ganti-ukuran', 'bright', 'Korean', '실례합니다, 이 셔츠가 너무 작아요. 다른 사이즈로 교환할 수 있을까요, 아주머니?', 'db23f3c7caf85dab3d38e6526b5fb166ca40864db2970e52e012cf685d140020'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-042-boleh-ganti-ukuran', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, ta koszula jest za mała. Czy mogę ją wymienić na inny rozmiar, proszę pani?', 'db23f3c7caf85dab3d38e6526b5fb166ca40864db2970e52e012cf685d140020'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-042-boleh-ganti-ukuran', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Com licença, esta camisa é muito pequena. Poderia trocá-la por outro tamanho, senhora?', 'db23f3c7caf85dab3d38e6526b5fb166ca40864db2970e52e012cf685d140020'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-042-boleh-ganti-ukuran', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, эта рубашка слишком мала. Могу ли я обменять ее на другой размер, мадам?', 'db23f3c7caf85dab3d38e6526b5fb166ca40864db2970e52e012cf685d140020'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-042-boleh-ganti-ukuran', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Disculpe, esta camisa es demasiado pequeña. ¿Podría cambiarla por otra talla, señora?', 'db23f3c7caf85dab3d38e6526b5fb166ca40864db2970e52e012cf685d140020'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-043-minta-air-putih-saja', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa, pwede ba ko mangayo og lahi nga ilimnon na lang? Gusto ko og plain nga tubig, Ma''am.', '1cab1187578165f3ac68514b0dd14ffefe94ce83d73f336412d2b70be9b1e6b2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-043-minta-air-putih-saja', 'bright', 'English', 'Excuse me, could I have a different drink instead? I’d like plain water, ma’am.', '1cab1187578165f3ac68514b0dd14ffefe94ce83d73f336412d2b70be9b1e6b2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-043-minta-air-putih-saja', 'bright', 'French', 'Excusez-moi, puis-je avoir une autre boisson à la place ? Je voudrais de l''eau plate, Madame.', '1cab1187578165f3ac68514b0dd14ffefe94ce83d73f336412d2b70be9b1e6b2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-043-minta-air-putih-saja', 'bright', 'German', 'Entschuldigung, könnte ich stattdessen ein anderes Getränk bekommen? Ich hätte gern stilles Wasser.', '1cab1187578165f3ac68514b0dd14ffefe94ce83d73f336412d2b70be9b1e6b2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-043-minta-air-putih-saja', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Maaf, boleh ganti minumannya? Saya minta air putih saja, Bu.', '1cab1187578165f3ac68514b0dd14ffefe94ce83d73f336412d2b70be9b1e6b2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-043-minta-air-putih-saja', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi scusi, potrei avere una bevanda diversa invece? Vorrei solo acqua naturale, signora.', '1cab1187578165f3ac68514b0dd14ffefe94ce83d73f336412d2b70be9b1e6b2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-043-minta-air-putih-saja', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すみません、代わりに別の飲み物をいただけますか？普通の水をください。', '1cab1187578165f3ac68514b0dd14ffefe94ce83d73f336412d2b70be9b1e6b2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-043-minta-air-putih-saja', 'bright', 'Korean', '실례합니다, 다른 음료로 바꿔주시겠어요? 그냥 물로 주세요, 아주머니.', '1cab1187578165f3ac68514b0dd14ffefe94ce83d73f336412d2b70be9b1e6b2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-043-minta-air-putih-saja', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, czy mogę zamiast tego inny napój? Poproszę zwykłą wodę, proszę pani.', '1cab1187578165f3ac68514b0dd14ffefe94ce83d73f336412d2b70be9b1e6b2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-043-minta-air-putih-saja', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Com licença, posso pegar outra bebida? Eu gostaria de água pura, por favor.', '1cab1187578165f3ac68514b0dd14ffefe94ce83d73f336412d2b70be9b1e6b2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-043-minta-air-putih-saja', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, можно мне другой напиток вместо этого? Я бы хотел простую воду, мадам.', '1cab1187578165f3ac68514b0dd14ffefe94ce83d73f336412d2b70be9b1e6b2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-043-minta-air-putih-saja', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Disculpe, ¿podría tomar otra bebida en su lugar? Quisiera agua simple, señora.', '1cab1187578165f3ac68514b0dd14ffefe94ce83d73f336412d2b70be9b1e6b2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-044-minta-yang-itu-saja', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa, dili kini, Ma''am. Gusto ko og kadto na lang.', '12b889cb515c7d1729ef3babeaa60ecef3f7bc4adeb604608a9a1d508a407880'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-044-minta-yang-itu-saja', 'bright', 'English', 'Excuse me, not these, ma’am. I’d like those instead.', '12b889cb515c7d1729ef3babeaa60ecef3f7bc4adeb604608a9a1d508a407880'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-044-minta-yang-itu-saja', 'bright', 'French', 'Excusez-moi, pas ceux-ci, Madame. Je voudrais ceux-là à la place.', '12b889cb515c7d1729ef3babeaa60ecef3f7bc4adeb604608a9a1d508a407880'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-044-minta-yang-itu-saja', 'bright', 'German', 'Entschuldigung, nicht diese hier. Ich hätte gern die dort.', '12b889cb515c7d1729ef3babeaa60ecef3f7bc4adeb604608a9a1d508a407880'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-044-minta-yang-itu-saja', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Maaf, bukan yang ini, Bu. Saya minta yang itu saja.', '12b889cb515c7d1729ef3babeaa60ecef3f7bc4adeb604608a9a1d508a407880'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-044-minta-yang-itu-saja', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi scusi, non questi, signora. Vorrei quelli invece.', '12b889cb515c7d1729ef3babeaa60ecef3f7bc4adeb604608a9a1d508a407880'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-044-minta-yang-itu-saja', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すみません、これらではなく、あれをお願いします。', '12b889cb515c7d1729ef3babeaa60ecef3f7bc4adeb604608a9a1d508a407880'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-044-minta-yang-itu-saja', 'bright', 'Korean', '실례합니다, 이것 말고 저것으로 주세요, 아주머니. 저것으로 할게요.', '12b889cb515c7d1729ef3babeaa60ecef3f7bc4adeb604608a9a1d508a407880'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-044-minta-yang-itu-saja', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, nie te, proszę pani. Poproszę tamte zamiast tego.', '12b889cb515c7d1729ef3babeaa60ecef3f7bc4adeb604608a9a1d508a407880'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-044-minta-yang-itu-saja', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Com licença, não estes, senhora. Eu gostaria daqueles em vez disso.', '12b889cb515c7d1729ef3babeaa60ecef3f7bc4adeb604608a9a1d508a407880'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-044-minta-yang-itu-saja', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, не эти, мадам. Я бы хотел те вместо этого.', '12b889cb515c7d1729ef3babeaa60ecef3f7bc4adeb604608a9a1d508a407880'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-044-minta-yang-itu-saja', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Disculpe, no estas, señora. Quisiera esas en su lugar.', '12b889cb515c7d1729ef3babeaa60ecef3f7bc4adeb604608a9a1d508a407880'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-045-kamar-terlalu-berisik', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa, kining lawak saba kaayo. Pwede ba ko mobalhin og lawak, Ma''am?', 'f7bda1a48a589c18028719257404e24b667c17d438daa82e6609774be2495e85'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-045-kamar-terlalu-berisik', 'bright', 'English', 'Excuse me, this room is too noisy. May I change rooms, ma’am?', 'f7bda1a48a589c18028719257404e24b667c17d438daa82e6609774be2495e85'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-045-kamar-terlalu-berisik', 'bright', 'French', 'Excusez-moi, cette chambre est trop bruyante. Puis-je changer de chambre, Madame ?', 'f7bda1a48a589c18028719257404e24b667c17d438daa82e6609774be2495e85'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-045-kamar-terlalu-berisik', 'bright', 'German', 'Entschuldigung, dieses Zimmer ist zu laut. Kann ich das Zimmer wechseln?', 'f7bda1a48a589c18028719257404e24b667c17d438daa82e6609774be2495e85'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-045-kamar-terlalu-berisik', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Maaf, kamar ini terlalu berisik. Boleh ganti kamar, Bu?', 'f7bda1a48a589c18028719257404e24b667c17d438daa82e6609774be2495e85'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-045-kamar-terlalu-berisik', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi scusi, questa stanza è troppo rumorosa. Posso cambiare stanza, signora?', 'f7bda1a48a589c18028719257404e24b667c17d438daa82e6609774be2495e85'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-045-kamar-terlalu-berisik', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すみません、この部屋はうるさすぎます。部屋の変更はできますか？', 'f7bda1a48a589c18028719257404e24b667c17d438daa82e6609774be2495e85'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-045-kamar-terlalu-berisik', 'bright', 'Korean', '실례합니다, 이 방이 너무 시끄러워요. 방을 바꿀 수 있을까요, 아주머니?', 'f7bda1a48a589c18028719257404e24b667c17d438daa82e6609774be2495e85'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-045-kamar-terlalu-berisik', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, ten pokój jest za głośny. Czy mogę zmienić pokój, proszę pani?', 'f7bda1a48a589c18028719257404e24b667c17d438daa82e6609774be2495e85'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-045-kamar-terlalu-berisik', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Com licença, este quarto está muito barulhento. Posso trocar de quarto, senhora?', 'f7bda1a48a589c18028719257404e24b667c17d438daa82e6609774be2495e85'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-045-kamar-terlalu-berisik', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, этот номер слишком шумный. Могу я сменить номер, мадам?', 'f7bda1a48a589c18028719257404e24b667c17d438daa82e6609774be2495e85'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-045-kamar-terlalu-berisik', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Disculpe, esta habitación está demasiado ruidosa. ¿Puedo cambiar de habitación, señora?', 'f7bda1a48a589c18028719257404e24b667c17d438daa82e6609774be2495e85'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-046-cukup-yang-ini-saja', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Dili, salamat, Ma''am. Kini lang ang igo na.', '7de070f89d14008a679a57793640b68335c5875ff4332a2c4612e61cdbe0b3c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-046-cukup-yang-ini-saja', 'bright', 'English', 'No, thank you, ma’am. This one alone is enough.', '7de070f89d14008a679a57793640b68335c5875ff4332a2c4612e61cdbe0b3c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-046-cukup-yang-ini-saja', 'bright', 'French', 'Non, merci, Madame. Celui-ci seul suffit.', '7de070f89d14008a679a57793640b68335c5875ff4332a2c4612e61cdbe0b3c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-046-cukup-yang-ini-saja', 'bright', 'German', 'Nein, danke. Nur dieses hier reicht mir.', '7de070f89d14008a679a57793640b68335c5875ff4332a2c4612e61cdbe0b3c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-046-cukup-yang-ini-saja', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Tidak, terima kasih, Bu. Cukup yang ini saja.', '7de070f89d14008a679a57793640b68335c5875ff4332a2c4612e61cdbe0b3c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-046-cukup-yang-ini-saja', 'bright', 'Italian', 'No, grazie, signora. Questo da solo è sufficiente.', '7de070f89d14008a679a57793640b68335c5875ff4332a2c4612e61cdbe0b3c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-046-cukup-yang-ini-saja', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'いいえ、結構です。これだけで十分です。', '7de070f89d14008a679a57793640b68335c5875ff4332a2c4612e61cdbe0b3c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-046-cukup-yang-ini-saja', 'bright', 'Korean', '아니요, 감사합니다, 아주머니. 이것만으로도 충분해요.', '7de070f89d14008a679a57793640b68335c5875ff4332a2c4612e61cdbe0b3c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-046-cukup-yang-ini-saja', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Nie, dziękuję, proszę pani. Ten sam wystarczy.', '7de070f89d14008a679a57793640b68335c5875ff4332a2c4612e61cdbe0b3c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-046-cukup-yang-ini-saja', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Não, obrigado, senhora. Só isto já é suficiente.', '7de070f89d14008a679a57793640b68335c5875ff4332a2c4612e61cdbe0b3c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-046-cukup-yang-ini-saja', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Нет, спасибо, мадам. Этого одного достаточно.', '7de070f89d14008a679a57793640b68335c5875ff4332a2c4612e61cdbe0b3c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-046-cukup-yang-ini-saja', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'No, gracias, señora. Solo esto es suficiente.', '7de070f89d14008a679a57793640b68335c5875ff4332a2c4612e61cdbe0b3c1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-047-sepertinya-salah-hitung', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa ko, ma’am, morag naay sayop sa pag-compute. Pwede nimo susihon pag-usab?', 'cc82c877bda7bdfed97370d78a66cb0bae7ea2a2ec94bc2742ea79d766a5a5ac'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-047-sepertinya-salah-hitung', 'bright', 'English', 'Excuse me, ma’am, there seems to be a calculation error. Can you check again?', 'cc82c877bda7bdfed97370d78a66cb0bae7ea2a2ec94bc2742ea79d766a5a5ac'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-047-sepertinya-salah-hitung', 'bright', 'French', 'Excusez-moi, Madame, il semble y avoir une erreur de calcul. Pouvez-vous vérifier à nouveau ?', 'cc82c877bda7bdfed97370d78a66cb0bae7ea2a2ec94bc2742ea79d766a5a5ac'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-047-sepertinya-salah-hitung', 'bright', 'German', 'Entschuldigung, anscheinend stimmt die Rechnung nicht. Können Sie noch einmal nachsehen?', 'cc82c877bda7bdfed97370d78a66cb0bae7ea2a2ec94bc2742ea79d766a5a5ac'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-047-sepertinya-salah-hitung', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Maaf, Bu, sepertinya salah hitung. Bisa periksa lagi?', 'cc82c877bda7bdfed97370d78a66cb0bae7ea2a2ec94bc2742ea79d766a5a5ac'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-047-sepertinya-salah-hitung', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi scusi, signora, sembra esserci un errore di calcolo. Può ricontrollare?', 'cc82c877bda7bdfed97370d78a66cb0bae7ea2a2ec94bc2742ea79d766a5a5ac'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-047-sepertinya-salah-hitung', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すみません、計算間違いのようですが、もう一度確認していただけますか？', 'cc82c877bda7bdfed97370d78a66cb0bae7ea2a2ec94bc2742ea79d766a5a5ac'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-047-sepertinya-salah-hitung', 'bright', 'Korean', '실례합니다, 아주머니, 계산 착오가 있는 것 같습니다. 다시 확인해 주시겠어요?', 'cc82c877bda7bdfed97370d78a66cb0bae7ea2a2ec94bc2742ea79d766a5a5ac'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-047-sepertinya-salah-hitung', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, proszę pani, wygląda na to, że jest błąd w obliczeniach. Czy może pani sprawdzić jeszcze raz?', 'cc82c877bda7bdfed97370d78a66cb0bae7ea2a2ec94bc2742ea79d766a5a5ac'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-047-sepertinya-salah-hitung', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Com licença, senhora, parece haver um erro de cálculo. Você pode verificar novamente?', 'cc82c877bda7bdfed97370d78a66cb0bae7ea2a2ec94bc2742ea79d766a5a5ac'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-047-sepertinya-salah-hitung', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, мадам, кажется, произошла ошибка в расчетах. Можете проверить еще раз?', 'cc82c877bda7bdfed97370d78a66cb0bae7ea2a2ec94bc2742ea79d766a5a5ac'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-047-sepertinya-salah-hitung', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Disculpe, señora, parece que hay un error de cálculo. ¿Puede revisar de nuevo?', 'cc82c877bda7bdfed97370d78a66cb0bae7ea2a2ec94bc2742ea79d766a5a5ac'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-048-minta-kemasan-lebih-kecil', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa ko, pwede ba ko mangayo og mas gamay nga putos, ma’am?', 'b725c68c762bf8d98632e9c363a887cafd89c1ba74d6e6b8422d3d350c766d91'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-048-minta-kemasan-lebih-kecil', 'bright', 'English', 'Excuse me, may I have a smaller pack, ma’am?', 'b725c68c762bf8d98632e9c363a887cafd89c1ba74d6e6b8422d3d350c766d91'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-048-minta-kemasan-lebih-kecil', 'bright', 'French', 'Excusez-moi, puis-je avoir un paquet plus petit, Madame ?', 'b725c68c762bf8d98632e9c363a887cafd89c1ba74d6e6b8422d3d350c766d91'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-048-minta-kemasan-lebih-kecil', 'bright', 'German', 'Entschuldigung, könnte ich bitte eine kleinere Packung bekommen?', 'b725c68c762bf8d98632e9c363a887cafd89c1ba74d6e6b8422d3d350c766d91'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-048-minta-kemasan-lebih-kecil', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Maaf, boleh minta kemasan yang lebih kecil, Bu?', 'b725c68c762bf8d98632e9c363a887cafd89c1ba74d6e6b8422d3d350c766d91'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-048-minta-kemasan-lebih-kecil', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi scusi, posso avere una confezione più piccola, signora?', 'b725c68c762bf8d98632e9c363a887cafd89c1ba74d6e6b8422d3d350c766d91'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-048-minta-kemasan-lebih-kecil', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すみません、小さいパックをいただけますか？', 'b725c68c762bf8d98632e9c363a887cafd89c1ba74d6e6b8422d3d350c766d91'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-048-minta-kemasan-lebih-kecil', 'bright', 'Korean', '실례합니다, 더 작은 포장으로 주시겠어요, 아주머니?', 'b725c68c762bf8d98632e9c363a887cafd89c1ba74d6e6b8422d3d350c766d91'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-048-minta-kemasan-lebih-kecil', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, czy mogę prosić o mniejszy pakiet, proszę pani?', 'b725c68c762bf8d98632e9c363a887cafd89c1ba74d6e6b8422d3d350c766d91'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-048-minta-kemasan-lebih-kecil', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Com licença, posso pegar um pacote menor, senhora?', 'b725c68c762bf8d98632e9c363a887cafd89c1ba74d6e6b8422d3d350c766d91'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-048-minta-kemasan-lebih-kecil', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, могу я получить меньшую упаковку, мадам?', 'b725c68c762bf8d98632e9c363a887cafd89c1ba74d6e6b8422d3d350c766d91'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-048-minta-kemasan-lebih-kecil', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Disculpe, ¿podría darme un paquete más pequeño, señora?', 'b725c68c762bf8d98632e9c363a887cafd89c1ba74d6e6b8422d3d350c766d91'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-049-tujuan-stasiun-bukan-mal', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa ko, sir, ang akong destinasyon mao ang estasyon, dili ang mall.', '15d64418550580f2be49d3c8df7e7f735592c44b6bb8a919d545e90cc052ebbb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-049-tujuan-stasiun-bukan-mal', 'bright', 'English', 'Excuse me, sir, my destination is the station, not the mall.', '15d64418550580f2be49d3c8df7e7f735592c44b6bb8a919d545e90cc052ebbb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-049-tujuan-stasiun-bukan-mal', 'bright', 'French', 'Excusez-moi, Monsieur, ma destination est la gare, pas le centre commercial.', '15d64418550580f2be49d3c8df7e7f735592c44b6bb8a919d545e90cc052ebbb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-049-tujuan-stasiun-bukan-mal', 'bright', 'German', 'Entschuldigung, mein Ziel ist der Bahnhof, nicht das Einkaufszentrum.', '15d64418550580f2be49d3c8df7e7f735592c44b6bb8a919d545e90cc052ebbb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-049-tujuan-stasiun-bukan-mal', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Maaf, Pak, tujuan saya stasiun, bukan mal.', '15d64418550580f2be49d3c8df7e7f735592c44b6bb8a919d545e90cc052ebbb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-049-tujuan-stasiun-bukan-mal', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi scusi, signore, la mia destinazione è la stazione, non il centro commerciale.', '15d64418550580f2be49d3c8df7e7f735592c44b6bb8a919d545e90cc052ebbb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-049-tujuan-stasiun-bukan-mal', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すみません、私の目的地は駅で、モールではありません。', '15d64418550580f2be49d3c8df7e7f735592c44b6bb8a919d545e90cc052ebbb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-049-tujuan-stasiun-bukan-mal', 'bright', 'Korean', '실례합니다, 기사님, 제 목적지는 쇼핑몰이 아니라 정거장입니다.', '15d64418550580f2be49d3c8df7e7f735592c44b6bb8a919d545e90cc052ebbb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-049-tujuan-stasiun-bukan-mal', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, proszę pana, moim celem jest stacja, a nie centrum handlowe.', '15d64418550580f2be49d3c8df7e7f735592c44b6bb8a919d545e90cc052ebbb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-049-tujuan-stasiun-bukan-mal', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Com licença, senhor, meu destino é a estação, não o shopping.', '15d64418550580f2be49d3c8df7e7f735592c44b6bb8a919d545e90cc052ebbb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-049-tujuan-stasiun-bukan-mal', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, сэр, мой пункт назначения — станция, а не торговый центр.', '15d64418550580f2be49d3c8df7e7f735592c44b6bb8a919d545e90cc052ebbb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-049-tujuan-stasiun-bukan-mal', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Disculpe, señor, mi destino es la estación, no el centro comercial.', '15d64418550580f2be49d3c8df7e7f735592c44b6bb8a919d545e90cc052ebbb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-050-maaf-hari-ini-tidak-bisa', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa, dili ko pwede karon, sir. Sa laing higayon, okay?', 'c701d4debd850f16b4b0dc35b9139ab7cf907d1462cb74eaa1053bdb1bf7ef98'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-050-maaf-hari-ini-tidak-bisa', 'bright', 'English', 'Sorry, I cannot today, sir. Another time, okay?', 'c701d4debd850f16b4b0dc35b9139ab7cf907d1462cb74eaa1053bdb1bf7ef98'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-050-maaf-hari-ini-tidak-bisa', 'bright', 'French', 'Désolé, je ne peux pas aujourd''hui, monsieur. Une autre fois, d''accord ?', 'c701d4debd850f16b4b0dc35b9139ab7cf907d1462cb74eaa1053bdb1bf7ef98'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-050-maaf-hari-ini-tidak-bisa', 'bright', 'German', 'Entschuldigung, heute kann ich leider nicht. Ein anderes Mal, ja?', 'c701d4debd850f16b4b0dc35b9139ab7cf907d1462cb74eaa1053bdb1bf7ef98'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-050-maaf-hari-ini-tidak-bisa', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Maaf, hari ini saya tidak bisa, Pak. Lain kali, ya.', 'c701d4debd850f16b4b0dc35b9139ab7cf907d1462cb74eaa1053bdb1bf7ef98'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-050-maaf-hari-ini-tidak-bisa', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi dispiace, oggi non posso, signore. Un''altra volta, va bene?', 'c701d4debd850f16b4b0dc35b9139ab7cf907d1462cb74eaa1053bdb1bf7ef98'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-050-maaf-hari-ini-tidak-bisa', 'bright', 'Japanese', '申し訳ありませんが、今日は無理です、お客様。また今度でよろしいでしょうか？', 'c701d4debd850f16b4b0dc35b9139ab7cf907d1462cb74eaa1053bdb1bf7ef98'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-050-maaf-hari-ini-tidak-bisa', 'bright', 'Korean', '죄송합니다, 오늘은 안 됩니다, 선생님. 다음에 부탁드려도 될까요?', 'c701d4debd850f16b4b0dc35b9139ab7cf907d1462cb74eaa1053bdb1bf7ef98'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-050-maaf-hari-ini-tidak-bisa', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, dzisiaj nie mogę, proszę Pana. Innym razem, dobrze?', 'c701d4debd850f16b4b0dc35b9139ab7cf907d1462cb74eaa1053bdb1bf7ef98'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-050-maaf-hari-ini-tidak-bisa', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Desculpe, não posso hoje, senhor. Outra hora, tudo bem?', 'c701d4debd850f16b4b0dc35b9139ab7cf907d1462cb74eaa1053bdb1bf7ef98'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-050-maaf-hari-ini-tidak-bisa', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, сегодня не могу, сэр. В другой раз, хорошо?', 'c701d4debd850f16b4b0dc35b9139ab7cf907d1462cb74eaa1053bdb1bf7ef98'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-5', 'indonesian-a2-practical-5-050-maaf-hari-ini-tidak-bisa', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Lo siento, hoy no puedo, señor. ¿Otra vez será?', 'c701d4debd850f16b4b0dc35b9139ab7cf907d1462cb74eaa1053bdb1bf7ef98'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-051-tiga-baju-untuk-laundry', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Gusto nako ipa-laundry kining tulo ka sinina, ma’am. Kanus-a kini mahuman?', 'f949b9b24a0534f4cd98d6db413c3fd1e6799d623acd78619a1da4ac990ca440'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-051-tiga-baju-untuk-laundry', 'bright', 'English', 'I would like to have these three items washed, ma’am. When can they be done?', 'f949b9b24a0534f4cd98d6db413c3fd1e6799d623acd78619a1da4ac990ca440'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-051-tiga-baju-untuk-laundry', 'bright', 'French', 'Je voudrais faire laver ces trois articles, madame. Quand seront-ils prêts ?', 'f949b9b24a0534f4cd98d6db413c3fd1e6799d623acd78619a1da4ac990ca440'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-051-tiga-baju-untuk-laundry', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich möchte diese drei Kleidungsstücke waschen lassen. Wann sind sie fertig?', 'f949b9b24a0534f4cd98d6db413c3fd1e6799d623acd78619a1da4ac990ca440'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-051-tiga-baju-untuk-laundry', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya mau laundry tiga baju ini, Bu. Kapan bisa selesai?', 'f949b9b24a0534f4cd98d6db413c3fd1e6799d623acd78619a1da4ac990ca440'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-051-tiga-baju-untuk-laundry', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Vorrei far lavare questi tre capi, signora. Quando saranno pronti?', 'f949b9b24a0534f4cd98d6db413c3fd1e6799d623acd78619a1da4ac990ca440'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-051-tiga-baju-untuk-laundry', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'これらの3点を洗濯していただきたいのですが、奥様。いつ仕上がりますか？', 'f949b9b24a0534f4cd98d6db413c3fd1e6799d623acd78619a1da4ac990ca440'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-051-tiga-baju-untuk-laundry', 'bright', 'Korean', '이 세 가지를 세탁하고 싶습니다, 부인. 언제 완료될까요?', 'f949b9b24a0534f4cd98d6db413c3fd1e6799d623acd78619a1da4ac990ca440'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-051-tiga-baju-untuk-laundry', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Chciałabym wyprać te trzy rzeczy, proszę Pani. Kiedy mogą być gotowe?', 'f949b9b24a0534f4cd98d6db413c3fd1e6799d623acd78619a1da4ac990ca440'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-051-tiga-baju-untuk-laundry', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu gostaria de lavar estas três peças, senhora. Quando elas podem ficar prontas?', 'f949b9b24a0534f4cd98d6db413c3fd1e6799d623acd78619a1da4ac990ca440'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-051-tiga-baju-untuk-laundry', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я хотел бы постирать эти три предмета, мадам. Когда их можно будет сделать?', 'f949b9b24a0534f4cd98d6db413c3fd1e6799d623acd78619a1da4ac990ca440'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-051-tiga-baju-untuk-laundry', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Quisiera lavar estas tres prendas, señora. ¿Cuándo estarán listas?', 'f949b9b24a0534f4cd98d6db413c3fd1e6799d623acd78619a1da4ac990ca440'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-052-perbaiki-layar-telepon', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pwede nimo ayohon kining screen sa telepono, sir? Guba ang screen.', '0dd63b2946af4080a292e0d44767f30a17ddd9416c55060d7961ed9a27a840cf'),
