  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-057-sewa-sepeda-dua-hari', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Noleggio questa bicicletta per due giorni, signore.', '9bc77b7ee776dd95d7cbf7fc9593dcf389e8f6aa26b8a52a8f770d9b2ad3f8d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-057-sewa-sepeda-dua-hari', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'この自転車を2日間レンタルしています、お客様。', '9bc77b7ee776dd95d7cbf7fc9593dcf389e8f6aa26b8a52a8f770d9b2ad3f8d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-057-sewa-sepeda-dua-hari', 'bright', 'Korean', '이 자전거를 이틀 동안 빌리겠습니다, 선생님.', '9bc77b7ee776dd95d7cbf7fc9593dcf389e8f6aa26b8a52a8f770d9b2ad3f8d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-057-sewa-sepeda-dua-hari', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Wypożyczam ten rower na dwa dni, proszę Pana.', '9bc77b7ee776dd95d7cbf7fc9593dcf389e8f6aa26b8a52a8f770d9b2ad3f8d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-057-sewa-sepeda-dua-hari', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Estou alugando esta bicicleta por dois dias, senhor.', '9bc77b7ee776dd95d7cbf7fc9593dcf389e8f6aa26b8a52a8f770d9b2ad3f8d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-057-sewa-sepeda-dua-hari', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я арендую этот велосипед на два дня, сэр.', '9bc77b7ee776dd95d7cbf7fc9593dcf389e8f6aa26b8a52a8f770d9b2ad3f8d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-057-sewa-sepeda-dua-hari', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Estoy alquilando esta bicicleta por dos días, señor.', '9bc77b7ee776dd95d7cbf7fc9593dcf389e8f6aa26b8a52a8f770d9b2ad3f8d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-058-toko-buka-sampai-kapan', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa, hangtod unsang orasa bukas kining tindahan, ma’am?', 'f2519b05267832302bad759abc630d2e4da35c0ed12f9ae16ba8c2816ec692c2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-058-toko-buka-sampai-kapan', 'bright', 'English', 'Excuse me, what time is this shop open until, ma’am?', 'f2519b05267832302bad759abc630d2e4da35c0ed12f9ae16ba8c2816ec692c2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-058-toko-buka-sampai-kapan', 'bright', 'French', 'Excusez-moi, jusqu''à quelle heure ce magasin est-il ouvert, madame ?', 'f2519b05267832302bad759abc630d2e4da35c0ed12f9ae16ba8c2816ec692c2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-058-toko-buka-sampai-kapan', 'bright', 'German', 'Entschuldigung, bis wie viel Uhr ist dieses Geschäft geöffnet?', 'f2519b05267832302bad759abc630d2e4da35c0ed12f9ae16ba8c2816ec692c2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-058-toko-buka-sampai-kapan', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Permisi, toko ini buka sampai jam berapa, Bu?', 'f2519b05267832302bad759abc630d2e4da35c0ed12f9ae16ba8c2816ec692c2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-058-toko-buka-sampai-kapan', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi scusi, a che ora chiude questo negozio, signora?', 'f2519b05267832302bad759abc630d2e4da35c0ed12f9ae16ba8c2816ec692c2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-058-toko-buka-sampai-kapan', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すみません、このお店は何時まで開いていますか？', 'f2519b05267832302bad759abc630d2e4da35c0ed12f9ae16ba8c2816ec692c2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-058-toko-buka-sampai-kapan', 'bright', 'Korean', '실례합니다, 이 가게는 몇 시까지 하나요?', 'f2519b05267832302bad759abc630d2e4da35c0ed12f9ae16ba8c2816ec692c2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-058-toko-buka-sampai-kapan', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, do której godziny jest dzisiaj otwarty ten sklep, proszę pani?', 'f2519b05267832302bad759abc630d2e4da35c0ed12f9ae16ba8c2816ec692c2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-058-toko-buka-sampai-kapan', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Com licença, até que horas esta loja fica aberta, senhora?', 'f2519b05267832302bad759abc630d2e4da35c0ed12f9ae16ba8c2816ec692c2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-058-toko-buka-sampai-kapan', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Простите, до скольки открыт этот магазин, мэм?', 'f2519b05267832302bad759abc630d2e4da35c0ed12f9ae16ba8c2816ec692c2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-058-toko-buka-sampai-kapan', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Disculpe, ¿hasta qué hora está abierta esta tienda, señora?', 'f2519b05267832302bad759abc630d2e4da35c0ed12f9ae16ba8c2816ec692c2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-059-teleponnya-siap', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Kuhaon nako ang akong telepono, sir. Andam na ba kini?', '729aca079b387ba3716b65b6660f7a8fadc4780359eb47b6673e7f62dbc277f0'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-059-teleponnya-siap', 'bright', 'English', 'I am picking up my phone, sir. Is it ready?', '729aca079b387ba3716b65b6660f7a8fadc4780359eb47b6673e7f62dbc277f0'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-059-teleponnya-siap', 'bright', 'French', 'Je viens chercher mon téléphone, monsieur. Est-il prêt ?', '729aca079b387ba3716b65b6660f7a8fadc4780359eb47b6673e7f62dbc277f0'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-059-teleponnya-siap', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich hole mein Handy ab. Ist es bereit?', '729aca079b387ba3716b65b6660f7a8fadc4780359eb47b6673e7f62dbc277f0'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-059-teleponnya-siap', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya ambil telepon saya, Pak. Teleponnya siap?', '729aca079b387ba3716b65b6660f7a8fadc4780359eb47b6673e7f62dbc277f0'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-059-teleponnya-siap', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Sto ritirando il mio telefono, signore. È pronto?', '729aca079b387ba3716b65b6660f7a8fadc4780359eb47b6673e7f62dbc277f0'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-059-teleponnya-siap', 'bright', 'Japanese', '電話を受け取りに来ました。準備はできていますか？', '729aca079b387ba3716b65b6660f7a8fadc4780359eb47b6673e7f62dbc277f0'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-059-teleponnya-siap', 'bright', 'Korean', '전화 찾으러 왔습니다. 준비되었나요?', '729aca079b387ba3716b65b6660f7a8fadc4780359eb47b6673e7f62dbc277f0'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-059-teleponnya-siap', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Odbieram mój telefon, proszę pana. Czy jest gotowy?', '729aca079b387ba3716b65b6660f7a8fadc4780359eb47b6673e7f62dbc277f0'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-059-teleponnya-siap', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Estou pegando meu telefone, senhor. Está pronto?', '729aca079b387ba3716b65b6660f7a8fadc4780359eb47b6673e7f62dbc277f0'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-059-teleponnya-siap', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я забираю свой телефон, сэр. Он готов?', '729aca079b387ba3716b65b6660f7a8fadc4780359eb47b6673e7f62dbc277f0'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-059-teleponnya-siap', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Recojo mi teléfono, señor. ¿Está listo?', '729aca079b387ba3716b65b6660f7a8fadc4780359eb47b6673e7f62dbc277f0'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-060-semua-urusan-selesai', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Salamat, ma’am. Kompleto na ang tanang buluhaton. Magkita ta sa Huwebes.', '9d9d18fb1f5f24f991f32ce18fb7fcf0be388c58ddc12074551a3fa34ec6f1ba'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-060-semua-urusan-selesai', 'bright', 'English', 'Thank you, ma’am. All the errands are complete. See you on Thursday.', '9d9d18fb1f5f24f991f32ce18fb7fcf0be388c58ddc12074551a3fa34ec6f1ba'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-060-semua-urusan-selesai', 'bright', 'French', 'Merci, madame. Toutes les courses sont terminées. À jeudi.', '9d9d18fb1f5f24f991f32ce18fb7fcf0be388c58ddc12074551a3fa34ec6f1ba'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-060-semua-urusan-selesai', 'bright', 'German', 'Vielen Dank. Alle Besorgungen sind erledigt. Bis Donnerstag.', '9d9d18fb1f5f24f991f32ce18fb7fcf0be388c58ddc12074551a3fa34ec6f1ba'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-060-semua-urusan-selesai', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Terima kasih, Bu. Semua urusan selesai. Sampai hari Kamis.', '9d9d18fb1f5f24f991f32ce18fb7fcf0be388c58ddc12074551a3fa34ec6f1ba'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-060-semua-urusan-selesai', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Grazie, signora. Tutte le commissioni sono completate. Ci vediamo giovedì.', '9d9d18fb1f5f24f991f32ce18fb7fcf0be388c58ddc12074551a3fa34ec6f1ba'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-060-semua-urusan-selesai', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'ありがとうございます。すべての用事が終わりました。木曜日にまたお会いしましょう。', '9d9d18fb1f5f24f991f32ce18fb7fcf0be388c58ddc12074551a3fa34ec6f1ba'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-060-semua-urusan-selesai', 'bright', 'Korean', '감사합니다, 부인. 모든 심부름이 완료되었습니다. 목요일에 뵙겠습니다.', '9d9d18fb1f5f24f991f32ce18fb7fcf0be388c58ddc12074551a3fa34ec6f1ba'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-060-semua-urusan-selesai', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Dziękuję, proszę pani. Wszystkie sprawy załatwione. Do zobaczenia w czwartek.', '9d9d18fb1f5f24f991f32ce18fb7fcf0be388c58ddc12074551a3fa34ec6f1ba'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-060-semua-urusan-selesai', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Obrigada, senhora. Todas as tarefas foram concluídas. Vejo você na quinta-feira.', '9d9d18fb1f5f24f991f32ce18fb7fcf0be388c58ddc12074551a3fa34ec6f1ba'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-060-semua-urusan-selesai', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Спасибо, мэм. Все поручения выполнены. До четверга.', '9d9d18fb1f5f24f991f32ce18fb7fcf0be388c58ddc12074551a3fa34ec6f1ba'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-6', 'indonesian-a2-practical-6-060-semua-urusan-selesai', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Gracias, señora. Todos los recados están completos. Nos vemos el jueves.', '9d9d18fb1f5f24f991f32ce18fb7fcf0be388c58ddc12074551a3fa34ec6f1ba'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-061-apa-rekomendasi-ibu', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Unsay imong girekomendar, ma’am? Gusto ko og pagkaon nga lami ug gaan.', 'e5b5c9ae511ec843346116016bfe9061a09f81b3db9eb80c9f0fd735fc679478'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-061-apa-rekomendasi-ibu', 'bright', 'English', 'What do you recommend, ma’am? I would like food that is tasty and light.', 'e5b5c9ae511ec843346116016bfe9061a09f81b3db9eb80c9f0fd735fc679478'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-061-apa-rekomendasi-ibu', 'bright', 'French', 'Que recommandez-vous, madame ? Je voudrais un plat savoureux et léger.', 'e5b5c9ae511ec843346116016bfe9061a09f81b3db9eb80c9f0fd735fc679478'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-061-apa-rekomendasi-ibu', 'bright', 'German', 'Was empfehlen Sie? Ich möchte ein Gericht, das lecker und leicht ist.', 'e5b5c9ae511ec843346116016bfe9061a09f81b3db9eb80c9f0fd735fc679478'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-061-apa-rekomendasi-ibu', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Apa rekomendasi Ibu? Saya ingin makanan yang enak dan ringan.', 'e5b5c9ae511ec843346116016bfe9061a09f81b3db9eb80c9f0fd735fc679478'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-061-apa-rekomendasi-ibu', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Cosa consiglia, signora? Vorrei del cibo gustoso e leggero.', 'e5b5c9ae511ec843346116016bfe9061a09f81b3db9eb80c9f0fd735fc679478'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-061-apa-rekomendasi-ibu', 'bright', 'Japanese', '何をおすすめしますか？美味しくて軽い食べ物が欲しいのですが。', 'e5b5c9ae511ec843346116016bfe9061a09f81b3db9eb80c9f0fd735fc679478'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-061-apa-rekomendasi-ibu', 'bright', 'Korean', '무엇을 추천하시나요? 맛있고 가벼운 음식을 원합니다.', 'e5b5c9ae511ec843346116016bfe9061a09f81b3db9eb80c9f0fd735fc679478'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-061-apa-rekomendasi-ibu', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Co pani poleca? Chciałbym coś smacznego i lekkiego do jedzenia.', 'e5b5c9ae511ec843346116016bfe9061a09f81b3db9eb80c9f0fd735fc679478'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-061-apa-rekomendasi-ibu', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'O que a senhora recomenda? Gostaria de uma comida saborosa e leve.', 'e5b5c9ae511ec843346116016bfe9061a09f81b3db9eb80c9f0fd735fc679478'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-061-apa-rekomendasi-ibu', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Что вы порекомендуете, мэм? Я бы хотел еду вкусную и легкую.', 'e5b5c9ae511ec843346116016bfe9061a09f81b3db9eb80c9f0fd735fc679478'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-061-apa-rekomendasi-ibu', 'bright', 'Spanish', '¿Qué me recomienda, señora? Quisiera comida que sea sabrosa y ligera.', 'e5b5c9ae511ec843346116016bfe9061a09f81b3db9eb80c9f0fd735fc679478'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-062-kalau-begitu-pilih-itu', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Kon mao kana, pilion nako kana, ma’am. Morag presko ug gaan kini.', 'ae4780faa06392fe88f621d2c8f064d934007079c7bfbc00eecf08723ec306de'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-062-kalau-begitu-pilih-itu', 'bright', 'English', 'In that case, I choose that, ma’am. It looks fresh and light.', 'ae4780faa06392fe88f621d2c8f064d934007079c7bfbc00eecf08723ec306de'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-062-kalau-begitu-pilih-itu', 'bright', 'French', 'Dans ce cas, je choisis cela, madame. Cela semble frais et léger.', 'ae4780faa06392fe88f621d2c8f064d934007079c7bfbc00eecf08723ec306de'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-062-kalau-begitu-pilih-itu', 'bright', 'German', 'Dann wähle ich das. Es sieht frisch und leicht aus.', 'ae4780faa06392fe88f621d2c8f064d934007079c7bfbc00eecf08723ec306de'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-062-kalau-begitu-pilih-itu', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Kalau begitu, saya pilih itu, Bu. Kelihatannya segar dan ringan.', 'ae4780faa06392fe88f621d2c8f064d934007079c7bfbc00eecf08723ec306de'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-062-kalau-begitu-pilih-itu', 'bright', 'Italian', 'In tal caso, scelgo quello, signora. Sembra fresco e leggero.', 'ae4780faa06392fe88f621d2c8f064d934007079c7bfbc00eecf08723ec306de'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-062-kalau-begitu-pilih-itu', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'では、それを選びます。新鮮で軽そうです。', 'ae4780faa06392fe88f621d2c8f064d934007079c7bfbc00eecf08723ec306de'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-062-kalau-begitu-pilih-itu', 'bright', 'Korean', '그렇다면, 저는 그것을 선택하겠습니다. 신선하고 가벼워 보입니다.', 'ae4780faa06392fe88f621d2c8f064d934007079c7bfbc00eecf08723ec306de'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-062-kalau-begitu-pilih-itu', 'bright', 'Polish', 'W takim razie wybieram to, proszę pani. Wygląda świeżo i lekko.', 'ae4780faa06392fe88f621d2c8f064d934007079c7bfbc00eecf08723ec306de'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-062-kalau-begitu-pilih-itu', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Nesse caso, eu escolho isso, senhora. Parece fresco e leve.', 'ae4780faa06392fe88f621d2c8f064d934007079c7bfbc00eecf08723ec306de'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-062-kalau-begitu-pilih-itu', 'bright', 'Russian', 'В таком случае, я выбираю это, мэм. Оно выглядит свежим и легким.', 'ae4780faa06392fe88f621d2c8f064d934007079c7bfbc00eecf08723ec306de'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-062-kalau-begitu-pilih-itu', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'En ese caso, elijo eso, señora. Parece fresco y ligero.', 'ae4780faa06392fe88f621d2c8f064d934007079c7bfbc00eecf08723ec306de'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-063-daerah-paling-aman', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Sir, asa nga dapit ang labing luwas ug labing hilom para maglakaw-lakaw?', '716160e7366bff8b340de7ccae626a97ee840c4bc92823d4e8ec5de71227276e'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-063-daerah-paling-aman', 'bright', 'English', 'Sir, which area is the safest and quietest for walking?', '716160e7366bff8b340de7ccae626a97ee840c4bc92823d4e8ec5de71227276e'),
