  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-068-pasar-malam-ramai-seru', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Le recomiendo ese mercado nocturno, señora. El lugar es animado y divertido.', '0f3df9dbc53600150274c9dc43fa3a02cc7be90a62a5fb85ba569bf3db0a469a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-069-makanan-penutup-manis', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Ma''am, hain nga dessert ang tam-is ug haom uban sa kape?', '68dda308403420d8785df57d5c09d7bdf29d10e4502019d58aac0f19d4f1d9d8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-069-makanan-penutup-manis', 'bright', 'English', 'Ma’am, which dessert is sweet and goes well with coffee?', '68dda308403420d8785df57d5c09d7bdf29d10e4502019d58aac0f19d4f1d9d8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-069-makanan-penutup-manis', 'bright', 'French', 'Madame, quel dessert est sucré et se marie bien avec le café ?', '68dda308403420d8785df57d5c09d7bdf29d10e4502019d58aac0f19d4f1d9d8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-069-makanan-penutup-manis', 'bright', 'German', 'Welcher Nachtisch ist süß und passt gut zum Kaffee?', '68dda308403420d8785df57d5c09d7bdf29d10e4502019d58aac0f19d4f1d9d8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-069-makanan-penutup-manis', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Bu, makanan penutup mana yang manis dan cocok dengan kopi?', '68dda308403420d8785df57d5c09d7bdf29d10e4502019d58aac0f19d4f1d9d8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-069-makanan-penutup-manis', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Signora, quale dessert è dolce e si abbina bene con il caffè?', '68dda308403420d8785df57d5c09d7bdf29d10e4502019d58aac0f19d4f1d9d8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-069-makanan-penutup-manis', 'bright', 'Japanese', '奥様、コーヒーによく合う甘いデザートはどれですか？', '68dda308403420d8785df57d5c09d7bdf29d10e4502019d58aac0f19d4f1d9d8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-069-makanan-penutup-manis', 'bright', 'Korean', '부인, 어떤 디저트가 달콤하고 커피와 잘 어울리나요?', '68dda308403420d8785df57d5c09d7bdf29d10e4502019d58aac0f19d4f1d9d8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-069-makanan-penutup-manis', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Proszę Pani, który deser jest słodki i pasuje do kawy?', '68dda308403420d8785df57d5c09d7bdf29d10e4502019d58aac0f19d4f1d9d8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-069-makanan-penutup-manis', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Senhora, qual sobremesa é doce e combina bem com café?', '68dda308403420d8785df57d5c09d7bdf29d10e4502019d58aac0f19d4f1d9d8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-069-makanan-penutup-manis', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Мадам, какой десерт сладкий и хорошо сочетается с кофе?', '68dda308403420d8785df57d5c09d7bdf29d10e4502019d58aac0f19d4f1d9d8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-069-makanan-penutup-manis', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Señora, ¿qué postre es dulce y combina bien con el café?', '68dda308403420d8785df57d5c09d7bdf29d10e4502019d58aac0f19d4f1d9d8'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-070-kue-lembut-enak', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Salamat, ma''am. Kini nga cake humok kaayo ug tinuod nga lami.', '27d1bd4ba07982d7e89db208c36047c1c76c186018e055f22225953db21ce26c'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-070-kue-lembut-enak', 'bright', 'English', 'Thank you, ma’am. This cake is very soft and truly delicious.', '27d1bd4ba07982d7e89db208c36047c1c76c186018e055f22225953db21ce26c'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-070-kue-lembut-enak', 'bright', 'French', 'Merci, madame. Ce gâteau est très moelleux et vraiment délicieux.', '27d1bd4ba07982d7e89db208c36047c1c76c186018e055f22225953db21ce26c'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-070-kue-lembut-enak', 'bright', 'German', 'Vielen Dank. Dieser Kuchen ist sehr weich und wirklich köstlich.', '27d1bd4ba07982d7e89db208c36047c1c76c186018e055f22225953db21ce26c'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-070-kue-lembut-enak', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Terima kasih, Bu. Kue ini sangat lembut dan enak sekali.', '27d1bd4ba07982d7e89db208c36047c1c76c186018e055f22225953db21ce26c'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-070-kue-lembut-enak', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Grazie, signora. Questa torta è molto soffice e davvero deliziosa.', '27d1bd4ba07982d7e89db208c36047c1c76c186018e055f22225953db21ce26c'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-070-kue-lembut-enak', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'ありがとうございます。このケーキはとても柔らかくて本当に美味しいです。', '27d1bd4ba07982d7e89db208c36047c1c76c186018e055f22225953db21ce26c'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-070-kue-lembut-enak', 'bright', 'Korean', '감사합니다, 부인. 이 케이크는 매우 부드럽고 정말 맛있습니다.', '27d1bd4ba07982d7e89db208c36047c1c76c186018e055f22225953db21ce26c'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-070-kue-lembut-enak', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Dziękuję, proszę Pani. To ciasto jest bardzo miękkie i naprawdę pyszne.', '27d1bd4ba07982d7e89db208c36047c1c76c186018e055f22225953db21ce26c'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-070-kue-lembut-enak', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Obrigada, senhora. Este bolo é muito macio e realmente delicioso.', '27d1bd4ba07982d7e89db208c36047c1c76c186018e055f22225953db21ce26c'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-070-kue-lembut-enak', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Спасибо, мадам. Этот торт очень мягкий и действительно вкусный.', '27d1bd4ba07982d7e89db208c36047c1c76c186018e055f22225953db21ce26c'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-7', 'indonesian-a2-practical-7-070-kue-lembut-enak', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Gracias, señora. Este pastel está muy tierno y realmente delicioso.', '27d1bd4ba07982d7e89db208c36047c1c76c186018e055f22225953db21ce26c'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-071-wah-kamu-pasti-senang', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Wow, pahalipay! Sigurado nga malipayon kaayo ka.', '1f509f6f9d7f9dc6926c69544fc4be0b03be8246c933f387880116483f1c2fe3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-071-wah-kamu-pasti-senang', 'bright', 'English', 'Wow, congratulations! You must be very happy.', '1f509f6f9d7f9dc6926c69544fc4be0b03be8246c933f387880116483f1c2fe3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-071-wah-kamu-pasti-senang', 'bright', 'French', 'Wow, félicitations ! Tu dois être très heureux/heureuse.', '1f509f6f9d7f9dc6926c69544fc4be0b03be8246c933f387880116483f1c2fe3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-071-wah-kamu-pasti-senang', 'bright', 'German', 'Wow, Glückwunsch! Du bist bestimmt sehr froh.', '1f509f6f9d7f9dc6926c69544fc4be0b03be8246c933f387880116483f1c2fe3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-071-wah-kamu-pasti-senang', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Wah, selamat! Kamu pasti senang sekali.', '1f509f6f9d7f9dc6926c69544fc4be0b03be8246c933f387880116483f1c2fe3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-071-wah-kamu-pasti-senang', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Wow, congratulazioni! Devi essere molto felice.', '1f509f6f9d7f9dc6926c69544fc4be0b03be8246c933f387880116483f1c2fe3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-071-wah-kamu-pasti-senang', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'わあ、おめでとう！とても嬉しいでしょう。', '1f509f6f9d7f9dc6926c69544fc4be0b03be8246c933f387880116483f1c2fe3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-071-wah-kamu-pasti-senang', 'bright', 'Korean', '와, 축하해요! 정말 기쁘겠어요.', '1f509f6f9d7f9dc6926c69544fc4be0b03be8246c933f387880116483f1c2fe3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-071-wah-kamu-pasti-senang', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Wow, gratulacje! Musisz być bardzo szczęśliwy.', '1f509f6f9d7f9dc6926c69544fc4be0b03be8246c933f387880116483f1c2fe3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-071-wah-kamu-pasti-senang', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Uau, parabéns! Você deve estar muito feliz.', '1f509f6f9d7f9dc6926c69544fc4be0b03be8246c933f387880116483f1c2fe3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-071-wah-kamu-pasti-senang', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Вау, поздравляю! Ты, должно быть, очень счастлив.', '1f509f6f9d7f9dc6926c69544fc4be0b03be8246c933f387880116483f1c2fe3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-071-wah-kamu-pasti-senang', 'bright', 'Spanish', '¡Vaya, felicidades! Debes estar muy feliz.', '1f509f6f9d7f9dc6926c69544fc4be0b03be8246c933f387880116483f1c2fe3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-072-panas-sekali-minum-es', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Oo, init kaayo. Gusto ka bang moinom og iced tea?', 'd401fad51ea619ac5fc821f1e8aa47f817f3d19ecbd9bb1bcaa3c2a2e05b92d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-072-panas-sekali-minum-es', 'bright', 'English', 'Yes, it is very hot. Do you want to drink iced tea?', 'd401fad51ea619ac5fc821f1e8aa47f817f3d19ecbd9bb1bcaa3c2a2e05b92d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-072-panas-sekali-minum-es', 'bright', 'French', 'Oui, il fait très chaud. Veux-tu boire du thé glacé ?', 'd401fad51ea619ac5fc821f1e8aa47f817f3d19ecbd9bb1bcaa3c2a2e05b92d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-072-panas-sekali-minum-es', 'bright', 'German', 'Ja, es ist sehr heiß. Möchtest du Eistee trinken?', 'd401fad51ea619ac5fc821f1e8aa47f817f3d19ecbd9bb1bcaa3c2a2e05b92d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-072-panas-sekali-minum-es', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Iya, panas sekali. Kamu mau minum es teh?', 'd401fad51ea619ac5fc821f1e8aa47f817f3d19ecbd9bb1bcaa3c2a2e05b92d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-072-panas-sekali-minum-es', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Sì, fa molto caldo. Vuoi bere un tè freddo?', 'd401fad51ea619ac5fc821f1e8aa47f817f3d19ecbd9bb1bcaa3c2a2e05b92d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-072-panas-sekali-minum-es', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'はい、とても暑いです。アイスティーを飲みますか？', 'd401fad51ea619ac5fc821f1e8aa47f817f3d19ecbd9bb1bcaa3c2a2e05b92d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-072-panas-sekali-minum-es', 'bright', 'Korean', '네, 정말 더워요. 아이스티 마실래요?', 'd401fad51ea619ac5fc821f1e8aa47f817f3d19ecbd9bb1bcaa3c2a2e05b92d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-072-panas-sekali-minum-es', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Tak, jest bardzo gorąco. Chcesz napić się mrożonej herbaty?', 'd401fad51ea619ac5fc821f1e8aa47f817f3d19ecbd9bb1bcaa3c2a2e05b92d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-072-panas-sekali-minum-es', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Sim, está muito quente. Você quer tomar um chá gelado?', 'd401fad51ea619ac5fc821f1e8aa47f817f3d19ecbd9bb1bcaa3c2a2e05b92d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-072-panas-sekali-minum-es', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Да, очень жарко. Хочешь выпить холодного чая?', 'd401fad51ea619ac5fc821f1e8aa47f817f3d19ecbd9bb1bcaa3c2a2e05b92d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-072-panas-sekali-minum-es', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Sí, hace mucho calor. ¿Quieres tomar té helado?', 'd401fad51ea619ac5fc821f1e8aa47f817f3d19ecbd9bb1bcaa3c2a2e05b92d3'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-073-kurang-tidur-dan-mengantuk', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Oo, wala ko nakatulog og tarong kagabii. Katulgon ka sab ba?', '657ba25f1dda64a2140a4018637662fc56f006b2b0f2ee3fdd4880e7fc9d6e78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-073-kurang-tidur-dan-mengantuk', 'bright', 'English', 'Yes, I did not get enough sleep last night. Are you sleepy too?', '657ba25f1dda64a2140a4018637662fc56f006b2b0f2ee3fdd4880e7fc9d6e78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-073-kurang-tidur-dan-mengantuk', 'bright', 'French', 'Oui, je n''ai pas assez dormi la nuit dernière. Tu as aussi sommeil ?', '657ba25f1dda64a2140a4018637662fc56f006b2b0f2ee3fdd4880e7fc9d6e78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-073-kurang-tidur-dan-mengantuk', 'bright', 'German', 'Ja, letzte Nacht habe ich zu wenig geschlafen. Bist du auch schläfrig?', '657ba25f1dda64a2140a4018637662fc56f006b2b0f2ee3fdd4880e7fc9d6e78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-073-kurang-tidur-dan-mengantuk', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Iya, tadi malam saya kurang tidur. Kamu juga mengantuk?', '657ba25f1dda64a2140a4018637662fc56f006b2b0f2ee3fdd4880e7fc9d6e78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-073-kurang-tidur-dan-mengantuk', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Sì, non ho dormito abbastanza ieri sera. Anche tu sei assonnato?', '657ba25f1dda64a2140a4018637662fc56f006b2b0f2ee3fdd4880e7fc9d6e78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-073-kurang-tidur-dan-mengantuk', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'はい、昨夜は十分な睡眠が取れませんでした。あなたも眠いですか？', '657ba25f1dda64a2140a4018637662fc56f006b2b0f2ee3fdd4880e7fc9d6e78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-073-kurang-tidur-dan-mengantuk', 'bright', 'Korean', '네, 어젯밤에 잠을 충분히 못 잤어요. 당신도 졸린가요?', '657ba25f1dda64a2140a4018637662fc56f006b2b0f2ee3fdd4880e7fc9d6e78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-073-kurang-tidur-dan-mengantuk', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Tak, mało spałem zeszłej nocy. Czy ty też jesteś śpiący?', '657ba25f1dda64a2140a4018637662fc56f006b2b0f2ee3fdd4880e7fc9d6e78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-073-kurang-tidur-dan-mengantuk', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Sim, não dormi o suficiente ontem à noite. Você também está com sono?', '657ba25f1dda64a2140a4018637662fc56f006b2b0f2ee3fdd4880e7fc9d6e78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-073-kurang-tidur-dan-mengantuk', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Да, я не выспался прошлой ночью. Ты тоже хочешь спать?', '657ba25f1dda64a2140a4018637662fc56f006b2b0f2ee3fdd4880e7fc9d6e78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-073-kurang-tidur-dan-mengantuk', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Sí, no dormí lo suficiente anoche. ¿Tú también tienes sueño?', '657ba25f1dda64a2140a4018637662fc56f006b2b0f2ee3fdd4880e7fc9d6e78'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-074-minggu-ini-sibuk', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Oo, busy kaayo ko karong semanaha. Ikaw, unsa man?', '30629ce30beab878fb74e48dcf16632b5437529ec45d0dd8a6a8a0d8c4b41ca6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-074-minggu-ini-sibuk', 'bright', 'English', 'Yes, I am very busy this week. How about you?', '30629ce30beab878fb74e48dcf16632b5437529ec45d0dd8a6a8a0d8c4b41ca6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-074-minggu-ini-sibuk', 'bright', 'French', 'Oui, je suis très occupé cette semaine. Et vous ?', '30629ce30beab878fb74e48dcf16632b5437529ec45d0dd8a6a8a0d8c4b41ca6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-074-minggu-ini-sibuk', 'bright', 'German', 'Ja, diese Woche bin ich sehr beschäftigt. Und wie ist es bei dir?', '30629ce30beab878fb74e48dcf16632b5437529ec45d0dd8a6a8a0d8c4b41ca6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-074-minggu-ini-sibuk', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Iya, minggu ini saya sibuk sekali. Kamu bagaimana?', '30629ce30beab878fb74e48dcf16632b5437529ec45d0dd8a6a8a0d8c4b41ca6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-074-minggu-ini-sibuk', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Sì, sono molto impegnato questa settimana. E tu?', '30629ce30beab878fb74e48dcf16632b5437529ec45d0dd8a6a8a0d8c4b41ca6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-074-minggu-ini-sibuk', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'はい、今週はとても忙しいです。あなたはどうですか？', '30629ce30beab878fb74e48dcf16632b5437529ec45d0dd8a6a8a0d8c4b41ca6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-074-minggu-ini-sibuk', 'bright', 'Korean', '네, 이번 주에 정말 바빠요. 당신은 어때요?', '30629ce30beab878fb74e48dcf16632b5437529ec45d0dd8a6a8a0d8c4b41ca6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-074-minggu-ini-sibuk', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Tak, jestem bardzo zajęty w tym tygodniu. A Ty?', '30629ce30beab878fb74e48dcf16632b5437529ec45d0dd8a6a8a0d8c4b41ca6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-074-minggu-ini-sibuk', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Sim, estou muito ocupado esta semana. E você?', '30629ce30beab878fb74e48dcf16632b5437529ec45d0dd8a6a8a0d8c4b41ca6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-074-minggu-ini-sibuk', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Да, я очень занят на этой неделе. А ты как?', '30629ce30beab878fb74e48dcf16632b5437529ec45d0dd8a6a8a0d8c4b41ca6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-074-minggu-ini-sibuk', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Sí, estoy muy ocupado esta semana. ¿Y tú?', '30629ce30beab878fb74e48dcf16632b5437529ec45d0dd8a6a8a0d8c4b41ca6'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-075-hujan-lagi-menunggu', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Oh dili, nag-ulan na usab. Gusto ka bang maghulat dinhi?', 'c87861328454a49f03b99e52043e2587cc9b8ebf4d83e8ebd4fc972615aec920'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-075-hujan-lagi-menunggu', 'bright', 'English', 'Oh no, it is raining again. Do you want to wait here?', 'c87861328454a49f03b99e52043e2587cc9b8ebf4d83e8ebd4fc972615aec920'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-075-hujan-lagi-menunggu', 'bright', 'French', 'Oh non, il pleut encore. Voulez-vous attendre ici ?', 'c87861328454a49f03b99e52043e2587cc9b8ebf4d83e8ebd4fc972615aec920'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-075-hujan-lagi-menunggu', 'bright', 'German', 'Ach, es regnet schon wieder. Möchtest du hier warten?', 'c87861328454a49f03b99e52043e2587cc9b8ebf4d83e8ebd4fc972615aec920'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-075-hujan-lagi-menunggu', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Aduh, hujan lagi. Kamu mau menunggu di sini?', 'c87861328454a49f03b99e52043e2587cc9b8ebf4d83e8ebd4fc972615aec920'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-075-hujan-lagi-menunggu', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Oh no, piove di nuovo. Vuoi aspettare qui?', 'c87861328454a49f03b99e52043e2587cc9b8ebf4d83e8ebd4fc972615aec920'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-075-hujan-lagi-menunggu', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'あら、また雨だ。ここで待つ？', 'c87861328454a49f03b99e52043e2587cc9b8ebf4d83e8ebd4fc972615aec920'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-075-hujan-lagi-menunggu', 'bright', 'Korean', '아이고, 또 비가 오네. 여기서 기다릴래?', 'c87861328454a49f03b99e52043e2587cc9b8ebf4d83e8ebd4fc972615aec920'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-075-hujan-lagi-menunggu', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Och nie, znowu pada deszcz. Chcesz poczekać tutaj?', 'c87861328454a49f03b99e52043e2587cc9b8ebf4d83e8ebd4fc972615aec920'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-075-hujan-lagi-menunggu', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Ah não, está chovendo de novo. Você quer esperar aqui?', 'c87861328454a49f03b99e52043e2587cc9b8ebf4d83e8ebd4fc972615aec920'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-075-hujan-lagi-menunggu', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Ох, опять дождь. Хочешь подождать здесь?', 'c87861328454a49f03b99e52043e2587cc9b8ebf4d83e8ebd4fc972615aec920'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-075-hujan-lagi-menunggu', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Oh no, está lloviendo de nuevo. ¿Quieres esperar aquí?', 'c87861328454a49f03b99e52043e2587cc9b8ebf4d83e8ebd4fc972615aec920'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-sekali-temani', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Oh, sayang kaayo. Gusto ka ba nga mokuyog ko nimo ngadto sa beterinaryo?', '86e28eec5662349de19ebcff912c016ad876282893b00898c262c9e29c7bbce2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-sekali-temani', 'bright', 'English', 'Oh, what a shame. Do you want me to accompany you to the vet?', '86e28eec5662349de19ebcff912c016ad876282893b00898c262c9e29c7bbce2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-sekali-temani', 'bright', 'French', 'Oh, quelle dommage. Voulez-vous que je vous accompagne chez le vétérinaire ?', '86e28eec5662349de19ebcff912c016ad876282893b00898c262c9e29c7bbce2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-sekali-temani', 'bright', 'German', 'Ach, wie schade. Soll ich dich zum Tierarzt begleiten?', '86e28eec5662349de19ebcff912c016ad876282893b00898c262c9e29c7bbce2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-sekali-temani', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Aduh, sayang sekali. Kamu mau saya temani ke dokter hewan?', '86e28eec5662349de19ebcff912c016ad876282893b00898c262c9e29c7bbce2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-sekali-temani', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Oh, che peccato. Vuoi che ti accompagni dal veterinario?', '86e28eec5662349de19ebcff912c016ad876282893b00898c262c9e29c7bbce2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-sekali-temani', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'あら、残念。動物病院に付き添いましょうか？', '86e28eec5662349de19ebcff912c016ad876282893b00898c262c9e29c7bbce2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-sekali-temani', 'bright', 'Korean', '아, 안됐네요. 제가 병원에 같이 가줄까요?', '86e28eec5662349de19ebcff912c016ad876282893b00898c262c9e29c7bbce2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-sekali-temani', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Och, szkoda. Chcesz, żebym Ci towarzyszył do weterynarza?', '86e28eec5662349de19ebcff912c016ad876282893b00898c262c9e29c7bbce2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-sekali-temani', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Ah, que pena. Quer que eu te acompanhe ao veterinário?', '86e28eec5662349de19ebcff912c016ad876282893b00898c262c9e29c7bbce2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-sekali-temani', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Ох, какая жалость. Хочешь, я поеду с тобой к ветеринару?', '86e28eec5662349de19ebcff912c016ad876282893b00898c262c9e29c7bbce2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-076-sayang-sekali-temani', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Oh, qué pena. ¿Quieres que te acompañe al veterinario?', '86e28eec5662349de19ebcff912c016ad876282893b00898c262c9e29c7bbce2'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-077-cukup-baik-kamu-sendiri', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Maayo ra. Ikaw, unsa man ang imong semana?', 'ea4e065ef8581ae47f2f9338e5e634a50b85a0789238d4c074611c7d9e81c864'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-077-cukup-baik-kamu-sendiri', 'bright', 'English', 'Pretty good. How about you this week?', 'ea4e065ef8581ae47f2f9338e5e634a50b85a0789238d4c074611c7d9e81c864'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-077-cukup-baik-kamu-sendiri', 'bright', 'French', 'Plutôt bien. Et vous cette semaine ?', 'ea4e065ef8581ae47f2f9338e5e634a50b85a0789238d4c074611c7d9e81c864'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-077-cukup-baik-kamu-sendiri', 'bright', 'German', 'Ganz gut. Und wie geht es dir diese Woche?', 'ea4e065ef8581ae47f2f9338e5e634a50b85a0789238d4c074611c7d9e81c864'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-077-cukup-baik-kamu-sendiri', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Cukup baik. Kamu sendiri bagaimana minggu ini?', 'ea4e065ef8581ae47f2f9338e5e634a50b85a0789238d4c074611c7d9e81c864'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-077-cukup-baik-kamu-sendiri', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Abbastanza bene. E tu questa settimana?', 'ea4e065ef8581ae47f2f9338e5e634a50b85a0789238d4c074611c7d9e81c864'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-077-cukup-baik-kamu-sendiri', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'かなり良いよ。今週はどう？', 'ea4e065ef8581ae47f2f9338e5e634a50b85a0789238d4c074611c7d9e81c864'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-077-cukup-baik-kamu-sendiri', 'bright', 'Korean', '꽤 좋아요. 이번 주는 어때요?', 'ea4e065ef8581ae47f2f9338e5e634a50b85a0789238d4c074611c7d9e81c864'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-077-cukup-baik-kamu-sendiri', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Całkiem dobrze. A Ty w tym tygodniu?', 'ea4e065ef8581ae47f2f9338e5e634a50b85a0789238d4c074611c7d9e81c864'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-077-cukup-baik-kamu-sendiri', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Muito bem. E você esta semana?', 'ea4e065ef8581ae47f2f9338e5e634a50b85a0789238d4c074611c7d9e81c864'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-077-cukup-baik-kamu-sendiri', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Довольно хорошо. А ты на этой неделе?', 'ea4e065ef8581ae47f2f9338e5e634a50b85a0789238d4c074611c7d9e81c864'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-077-cukup-baik-kamu-sendiri', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Bastante bien. ¿Y tú esta semana?', 'ea4e065ef8581ae47f2f9338e5e634a50b85a0789238d4c074611c7d9e81c864'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-078-kamu-memang-hebat', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Wow, nindot kaayo kana! Talagsaon ka gyud.', 'b36fdd0fcfece7c1e789d4168e145ce2622870c3f4cf9c2d2f69f7288564110d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-078-kamu-memang-hebat', 'bright', 'English', 'Wow, that is great! You really are amazing.', 'b36fdd0fcfece7c1e789d4168e145ce2622870c3f4cf9c2d2f69f7288564110d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-078-kamu-memang-hebat', 'bright', 'French', 'Wow, c''est génial ! Tu es vraiment incroyable.', 'b36fdd0fcfece7c1e789d4168e145ce2622870c3f4cf9c2d2f69f7288564110d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-078-kamu-memang-hebat', 'bright', 'German', 'Wow, das ist großartig! Du bist wirklich klasse.', 'b36fdd0fcfece7c1e789d4168e145ce2622870c3f4cf9c2d2f69f7288564110d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-078-kamu-memang-hebat', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Wah, bagus sekali! Kamu memang hebat.', 'b36fdd0fcfece7c1e789d4168e145ce2622870c3f4cf9c2d2f69f7288564110d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-078-kamu-memang-hebat', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Wow, è fantastico! Sei davvero incredibile.', 'b36fdd0fcfece7c1e789d4168e145ce2622870c3f4cf9c2d2f69f7288564110d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-078-kamu-memang-hebat', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'わあ、それは素晴らしい！あなたは本当に素晴らしいです。', 'b36fdd0fcfece7c1e789d4168e145ce2622870c3f4cf9c2d2f69f7288564110d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-078-kamu-memang-hebat', 'bright', 'Korean', '와, 정말 잘됐네요! 당신은 정말 대단해요.', 'b36fdd0fcfece7c1e789d4168e145ce2622870c3f4cf9c2d2f69f7288564110d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-078-kamu-memang-hebat', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Wow, to wspaniale! Jesteś naprawdę niesamowity.', 'b36fdd0fcfece7c1e789d4168e145ce2622870c3f4cf9c2d2f69f7288564110d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-078-kamu-memang-hebat', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Uau, que ótimo! Você é realmente incrível.', 'b36fdd0fcfece7c1e789d4168e145ce2622870c3f4cf9c2d2f69f7288564110d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-078-kamu-memang-hebat', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Вау, это здорово! Ты действительно потрясающий.', 'b36fdd0fcfece7c1e789d4168e145ce2622870c3f4cf9c2d2f69f7288564110d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-078-kamu-memang-hebat', 'bright', 'Spanish', '¡Vaya, eso es genial! Realmente eres increíble.', 'b36fdd0fcfece7c1e789d4168e145ce2622870c3f4cf9c2d2f69f7288564110d'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-079-kopi-hangat-pagi-ini', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Oo, bugnaw kaayo. Gusto ka ba moinom og init nga kape?', '753ddc22473a090821d03bc2989bb909d53454a3c14644e09f6ee3c52dc5c3a1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-079-kopi-hangat-pagi-ini', 'bright', 'English', 'Yes, it is very cold. Do you want to drink warm coffee?', '753ddc22473a090821d03bc2989bb909d53454a3c14644e09f6ee3c52dc5c3a1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-079-kopi-hangat-pagi-ini', 'bright', 'French', 'Oui, il fait très froid. Voulez-vous boire un café chaud ?', '753ddc22473a090821d03bc2989bb909d53454a3c14644e09f6ee3c52dc5c3a1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-079-kopi-hangat-pagi-ini', 'bright', 'German', 'Ja, es ist sehr kalt. Möchtest du warmen Kaffee trinken?', '753ddc22473a090821d03bc2989bb909d53454a3c14644e09f6ee3c52dc5c3a1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-079-kopi-hangat-pagi-ini', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Iya, dingin sekali. Kamu mau minum kopi hangat?', '753ddc22473a090821d03bc2989bb909d53454a3c14644e09f6ee3c52dc5c3a1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-079-kopi-hangat-pagi-ini', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Sì, fa molto freddo. Vuoi bere un caffè caldo?', '753ddc22473a090821d03bc2989bb909d53454a3c14644e09f6ee3c52dc5c3a1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-079-kopi-hangat-pagi-ini', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'はい、とても寒いです。温かいコーヒーを飲みますか？', '753ddc22473a090821d03bc2989bb909d53454a3c14644e09f6ee3c52dc5c3a1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-079-kopi-hangat-pagi-ini', 'bright', 'Korean', '네, 정말 추워요. 따뜻한 커피 마실래요?', '753ddc22473a090821d03bc2989bb909d53454a3c14644e09f6ee3c52dc5c3a1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-079-kopi-hangat-pagi-ini', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Tak, jest bardzo zimno. Chcesz napić się gorącej kawy?', '753ddc22473a090821d03bc2989bb909d53454a3c14644e09f6ee3c52dc5c3a1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-079-kopi-hangat-pagi-ini', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Sim, está muito frio. Você quer tomar um café quente?', '753ddc22473a090821d03bc2989bb909d53454a3c14644e09f6ee3c52dc5c3a1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-079-kopi-hangat-pagi-ini', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Да, очень холодно. Хочешь выпить горячий кофе?', '753ddc22473a090821d03bc2989bb909d53454a3c14644e09f6ee3c52dc5c3a1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-079-kopi-hangat-pagi-ini', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Sí, hace mucho frío. ¿Quieres tomar un café caliente?', '753ddc22473a090821d03bc2989bb909d53454a3c14644e09f6ee3c52dc5c3a1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-080-hari-ini-menyenangkan', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Oo, nindot ang adlaw karon. Malipayon ka usab ba?', 'cac8dd168d28ed3915f9e8ea1354f64f9daed666fcc0c29c4454b4fa478d211f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-080-hari-ini-menyenangkan', 'bright', 'English', 'Yes, today is lovely. Are you happy too?', 'cac8dd168d28ed3915f9e8ea1354f64f9daed666fcc0c29c4454b4fa478d211f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-080-hari-ini-menyenangkan', 'bright', 'French', 'Oui, aujourd''hui est une belle journée. Es-tu heureux aussi ?', 'cac8dd168d28ed3915f9e8ea1354f64f9daed666fcc0c29c4454b4fa478d211f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-080-hari-ini-menyenangkan', 'bright', 'German', 'Ja, heute ist ein schöner Tag. Bist du auch froh?', 'cac8dd168d28ed3915f9e8ea1354f64f9daed666fcc0c29c4454b4fa478d211f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-080-hari-ini-menyenangkan', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Iya, hari ini menyenangkan. Kamu juga senang?', 'cac8dd168d28ed3915f9e8ea1354f64f9daed666fcc0c29c4454b4fa478d211f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-080-hari-ini-menyenangkan', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Sì, oggi è bello. Sei felice anche tu?', 'cac8dd168d28ed3915f9e8ea1354f64f9daed666fcc0c29c4454b4fa478d211f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-080-hari-ini-menyenangkan', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'はい、今日は素敵です。あなたも幸せですか？', 'cac8dd168d28ed3915f9e8ea1354f64f9daed666fcc0c29c4454b4fa478d211f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-080-hari-ini-menyenangkan', 'bright', 'Korean', '네, 오늘 정말 좋아요. 당신도 행복해요?', 'cac8dd168d28ed3915f9e8ea1354f64f9daed666fcc0c29c4454b4fa478d211f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-080-hari-ini-menyenangkan', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Tak, dzisiaj jest piękny dzień. Czy Ty też jesteś szczęśliwy?', 'cac8dd168d28ed3915f9e8ea1354f64f9daed666fcc0c29c4454b4fa478d211f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-080-hari-ini-menyenangkan', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Sim, hoje está adorável. Você também está feliz?', 'cac8dd168d28ed3915f9e8ea1354f64f9daed666fcc0c29c4454b4fa478d211f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-080-hari-ini-menyenangkan', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Да, сегодня прекрасный день. Ты тоже рад?', 'cac8dd168d28ed3915f9e8ea1354f64f9daed666fcc0c29c4454b4fa478d211f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-8', 'indonesian-a2-practical-8-080-hari-ini-menyenangkan', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Sí, hoy es encantador. ¿Tú también estás feliz?', 'cac8dd168d28ed3915f9e8ea1354f64f9daed666fcc0c29c4454b4fa478d211f'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-081-air-panas-tidak-keluar', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Dili mogawas ang init nga tubig, sir. Nanawag na ko sa reception. Mahimo ba nimo kining susihon?', 'a6760031e7523dfc617692942dae7e2d45ccf1fea7c83ee52248cecccaaf29d1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-081-air-panas-tidak-keluar', 'bright', 'English', 'The hot water is not coming out, sir. I have already called reception. Can you please check?', 'a6760031e7523dfc617692942dae7e2d45ccf1fea7c83ee52248cecccaaf29d1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-081-air-panas-tidak-keluar', 'bright', 'French', 'L''eau chaude ne sort pas, monsieur. J''ai déjà appelé la réception. Pouvez-vous s''il vous plaît vérifier ?', 'a6760031e7523dfc617692942dae7e2d45ccf1fea7c83ee52248cecccaaf29d1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-081-air-panas-tidak-keluar', 'bright', 'German', 'Es kommt kein heißes Wasser. Ich habe schon an der Rezeption angerufen. Können Sie bitte nachsehen?', 'a6760031e7523dfc617692942dae7e2d45ccf1fea7c83ee52248cecccaaf29d1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-081-air-panas-tidak-keluar', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Air panasnya tidak keluar, Pak. Saya sudah telepon resepsionis. Bisa tolong periksa?', 'a6760031e7523dfc617692942dae7e2d45ccf1fea7c83ee52248cecccaaf29d1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-081-air-panas-tidak-keluar', 'bright', 'Italian', 'L''acqua calda non esce, signore. Ho già chiamato la reception. Può per favore controllare?', 'a6760031e7523dfc617692942dae7e2d45ccf1fea7c83ee52248cecccaaf29d1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-081-air-panas-tidak-keluar', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'お湯が出ません、お客様。すでにフロントに電話しました。確認していただけますか？', 'a6760031e7523dfc617692942dae7e2d45ccf1fea7c83ee52248cecccaaf29d1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-081-air-panas-tidak-keluar', 'bright', 'Korean', '손님, 온수가 나오지 않습니다. 이미 프런트에 전화했습니다. 확인해주시겠어요?', 'a6760031e7523dfc617692942dae7e2d45ccf1fea7c83ee52248cecccaaf29d1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-081-air-panas-tidak-keluar', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Gorąca woda nie leci, proszę Pana. Już dzwoniłem do recepcji. Czy może Pan to sprawdzić?', 'a6760031e7523dfc617692942dae7e2d45ccf1fea7c83ee52248cecccaaf29d1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-081-air-panas-tidak-keluar', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'A água quente não está saindo, senhor. Já liguei para a recepção. Você pode verificar, por favor?', 'a6760031e7523dfc617692942dae7e2d45ccf1fea7c83ee52248cecccaaf29d1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-081-air-panas-tidak-keluar', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Горячая вода не идет, сэр. Я уже звонил на ресепшн. Можете, пожалуйста, проверить?', 'a6760031e7523dfc617692942dae7e2d45ccf1fea7c83ee52248cecccaaf29d1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-081-air-panas-tidak-keluar', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'El agua caliente no sale, señor. Ya he llamado a recepción. ¿Puede revisarlo, por favor?', 'a6760031e7523dfc617692942dae7e2d45ccf1fea7c83ee52248cecccaaf29d1'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-082-soto-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nag-order na ko og soto, ma''am, apan wala pa moabot ang pagkaon. Mahimo ba nimo kining susihon?', 'a618c57307b88779ea7d722bda82f1cb56ce55d5a291774455a12ee82667549b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-082-soto-belum-datang', 'bright', 'English', 'I have already ordered soto, ma’am, but the food has not arrived yet. Can you please check?', 'a618c57307b88779ea7d722bda82f1cb56ce55d5a291774455a12ee82667549b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-082-soto-belum-datang', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai déjà commandé du soto, madame, mais la nourriture n''est pas encore arrivée. Pouvez-vous vérifier, s''il vous plaît ?', 'a618c57307b88779ea7d722bda82f1cb56ce55d5a291774455a12ee82667549b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-082-soto-belum-datang', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe schon Soto bestellt, aber das Essen ist noch nicht gekommen. Können Sie bitte nachsehen?', 'a618c57307b88779ea7d722bda82f1cb56ce55d5a291774455a12ee82667549b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-082-soto-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya sudah pesan soto, Bu, tetapi makanannya belum datang. Bisa tolong periksa?', 'a618c57307b88779ea7d722bda82f1cb56ce55d5a291774455a12ee82667549b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-082-soto-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho già ordinato il soto, signora, ma il cibo non è ancora arrivato. Può controllare, per favore?', 'a618c57307b88779ea7d722bda82f1cb56ce55d5a291774455a12ee82667549b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-082-soto-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'ソーソーを注文しましたが、まだ届いていません。確認していただけますか？', 'a618c57307b88779ea7d722bda82f1cb56ce55d5a291774455a12ee82667549b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-082-soto-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Korean', '손님, 소토를 주문했는데 음식이 아직 나오지 않았습니다. 확인해 주시겠어요?', 'a618c57307b88779ea7d722bda82f1cb56ce55d5a291774455a12ee82667549b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-082-soto-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Już zamówiłem soto, proszę pani, ale jedzenie jeszcze nie dotarło. Czy może pani sprawdzić?', 'a618c57307b88779ea7d722bda82f1cb56ce55d5a291774455a12ee82667549b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-082-soto-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu já pedi soto, senhora, mas a comida ainda não chegou. Você pode verificar, por favor?', 'a618c57307b88779ea7d722bda82f1cb56ce55d5a291774455a12ee82667549b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-082-soto-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я уже заказал сото, мэм, но еда еще не пришла. Можете, пожалуйста, проверить?', 'a618c57307b88779ea7d722bda82f1cb56ce55d5a291774455a12ee82667549b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-082-soto-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Ya pedí soto, señora, pero la comida aún no ha llegado. ¿Puede comprobarlo, por favor?', 'a618c57307b88779ea7d722bda82f1cb56ce55d5a291774455a12ee82667549b'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-083-tidak-bisa-pakai-wifi', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Dili ko makagamit sa Wi-Fi, ma''am. Nakasulay na ko kaduha. Palihug susiha.', '7992ae7f1779d677679ed6b897734040e8de6d2fcad0ae9a9e5d05c5d02fc33a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-083-tidak-bisa-pakai-wifi', 'bright', 'English', 'I cannot use the Wi-Fi, ma’am. I have already tried twice. Please check.', '7992ae7f1779d677679ed6b897734040e8de6d2fcad0ae9a9e5d05c5d02fc33a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-083-tidak-bisa-pakai-wifi', 'bright', 'French', 'Je ne peux pas utiliser le Wi-Fi, madame. J''ai déjà essayé deux fois. Veuillez vérifier.', '7992ae7f1779d677679ed6b897734040e8de6d2fcad0ae9a9e5d05c5d02fc33a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-083-tidak-bisa-pakai-wifi', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich kann das WLAN nicht benutzen. Ich habe es schon zweimal versucht. Bitte prüfen Sie das.', '7992ae7f1779d677679ed6b897734040e8de6d2fcad0ae9a9e5d05c5d02fc33a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-083-tidak-bisa-pakai-wifi', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya tidak bisa pakai Wi-Fi, Bu. Saya sudah coba dua kali. Tolong periksa.', '7992ae7f1779d677679ed6b897734040e8de6d2fcad0ae9a9e5d05c5d02fc33a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-083-tidak-bisa-pakai-wifi', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Non riesco a usare il Wi-Fi, signora. Ho già provato due volte. Per favore, controlli.', '7992ae7f1779d677679ed6b897734040e8de6d2fcad0ae9a9e5d05c5d02fc33a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-083-tidak-bisa-pakai-wifi', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'Wi-Fiが使えません。すでに2回試しました。確認してください。', '7992ae7f1779d677679ed6b897734040e8de6d2fcad0ae9a9e5d05c5d02fc33a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-083-tidak-bisa-pakai-wifi', 'bright', 'Korean', '손님, Wi-Fi를 사용할 수 없습니다. 이미 두 번 시도했습니다. 확인해 주세요.', '7992ae7f1779d677679ed6b897734040e8de6d2fcad0ae9a9e5d05c5d02fc33a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-083-tidak-bisa-pakai-wifi', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Nie mogę korzystać z Wi-Fi, proszę pani. Próbowałem już dwa razy. Proszę sprawdzić.', '7992ae7f1779d677679ed6b897734040e8de6d2fcad0ae9a9e5d05c5d02fc33a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-083-tidak-bisa-pakai-wifi', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Não consigo usar o Wi-Fi, senhora. Já tentei duas vezes. Por favor, verifique.', '7992ae7f1779d677679ed6b897734040e8de6d2fcad0ae9a9e5d05c5d02fc33a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-083-tidak-bisa-pakai-wifi', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я не могу пользоваться Wi-Fi, мэм. Я уже пробовал дважды. Пожалуйста, проверьте.', '7992ae7f1779d677679ed6b897734040e8de6d2fcad0ae9a9e5d05c5d02fc33a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-083-tidak-bisa-pakai-wifi', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'No puedo usar el Wi-Fi, señora. Ya lo he intentado dos veces. Por favor, compruébelo.', '7992ae7f1779d677679ed6b897734040e8de6d2fcad0ae9a9e5d05c5d02fc33a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-084-kunci-hilang-tidak-masuk', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nawala ang akong yawe, ma''am. Nangita na ko, apan dili ko makasulod sa lawak. Palihug tabangi ko.', '8dacfbaf0ae079aa35b40a803d4057bf6482cd9c81acb928a53fe53e9c972dcb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-084-kunci-hilang-tidak-masuk', 'bright', 'English', 'My key is missing, ma’am. I have already looked, but I cannot enter the room. Please help.', '8dacfbaf0ae079aa35b40a803d4057bf6482cd9c81acb928a53fe53e9c972dcb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-084-kunci-hilang-tidak-masuk', 'bright', 'French', 'Ma clé est manquante, madame. J''ai déjà cherché, mais je ne peux pas entrer dans la chambre. Aidez-moi, s''il vous plaît.', '8dacfbaf0ae079aa35b40a803d4057bf6482cd9c81acb928a53fe53e9c972dcb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-084-kunci-hilang-tidak-masuk', 'bright', 'German', 'Mein Schlüssel ist weg. Ich habe schon gesucht, kann aber nicht ins Zimmer. Bitte helfen Sie mir.', '8dacfbaf0ae079aa35b40a803d4057bf6482cd9c81acb928a53fe53e9c972dcb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-084-kunci-hilang-tidak-masuk', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Kunci saya hilang, Bu. Saya sudah cari, tetapi tidak bisa masuk kamar. Tolong bantu.', '8dacfbaf0ae079aa35b40a803d4057bf6482cd9c81acb928a53fe53e9c972dcb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-084-kunci-hilang-tidak-masuk', 'bright', 'Italian', 'La mia chiave è mancante, signora. Ho già cercato, ma non riesco ad entrare in camera. Per favore, aiuti.', '8dacfbaf0ae079aa35b40a803d4057bf6482cd9c81acb928a53fe53e9c972dcb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-084-kunci-hilang-tidak-masuk', 'bright', 'Japanese', '鍵を紛失しました。探しましたが、部屋に入れません。助けてください。', '8dacfbaf0ae079aa35b40a803d4057bf6482cd9c81acb928a53fe53e9c972dcb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-084-kunci-hilang-tidak-masuk', 'bright', 'Korean', '손님, 제 열쇠가 없습니다. 이미 찾아봤지만 방에 들어갈 수 없습니다. 도와주세요.', '8dacfbaf0ae079aa35b40a803d4057bf6482cd9c81acb928a53fe53e9c972dcb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-084-kunci-hilang-tidak-masuk', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Mój klucz zaginął, proszę pani. Już szukałem, ale nie mogę wejść do pokoju. Proszę o pomoc.', '8dacfbaf0ae079aa35b40a803d4057bf6482cd9c81acb928a53fe53e9c972dcb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-084-kunci-hilang-tidak-masuk', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Minha chave sumiu, senhora. Já procurei, mas não consigo entrar no quarto. Por favor, ajude.', '8dacfbaf0ae079aa35b40a803d4057bf6482cd9c81acb928a53fe53e9c972dcb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-084-kunci-hilang-tidak-masuk', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Мой ключ потерян, мэм. Я уже искал, но не могу войти в номер. Пожалуйста, помогите.', '8dacfbaf0ae079aa35b40a803d4057bf6482cd9c81acb928a53fe53e9c972dcb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-084-kunci-hilang-tidak-masuk', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Mi llave está perdida, señora. Ya he buscado, pero no puedo entrar a la habitación. Por favor, ayúdeme.', '8dacfbaf0ae079aa35b40a803d4057bf6482cd9c81acb928a53fe53e9c972dcb'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Wala pa moabot ang akong taxi, sir. Dugay na kong naghulat. Palihug pagtawag og lain.', '5a3828bc262e60f285dfd12ab6a750cacb7e59adb70ab74fa17f5d10becdacfe'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-belum-datang', 'bright', 'English', 'My taxi has not arrived yet, sir. I have already waited a long time. Please call another one.', '5a3828bc262e60f285dfd12ab6a750cacb7e59adb70ab74fa17f5d10becdacfe'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-belum-datang', 'bright', 'French', 'Mon taxi n''est pas encore arrivé, monsieur. J''attends depuis longtemps. Veuillez en appeler un autre.', '5a3828bc262e60f285dfd12ab6a750cacb7e59adb70ab74fa17f5d10becdacfe'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-belum-datang', 'bright', 'German', 'Mein Taxi ist noch nicht gekommen. Ich habe schon lange gewartet. Bitte rufen Sie ein anderes.', '5a3828bc262e60f285dfd12ab6a750cacb7e59adb70ab74fa17f5d10becdacfe'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Taksi saya belum datang, Pak. Saya sudah menunggu lama. Tolong panggil yang lain.', '5a3828bc262e60f285dfd12ab6a750cacb7e59adb70ab74fa17f5d10becdacfe'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Il mio taxi non è ancora arrivato, signore. Ho già aspettato molto tempo. Per favore, ne chiami un altro.', '5a3828bc262e60f285dfd12ab6a750cacb7e59adb70ab74fa17f5d10becdacfe'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'タクシーがまだ来ていません。長時間待っています。別のタクシーを呼んでください。', '5a3828bc262e60f285dfd12ab6a750cacb7e59adb70ab74fa17f5d10becdacfe'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Korean', '손님, 제 택시가 아직 오지 않았습니다. 오래 기다렸습니다. 다른 택시를 불러주세요.', '5a3828bc262e60f285dfd12ab6a750cacb7e59adb70ab74fa17f5d10becdacfe'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Moja taksówka jeszcze nie przyjechała, proszę pana. Czekałem już długo. Proszę zamówić inną.', '5a3828bc262e60f285dfd12ab6a750cacb7e59adb70ab74fa17f5d10becdacfe'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Meu táxi ainda não chegou, senhor. Já esperei muito tempo. Por favor, chame outro.', '5a3828bc262e60f285dfd12ab6a750cacb7e59adb70ab74fa17f5d10becdacfe'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Мое такси еще не приехало, сэр. Я уже долго жду. Пожалуйста, вызовите другое.', '5a3828bc262e60f285dfd12ab6a750cacb7e59adb70ab74fa17f5d10becdacfe'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-085-taksi-belum-datang', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Mi taxi aún no ha llegado, señor. Llevo esperando mucho tiempo. Por favor, llame a otro.', '5a3828bc262e60f285dfd12ab6a750cacb7e59adb70ab74fa17f5d10becdacfe'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-086-kembalian-kurang-dua-ribu', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Kulang ang akong sukli og duha ka libo, ma''am. Nakabayad na ko sa tibuok nga kantidad. Palihug susiha.', '99e5d0564a5a4f32c34d36e5e201e1800ff9786bd6778f721c331e72be55b268'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-086-kembalian-kurang-dua-ribu', 'bright', 'English', 'My change is short by two thousand rupiah, ma’am. I have already paid in full. Please check.', '99e5d0564a5a4f32c34d36e5e201e1800ff9786bd6778f721c331e72be55b268'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-086-kembalian-kurang-dua-ribu', 'bright', 'French', 'Ma monnaie est insuffisante de deux mille roupies, madame. J''ai déjà payé en totalité. Veuillez vérifier.', '99e5d0564a5a4f32c34d36e5e201e1800ff9786bd6778f721c331e72be55b268'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-086-kembalian-kurang-dua-ribu', 'bright', 'German', 'Bei meinem Rückgeld fehlen zweitausend Rupiah. Ich habe vollständig bezahlt. Bitte prüfen Sie es.', '99e5d0564a5a4f32c34d36e5e201e1800ff9786bd6778f721c331e72be55b268'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-086-kembalian-kurang-dua-ribu', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Kembalian saya kurang dua ribu, Bu. Saya sudah bayar penuh. Tolong periksa.', '99e5d0564a5a4f32c34d36e5e201e1800ff9786bd6778f721c331e72be55b268'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-086-kembalian-kurang-dua-ribu', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Il mio resto è di duemila rupie in meno, signora. Ho già pagato per intero. Per favore, controlli.', '99e5d0564a5a4f32c34d36e5e201e1800ff9786bd6778f721c331e72be55b268'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-086-kembalian-kurang-dua-ribu', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'お釣りが2000ルピア足りません。全額支払いました。確認してください。', '99e5d0564a5a4f32c34d36e5e201e1800ff9786bd6778f721c331e72be55b268'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-086-kembalian-kurang-dua-ribu', 'bright', 'Korean', '손님, 잔돈이 2천 루피아 부족합니다. 이미 전액 지불했습니다. 확인해 주세요.', '99e5d0564a5a4f32c34d36e5e201e1800ff9786bd6778f721c331e72be55b268'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-086-kembalian-kurang-dua-ribu', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Moja reszta jest za krótka o dwa tysiące rupii, proszę pani. Zapłaciłem już w całości. Proszę sprawdzić.', '99e5d0564a5a4f32c34d36e5e201e1800ff9786bd6778f721c331e72be55b268'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-086-kembalian-kurang-dua-ribu', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Meu troco está faltando duas mil rúpias, senhora. Já paguei integralmente. Por favor, verifique.', '99e5d0564a5a4f32c34d36e5e201e1800ff9786bd6778f721c331e72be55b268'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-086-kembalian-kurang-dua-ribu', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Моя сдача меньше на две тысячи рупий, мэм. Я уже заплатил полностью. Пожалуйста, проверьте.', '99e5d0564a5a4f32c34d36e5e201e1800ff9786bd6778f721c331e72be55b268'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-086-kembalian-kurang-dua-ribu', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Me faltan dos mil rupias de cambio, señora. Ya he pagado completo. Por favor, compruebe.', '99e5d0564a5a4f32c34d36e5e201e1800ff9786bd6778f721c331e72be55b268'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-087-kipas-sekarang-rusak', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Gipalit nako kini nga fan kaniadto, sir, apan karon guba na kini. Palihug ilisi kini.', 'b3c511bb0a798a154de8c1028d7f31731b9a9018037540c36fd53645c7e48d06'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-087-kipas-sekarang-rusak', 'bright', 'English', 'I bought this fan earlier, sir, but now it is broken. Please replace it.', 'b3c511bb0a798a154de8c1028d7f31731b9a9018037540c36fd53645c7e48d06'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-087-kipas-sekarang-rusak', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai acheté ce ventilateur plus tôt, monsieur, mais maintenant il est cassé. Veuillez le remplacer.', 'b3c511bb0a798a154de8c1028d7f31731b9a9018037540c36fd53645c7e48d06'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-087-kipas-sekarang-rusak', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe diesen Ventilator vorhin gekauft, aber jetzt ist er kaputt. Bitte tauschen Sie ihn um.', 'b3c511bb0a798a154de8c1028d7f31731b9a9018037540c36fd53645c7e48d06'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-087-kipas-sekarang-rusak', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya beli kipas ini tadi, Pak, tetapi sekarang rusak. Tolong ganti.', 'b3c511bb0a798a154de8c1028d7f31731b9a9018037540c36fd53645c7e48d06'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-087-kipas-sekarang-rusak', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho comprato questo ventilatore prima, signore, ma ora è rotto. Per favore, lo sostituisca.', 'b3c511bb0a798a154de8c1028d7f31731b9a9018037540c36fd53645c7e48d06'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-087-kipas-sekarang-rusak', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'この扇風機は先ほど購入しましたが、今は壊れています。交換してください。', 'b3c511bb0a798a154de8c1028d7f31731b9a9018037540c36fd53645c7e48d06'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-087-kipas-sekarang-rusak', 'bright', 'Korean', '손님, 이 선풍기 조금 전에 샀는데 지금 고장 났어요. 교환해 주세요.', 'b3c511bb0a798a154de8c1028d7f31731b9a9018037540c36fd53645c7e48d06'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-087-kipas-sekarang-rusak', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Kupiłem ten wentylator wcześniej, proszę pana, ale teraz jest zepsuty. Proszę go wymienić.', 'b3c511bb0a798a154de8c1028d7f31731b9a9018037540c36fd53645c7e48d06'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-087-kipas-sekarang-rusak', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Comprei este ventilador antes, senhor, mas agora está quebrado. Por favor, troque.', 'b3c511bb0a798a154de8c1028d7f31731b9a9018037540c36fd53645c7e48d06'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-087-kipas-sekarang-rusak', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я купил этот вентилятор раньше, сэр, но теперь он сломан. Пожалуйста, замените его.', 'b3c511bb0a798a154de8c1028d7f31731b9a9018037540c36fd53645c7e48d06'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-087-kipas-sekarang-rusak', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Compré este ventilador antes, señor, pero ahora está roto. Por favor, cámbielo.', 'b3c511bb0a798a154de8c1028d7f31731b9a9018037540c36fd53645c7e48d06'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-088-sup-dingin-hangatkan', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Miabot na ang sabaw, ma''am, apan karon bugnaw na kini. Mahimo ba nimo kining initon?', '5205830fc611d58dca7188bb6f64cede30011e4299ed82486460a95305b2500a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-088-sup-dingin-hangatkan', 'bright', 'English', 'The soup has arrived, ma’am, but now it is cold. Can you please warm it up?', '5205830fc611d58dca7188bb6f64cede30011e4299ed82486460a95305b2500a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-088-sup-dingin-hangatkan', 'bright', 'French', 'La soupe est arrivée, madame, mais maintenant elle est froide. Pouvez-vous la réchauffer, s''il vous plaît ?', '5205830fc611d58dca7188bb6f64cede30011e4299ed82486460a95305b2500a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-088-sup-dingin-hangatkan', 'bright', 'German', 'Die Suppe ist schon da, aber jetzt ist sie kalt. Können Sie sie bitte aufwärmen?', '5205830fc611d58dca7188bb6f64cede30011e4299ed82486460a95305b2500a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-088-sup-dingin-hangatkan', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Supnya sudah datang, Bu, tetapi sekarang dingin. Bisa tolong hangatkan?', '5205830fc611d58dca7188bb6f64cede30011e4299ed82486460a95305b2500a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-088-sup-dingin-hangatkan', 'bright', 'Italian', 'La zuppa è arrivata, signora, ma ora è fredda. Può per favore scaldarla?', '5205830fc611d58dca7188bb6f64cede30011e4299ed82486460a95305b2500a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-088-sup-dingin-hangatkan', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'スープが届きましたが、今は冷たいです。温めていただけますか？', '5205830fc611d58dca7188bb6f64cede30011e4299ed82486460a95305b2500a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-088-sup-dingin-hangatkan', 'bright', 'Korean', '손님, 수프가 나왔는데 지금 차갑습니다. 데워 주시겠어요?', '5205830fc611d58dca7188bb6f64cede30011e4299ed82486460a95305b2500a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-088-sup-dingin-hangatkan', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Zupa już dotarła, proszę pani, ale teraz jest zimna. Czy może pani ją podgrzać?', '5205830fc611d58dca7188bb6f64cede30011e4299ed82486460a95305b2500a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-088-sup-dingin-hangatkan', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'A sopa chegou, senhora, mas agora está fria. Você pode esquentá-la, por favor?', '5205830fc611d58dca7188bb6f64cede30011e4299ed82486460a95305b2500a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-088-sup-dingin-hangatkan', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Суп прибыл, мэм, но теперь он холодный. Можете, пожалуйста, подогреть его?', '5205830fc611d58dca7188bb6f64cede30011e4299ed82486460a95305b2500a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-088-sup-dingin-hangatkan', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'La sopa ha llegado, señora, pero ahora está fría. ¿Podría calentarla, por favor?', '5205830fc611d58dca7188bb6f64cede30011e4299ed82486460a95305b2500a'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-089-kamar-berisik-pindahkan', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Wala ko nakatulog og tarong kagabii. Saba ang lawak, ma''am. Palihug ibalhin ko sa laing lawak.', '3bbb7cb042158cf814c5fb6f75c5bfeaa768f5b37f48b823a4b149e89433fcd7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-089-kamar-berisik-pindahkan', 'bright', 'English', 'I did not get enough sleep last night. The room is noisy, ma’am. Please move me to another room.', '3bbb7cb042158cf814c5fb6f75c5bfeaa768f5b37f48b823a4b149e89433fcd7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-089-kamar-berisik-pindahkan', 'bright', 'French', 'Je n''ai pas assez dormi la nuit dernière. La chambre est bruyante, madame. Veuillez me déplacer dans une autre chambre.', '3bbb7cb042158cf814c5fb6f75c5bfeaa768f5b37f48b823a4b149e89433fcd7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-089-kamar-berisik-pindahkan', 'bright', 'German', 'Letzte Nacht habe ich zu wenig geschlafen. Das Zimmer ist laut. Bitte geben Sie mir ein anderes Zimmer.', '3bbb7cb042158cf814c5fb6f75c5bfeaa768f5b37f48b823a4b149e89433fcd7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-089-kamar-berisik-pindahkan', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Tadi malam saya kurang tidur. Kamarnya berisik, Bu. Tolong pindahkan saya ke kamar lain.', '3bbb7cb042158cf814c5fb6f75c5bfeaa768f5b37f48b823a4b149e89433fcd7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-089-kamar-berisik-pindahkan', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Non ho dormito abbastanza la scorsa notte. La stanza è rumorosa, signora. Per favore, mi sposti in un''altra stanza.', '3bbb7cb042158cf814c5fb6f75c5bfeaa768f5b37f48b823a4b149e89433fcd7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-089-kamar-berisik-pindahkan', 'bright', 'Japanese', '昨夜は十分な睡眠が取れませんでした。部屋がうるさいです。部屋を移動してください。', '3bbb7cb042158cf814c5fb6f75c5bfeaa768f5b37f48b823a4b149e89433fcd7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-089-kamar-berisik-pindahkan', 'bright', 'Korean', '손님, 어젯밤에 잠을 충분히 못 잤습니다. 방이 시끄럽습니다. 다른 방으로 옮겨주세요.', '3bbb7cb042158cf814c5fb6f75c5bfeaa768f5b37f48b823a4b149e89433fcd7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-089-kamar-berisik-pindahkan', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Nie wyspałem się zeszłej nocy. W pokoju jest głośno, proszę pani. Proszę przenieść mnie do innego pokoju.', '3bbb7cb042158cf814c5fb6f75c5bfeaa768f5b37f48b823a4b149e89433fcd7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-089-kamar-berisik-pindahkan', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Não dormi o suficiente ontem à noite. O quarto está barulhento, senhora. Por favor, mude-me para outro quarto.', '3bbb7cb042158cf814c5fb6f75c5bfeaa768f5b37f48b823a4b149e89433fcd7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-089-kamar-berisik-pindahkan', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я плохо спал прошлой ночью. В номере шумно, мэм. Пожалуйста, переселите меня в другой номер.', '3bbb7cb042158cf814c5fb6f75c5bfeaa768f5b37f48b823a4b149e89433fcd7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-089-kamar-berisik-pindahkan', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'No dormí lo suficiente anoche. La habitación es ruidosa, señora. Por favor, cámbieme a otra habitación.', '3bbb7cb042158cf814c5fb6f75c5bfeaa768f5b37f48b823a4b149e89433fcd7'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-090-sekarang-semua-berfungsi', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Ganina walay init nga tubig nga migawas, sir. Karon naglihok na ang tanan. Daghang salamat sa imong tabang.', '44c620c3163e6475eb87f883a27b2d3f07f822d1873d12db6bc8d521c6f141a9'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-090-sekarang-semua-berfungsi', 'bright', 'English', 'Earlier no hot water was coming out, sir. Now everything works. Thank you very much for your help.', '44c620c3163e6475eb87f883a27b2d3f07f822d1873d12db6bc8d521c6f141a9'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-090-sekarang-semua-berfungsi', 'bright', 'French', 'Avant, il n''y avait pas d''eau chaude, monsieur. Maintenant, tout fonctionne. Merci beaucoup pour votre aide.', '44c620c3163e6475eb87f883a27b2d3f07f822d1873d12db6bc8d521c6f141a9'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-090-sekarang-semua-berfungsi', 'bright', 'German', 'Vorhin kam kein heißes Wasser. Jetzt funktioniert alles. Vielen Dank für Ihre Hilfe.', '44c620c3163e6475eb87f883a27b2d3f07f822d1873d12db6bc8d521c6f141a9'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-090-sekarang-semua-berfungsi', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Tadi air panasnya tidak keluar, Pak. Sekarang semuanya berfungsi. Terima kasih banyak atas bantuannya.', '44c620c3163e6475eb87f883a27b2d3f07f822d1873d12db6bc8d521c6f141a9'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-090-sekarang-semua-berfungsi', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Prima non usciva acqua calda, signore. Ora funziona tutto. Grazie mille per il suo aiuto.', '44c620c3163e6475eb87f883a27b2d3f07f822d1873d12db6bc8d521c6f141a9'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-090-sekarang-semua-berfungsi', 'bright', 'Japanese', '以前はお湯が出ませんでした。今はすべて正常に動作しています。ご協力いただき、誠にありがとうございました。', '44c620c3163e6475eb87f883a27b2d3f07f822d1873d12db6bc8d521c6f141a9'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-090-sekarang-semua-berfungsi', 'bright', 'Korean', '아까는 뜨거운 물이 나오지 않았습니다. 지금은 모두 잘 작동합니다. 도와주셔서 정말 감사합니다.', '44c620c3163e6475eb87f883a27b2d3f07f822d1873d12db6bc8d521c6f141a9'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-090-sekarang-semua-berfungsi', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Wcześniej nie leciała ciepła woda, proszę pana. Teraz wszystko działa. Bardzo dziękuję za pomoc.', '44c620c3163e6475eb87f883a27b2d3f07f822d1873d12db6bc8d521c6f141a9'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-090-sekarang-semua-berfungsi', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Antes não saía água quente, senhor. Agora tudo funciona. Muito obrigado pela sua ajuda.', '44c620c3163e6475eb87f883a27b2d3f07f822d1873d12db6bc8d521c6f141a9'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-090-sekarang-semua-berfungsi', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Раньше не было горячей воды, сэр. Теперь все работает. Большое спасибо за вашу помощь.', '44c620c3163e6475eb87f883a27b2d3f07f822d1873d12db6bc8d521c6f141a9'),
  ('indonesian-a2-practical-9', 'indonesian-a2-practical-9-090-sekarang-semua-berfungsi', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Antes no salía agua caliente, señor. Ahora todo funciona. Muchas gracias por su ayuda.', '44c620c3163e6475eb87f883a27b2d3f07f822d1873d12db6bc8d521c6f141a9'),
