  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-087-ho-comprato-questo-caricatore-oggi-ma-non-funziona', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Comprei este carregador hoje, mas não funciona. Pode trocá-lo?', 'e392a4d6104319cd2774e756419a9af18a9d82a50a42c3c961c48ffff0b9f5f2'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-087-ho-comprato-questo-caricatore-oggi-ma-non-funziona', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я купил это зарядное устройство сегодня, но оно не работает. Можете его обменять?', 'e392a4d6104319cd2774e756419a9af18a9d82a50a42c3c961c48ffff0b9f5f2'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-087-ho-comprato-questo-caricatore-oggi-ma-non-funziona', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Compré este cargador hoy, pero no funciona. ¿Puede cambiarlo?', 'e392a4d6104319cd2774e756419a9af18a9d82a50a42c3c961c48ffff0b9f5f2'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-088-ho-ordinato-la-zuppa-ma-e-fredda', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nag-order ko og sabaw, pero bugnaw kini. Pwede ba nimo initon ang sabaw, palihug?', 'd81008f6cae5115a0d3c98a5b1b02f17cb7c89d71f9068bb4294632f4f73b4f0'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-088-ho-ordinato-la-zuppa-ma-e-fredda', 'bright', 'English', 'I ordered the soup, but it is cold. Can you heat the soup, please?', 'd81008f6cae5115a0d3c98a5b1b02f17cb7c89d71f9068bb4294632f4f73b4f0'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-088-ho-ordinato-la-zuppa-ma-e-fredda', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai commandé la soupe, mais elle est froide. Pouvez-vous la réchauffer, s''il vous plaît ?', 'd81008f6cae5115a0d3c98a5b1b02f17cb7c89d71f9068bb4294632f4f73b4f0'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-088-ho-ordinato-la-zuppa-ma-e-fredda', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe die Suppe bestellt, aber sie ist kalt. Können Sie die Suppe bitte erwärmen?', 'd81008f6cae5115a0d3c98a5b1b02f17cb7c89d71f9068bb4294632f4f73b4f0'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-088-ho-ordinato-la-zuppa-ma-e-fredda', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya memesan sup, tetapi supnya dingin. Bisakah Anda memanaskan supnya, tolong?', 'd81008f6cae5115a0d3c98a5b1b02f17cb7c89d71f9068bb4294632f4f73b4f0'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-088-ho-ordinato-la-zuppa-ma-e-fredda', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho ordinato la zuppa, ma è fredda. Può scaldare la zuppa, per favore?', 'd81008f6cae5115a0d3c98a5b1b02f17cb7c89d71f9068bb4294632f4f73b4f0'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-088-ho-ordinato-la-zuppa-ma-e-fredda', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'スープを注文しましたが、冷たいです。スープを温めてもらえますか？', 'd81008f6cae5115a0d3c98a5b1b02f17cb7c89d71f9068bb4294632f4f73b4f0'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-088-ho-ordinato-la-zuppa-ma-e-fredda', 'bright', 'Korean', '수프를 주문했는데 차가워요. 수프 좀 데워주시겠어요?', 'd81008f6cae5115a0d3c98a5b1b02f17cb7c89d71f9068bb4294632f4f73b4f0'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-088-ho-ordinato-la-zuppa-ma-e-fredda', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Zamówiłem zupę, ale jest zimna. Czy możesz podgrzać zupę, proszę?', 'd81008f6cae5115a0d3c98a5b1b02f17cb7c89d71f9068bb4294632f4f73b4f0'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-088-ho-ordinato-la-zuppa-ma-e-fredda', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Pedi a sopa, mas está fria. Pode esquentar a sopa, por favor?', 'd81008f6cae5115a0d3c98a5b1b02f17cb7c89d71f9068bb4294632f4f73b4f0'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-088-ho-ordinato-la-zuppa-ma-e-fredda', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я заказал суп, но он холодный. Можете подогреть суп, пожалуйста?', 'd81008f6cae5115a0d3c98a5b1b02f17cb7c89d71f9068bb4294632f4f73b4f0'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-088-ho-ordinato-la-zuppa-ma-e-fredda', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Pedí la sopa, pero está fría. ¿Puede calentar la sopa, por favor?', 'd81008f6cae5115a0d3c98a5b1b02f17cb7c89d71f9068bb4294632f4f73b4f0'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-089-ho-dormito-poco-i-vicini-fanno-troppo-rumore', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Gamay ra ang akong tulog: saba kaayo ang mga silingan. Pwede ba nimo sila istoryahon?', 'a439e6b8d7971dce0b7b18bb509ce61a75a8444d4151997a0ff221d2075ffef1'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-089-ho-dormito-poco-i-vicini-fanno-troppo-rumore', 'bright', 'English', 'I slept little: the neighbors make too much noise. Can you speak with them?', 'a439e6b8d7971dce0b7b18bb509ce61a75a8444d4151997a0ff221d2075ffef1'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-089-ho-dormito-poco-i-vicini-fanno-troppo-rumore', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai peu dormi : les voisins font trop de bruit. Pouvez-vous leur parler ?', 'a439e6b8d7971dce0b7b18bb509ce61a75a8444d4151997a0ff221d2075ffef1'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-089-ho-dormito-poco-i-vicini-fanno-troppo-rumore', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe wenig geschlafen: Die Nachbarn machen zu viel Lärm. Können Sie mit ihnen sprechen?', 'a439e6b8d7971dce0b7b18bb509ce61a75a8444d4151997a0ff221d2075ffef1'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-089-ho-dormito-poco-i-vicini-fanno-troppo-rumore', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya sedikit tidur: tetangga membuat terlalu banyak kebisingan. Bisakah Anda berbicara dengan mereka?', 'a439e6b8d7971dce0b7b18bb509ce61a75a8444d4151997a0ff221d2075ffef1'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-089-ho-dormito-poco-i-vicini-fanno-troppo-rumore', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho dormito poco: i vicini fanno troppo rumore. Può parlare con loro?', 'a439e6b8d7971dce0b7b18bb509ce61a75a8444d4151997a0ff221d2075ffef1'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-089-ho-dormito-poco-i-vicini-fanno-troppo-rumore', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'あまり眠れませんでした。隣人がうるさすぎます。彼らと話してもらえますか？', 'a439e6b8d7971dce0b7b18bb509ce61a75a8444d4151997a0ff221d2075ffef1'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-089-ho-dormito-poco-i-vicini-fanno-troppo-rumore', 'bright', 'Korean', '이웃들이 너무 시끄러워서 잠을 거의 못 잤어요. 그들에게 말씀해 주시겠어요?', 'a439e6b8d7971dce0b7b18bb509ce61a75a8444d4151997a0ff221d2075ffef1'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-089-ho-dormito-poco-i-vicini-fanno-troppo-rumore', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Mało spałem: sąsiedzi robią za dużo hałasu. Czy możesz z nimi porozmawiać?', 'a439e6b8d7971dce0b7b18bb509ce61a75a8444d4151997a0ff221d2075ffef1'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-089-ho-dormito-poco-i-vicini-fanno-troppo-rumore', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Dormi pouco: os vizinhos fazem muito barulho. Pode falar com eles?', 'a439e6b8d7971dce0b7b18bb509ce61a75a8444d4151997a0ff221d2075ffef1'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-089-ho-dormito-poco-i-vicini-fanno-troppo-rumore', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я мало спал: соседи слишком шумят. Можете поговорить с ними?', 'a439e6b8d7971dce0b7b18bb509ce61a75a8444d4151997a0ff221d2075ffef1'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-089-ho-dormito-poco-i-vicini-fanno-troppo-rumore', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Dormí poco: los vecinos hacen demasiado ruido. ¿Puede hablar con ellos?', 'a439e6b8d7971dce0b7b18bb509ce61a75a8444d4151997a0ff221d2075ffef1'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-090-ho-chiamato-la-reception-ora-funziona-tutto-grazie-mille-per-laiuto', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Mitawag ko sa reception: naggana na ang tanan. Daghang salamat sa tabang.', 'd03ebcf91031ba486a2d1b3ba48aa8d27fdd16a39d099553fcc6c665cacc7fb5'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-090-ho-chiamato-la-reception-ora-funziona-tutto-grazie-mille-per-laiuto', 'bright', 'English', 'I called reception: everything works now. Thank you very much for the help.', 'd03ebcf91031ba486a2d1b3ba48aa8d27fdd16a39d099553fcc6c665cacc7fb5'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-090-ho-chiamato-la-reception-ora-funziona-tutto-grazie-mille-per-laiuto', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai appelé la réception : tout fonctionne maintenant. Merci beaucoup pour votre aide.', 'd03ebcf91031ba486a2d1b3ba48aa8d27fdd16a39d099553fcc6c665cacc7fb5'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-090-ho-chiamato-la-reception-ora-funziona-tutto-grazie-mille-per-laiuto', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe die Rezeption angerufen: Jetzt funktioniert alles. Vielen Dank für die Hilfe.', 'd03ebcf91031ba486a2d1b3ba48aa8d27fdd16a39d099553fcc6c665cacc7fb5'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-090-ho-chiamato-la-reception-ora-funziona-tutto-grazie-mille-per-laiuto', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya menelepon resepsionis: semuanya berfungsi sekarang. Terima kasih banyak atas bantuannya.', 'd03ebcf91031ba486a2d1b3ba48aa8d27fdd16a39d099553fcc6c665cacc7fb5'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-090-ho-chiamato-la-reception-ora-funziona-tutto-grazie-mille-per-laiuto', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho chiamato la reception: ora funziona tutto. Grazie mille per l''aiuto.', 'd03ebcf91031ba486a2d1b3ba48aa8d27fdd16a39d099553fcc6c665cacc7fb5'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-090-ho-chiamato-la-reception-ora-funziona-tutto-grazie-mille-per-laiuto', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'フロントに電話しました。今はすべてうまくいっています。助けてくれて本当にありがとう。', 'd03ebcf91031ba486a2d1b3ba48aa8d27fdd16a39d099553fcc6c665cacc7fb5'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-090-ho-chiamato-la-reception-ora-funziona-tutto-grazie-mille-per-laiuto', 'bright', 'Korean', '리셉션에 전화했는데 이제 모든 것이 잘 작동해요. 도와주셔서 정말 감사합니다.', 'd03ebcf91031ba486a2d1b3ba48aa8d27fdd16a39d099553fcc6c665cacc7fb5'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-090-ho-chiamato-la-reception-ora-funziona-tutto-grazie-mille-per-laiuto', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Zadzwoniłem na recepcję: wszystko teraz działa. Dziękuję bardzo za pomoc.', 'd03ebcf91031ba486a2d1b3ba48aa8d27fdd16a39d099553fcc6c665cacc7fb5'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-090-ho-chiamato-la-reception-ora-funziona-tutto-grazie-mille-per-laiuto', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Liguei para a recepção: agora tudo funciona. Muito obrigado pela ajuda.', 'd03ebcf91031ba486a2d1b3ba48aa8d27fdd16a39d099553fcc6c665cacc7fb5'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-090-ho-chiamato-la-reception-ora-funziona-tutto-grazie-mille-per-laiuto', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я позвонил на ресепшен: теперь все работает. Большое спасибо за помощь.', 'd03ebcf91031ba486a2d1b3ba48aa8d27fdd16a39d099553fcc6c665cacc7fb5'),
  ('italian-a2-practical-9', 'italian-a2-practical-9-090-ho-chiamato-la-reception-ora-funziona-tutto-grazie-mille-per-laiuto', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Llamé a recepción: ahora todo funciona. Muchas gracias por la ayuda.', 'd03ebcf91031ba486a2d1b3ba48aa8d27fdd16a39d099553fcc6c665cacc7fb5'),
