  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-046-iie-kekko-desu-kusuri-dake', 'bright', 'German', 'Nein danke. Nur dieses Medikament, bitte.', '5bf1630b9d9dfcc60705990352411a61f1d0e13266b1ccb9ef5dc04fbb81864b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-046-iie-kekko-desu-kusuri-dake', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Tidak terima kasih. Hanya obat ini, tolong.', '5bf1630b9d9dfcc60705990352411a61f1d0e13266b1ccb9ef5dc04fbb81864b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-046-iie-kekko-desu-kusuri-dake', 'bright', 'Italian', 'No grazie. Solo questo medicinale, per favore.', '5bf1630b9d9dfcc60705990352411a61f1d0e13266b1ccb9ef5dc04fbb81864b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-046-iie-kekko-desu-kusuri-dake', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'いいえ結構です。この薬だけお願いします。', '5bf1630b9d9dfcc60705990352411a61f1d0e13266b1ccb9ef5dc04fbb81864b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-046-iie-kekko-desu-kusuri-dake', 'bright', 'Korean', '아니요, 괜찮습니다. 이 약만 주세요.', '5bf1630b9d9dfcc60705990352411a61f1d0e13266b1ccb9ef5dc04fbb81864b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-046-iie-kekko-desu-kusuri-dake', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Nie, dziękuję. Tylko to lekarstwo, proszę.', '5bf1630b9d9dfcc60705990352411a61f1d0e13266b1ccb9ef5dc04fbb81864b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-046-iie-kekko-desu-kusuri-dake', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Não, obrigado. Só este remédio, por favor.', '5bf1630b9d9dfcc60705990352411a61f1d0e13266b1ccb9ef5dc04fbb81864b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-046-iie-kekko-desu-kusuri-dake', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Нет, спасибо. Только это лекарство, пожалуйста.', '5bf1630b9d9dfcc60705990352411a61f1d0e13266b1ccb9ef5dc04fbb81864b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-046-iie-kekko-desu-kusuri-dake', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'No gracias. Solo este medicamento, por favor.', '5bf1630b9d9dfcc60705990352411a61f1d0e13266b1ccb9ef5dc04fbb81864b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-047-okaikei-chigaimasu-mouichido', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa, dili sakto ang bayranan. Palihug susiha kini pag-usab.', 'c17308a6265826ee8580fb3c65dcebd33d26560167fc0ccb902f34ad7e9cbc86'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-047-okaikei-chigaimasu-mouichido', 'bright', 'English', 'Excuse me, the bill is not right. Please check it again.', 'c17308a6265826ee8580fb3c65dcebd33d26560167fc0ccb902f34ad7e9cbc86'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-047-okaikei-chigaimasu-mouichido', 'bright', 'French', 'Excusez-moi, l''addition n''est pas correcte. Veuillez la vérifier à nouveau.', 'c17308a6265826ee8580fb3c65dcebd33d26560167fc0ccb902f34ad7e9cbc86'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-047-okaikei-chigaimasu-mouichido', 'bright', 'German', 'Entschuldigung, die Rechnung stimmt nicht. Bitte sehen Sie noch einmal nach.', 'c17308a6265826ee8580fb3c65dcebd33d26560167fc0ccb902f34ad7e9cbc86'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-047-okaikei-chigaimasu-mouichido', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Permisi, tagihannya tidak benar. Tolong periksa lagi.', 'c17308a6265826ee8580fb3c65dcebd33d26560167fc0ccb902f34ad7e9cbc86'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-047-okaikei-chigaimasu-mouichido', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi scusi, il conto non è corretto. Per favore, lo ricontrolli.', 'c17308a6265826ee8580fb3c65dcebd33d26560167fc0ccb902f34ad7e9cbc86'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-047-okaikei-chigaimasu-mouichido', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すみません、お会計が違います。もう一度確認していただけますか。', 'c17308a6265826ee8580fb3c65dcebd33d26560167fc0ccb902f34ad7e9cbc86'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-047-okaikei-chigaimasu-mouichido', 'bright', 'Korean', '실례합니다, 계산이 맞지 않습니다. 다시 확인해 주세요.', 'c17308a6265826ee8580fb3c65dcebd33d26560167fc0ccb902f34ad7e9cbc86'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-047-okaikei-chigaimasu-mouichido', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, rachunek się nie zgadza. Proszę sprawdzić go jeszcze raz.', 'c17308a6265826ee8580fb3c65dcebd33d26560167fc0ccb902f34ad7e9cbc86'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-047-okaikei-chigaimasu-mouichido', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Com licença, a conta está errada. Por favor, verifique novamente.', 'c17308a6265826ee8580fb3c65dcebd33d26560167fc0ccb902f34ad7e9cbc86'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-047-okaikei-chigaimasu-mouichido', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, счет неверный. Пожалуйста, проверьте его еще раз.', 'c17308a6265826ee8580fb3c65dcebd33d26560167fc0ccb902f34ad7e9cbc86'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-047-okaikei-chigaimasu-mouichido', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Disculpe, la cuenta no está bien. Por favor, revísela de nuevo.', 'c17308a6265826ee8580fb3c65dcebd33d26560167fc0ccb902f34ad7e9cbc86'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-048-motto-chiisai-size', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa, mas gamay nga size palihug.', '856dc76dabbbef5081727c4e71be5633b6d18c2fae652b147a591a278f31396b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-048-motto-chiisai-size', 'bright', 'English', 'Excuse me, a smaller size, please.', '856dc76dabbbef5081727c4e71be5633b6d18c2fae652b147a591a278f31396b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-048-motto-chiisai-size', 'bright', 'French', 'Excusez-moi, une taille plus petite, s''il vous plaît.', '856dc76dabbbef5081727c4e71be5633b6d18c2fae652b147a591a278f31396b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-048-motto-chiisai-size', 'bright', 'German', 'Entschuldigung, bitte eine kleinere Größe.', '856dc76dabbbef5081727c4e71be5633b6d18c2fae652b147a591a278f31396b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-048-motto-chiisai-size', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Permisi, ukuran yang lebih kecil, tolong.', '856dc76dabbbef5081727c4e71be5633b6d18c2fae652b147a591a278f31396b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-048-motto-chiisai-size', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi scusi, una taglia più piccola, per favore.', '856dc76dabbbef5081727c4e71be5633b6d18c2fae652b147a591a278f31396b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-048-motto-chiisai-size', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すみません、もう少し小さいサイズをお願いします。', '856dc76dabbbef5081727c4e71be5633b6d18c2fae652b147a591a278f31396b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-048-motto-chiisai-size', 'bright', 'Korean', '실례합니다, 더 작은 사이즈로 주세요.', '856dc76dabbbef5081727c4e71be5633b6d18c2fae652b147a591a278f31396b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-048-motto-chiisai-size', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, mniejszy rozmiar, proszę.', '856dc76dabbbef5081727c4e71be5633b6d18c2fae652b147a591a278f31396b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-048-motto-chiisai-size', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Com licença, um tamanho menor, por favor.', '856dc76dabbbef5081727c4e71be5633b6d18c2fae652b147a591a278f31396b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-048-motto-chiisai-size', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, меньший размер, пожалуйста.', '856dc76dabbbef5081727c4e71be5633b6d18c2fae652b147a591a278f31396b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-048-motto-chiisai-size', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Disculpe, un tamaño más pequeño, por favor.', '856dc76dabbbef5081727c4e71be5633b6d18c2fae652b147a591a278f31396b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-049-machi-naka-ja-nakute-kitaguchi', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Dili sa downtown; sa north exit sa estasyon, palihug.', '282c254086faaa841688676e8644d2cd27474d0616997b7b229782a33320d39a'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-049-machi-naka-ja-nakute-kitaguchi', 'bright', 'English', 'Not downtown; to the station’s north exit, please.', '282c254086faaa841688676e8644d2cd27474d0616997b7b229782a33320d39a'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-049-machi-naka-ja-nakute-kitaguchi', 'bright', 'French', 'Pas au centre-ville ; à la sortie nord de la gare, s''il vous plaît.', '282c254086faaa841688676e8644d2cd27474d0616997b7b229782a33320d39a'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-049-machi-naka-ja-nakute-kitaguchi', 'bright', 'German', 'Nicht ins Stadtzentrum, bitte bis zum Nordausgang des Bahnhofs.', '282c254086faaa841688676e8644d2cd27474d0616997b7b229782a33320d39a'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-049-machi-naka-ja-nakute-kitaguchi', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Bukan ke pusat kota; ke pintu keluar utara stasiun, tolong.', '282c254086faaa841688676e8644d2cd27474d0616997b7b229782a33320d39a'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-049-machi-naka-ja-nakute-kitaguchi', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Non in centro, ma all''uscita nord della stazione, per favore.', '282c254086faaa841688676e8644d2cd27474d0616997b7b229782a33320d39a'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-049-machi-naka-ja-nakute-kitaguchi', 'bright', 'Japanese', '町の中心ではなく、駅の北口までお願いします。', '282c254086faaa841688676e8644d2cd27474d0616997b7b229782a33320d39a'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-049-machi-naka-ja-nakute-kitaguchi', 'bright', 'Korean', '시내 중심이 아니라 역 북쪽 출구까지 부탁합니다.', '282c254086faaa841688676e8644d2cd27474d0616997b7b229782a33320d39a'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-049-machi-naka-ja-nakute-kitaguchi', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Nie do centrum miasta; na północne wyjście ze stacji, proszę.', '282c254086faaa841688676e8644d2cd27474d0616997b7b229782a33320d39a'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-049-machi-naka-ja-nakute-kitaguchi', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Não para o centro da cidade; para a saída norte da estação, por favor.', '282c254086faaa841688676e8644d2cd27474d0616997b7b229782a33320d39a'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-049-machi-naka-ja-nakute-kitaguchi', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Не в центр города, а к северному выходу станции, пожалуйста.', '282c254086faaa841688676e8644d2cd27474d0616997b7b229782a33320d39a'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-049-machi-naka-ja-nakute-kitaguchi', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'No al centro; a la salida norte de la estación, por favor.', '282c254086faaa841688676e8644d2cd27474d0616997b7b229782a33320d39a'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-050-konya-muzukashii-kondo', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pasayloa, dili mahimo karong gabhiona. Tingali sa laing higayon.', '7e7a1de322c9b9c8c7203d6132833131d3abd9da4639a3be75e56d2fc492b334'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-050-konya-muzukashii-kondo', 'bright', 'English', 'Sorry, tonight won’t work for me. Maybe another time.', '7e7a1de322c9b9c8c7203d6132833131d3abd9da4639a3be75e56d2fc492b334'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-050-konya-muzukashii-kondo', 'bright', 'French', 'Désolé, ce soir ça ne va pas pour moi. Peut-être une autre fois.', '7e7a1de322c9b9c8c7203d6132833131d3abd9da4639a3be75e56d2fc492b334'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-050-konya-muzukashii-kondo', 'bright', 'German', 'Entschuldigung, heute Abend geht es leider nicht. Gern ein anderes Mal.', '7e7a1de322c9b9c8c7203d6132833131d3abd9da4639a3be75e56d2fc492b334'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-050-konya-muzukashii-kondo', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Maaf, malam ini saya tidak bisa. Mungkin lain kali.', '7e7a1de322c9b9c8c7203d6132833131d3abd9da4639a3be75e56d2fc492b334'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-050-konya-muzukashii-kondo', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Mi dispiace, stasera non posso. Magari un''altra volta.', '7e7a1de322c9b9c8c7203d6132833131d3abd9da4639a3be75e56d2fc492b334'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-050-konya-muzukashii-kondo', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'すみません、今夜は難しいです。また今度お願いします。', '7e7a1de322c9b9c8c7203d6132833131d3abd9da4639a3be75e56d2fc492b334'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-050-konya-muzukashii-kondo', 'bright', 'Korean', '죄송합니다, 오늘 밤은 어렵습니다. 다음에 부탁드립니다.', '7e7a1de322c9b9c8c7203d6132833131d3abd9da4639a3be75e56d2fc492b334'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-050-konya-muzukashii-kondo', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Przepraszam, dziś wieczorem mi nie pasuje. Może innym razem.', '7e7a1de322c9b9c8c7203d6132833131d3abd9da4639a3be75e56d2fc492b334'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-050-konya-muzukashii-kondo', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Desculpe, esta noite não vai dar para mim. Talvez outra hora.', '7e7a1de322c9b9c8c7203d6132833131d3abd9da4639a3be75e56d2fc492b334'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-050-konya-muzukashii-kondo', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Извините, сегодня вечером мне не подходит. Может быть, в другой раз.', '7e7a1de322c9b9c8c7203d6132833131d3abd9da4639a3be75e56d2fc492b334'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-5', 'japanese-a2-practical-5-050-konya-muzukashii-kondo', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Lo siento, esta noche no me va bien. Quizás en otro momento.', '7e7a1de322c9b9c8c7203d6132833131d3abd9da4639a3be75e56d2fc492b334'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-6', 'japanese-a2-practical-6-051-cleaning-itsu-dekimasuka', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Pa-dry clean lang unta. Kanus-a kini mahuman?', '8acb16ff454feeb18afb21094a38ef12dd0737e3fccdb5de694601f540e1ec80'),
