  ('japanese-a2-practical-8', 'japanese-a2-practical-8-080-honto-ii-hi-tanoshii', 'bright', 'German', 'Heute ist wirklich ein schöner Tag, oder? Es macht sehr viel Spaß.', '3e1bb803c95405d77f38f39f86ea80e07365c9fda7cbbb0d803be03620396ad9'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-8', 'japanese-a2-practical-8-080-honto-ii-hi-tanoshii', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Hari ini benar-benar hari yang baik, bukan? Saya sangat bersenang-senang.', '3e1bb803c95405d77f38f39f86ea80e07365c9fda7cbbb0d803be03620396ad9'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-8', 'japanese-a2-practical-8-080-honto-ii-hi-tanoshii', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Oggi è davvero una bella giornata, non è vero? Mi sto divertendo molto.', '3e1bb803c95405d77f38f39f86ea80e07365c9fda7cbbb0d803be03620396ad9'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-8', 'japanese-a2-practical-8-080-honto-ii-hi-tanoshii', 'bright', 'Japanese', '今日は本当に良い一日ですね。とても楽しいです。', '3e1bb803c95405d77f38f39f86ea80e07365c9fda7cbbb0d803be03620396ad9'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-8', 'japanese-a2-practical-8-080-honto-ii-hi-tanoshii', 'bright', 'Korean', '오늘은 정말 좋은 날이네요, 그렇죠? 정말 즐거워요.', '3e1bb803c95405d77f38f39f86ea80e07365c9fda7cbbb0d803be03620396ad9'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-8', 'japanese-a2-practical-8-080-honto-ii-hi-tanoshii', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Dziś jest naprawdę dobry dzień, prawda? Świetnie się bawię.', '3e1bb803c95405d77f38f39f86ea80e07365c9fda7cbbb0d803be03620396ad9'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-8', 'japanese-a2-practical-8-080-honto-ii-hi-tanoshii', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Hoje é um dia muito bom, não é? Estou me divertindo muito.', '3e1bb803c95405d77f38f39f86ea80e07365c9fda7cbbb0d803be03620396ad9'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-8', 'japanese-a2-practical-8-080-honto-ii-hi-tanoshii', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Сегодня действительно хороший день, не так ли? Мне очень весело.', '3e1bb803c95405d77f38f39f86ea80e07365c9fda7cbbb0d803be03620396ad9'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-8', 'japanese-a2-practical-8-080-honto-ii-hi-tanoshii', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Hoy es un día realmente bueno, ¿verdad? Me estoy divirtiendo mucho.', '3e1bb803c95405d77f38f39f86ea80e07365c9fda7cbbb0d803be03620396ad9'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-081-shawa-kowaremashita-denwa', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Naguba ang shower. Mitawag ko sa front desk. Mahimo ba nimo kining tan-awon?', '35ee88fb8f8809e6d71e8ff6f7c32e667f71b0ca66105caa1501bd333039cfb1'),
