  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-081-shawa-kowaremashita-denwa', 'bright', 'German', 'Die Dusche ist kaputtgegangen. Ich habe an der Rezeption angerufen. Könnten Sie bitte nachsehen?', '35ee88fb8f8809e6d71e8ff6f7c32e667f71b0ca66105caa1501bd333039cfb1'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-081-shawa-kowaremashita-denwa', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Pancuran rusak. Saya menelepon resepsionis. Bisakah Anda memeriksanya?', '35ee88fb8f8809e6d71e8ff6f7c32e667f71b0ca66105caa1501bd333039cfb1'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-081-shawa-kowaremashita-denwa', 'bright', 'Italian', 'La doccia si è rotta. Ho chiamato la reception. Potresti dare un''occhiata?', '35ee88fb8f8809e6d71e8ff6f7c32e667f71b0ca66105caa1501bd333039cfb1'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-081-shawa-kowaremashita-denwa', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'シャワーが壊れました。フロントに電話しました。見てもらえますか。', '35ee88fb8f8809e6d71e8ff6f7c32e667f71b0ca66105caa1501bd333039cfb1'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-081-shawa-kowaremashita-denwa', 'bright', 'Korean', '샤워기가 고장났어요. 프런트에 전화했어요. 좀 봐주시겠어요?', '35ee88fb8f8809e6d71e8ff6f7c32e667f71b0ca66105caa1501bd333039cfb1'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-081-shawa-kowaremashita-denwa', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Prysznic się zepsuł. Zadzwoniłem do recepcji. Czy mógłbyś spojrzeć?', '35ee88fb8f8809e6d71e8ff6f7c32e667f71b0ca66105caa1501bd333039cfb1'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-081-shawa-kowaremashita-denwa', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'O chuveiro quebrou. Liguei para a recepção. Você poderia dar uma olhada?', '35ee88fb8f8809e6d71e8ff6f7c32e667f71b0ca66105caa1501bd333039cfb1'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-081-shawa-kowaremashita-denwa', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Душ сломался. Я позвонил на стойку регистрации. Не могли бы вы посмотреть?', '35ee88fb8f8809e6d71e8ff6f7c32e667f71b0ca66105caa1501bd333039cfb1'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-081-shawa-kowaremashita-denwa', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'La ducha se rompió. Llamé a recepción. ¿Podrías echar un vistazo?', '35ee88fb8f8809e6d71e8ff6f7c32e667f71b0ca66105caa1501bd333039cfb1'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-082-sanjuppun-chumon-mada', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nag-order ko katloan ka minuto ang milabay. Wala pa kini moabot. Mahimo ba nimo kining susihon?', '6b8a8084b6425657b9f1026817ebd7c4db251debf406e0ca415d160724bfc556'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-082-sanjuppun-chumon-mada', 'bright', 'English', 'I ordered thirty minutes ago. It has not arrived yet. Could you check?', '6b8a8084b6425657b9f1026817ebd7c4db251debf406e0ca415d160724bfc556'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-082-sanjuppun-chumon-mada', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai commandé il y a trente minutes. Ce n''est pas encore arrivé. Pourriez-vous vérifier ?', '6b8a8084b6425657b9f1026817ebd7c4db251debf406e0ca415d160724bfc556'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-082-sanjuppun-chumon-mada', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe vor dreißig Minuten bestellt. Es ist noch nicht gekommen. Könnten Sie bitte nachsehen?', '6b8a8084b6425657b9f1026817ebd7c4db251debf406e0ca415d160724bfc556'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-082-sanjuppun-chumon-mada', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya memesan tiga puluh menit yang lalu. Belum sampai. Bisakah Anda memeriksanya?', '6b8a8084b6425657b9f1026817ebd7c4db251debf406e0ca415d160724bfc556'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-082-sanjuppun-chumon-mada', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho ordinato trenta minuti fa. Non è ancora arrivato. Potresti controllare?', '6b8a8084b6425657b9f1026817ebd7c4db251debf406e0ca415d160724bfc556'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-082-sanjuppun-chumon-mada', 'bright', 'Japanese', '30分前に注文しました。まだ届いていません。確認してもらえますか。', '6b8a8084b6425657b9f1026817ebd7c4db251debf406e0ca415d160724bfc556'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-082-sanjuppun-chumon-mada', 'bright', 'Korean', '30분 전에 주문했습니다. 아직 오지 않았습니다. 확인해 주시겠어요?', '6b8a8084b6425657b9f1026817ebd7c4db251debf406e0ca415d160724bfc556'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-082-sanjuppun-chumon-mada', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Zamówiłem trzydzieści minut temu. Jeszcze nie dotarło. Czy możesz sprawdzić?', '6b8a8084b6425657b9f1026817ebd7c4db251debf406e0ca415d160724bfc556'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-082-sanjuppun-chumon-mada', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu pedi há trinta minutos. Ainda não chegou. Você poderia verificar?', '6b8a8084b6425657b9f1026817ebd7c4db251debf406e0ca415d160724bfc556'),
