  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-086-otsuri-hyakuen-tarimasen', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Сдачи не хватает ста иен. Не могли бы вы проверить еще раз?', '3bf8848e110320fbfb963bd2903c095391292774c4dc5b68ace9f8a38458a092'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-086-otsuri-hyakuen-tarimasen', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'El cambio es de cien yenes menos. ¿Podría comprobarlo una vez más?', '3bf8848e110320fbfb963bd2903c095391292774c4dc5b68ace9f8a38458a092'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-087-kyo-kaimashita-ugokimasen', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Gipalit nako kini karon, pero mihunong na kini og gana. Mahimo ba nimo kining ilisan?', 'be55a2f356fc57e0aa616287a44809b20f4ed1ec0bdf0925dfa38039905d22aa'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-087-kyo-kaimashita-ugokimasen', 'bright', 'English', 'I bought it today, but it has already stopped working. Could you exchange it?', 'be55a2f356fc57e0aa616287a44809b20f4ed1ec0bdf0925dfa38039905d22aa'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-087-kyo-kaimashita-ugokimasen', 'bright', 'French', 'Je l''ai acheté aujourd''hui, mais il a déjà cessé de fonctionner. Pourriez-vous l''échanger ?', 'be55a2f356fc57e0aa616287a44809b20f4ed1ec0bdf0925dfa38039905d22aa'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-087-kyo-kaimashita-ugokimasen', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe sie heute gekauft. Aber sie läuft schon nicht mehr. Könnten Sie sie bitte umtauschen?', 'be55a2f356fc57e0aa616287a44809b20f4ed1ec0bdf0925dfa38039905d22aa'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-087-kyo-kaimashita-ugokimasen', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya membelinya hari ini, tetapi sudah tidak berfungsi lagi. Bisakah Anda menukarnya?', 'be55a2f356fc57e0aa616287a44809b20f4ed1ec0bdf0925dfa38039905d22aa'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-087-kyo-kaimashita-ugokimasen', 'bright', 'Italian', 'L''ho comprato oggi, ma ha già smesso di funzionare. Potresti cambiarlo?', 'be55a2f356fc57e0aa616287a44809b20f4ed1ec0bdf0925dfa38039905d22aa'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-087-kyo-kaimashita-ugokimasen', 'bright', 'Japanese', '今日買いましたが、もう動きません。交換してもらえますか。', 'be55a2f356fc57e0aa616287a44809b20f4ed1ec0bdf0925dfa38039905d22aa'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-087-kyo-kaimashita-ugokimasen', 'bright', 'Korean', '오늘 샀는데 벌써 작동을 멈췄어요. 교환해 주시겠어요?', 'be55a2f356fc57e0aa616287a44809b20f4ed1ec0bdf0925dfa38039905d22aa'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-087-kyo-kaimashita-ugokimasen', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Kupiłem/Kupiłam dzisiaj, ale już przestało działać. Czy możesz to wymienić?', 'be55a2f356fc57e0aa616287a44809b20f4ed1ec0bdf0925dfa38039905d22aa'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-087-kyo-kaimashita-ugokimasen', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Comprei hoje, mas já parou de funcionar. Você poderia trocá-lo?', 'be55a2f356fc57e0aa616287a44809b20f4ed1ec0bdf0925dfa38039905d22aa'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-087-kyo-kaimashita-ugokimasen', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я купил это сегодня, но оно уже перестало работать. Не могли бы вы обменять?', 'be55a2f356fc57e0aa616287a44809b20f4ed1ec0bdf0925dfa38039905d22aa'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-087-kyo-kaimashita-ugokimasen', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Lo compré hoy, pero ya dejó de funcionar. ¿Podría cambiarlo?', 'be55a2f356fc57e0aa616287a44809b20f4ed1ec0bdf0925dfa38039905d22aa'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-088-supu-tsumetai-atatamete', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Ang sabaw medyo bugnaw. Mahimo ba nimo kining ipainit?', '32ba6c7a1372f75d134445cfceb68c5de7b4a6b8717fac7bd76aadb5e5330a33'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-088-supu-tsumetai-atatamete', 'bright', 'English', 'The soup is a little cold. Could you warm it up?', '32ba6c7a1372f75d134445cfceb68c5de7b4a6b8717fac7bd76aadb5e5330a33'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-088-supu-tsumetai-atatamete', 'bright', 'French', 'La soupe est un peu froide. Pourriez-vous la réchauffer ?', '32ba6c7a1372f75d134445cfceb68c5de7b4a6b8717fac7bd76aadb5e5330a33'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-088-supu-tsumetai-atatamete', 'bright', 'German', 'Die Suppe ist etwas kalt. Könnten Sie sie bitte aufwärmen?', '32ba6c7a1372f75d134445cfceb68c5de7b4a6b8717fac7bd76aadb5e5330a33'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-088-supu-tsumetai-atatamete', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Supnya sedikit dingin. Bisakah Anda menghangatkannya?', '32ba6c7a1372f75d134445cfceb68c5de7b4a6b8717fac7bd76aadb5e5330a33'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-088-supu-tsumetai-atatamete', 'bright', 'Italian', 'La zuppa è un po'' fredda. Potresti scaldarla?', '32ba6c7a1372f75d134445cfceb68c5de7b4a6b8717fac7bd76aadb5e5330a33'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-088-supu-tsumetai-atatamete', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'スープが少し冷たいです。温めてもらえますか。', '32ba6c7a1372f75d134445cfceb68c5de7b4a6b8717fac7bd76aadb5e5330a33'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-088-supu-tsumetai-atatamete', 'bright', 'Korean', '수프가 좀 차갑습니다. 데워주시겠어요?', '32ba6c7a1372f75d134445cfceb68c5de7b4a6b8717fac7bd76aadb5e5330a33'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-088-supu-tsumetai-atatamete', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Zupa jest trochę zimna. Czy możesz ją podgrzać?', '32ba6c7a1372f75d134445cfceb68c5de7b4a6b8717fac7bd76aadb5e5330a33'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-088-supu-tsumetai-atatamete', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'A sopa está um pouco fria. Você poderia aquecê-la?', '32ba6c7a1372f75d134445cfceb68c5de7b4a6b8717fac7bd76aadb5e5330a33'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-088-supu-tsumetai-atatamete', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Суп немного холодный. Не могли бы вы его подогреть?', '32ba6c7a1372f75d134445cfceb68c5de7b4a6b8717fac7bd76aadb5e5330a33'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-088-supu-tsumetai-atatamete', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'La sopa está un poco fría. ¿Podría calentarla?', '32ba6c7a1372f75d134445cfceb68c5de7b4a6b8717fac7bd76aadb5e5330a33'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-089-tonari-urusai-nemurenai', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Ang lawak sa pikas saba. Wala ko makatulog og maayo. Mahimo ba nimo akong ibalhin sa laing lawak?', '2e193f71581141dd6da45ada6ab0977186281679ad708ac8ced8a0d570c5b11b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-089-tonari-urusai-nemurenai', 'bright', 'English', 'The room next door is noisy. I could not sleep well. Could you move me to another room?', '2e193f71581141dd6da45ada6ab0977186281679ad708ac8ced8a0d570c5b11b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-089-tonari-urusai-nemurenai', 'bright', 'French', 'La chambre voisine est bruyante. Je n''ai pas bien dormi. Pourriez-vous me déplacer dans une autre chambre ?', '2e193f71581141dd6da45ada6ab0977186281679ad708ac8ced8a0d570c5b11b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-089-tonari-urusai-nemurenai', 'bright', 'German', 'Das Nachbarzimmer ist laut. Ich konnte nicht gut schlafen. Könnten Sie mich bitte in ein anderes Zimmer umquartieren?', '2e193f71581141dd6da45ada6ab0977186281679ad708ac8ced8a0d570c5b11b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-089-tonari-urusai-nemurenai', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Kamar sebelah berisik. Saya tidak bisa tidur nyenyak. Bisakah Anda memindahkan saya ke kamar lain?', '2e193f71581141dd6da45ada6ab0977186281679ad708ac8ced8a0d570c5b11b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-089-tonari-urusai-nemurenai', 'bright', 'Italian', 'La stanza accanto è rumorosa. Non ho dormito bene. Potrebbe spostarmi in un''altra stanza?', '2e193f71581141dd6da45ada6ab0977186281679ad708ac8ced8a0d570c5b11b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-089-tonari-urusai-nemurenai', 'bright', 'Japanese', '隣の部屋がうるさいです。よく眠れませんでした。他の部屋に変えてもらえますか。', '2e193f71581141dd6da45ada6ab0977186281679ad708ac8ced8a0d570c5b11b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-089-tonari-urusai-nemurenai', 'bright', 'Korean', '옆방이 시끄럽습니다. 잠을 잘 자지 못했습니다. 다른 방으로 옮겨주시겠어요?', '2e193f71581141dd6da45ada6ab0977186281679ad708ac8ced8a0d570c5b11b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-089-tonari-urusai-nemurenai', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Pokój obok jest głośny. Nie udało mi się dobrze wyspać. Czy można mnie przenieść do innego pokoju?', '2e193f71581141dd6da45ada6ab0977186281679ad708ac8ced8a0d570c5b11b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-089-tonari-urusai-nemurenai', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'O quarto ao lado está barulhento. Não consegui dormir bem. Você poderia me mudar para outro quarto?', '2e193f71581141dd6da45ada6ab0977186281679ad708ac8ced8a0d570c5b11b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-089-tonari-urusai-nemurenai', 'bright', 'Russian', 'В соседней комнате шумно. Я плохо спал. Не могли бы вы переселить меня в другую комнату?', '2e193f71581141dd6da45ada6ab0977186281679ad708ac8ced8a0d570c5b11b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-089-tonari-urusai-nemurenai', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'La habitación de al lado es ruidosa. No pude dormir bien. ¿Podría trasladarme a otra habitación?', '2e193f71581141dd6da45ada6ab0977186281679ad708ac8ced8a0d570c5b11b'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-090-mou-daijobu-arigato', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Okay na ang tanan karon. Wala na kini problema. Daghang salamat.', 'e69c8d9cf426ada2665999ee26dce1b94bbb12e2fbe9076ea1e03682fe41ffc0'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-090-mou-daijobu-arigato', 'bright', 'English', 'Everything is fine now. There is no problem anymore. Thank you very much.', 'e69c8d9cf426ada2665999ee26dce1b94bbb12e2fbe9076ea1e03682fe41ffc0'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-090-mou-daijobu-arigato', 'bright', 'French', 'Tout va bien maintenant. Il n''y a plus de problème. Merci beaucoup.', 'e69c8d9cf426ada2665999ee26dce1b94bbb12e2fbe9076ea1e03682fe41ffc0'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-090-mou-daijobu-arigato', 'bright', 'German', 'Jetzt ist alles in Ordnung. Es gibt kein Problem mehr. Vielen herzlichen Dank.', 'e69c8d9cf426ada2665999ee26dce1b94bbb12e2fbe9076ea1e03682fe41ffc0'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-090-mou-daijobu-arigato', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Semuanya baik-baik saja sekarang. Tidak ada masalah lagi. Terima kasih banyak.', 'e69c8d9cf426ada2665999ee26dce1b94bbb12e2fbe9076ea1e03682fe41ffc0'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-090-mou-daijobu-arigato', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ora va tutto bene. Non c''è più nessun problema. Grazie mille.', 'e69c8d9cf426ada2665999ee26dce1b94bbb12e2fbe9076ea1e03682fe41ffc0'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-090-mou-daijobu-arigato', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'もう大丈夫です。問題はありません。本当にありがとうございました。', 'e69c8d9cf426ada2665999ee26dce1b94bbb12e2fbe9076ea1e03682fe41ffc0'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-090-mou-daijobu-arigato', 'bright', 'Korean', '이제 모든 것이 괜찮습니다. 더 이상 문제는 없습니다. 정말 감사합니다.', 'e69c8d9cf426ada2665999ee26dce1b94bbb12e2fbe9076ea1e03682fe41ffc0'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-090-mou-daijobu-arigato', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Wszystko jest teraz w porządku. Nie ma już problemu. Dziękuję bardzo.', 'e69c8d9cf426ada2665999ee26dce1b94bbb12e2fbe9076ea1e03682fe41ffc0'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-090-mou-daijobu-arigato', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Tudo está bem agora. Não há mais problemas. Muito obrigado.', 'e69c8d9cf426ada2665999ee26dce1b94bbb12e2fbe9076ea1e03682fe41ffc0'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-090-mou-daijobu-arigato', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Теперь все в порядке. Больше никаких проблем нет. Большое спасибо.', 'e69c8d9cf426ada2665999ee26dce1b94bbb12e2fbe9076ea1e03682fe41ffc0'),
  ('japanese-a2-practical-9', 'japanese-a2-practical-9-090-mou-daijobu-arigato', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Todo está bien ahora. Ya no hay ningún problema. Muchas gracias.', 'e69c8d9cf426ada2665999ee26dce1b94bbb12e2fbe9076ea1e03682fe41ffc0'),
  ('korean-a1-practical-1', 'korean-a1-practical-1-lesson-1-annyeong-first-contact', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Hello. Makasulti ba kaha ka og English?', '2c1a2bf4648fce2e52eae601990694cadea8b1061c6e54710c8377aaa69c896a'),
