  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-036-oneul-mot-gayo', 'bright', 'English', 'I have work, so I cannot go today. I am sorry.', 'ad4c6965a18e6b945988e0f8cd231689bacba17195b39766c852a2960461b363'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-036-oneul-mot-gayo', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai du travail, donc je ne peux pas venir aujourd''hui. Je suis désolé.', 'ad4c6965a18e6b945988e0f8cd231689bacba17195b39766c852a2960461b363'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-036-oneul-mot-gayo', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe Arbeit, deshalb kann ich heute nicht gehen. Es tut mir leid.', 'ad4c6965a18e6b945988e0f8cd231689bacba17195b39766c852a2960461b363'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-036-oneul-mot-gayo', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya ada pekerjaan, jadi saya tidak bisa pergi hari ini. Maaf.', 'ad4c6965a18e6b945988e0f8cd231689bacba17195b39766c852a2960461b363'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-036-oneul-mot-gayo', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho lavoro, quindi oggi non posso venire. Mi dispiace.', 'ad4c6965a18e6b945988e0f8cd231689bacba17195b39766c852a2960461b363'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-036-oneul-mot-gayo', 'bright', 'Japanese', '仕事があるので、今日は行けません。すみません。', 'ad4c6965a18e6b945988e0f8cd231689bacba17195b39766c852a2960461b363'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-036-oneul-mot-gayo', 'bright', 'Korean', '일이 있어서 오늘은 못 가요. 죄송해요.', 'ad4c6965a18e6b945988e0f8cd231689bacba17195b39766c852a2960461b363'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-036-oneul-mot-gayo', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Mam pracę, więc dzisiaj nie mogę iść. Przepraszam.', 'ad4c6965a18e6b945988e0f8cd231689bacba17195b39766c852a2960461b363'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-036-oneul-mot-gayo', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Tenho trabalho, então não posso ir hoje. Sinto muito.', 'ad4c6965a18e6b945988e0f8cd231689bacba17195b39766c852a2960461b363'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-036-oneul-mot-gayo', 'bright', 'Russian', 'У меня работа, поэтому я не могу пойти сегодня. Извините.', 'ad4c6965a18e6b945988e0f8cd231689bacba17195b39766c852a2960461b363'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-036-oneul-mot-gayo', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Tengo trabajo, así que no puedo ir hoy. Lo siento.', 'ad4c6965a18e6b945988e0f8cd231689bacba17195b39766c852a2960461b363'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-037-jega-jeonyeok-salgeyo', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Maayo kana. Mangaon kita nga mag-uban. Ako ang mobayad sa panihapon.', '5397a94ee29c01aac214be7943555de870fef92dcc3f6f357d699ab23e617306'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-037-jega-jeonyeok-salgeyo', 'bright', 'English', 'Sounds good. Let us eat together. I will pay for dinner.', '5397a94ee29c01aac214be7943555de870fef92dcc3f6f357d699ab23e617306'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-037-jega-jeonyeok-salgeyo', 'bright', 'French', 'Ça marche. Mangeons ensemble. Je paierai le dîner.', '5397a94ee29c01aac214be7943555de870fef92dcc3f6f357d699ab23e617306'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-037-jega-jeonyeok-salgeyo', 'bright', 'German', 'Gern. Essen wir zusammen. Ich übernehme das Abendessen.', '5397a94ee29c01aac214be7943555de870fef92dcc3f6f357d699ab23e617306'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-4', 'korean-a2-practical-4-037-jega-jeonyeok-salgeyo', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Bagus. Ayo makan bersama. Saya akan mentraktir makan malam.', '5397a94ee29c01aac214be7943555de870fef92dcc3f6f357d699ab23e617306'),
