  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-084-jigabeul-ireobeoryeosseoyo', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я потерял кошелек. Помогите мне, пожалуйста, поискать.', 'a3aa12386b67cce355037fe96415aa0f8e17a838daa6bf3162b67aa498fb8e03'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-084-jigabeul-ireobeoryeosseoyo', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Perdí mi cartera. Por favor, ayúdame a buscarla.', 'a3aa12386b67cce355037fe96415aa0f8e17a838daa6bf3162b67aa498fb8e03'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-085-ajik-an-wayo', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nanawag ko sa kompanya sa taxi. Wala pa kini moabot. Palihug pagtawag og laing taxi.', '7b86ce3349c8df634c1b168435fcd8d304b24cadd658471977264c97b932e37e'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-085-ajik-an-wayo', 'bright', 'English', 'I called the taxi company. It has not come yet. Please call another taxi.', '7b86ce3349c8df634c1b168435fcd8d304b24cadd658471977264c97b932e37e'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-085-ajik-an-wayo', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai appelé la compagnie de taxi. Elle n''est pas encore venue. Veuillez appeler un autre taxi.', '7b86ce3349c8df634c1b168435fcd8d304b24cadd658471977264c97b932e37e'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-085-ajik-an-wayo', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe beim Taxiunternehmen angerufen. Es ist noch nicht da. Bitte rufen Sie ein anderes Taxi.', '7b86ce3349c8df634c1b168435fcd8d304b24cadd658471977264c97b932e37e'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-085-ajik-an-wayo', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya menelepon perusahaan taksi. Belum datang. Tolong panggil taksi lain.', '7b86ce3349c8df634c1b168435fcd8d304b24cadd658471977264c97b932e37e'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-085-ajik-an-wayo', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho chiamato la compagnia di taxi. Non è ancora arrivato. Per favore, chiama un altro taxi.', '7b86ce3349c8df634c1b168435fcd8d304b24cadd658471977264c97b932e37e'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-085-ajik-an-wayo', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'タクシー会社に電話しました。まだ来ていません。別のタクシーを呼んでください。', '7b86ce3349c8df634c1b168435fcd8d304b24cadd658471977264c97b932e37e'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-085-ajik-an-wayo', 'bright', 'Korean', '택시 회사에 전화했어요. 아직 안 와요. 다른 택시 불러 주세요.', '7b86ce3349c8df634c1b168435fcd8d304b24cadd658471977264c97b932e37e'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-085-ajik-an-wayo', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Zadzwoniłem(am) do firmy taksówkarskiej. Jeszcze nie przyjechała. Proszę, zamów inną taksówkę.', '7b86ce3349c8df634c1b168435fcd8d304b24cadd658471977264c97b932e37e'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-085-ajik-an-wayo', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Liguei para a companhia de táxi. Ainda não chegou. Por favor, chame outro táxi.', '7b86ce3349c8df634c1b168435fcd8d304b24cadd658471977264c97b932e37e'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-085-ajik-an-wayo', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я позвонил в таксомоторную компанию. Еще не приехало. Пожалуйста, вызовите другое такси.', '7b86ce3349c8df634c1b168435fcd8d304b24cadd658471977264c97b932e37e'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-085-ajik-an-wayo', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Llamé a la compañía de taxis. Aún no ha llegado. Por favor, llama a otro taxi.', '7b86ce3349c8df634c1b168435fcd8d304b24cadd658471977264c97b932e37e'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-086-cheon-woni-mojarayo', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nagbayad ko. Apan kulang og usa ka libo ka won ang sukli. Palihug susiha kini.', '36d7f41ca2b47df041b9ef835999eac8c54c6a8f35e634a92ec7d64b8cce5511'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-086-cheon-woni-mojarayo', 'bright', 'English', 'I paid. But the change is short a thousand won. Please check it.', '36d7f41ca2b47df041b9ef835999eac8c54c6a8f35e634a92ec7d64b8cce5511'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-086-cheon-woni-mojarayo', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai payé. Mais la monnaie est insuffisante de mille won. Veuillez vérifier.', '36d7f41ca2b47df041b9ef835999eac8c54c6a8f35e634a92ec7d64b8cce5511'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-086-cheon-woni-mojarayo', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe bezahlt. Aber beim Wechselgeld fehlen tausend Won. Bitte prüfen Sie das.', '36d7f41ca2b47df041b9ef835999eac8c54c6a8f35e634a92ec7d64b8cce5511'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-086-cheon-woni-mojarayo', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya sudah membayar. Tapi kembaliannya kurang seribu won. Tolong periksa.', '36d7f41ca2b47df041b9ef835999eac8c54c6a8f35e634a92ec7d64b8cce5511'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-086-cheon-woni-mojarayo', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho pagato. Ma il resto è di mille won in meno. Per favore, controlla.', '36d7f41ca2b47df041b9ef835999eac8c54c6a8f35e634a92ec7d64b8cce5511'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-086-cheon-woni-mojarayo', 'bright', 'Japanese', '支払いましたが、お釣りが千ウォン足りません。確認してください。', '36d7f41ca2b47df041b9ef835999eac8c54c6a8f35e634a92ec7d64b8cce5511'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-086-cheon-woni-mojarayo', 'bright', 'Korean', '계산했어요. 그런데 거스름돈이 천 원 모자라요. 확인해 주세요.', '36d7f41ca2b47df041b9ef835999eac8c54c6a8f35e634a92ec7d64b8cce5511'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-086-cheon-woni-mojarayo', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Zapłaciłem(am). Ale brakuje tysiąca wonów reszty. Proszę, sprawdź to.', '36d7f41ca2b47df041b9ef835999eac8c54c6a8f35e634a92ec7d64b8cce5511'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-086-cheon-woni-mojarayo', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Eu paguei. Mas o troco está faltando mil won. Por favor, verifique.', '36d7f41ca2b47df041b9ef835999eac8c54c6a8f35e634a92ec7d64b8cce5511'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-086-cheon-woni-mojarayo', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я заплатил. Но сдачи не хватает на тысячу вон. Пожалуйста, проверьте.', '36d7f41ca2b47df041b9ef835999eac8c54c6a8f35e634a92ec7d64b8cce5511'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-086-cheon-woni-mojarayo', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Pagué. Pero el cambio es de mil wones menos. Por favor, compruébalo.', '36d7f41ca2b47df041b9ef835999eac8c54c6a8f35e634a92ec7d64b8cce5511'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-087-beolsseo-an-dwaeyo', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Gipalit nako kini karon. Apan dili na kini naglihok. Palihug ilisi kini.', '3d99461259635e8ed02db956a028d79eba8f31751e003dec93a4cee6956ee935'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-087-beolsseo-an-dwaeyo', 'bright', 'English', 'I bought it today. But it already does not work. Please exchange it.', '3d99461259635e8ed02db956a028d79eba8f31751e003dec93a4cee6956ee935'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-087-beolsseo-an-dwaeyo', 'bright', 'French', 'Je l''ai acheté aujourd''hui. Mais ça ne marche déjà plus. Échangez-le, s''il vous plaît.', '3d99461259635e8ed02db956a028d79eba8f31751e003dec93a4cee6956ee935'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-087-beolsseo-an-dwaeyo', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe es heute gekauft. Aber es funktioniert schon nicht. Bitte tauschen Sie es um.', '3d99461259635e8ed02db956a028d79eba8f31751e003dec93a4cee6956ee935'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-087-beolsseo-an-dwaeyo', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya membelinya hari ini. Tapi sudah tidak berfungsi. Tolong tukarkan.', '3d99461259635e8ed02db956a028d79eba8f31751e003dec93a4cee6956ee935'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-087-beolsseo-an-dwaeyo', 'bright', 'Italian', 'L''ho comprato oggi. Ma non funziona già più. Per favore, cambialo.', '3d99461259635e8ed02db956a028d79eba8f31751e003dec93a4cee6956ee935'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-087-beolsseo-an-dwaeyo', 'bright', 'Japanese', '今日買いましたが、もう使えません。交換してください。', '3d99461259635e8ed02db956a028d79eba8f31751e003dec93a4cee6956ee935'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-087-beolsseo-an-dwaeyo', 'bright', 'Korean', '오늘 샀어요. 그런데 벌써 안 돼요. 바꿔 주세요.', '3d99461259635e8ed02db956a028d79eba8f31751e003dec93a4cee6956ee935'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-087-beolsseo-an-dwaeyo', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Kupiłem(am) dzisiaj. Ale już nie działa. Proszę, wymień to.', '3d99461259635e8ed02db956a028d79eba8f31751e003dec93a4cee6956ee935'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-087-beolsseo-an-dwaeyo', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Comprei hoje. Mas já não funciona. Por favor, troque.', '3d99461259635e8ed02db956a028d79eba8f31751e003dec93a4cee6956ee935'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-087-beolsseo-an-dwaeyo', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я купил сегодня. Но оно уже не работает. Пожалуйста, обменяйте.', '3d99461259635e8ed02db956a028d79eba8f31751e003dec93a4cee6956ee935'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-087-beolsseo-an-dwaeyo', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Lo compré hoy. Pero ya no funciona. Por favor, cámbialo.', '3d99461259635e8ed02db956a028d79eba8f31751e003dec93a4cee6956ee935'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-088-gugi-chagawoyo', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nag-order ko og sabaw. Medyo bugnaw na kini karon. Mahimo ba nimo kining ipainit?', 'd4bcb1e63c8837155248dd41292791a2d880a244040402f743deb4872404ce55'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-088-gugi-chagawoyo', 'bright', 'English', 'I ordered soup. It is a little cold now. Can you warm it up?', 'd4bcb1e63c8837155248dd41292791a2d880a244040402f743deb4872404ce55'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-088-gugi-chagawoyo', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai commandé de la soupe. Elle est un peu froide maintenant. Pouvez-vous la réchauffer ?', 'd4bcb1e63c8837155248dd41292791a2d880a244040402f743deb4872404ce55'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-088-gugi-chagawoyo', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe Suppe bestellt. Sie ist jetzt etwas kalt. Können Sie sie warm machen?', 'd4bcb1e63c8837155248dd41292791a2d880a244040402f743deb4872404ce55'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-088-gugi-chagawoyo', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya memesan sup. Sekarang agak dingin. Bisakah Anda menghangatkannya?', 'd4bcb1e63c8837155248dd41292791a2d880a244040402f743deb4872404ce55'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-088-gugi-chagawoyo', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho ordinato una zuppa. Ora è un po'' fredda. Puoi scaldarla?', 'd4bcb1e63c8837155248dd41292791a2d880a244040402f743deb4872404ce55'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-088-gugi-chagawoyo', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'スープを注文しました。今ちょっと冷たいです。温めてもらえますか？', 'd4bcb1e63c8837155248dd41292791a2d880a244040402f743deb4872404ce55'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-088-gugi-chagawoyo', 'bright', 'Korean', '국을 주문했어요. 지금 좀 차가워요. 따뜻하게 해 줄 수 있어요?', 'd4bcb1e63c8837155248dd41292791a2d880a244040402f743deb4872404ce55'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-088-gugi-chagawoyo', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Zamówiłem(am) zupę. Jest teraz trochę zimna. Czy możesz ją podgrzać?', 'd4bcb1e63c8837155248dd41292791a2d880a244040402f743deb4872404ce55'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-088-gugi-chagawoyo', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Pedi sopa. Está um pouco fria agora. Você pode esquentá-la?', 'd4bcb1e63c8837155248dd41292791a2d880a244040402f743deb4872404ce55'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-088-gugi-chagawoyo', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я заказал суп. Сейчас он немного холодный. Можете его подогреть?', 'd4bcb1e63c8837155248dd41292791a2d880a244040402f743deb4872404ce55'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-088-gugi-chagawoyo', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Pedí sopa. Ahora está un poco fría. ¿Puedes calentarla?', 'd4bcb1e63c8837155248dd41292791a2d880a244040402f743deb4872404ce55'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-089-yeopbang-i-sikkeureowoyo', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Saba kaayo ang sunod nga lawak. Wala ko nakatulog og tarong. Palihug ilisi ang akong lawak.', '2d590bc34e39834a87f00619fe014f4dd894f5236d548dd1004b95c45b0b70fb'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-089-yeopbang-i-sikkeureowoyo', 'bright', 'English', 'The next room is too loud. I did not sleep well. Please change my room.', '2d590bc34e39834a87f00619fe014f4dd894f5236d548dd1004b95c45b0b70fb'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-089-yeopbang-i-sikkeureowoyo', 'bright', 'French', 'La chambre voisine est trop bruyante. Je n''ai pas bien dormi. Veuillez changer ma chambre.', '2d590bc34e39834a87f00619fe014f4dd894f5236d548dd1004b95c45b0b70fb'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-089-yeopbang-i-sikkeureowoyo', 'bright', 'German', 'Das Zimmer nebenan ist zu laut. Ich habe nicht gut geschlafen. Bitte wechseln Sie mein Zimmer.', '2d590bc34e39834a87f00619fe014f4dd894f5236d548dd1004b95c45b0b70fb'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-089-yeopbang-i-sikkeureowoyo', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Kamar sebelah terlalu berisik. Saya tidak tidur nyenyak. Tolong ganti kamar saya.', '2d590bc34e39834a87f00619fe014f4dd894f5236d548dd1004b95c45b0b70fb'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-089-yeopbang-i-sikkeureowoyo', 'bright', 'Italian', 'La stanza accanto è troppo rumorosa. Non ho dormito bene. Per favore, cambia la mia stanza.', '2d590bc34e39834a87f00619fe014f4dd894f5236d548dd1004b95c45b0b70fb'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-089-yeopbang-i-sikkeureowoyo', 'bright', 'Japanese', '隣の部屋がうるさすぎます。よく眠れませんでした。部屋を変えてください。', '2d590bc34e39834a87f00619fe014f4dd894f5236d548dd1004b95c45b0b70fb'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-089-yeopbang-i-sikkeureowoyo', 'bright', 'Korean', '옆방이 너무 시끄러워요. 잘 못 잤어요. 방을 바꿔 주세요.', '2d590bc34e39834a87f00619fe014f4dd894f5236d548dd1004b95c45b0b70fb'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-089-yeopbang-i-sikkeureowoyo', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Następny pokój jest za głośny. Słabo spałem. Proszę o zmianę pokoju.', '2d590bc34e39834a87f00619fe014f4dd894f5236d548dd1004b95c45b0b70fb'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-089-yeopbang-i-sikkeureowoyo', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'O quarto ao lado está muito barulhento. Não dormi bem. Por favor, troque meu quarto.', '2d590bc34e39834a87f00619fe014f4dd894f5236d548dd1004b95c45b0b70fb'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-089-yeopbang-i-sikkeureowoyo', 'bright', 'Russian', 'В соседней комнате слишком шумно. Я плохо спал. Пожалуйста, поменяйте мне комнату.', '2d590bc34e39834a87f00619fe014f4dd894f5236d548dd1004b95c45b0b70fb'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-089-yeopbang-i-sikkeureowoyo', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'La habitación de al lado está demasiado ruidosa. No dormí bien. Por favor, cámbieme de habitación.', '2d590bc34e39834a87f00619fe014f4dd894f5236d548dd1004b95c45b0b70fb'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-090-ije-da-gwaenchanayo', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nanawag ko kagahapon. Okay na ang tanan karon. Daghang salamat.', '16cf26408b6c7865667a5ef1e626b4a82cdb95abdc107353132973e0da346a42'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-090-ije-da-gwaenchanayo', 'bright', 'English', 'I called yesterday. Everything is okay now. Thank you very much.', '16cf26408b6c7865667a5ef1e626b4a82cdb95abdc107353132973e0da346a42'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-090-ije-da-gwaenchanayo', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai appelé hier. Tout va bien maintenant. Merci beaucoup.', '16cf26408b6c7865667a5ef1e626b4a82cdb95abdc107353132973e0da346a42'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-090-ije-da-gwaenchanayo', 'bright', 'German', 'Gestern habe ich angerufen. Jetzt ist alles in Ordnung. Vielen Dank.', '16cf26408b6c7865667a5ef1e626b4a82cdb95abdc107353132973e0da346a42'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-090-ije-da-gwaenchanayo', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya menelepon kemarin. Sekarang semuanya baik-baik saja. Terima kasih banyak.', '16cf26408b6c7865667a5ef1e626b4a82cdb95abdc107353132973e0da346a42'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-090-ije-da-gwaenchanayo', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho chiamato ieri. Ora va tutto bene. Grazie mille.', '16cf26408b6c7865667a5ef1e626b4a82cdb95abdc107353132973e0da346a42'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-090-ije-da-gwaenchanayo', 'bright', 'Japanese', '昨日電話しました。今はすべて大丈夫です。本当にありがとうございます。', '16cf26408b6c7865667a5ef1e626b4a82cdb95abdc107353132973e0da346a42'),
  ('korean-a2-practical-9', 'korean-a2-practical-9-090-ije-da-gwaenchanayo', 'bright', 'Korean', '어제 전화했어요. 이제 다 괜찮아요. 정말 감사합니다.', '16cf26408b6c7865667a5ef1e626b4a82cdb95abdc107353132973e0da346a42'),
