  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-073-jestem-zmeczony-bo-malo-spalem', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Hoy estoy cansado porque anoche dormí poco.', 'f20e8a268f4edc3f78fdf1a14185fe2a47b39589be4923c35e9974ee4ea1df90'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-074-mam-duzo-pracy-w-tym-tygodniu', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Wala koy panahon. Daghan kog trabaho karong semanaha.', '684bd2a540178cd1cf397b219d0210d5b62680bb7f6b44bda6362e92b55d36b5'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-074-mam-duzo-pracy-w-tym-tygodniu', 'bright', 'English', 'I do not have time. I have a lot of work this week.', '684bd2a540178cd1cf397b219d0210d5b62680bb7f6b44bda6362e92b55d36b5'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-074-mam-duzo-pracy-w-tym-tygodniu', 'bright', 'French', 'Je n''ai pas le temps. J''ai beaucoup de travail cette semaine.', '684bd2a540178cd1cf397b219d0210d5b62680bb7f6b44bda6362e92b55d36b5'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-074-mam-duzo-pracy-w-tym-tygodniu', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe keine Zeit. Ich habe diese Woche viel Arbeit.', '684bd2a540178cd1cf397b219d0210d5b62680bb7f6b44bda6362e92b55d36b5'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-074-mam-duzo-pracy-w-tym-tygodniu', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya tidak punya waktu. Saya punya banyak pekerjaan minggu ini.', '684bd2a540178cd1cf397b219d0210d5b62680bb7f6b44bda6362e92b55d36b5'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-074-mam-duzo-pracy-w-tym-tygodniu', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Non ho tempo. Ho molto lavoro questa settimana.', '684bd2a540178cd1cf397b219d0210d5b62680bb7f6b44bda6362e92b55d36b5'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-074-mam-duzo-pracy-w-tym-tygodniu', 'bright', 'Japanese', '時間がありません。今週は仕事がたくさんあります。', '684bd2a540178cd1cf397b219d0210d5b62680bb7f6b44bda6362e92b55d36b5'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-074-mam-duzo-pracy-w-tym-tygodniu', 'bright', 'Korean', '시간이 없어요. 이번 주에 일이 많아요.', '684bd2a540178cd1cf397b219d0210d5b62680bb7f6b44bda6362e92b55d36b5'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-074-mam-duzo-pracy-w-tym-tygodniu', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Nie mam czasu. Mam dużo pracy w tym tygodniu.', '684bd2a540178cd1cf397b219d0210d5b62680bb7f6b44bda6362e92b55d36b5'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-074-mam-duzo-pracy-w-tym-tygodniu', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Não tenho tempo. Tenho muito trabalho esta semana.', '684bd2a540178cd1cf397b219d0210d5b62680bb7f6b44bda6362e92b55d36b5'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-074-mam-duzo-pracy-w-tym-tygodniu', 'bright', 'Russian', 'У меня нет времени. У меня много работы на этой неделе.', '684bd2a540178cd1cf397b219d0210d5b62680bb7f6b44bda6362e92b55d36b5'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-074-mam-duzo-pracy-w-tym-tygodniu', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'No tengo tiempo. Tengo mucho trabajo esta semana.', '684bd2a540178cd1cf397b219d0210d5b62680bb7f6b44bda6362e92b55d36b5'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-075-szkoda-znowu-pada', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Sayang kana; nag-ulan na usab. Magpabilin na lang kita sa cafe karon.', '305a2aa62d6a91811dd1096883f639cbf82d53caa0f1d0dda24889536406a425'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-075-szkoda-znowu-pada', 'bright', 'English', 'That is a shame; it is raining again. Let us stay in the cafe today.', '305a2aa62d6a91811dd1096883f639cbf82d53caa0f1d0dda24889536406a425'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-075-szkoda-znowu-pada', 'bright', 'French', 'C''est dommage ; il pleut encore. Restons au café aujourd''hui.', '305a2aa62d6a91811dd1096883f639cbf82d53caa0f1d0dda24889536406a425'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-075-szkoda-znowu-pada', 'bright', 'German', 'Schade, es regnet schon wieder. Bleiben wir heute im Café.', '305a2aa62d6a91811dd1096883f639cbf82d53caa0f1d0dda24889536406a425'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-075-szkoda-znowu-pada', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Sayang sekali; hujan lagi. Mari kita tinggal di kafe hari ini.', '305a2aa62d6a91811dd1096883f639cbf82d53caa0f1d0dda24889536406a425'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-075-szkoda-znowu-pada', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Peccato, piove di nuovo. Restiamo oggi al bar.', '305a2aa62d6a91811dd1096883f639cbf82d53caa0f1d0dda24889536406a425'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-075-szkoda-znowu-pada', 'bright', 'Japanese', '残念ですね。また雨が降っています。今日はカフェにしましょう。', '305a2aa62d6a91811dd1096883f639cbf82d53caa0f1d0dda24889536406a425'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-075-szkoda-znowu-pada', 'bright', 'Korean', '안됐네요. 또 비가 오네요. 오늘은 카페에 있자.', '305a2aa62d6a91811dd1096883f639cbf82d53caa0f1d0dda24889536406a425'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-075-szkoda-znowu-pada', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Szkoda, znowu pada. Zostańmy dziś w kawiarni.', '305a2aa62d6a91811dd1096883f639cbf82d53caa0f1d0dda24889536406a425'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-075-szkoda-znowu-pada', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Que pena; está chovendo de novo. Vamos ficar no café hoje.', '305a2aa62d6a91811dd1096883f639cbf82d53caa0f1d0dda24889536406a425'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-075-szkoda-znowu-pada', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Жаль, снова идёт дождь. Останемся сегодня в кафе.', '305a2aa62d6a91811dd1096883f639cbf82d53caa0f1d0dda24889536406a425'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-075-szkoda-znowu-pada', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Qué pena; llueve otra vez. Quedémonos hoy en la cafetería.', '305a2aa62d6a91811dd1096883f639cbf82d53caa0f1d0dda24889536406a425'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-076-o-nie-przykro-mi', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'O dili, pasayloa ko. Makatabang ba ko nimo?', '016da3a1b3a73197b291940aaae5a242ac4e767f2279622a5ce118fd1564c8b1'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-076-o-nie-przykro-mi', 'bright', 'English', 'Oh no, I am sorry. Can I help you?', '016da3a1b3a73197b291940aaae5a242ac4e767f2279622a5ce118fd1564c8b1'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-076-o-nie-przykro-mi', 'bright', 'French', 'Oh non, je suis désolé. Puis-je vous aider ?', '016da3a1b3a73197b291940aaae5a242ac4e767f2279622a5ce118fd1564c8b1'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-076-o-nie-przykro-mi', 'bright', 'German', 'Oh nein, das tut mir leid. Kann ich dir helfen?', '016da3a1b3a73197b291940aaae5a242ac4e767f2279622a5ce118fd1564c8b1'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-076-o-nie-przykro-mi', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Oh tidak, saya turut prihatin. Bisakah saya membantu Anda?', '016da3a1b3a73197b291940aaae5a242ac4e767f2279622a5ce118fd1564c8b1'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-076-o-nie-przykro-mi', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Oh no, mi dispiace. Posso aiutarti?', '016da3a1b3a73197b291940aaae5a242ac4e767f2279622a5ce118fd1564c8b1'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-076-o-nie-przykro-mi', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'あら、それは残念です。お手伝いしましょうか？', '016da3a1b3a73197b291940aaae5a242ac4e767f2279622a5ce118fd1564c8b1'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-076-o-nie-przykro-mi', 'bright', 'Korean', '아이고, 안됐네요. 제가 도와드릴까요?', '016da3a1b3a73197b291940aaae5a242ac4e767f2279622a5ce118fd1564c8b1'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-076-o-nie-przykro-mi', 'bright', 'Polish', 'O nie, przykro mi. Mogę ci pomóc?', '016da3a1b3a73197b291940aaae5a242ac4e767f2279622a5ce118fd1564c8b1'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-076-o-nie-przykro-mi', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Oh não, sinto muito. Posso ajudar?', '016da3a1b3a73197b291940aaae5a242ac4e767f2279622a5ce118fd1564c8b1'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-076-o-nie-przykro-mi', 'bright', 'Russian', 'О нет, мне жаль. Могу я помочь?', '016da3a1b3a73197b291940aaae5a242ac4e767f2279622a5ce118fd1564c8b1'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-076-o-nie-przykro-mi', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Oh no, lo siento. ¿Puedo ayudarte?', '016da3a1b3a73197b291940aaae5a242ac4e767f2279622a5ce118fd1564c8b1'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-077-dosc-dobrze-troche-zmeczony', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Maayo-ayo; gikapoy lang ko og gamay.', 'a0a59c202715e8702d29120532fb352f9af079df4a9d05ded475a318730f3196'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-077-dosc-dobrze-troche-zmeczony', 'bright', 'English', 'Quite well; I am just a little tired.', 'a0a59c202715e8702d29120532fb352f9af079df4a9d05ded475a318730f3196'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-077-dosc-dobrze-troche-zmeczony', 'bright', 'French', 'Assez bien, je suis juste un peu fatigué.', 'a0a59c202715e8702d29120532fb352f9af079df4a9d05ded475a318730f3196'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-077-dosc-dobrze-troche-zmeczony', 'bright', 'German', 'Ziemlich gut, ich bin nur etwas müde.', 'a0a59c202715e8702d29120532fb352f9af079df4a9d05ded475a318730f3196'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-077-dosc-dobrze-troche-zmeczony', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Cukup baik, hanya saja saya sedikit lelah.', 'a0a59c202715e8702d29120532fb352f9af079df4a9d05ded475a318730f3196'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-077-dosc-dobrze-troche-zmeczony', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Abbastanza bene, sono solo un po'' stanco.', 'a0a59c202715e8702d29120532fb352f9af079df4a9d05ded475a318730f3196'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-077-dosc-dobrze-troche-zmeczony', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'かなり良いです。少し疲れているだけです。', 'a0a59c202715e8702d29120532fb352f9af079df4a9d05ded475a318730f3196'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-077-dosc-dobrze-troche-zmeczony', 'bright', 'Korean', '꽤 잘 지내요, 그냥 좀 피곤해요.', 'a0a59c202715e8702d29120532fb352f9af079df4a9d05ded475a318730f3196'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-077-dosc-dobrze-troche-zmeczony', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Dość dobrze, tylko jestem trochę zmęczony.', 'a0a59c202715e8702d29120532fb352f9af079df4a9d05ded475a318730f3196'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-077-dosc-dobrze-troche-zmeczony', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Muito bem; estou só um pouco cansado.', 'a0a59c202715e8702d29120532fb352f9af079df4a9d05ded475a318730f3196'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-077-dosc-dobrze-troche-zmeczony', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Довольно хорошо, я просто немного устал.', 'a0a59c202715e8702d29120532fb352f9af079df4a9d05ded475a318730f3196'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-077-dosc-dobrze-troche-zmeczony', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Bastante bien, solo estoy un poco cansado.', 'a0a59c202715e8702d29120532fb352f9af079df4a9d05ded475a318730f3196'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-078-swietnie-idziemy-na-koncert', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Maayo! Mag-uban na lang kita sa pag-adto sa konsyerto, kon mao na.', 'd149da463d54b80abc138463ecd77e99c7d51a6de3d7d072c2a69e804a239034'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-078-swietnie-idziemy-na-koncert', 'bright', 'English', 'Great! We are going to the concert together, then.', 'd149da463d54b80abc138463ecd77e99c7d51a6de3d7d072c2a69e804a239034'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-078-swietnie-idziemy-na-koncert', 'bright', 'French', 'Super ! Alors nous allons ensemble au concert.', 'd149da463d54b80abc138463ecd77e99c7d51a6de3d7d072c2a69e804a239034'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-078-swietnie-idziemy-na-koncert', 'bright', 'German', 'Großartig! Dann gehen wir zusammen zum Konzert.', 'd149da463d54b80abc138463ecd77e99c7d51a6de3d7d072c2a69e804a239034'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-078-swietnie-idziemy-na-koncert', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Hebat! Kalau begitu kita pergi ke konser bersama.', 'd149da463d54b80abc138463ecd77e99c7d51a6de3d7d072c2a69e804a239034'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-078-swietnie-idziemy-na-koncert', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Fantastico! Allora andiamo insieme al concerto.', 'd149da463d54b80abc138463ecd77e99c7d51a6de3d7d072c2a69e804a239034'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-078-swietnie-idziemy-na-koncert', 'bright', 'Japanese', '素晴らしい！じゃあ、一緒に行きましょう。', 'd149da463d54b80abc138463ecd77e99c7d51a6de3d7d072c2a69e804a239034'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-078-swietnie-idziemy-na-koncert', 'bright', 'Korean', '좋아요! 그럼 같이 콘서트에 가는 거네요.', 'd149da463d54b80abc138463ecd77e99c7d51a6de3d7d072c2a69e804a239034'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-078-swietnie-idziemy-na-koncert', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Świetnie! To idziemy razem na koncert.', 'd149da463d54b80abc138463ecd77e99c7d51a6de3d7d072c2a69e804a239034'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-078-swietnie-idziemy-na-koncert', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Ótimo! Então vamos juntos ao show.', 'd149da463d54b80abc138463ecd77e99c7d51a6de3d7d072c2a69e804a239034'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-078-swietnie-idziemy-na-koncert', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Отлично! Тогда мы идём на концерт вместе.', 'd149da463d54b80abc138463ecd77e99c7d51a6de3d7d072c2a69e804a239034'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-078-swietnie-idziemy-na-koncert', 'bright', 'Spanish', '¡Genial! Entonces vamos juntos al concierto.', 'd149da463d54b80abc138463ecd77e99c7d51a6de3d7d072c2a69e804a239034'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-079-jest-mi-zimno-potrzebuje-kawy', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Bugnaw ug gigutom ko. Nagkinahanglan ko og init nga kape.', 'dd8d123dd021df11da30719e0f03bd75d911d0fce98065d1fa7a99aafe84b200'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-079-jest-mi-zimno-potrzebuje-kawy', 'bright', 'English', 'I am cold and hungry. I need a hot coffee.', 'dd8d123dd021df11da30719e0f03bd75d911d0fce98065d1fa7a99aafe84b200'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-079-jest-mi-zimno-potrzebuje-kawy', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai froid et j''ai faim. J''ai besoin d''un café chaud.', 'dd8d123dd021df11da30719e0f03bd75d911d0fce98065d1fa7a99aafe84b200'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-079-jest-mi-zimno-potrzebuje-kawy', 'bright', 'German', 'Mir ist kalt und ich bin hungrig. Ich brauche einen heißen Kaffee.', 'dd8d123dd021df11da30719e0f03bd75d911d0fce98065d1fa7a99aafe84b200'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-079-jest-mi-zimno-potrzebuje-kawy', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya kedinginan dan lapar. Saya butuh kopi panas.', 'dd8d123dd021df11da30719e0f03bd75d911d0fce98065d1fa7a99aafe84b200'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-079-jest-mi-zimno-potrzebuje-kawy', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho freddo e fame. Ho bisogno di un caffè caldo.', 'dd8d123dd021df11da30719e0f03bd75d911d0fce98065d1fa7a99aafe84b200'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-079-jest-mi-zimno-potrzebuje-kawy', 'bright', 'Japanese', '寒くてお腹が空いています。温かいコーヒーが必要です。', 'dd8d123dd021df11da30719e0f03bd75d911d0fce98065d1fa7a99aafe84b200'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-079-jest-mi-zimno-potrzebuje-kawy', 'bright', 'Korean', '춥고 배고파요. 따뜻한 커피가 필요해요.', 'dd8d123dd021df11da30719e0f03bd75d911d0fce98065d1fa7a99aafe84b200'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-079-jest-mi-zimno-potrzebuje-kawy', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Jest mi zimno i jestem głodny. Potrzebuję gorącej kawy.', 'dd8d123dd021df11da30719e0f03bd75d911d0fce98065d1fa7a99aafe84b200'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-8', 'polish-a2-practical-8-079-jest-mi-zimno-potrzebuje-kawy', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Estou com frio e fome. Preciso de um café quente.', 'dd8d123dd021df11da30719e0f03bd75d911d0fce98065d1fa7a99aafe84b200'),
