  ('polish-a2-practical-9', 'polish-a2-practical-9-089-zle-spalam-za-duzo-halasu', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Dili maayo ang akong pagkatulog tungod kay saba kaayo sa lawak. Aduna bay mas hilom nga dapit?', 'f86296dad1de8826452aa4e93a7cc6a8793bf899188ba7b8a55873898af407ff'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-9', 'polish-a2-practical-9-089-zle-spalam-za-duzo-halasu', 'bright', 'English', 'I slept badly because there is too much noise in the room. Is there somewhere quieter?', 'f86296dad1de8826452aa4e93a7cc6a8793bf899188ba7b8a55873898af407ff'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-9', 'polish-a2-practical-9-089-zle-spalam-za-duzo-halasu', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai mal dormi parce qu''il y a trop de bruit dans la chambre. Y a-t-il un endroit plus calme ?', 'f86296dad1de8826452aa4e93a7cc6a8793bf899188ba7b8a55873898af407ff'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-9', 'polish-a2-practical-9-089-zle-spalam-za-duzo-halasu', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe schlecht geschlafen, weil im Zimmer zu viel Lärm ist. Ist es irgendwo ruhiger?', 'f86296dad1de8826452aa4e93a7cc6a8793bf899188ba7b8a55873898af407ff'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-9', 'polish-a2-practical-9-089-zle-spalam-za-duzo-halasu', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya tidur buruk karena terlalu banyak kebisingan di kamar. Apakah ada tempat yang lebih tenang?', 'f86296dad1de8826452aa4e93a7cc6a8793bf899188ba7b8a55873898af407ff'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-9', 'polish-a2-practical-9-089-zle-spalam-za-duzo-halasu', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho dormito male perché c''è troppo rumore nella stanza. C''è un posto più tranquillo?', 'f86296dad1de8826452aa4e93a7cc6a8793bf899188ba7b8a55873898af407ff'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-9', 'polish-a2-practical-9-089-zle-spalam-za-duzo-halasu', 'bright', 'Japanese', '部屋がうるさすぎてよく眠れませんでした。もっと静かな場所はありますか？', 'f86296dad1de8826452aa4e93a7cc6a8793bf899188ba7b8a55873898af407ff'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-9', 'polish-a2-practical-9-089-zle-spalam-za-duzo-halasu', 'bright', 'Korean', '방에 너무 시끄러워서 잠을 잘 못 잤습니다. 더 조용한 곳이 있나요?', 'f86296dad1de8826452aa4e93a7cc6a8793bf899188ba7b8a55873898af407ff'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-9', 'polish-a2-practical-9-089-zle-spalam-za-duzo-halasu', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Źle spałam, bo w pokoju jest za dużo hałasu. Czy jest gdzieś ciszej?', 'f86296dad1de8826452aa4e93a7cc6a8793bf899188ba7b8a55873898af407ff'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-9', 'polish-a2-practical-9-089-zle-spalam-za-duzo-halasu', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Dormi mal porque há muito barulho no quarto. Existe algum lugar mais silencioso?', 'f86296dad1de8826452aa4e93a7cc6a8793bf899188ba7b8a55873898af407ff'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-9', 'polish-a2-practical-9-089-zle-spalam-za-duzo-halasu', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я плохо спал, потому что в комнате слишком шумно. Есть ли где-нибудь потише?', 'f86296dad1de8826452aa4e93a7cc6a8793bf899188ba7b8a55873898af407ff'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-9', 'polish-a2-practical-9-089-zle-spalam-za-duzo-halasu', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Dormí mal porque hay demasiado ruido en la habitación. ¿Hay algún lugar más tranquilo?', 'f86296dad1de8826452aa4e93a7cc6a8793bf899188ba7b8a55873898af407ff'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-9', 'polish-a2-practical-9-090-zadzwonilam-rano-teraz-wszystko-dziala', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nanawag ko kaganinang buntag, ug karon naggana na ang tanan. Daghang salamat sa tabang.', 'ce1942966a5d3cda5f7b290ff1dd4a06d933eea1af7816f24d56a98f333c4e06'),
  ('polish-a2-practical-9', 'polish-a2-practical-9-090-zadzwonilam-rano-teraz-wszystko-dziala', 'bright', 'English', 'I called this morning, and now everything works. Thank you very much for the help.', 'ce1942966a5d3cda5f7b290ff1dd4a06d933eea1af7816f24d56a98f333c4e06'),
