  ('portuguese-a2-practical-8', 'portuguese-a2-practical-8-080-que-dia-agradavel-ne-tudo-esta-muito-bem', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Che giornata piacevole, vero? Tutto va molto bene.', '96e8bfdac4a92e62369b0bc046dba39c401313b923887216efc0b5e26a816c80'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-8', 'portuguese-a2-practical-8-080-que-dia-agradavel-ne-tudo-esta-muito-bem', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'なんて心地よい日でしょう、ね？すべてがとても順調です。', '96e8bfdac4a92e62369b0bc046dba39c401313b923887216efc0b5e26a816c80'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-8', 'portuguese-a2-practical-8-080-que-dia-agradavel-ne-tudo-esta-muito-bem', 'bright', 'Korean', '정말 즐거운 하루죠? 모든 것이 아주 잘 되어가고 있어요.', '96e8bfdac4a92e62369b0bc046dba39c401313b923887216efc0b5e26a816c80'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-8', 'portuguese-a2-practical-8-080-que-dia-agradavel-ne-tudo-esta-muito-bem', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Co za przyjemny dzień, prawda? Wszystko idzie bardzo dobrze.', '96e8bfdac4a92e62369b0bc046dba39c401313b923887216efc0b5e26a816c80'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-8', 'portuguese-a2-practical-8-080-que-dia-agradavel-ne-tudo-esta-muito-bem', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Que dia agradável, né? Tudo está muito bem.', '96e8bfdac4a92e62369b0bc046dba39c401313b923887216efc0b5e26a816c80'),
