  ('portuguese-a2-practical-8', 'portuguese-a2-practical-8-080-que-dia-agradavel-ne-tudo-esta-muito-bem', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Qué día tan agradable, ¿verdad? Todo va muy bien.', '96e8bfdac4a92e62369b0bc046dba39c401313b923887216efc0b5e26a816c80'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-081-ja-liguei-mas-o-chuveiro-nao-funciona', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nanawag na ko, pero dili mogana ang shower. Makapadala ba mo og tawo, palihog?', '3324e2de0c0e327fb70692667aeb792ba811673470989b94e5fcf297525f6447'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-081-ja-liguei-mas-o-chuveiro-nao-funciona', 'bright', 'English', 'I already called, but the shower does not work. Can you send someone, please?', '3324e2de0c0e327fb70692667aeb792ba811673470989b94e5fcf297525f6447'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-081-ja-liguei-mas-o-chuveiro-nao-funciona', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai déjà appelé, mais la douche ne fonctionne pas. Pouvez-vous envoyer quelqu''un, s''il vous plaît ?', '3324e2de0c0e327fb70692667aeb792ba811673470989b94e5fcf297525f6447'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-081-ja-liguei-mas-o-chuveiro-nao-funciona', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe schon angerufen, aber die Dusche funktioniert nicht. Können Sie bitte jemanden schicken?', '3324e2de0c0e327fb70692667aeb792ba811673470989b94e5fcf297525f6447'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-081-ja-liguei-mas-o-chuveiro-nao-funciona', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya sudah menelepon, tetapi pancuran tidak berfungsi. Bisakah Anda mengirim seseorang, tolong?', '3324e2de0c0e327fb70692667aeb792ba811673470989b94e5fcf297525f6447'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-081-ja-liguei-mas-o-chuveiro-nao-funciona', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Ho già chiamato, ma la doccia non funziona. Può mandare qualcuno, per favore?', '3324e2de0c0e327fb70692667aeb792ba811673470989b94e5fcf297525f6447'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-081-ja-liguei-mas-o-chuveiro-nao-funciona', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'もう電話しましたが、シャワーが機能しません。誰か送ってもらえますか？', '3324e2de0c0e327fb70692667aeb792ba811673470989b94e5fcf297525f6447'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-081-ja-liguei-mas-o-chuveiro-nao-funciona', 'bright', 'Korean', '이미 전화했지만 샤워기가 작동하지 않아요. 누가 좀 보내주실 수 있나요?', '3324e2de0c0e327fb70692667aeb792ba811673470989b94e5fcf297525f6447'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-081-ja-liguei-mas-o-chuveiro-nao-funciona', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Już dzwoniłem, ale prysznic nie działa. Czy możesz kogoś wysłać, proszę?', '3324e2de0c0e327fb70692667aeb792ba811673470989b94e5fcf297525f6447'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-081-ja-liguei-mas-o-chuveiro-nao-funciona', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Já liguei, mas o chuveiro não funciona. Pode mandar alguém, por favor?', '3324e2de0c0e327fb70692667aeb792ba811673470989b94e5fcf297525f6447'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-081-ja-liguei-mas-o-chuveiro-nao-funciona', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я уже звонил, но душ не работает. Можете кого-нибудь прислать, пожалуйста?', '3324e2de0c0e327fb70692667aeb792ba811673470989b94e5fcf297525f6447'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-081-ja-liguei-mas-o-chuveiro-nao-funciona', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Ya llamé, pero la ducha no funciona. ¿Puedes mandar a alguien, por favor?', '3324e2de0c0e327fb70692667aeb792ba811673470989b94e5fcf297525f6447'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-082-pedi-a-sopa-mas-ainda-nao-chegou', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Nag-order ko og sabaw, pero wala pa kini miabot. Mahimo ba nimo kining susihon, palihug?', 'c53145c465cbb56ca8e3b0d9883b48418b08b7778467468e0ad91c2c46c0ca69'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-082-pedi-a-sopa-mas-ainda-nao-chegou', 'bright', 'English', 'I ordered the soup, but it has not arrived yet. Can you check, please?', 'c53145c465cbb56ca8e3b0d9883b48418b08b7778467468e0ad91c2c46c0ca69'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-082-pedi-a-sopa-mas-ainda-nao-chegou', 'bright', 'French', 'J''ai commandé la soupe, mais elle n''est pas encore arrivée. Pouvez-vous vérifier, s''il vous plaît ?', 'c53145c465cbb56ca8e3b0d9883b48418b08b7778467468e0ad91c2c46c0ca69'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-082-pedi-a-sopa-mas-ainda-nao-chegou', 'bright', 'German', 'Ich habe die Suppe bestellt, aber sie ist noch nicht gekommen. Können Sie bitte nachsehen?', 'c53145c465cbb56ca8e3b0d9883b48418b08b7778467468e0ad91c2c46c0ca69'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-082-pedi-a-sopa-mas-ainda-nao-chegou', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Saya memesan sup, tetapi belum tiba. Bisakah Anda memeriksanya, tolong?', 'c53145c465cbb56ca8e3b0d9883b48418b08b7778467468e0ad91c2c46c0ca69'),
