  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-082-pedi-a-sopa-mas-ainda-nao-chegou', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'スープを注文しましたが、まだ届いていません。確認してもらえますか？', 'c53145c465cbb56ca8e3b0d9883b48418b08b7778467468e0ad91c2c46c0ca69'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-082-pedi-a-sopa-mas-ainda-nao-chegou', 'bright', 'Korean', '수프를 주문했는데 아직 나오지 않았어요. 확인해 주시겠어요?', 'c53145c465cbb56ca8e3b0d9883b48418b08b7778467468e0ad91c2c46c0ca69'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-082-pedi-a-sopa-mas-ainda-nao-chegou', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Zamówiłem zupę, ale jeszcze nie dotarła. Czy możesz sprawdzić, proszę?', 'c53145c465cbb56ca8e3b0d9883b48418b08b7778467468e0ad91c2c46c0ca69'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-082-pedi-a-sopa-mas-ainda-nao-chegou', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Pedi a sopa, mas ela ainda não chegou. Pode verificar, por favor?', 'c53145c465cbb56ca8e3b0d9883b48418b08b7778467468e0ad91c2c46c0ca69'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-082-pedi-a-sopa-mas-ainda-nao-chegou', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Я заказал суп, но он еще не принесли. Можете проверить, пожалуйста?', 'c53145c465cbb56ca8e3b0d9883b48418b08b7778467468e0ad91c2c46c0ca69'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-082-pedi-a-sopa-mas-ainda-nao-chegou', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Pedí la sopa, pero aún no ha llegado. ¿Puede comprobarlo, por favor?', 'c53145c465cbb56ca8e3b0d9883b48418b08b7778467468e0ad91c2c46c0ca69'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-083-wifi-nao-esta-funcionando-liguei-antes', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Ang wi-fi dili naglihok. Mitawag ko ganina; mahimo ba nimo kining susihon, palihug?', 'ce0f57f5987209994b58ba220fa2d152c6a0c57f53813c8698f9cc053102e03a'),
