  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-086-paguei-dez-reais-falta-troco', 'bright', 'Japanese', '10レアル払いましたが、お釣りが1レアル足りません。確認してもらえますか？', 'f326e35c4a07815be4c1e4cb3ba4bdd243818cc881e9edaca7a1330fe4bfd4e5'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-086-paguei-dez-reais-falta-troco', 'bright', 'Korean', '10헤알을 냈는데 거스름돈에 1헤알이 부족해요. 확인해 주시겠어요?', 'f326e35c4a07815be4c1e4cb3ba4bdd243818cc881e9edaca7a1330fe4bfd4e5'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-086-paguei-dez-reais-falta-troco', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Zapłaciłem dziesięć reali, ale brakuje jednego reala z reszty. Czy możesz sprawdzić?', 'f326e35c4a07815be4c1e4cb3ba4bdd243818cc881e9edaca7a1330fe4bfd4e5'),
  ('portuguese-a2-practical-9', 'portuguese-a2-practical-9-086-paguei-dez-reais-falta-troco', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Paguei dez reais, mas falta um real no troco. Pode conferir?', 'f326e35c4a07815be4c1e4cb3ba4bdd243818cc881e9edaca7a1330fe4bfd4e5'),
