  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-002-para-llevar', 'bright', 'Russian', 'С собой, пожалуйста. Сколько всё вместе?', 'add70733199d7ec942fd3ea3d5de40537950ebb41cea319db04d1c5124137a27'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-002-para-llevar', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Para llevar, por favor. ¿Cuánto es todo?', 'add70733199d7ec942fd3ea3d5de40537950ebb41cea319db04d1c5124137a27'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-003-la-tarjeta-sim', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Oo, nangita ko og SIM card para sa akong cellphone. Naa ba nimo kini?', '4cd99d41fa6edfa9b872e158cc4fac58ed5b081049df641ea6b44de59fd87fee'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-003-la-tarjeta-sim', 'bright', 'English', 'Yes, I am looking for a SIM card for my phone. Do you have it?', '4cd99d41fa6edfa9b872e158cc4fac58ed5b081049df641ea6b44de59fd87fee'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-003-la-tarjeta-sim', 'bright', 'French', 'Oui, je cherche une carte SIM pour mon téléphone. Vous l''avez ?', '4cd99d41fa6edfa9b872e158cc4fac58ed5b081049df641ea6b44de59fd87fee'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-003-la-tarjeta-sim', 'bright', 'German', 'Ja, ich suche eine SIM-Karte für mein Handy. Haben Sie sie?', '4cd99d41fa6edfa9b872e158cc4fac58ed5b081049df641ea6b44de59fd87fee'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-003-la-tarjeta-sim', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Ya, saya mencari kartu SIM untuk ponsel saya. Apakah Anda punya?', '4cd99d41fa6edfa9b872e158cc4fac58ed5b081049df641ea6b44de59fd87fee'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-003-la-tarjeta-sim', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Sì, sto cercando una scheda SIM per il mio cellulare. Ce l''hai?', '4cd99d41fa6edfa9b872e158cc4fac58ed5b081049df641ea6b44de59fd87fee'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-003-la-tarjeta-sim', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'はい、携帯電話用のSIMカードを探しています。ありますか？', '4cd99d41fa6edfa9b872e158cc4fac58ed5b081049df641ea6b44de59fd87fee'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-003-la-tarjeta-sim', 'bright', 'Korean', '네, 휴대폰 SIM 카드를 찾고 있습니다. 가지고 계신가요?', '4cd99d41fa6edfa9b872e158cc4fac58ed5b081049df641ea6b44de59fd87fee'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-003-la-tarjeta-sim', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Tak, szukam karty SIM do mojego telefonu. Czy ją masz?', '4cd99d41fa6edfa9b872e158cc4fac58ed5b081049df641ea6b44de59fd87fee'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-003-la-tarjeta-sim', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Sim, estou procurando um chip para meu celular. Você tem?', '4cd99d41fa6edfa9b872e158cc4fac58ed5b081049df641ea6b44de59fd87fee'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-003-la-tarjeta-sim', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Да, я ищу SIM-карту для своего телефона. У вас есть?', '4cd99d41fa6edfa9b872e158cc4fac58ed5b081049df641ea6b44de59fd87fee'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-003-la-tarjeta-sim', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Sí, busco una tarjeta SIM para mi móvil. ¿La tiene?', '4cd99d41fa6edfa9b872e158cc4fac58ed5b081049df641ea6b44de59fd87fee'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-004-cuantos-minutos', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Duol ra? Pila ka minuto kon maglakaw, mga pila kaha?', 'd5f63bb9c8b73a0dd863904af3b0993c24f04da91e4ce33280342c6cce2e1f6d'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-004-cuantos-minutos', 'bright', 'English', 'Close by? How many minutes on foot, roughly?', 'd5f63bb9c8b73a0dd863904af3b0993c24f04da91e4ce33280342c6cce2e1f6d'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-004-cuantos-minutos', 'bright', 'French', 'Près d''ici ? Combien de minutes à pied, plus ou moins ?', 'd5f63bb9c8b73a0dd863904af3b0993c24f04da91e4ce33280342c6cce2e1f6d'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-004-cuantos-minutos', 'bright', 'German', 'In der Nähe? Wie viele Minuten zu Fuß, ungefähr?', 'd5f63bb9c8b73a0dd863904af3b0993c24f04da91e4ce33280342c6cce2e1f6d'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-004-cuantos-minutos', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Dekat? Berapa menit berjalan kaki, kira-kira?', 'd5f63bb9c8b73a0dd863904af3b0993c24f04da91e4ce33280342c6cce2e1f6d'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-004-cuantos-minutos', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Vicino? Quanti minuti a piedi, più o meno?', 'd5f63bb9c8b73a0dd863904af3b0993c24f04da91e4ce33280342c6cce2e1f6d'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-004-cuantos-minutos', 'bright', 'Japanese', '近くですか？歩いて何分くらいですか？', 'd5f63bb9c8b73a0dd863904af3b0993c24f04da91e4ce33280342c6cce2e1f6d'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-004-cuantos-minutos', 'bright', 'Korean', '가까운 곳인가요? 걸어서 대략 몇 분 정도 걸리나요?', 'd5f63bb9c8b73a0dd863904af3b0993c24f04da91e4ce33280342c6cce2e1f6d'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-004-cuantos-minutos', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Blisko? Ile minut pieszo, mniej więcej?', 'd5f63bb9c8b73a0dd863904af3b0993c24f04da91e4ce33280342c6cce2e1f6d'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-004-cuantos-minutos', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Perto? Quantos minutos a pé, mais ou menos?', 'd5f63bb9c8b73a0dd863904af3b0993c24f04da91e4ce33280342c6cce2e1f6d'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-004-cuantos-minutos', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Рядом? Сколько минут пешком, примерно?', 'd5f63bb9c8b73a0dd863904af3b0993c24f04da91e4ce33280342c6cce2e1f6d'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-004-cuantos-minutos', 'bright', 'Spanish', '¿Cerca? ¿Cuántos minutos a pie, más o menos?', 'd5f63bb9c8b73a0dd863904af3b0993c24f04da91e4ce33280342c6cce2e1f6d'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-005-todo-muy-rico', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Oo, lami kaayo ang tanan, salamat. Pwede nimo dad-on ang bill?', 'd06767ac618ba01a698272079f9159f4c0855040cc3ad53e95718b92b10941d2'),
