  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-005-todo-muy-rico', 'bright', 'French', 'Oui, tout est très bon, merci. Pourriez-vous m''apporter l''addition ?', 'd06767ac618ba01a698272079f9159f4c0855040cc3ad53e95718b92b10941d2'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-005-todo-muy-rico', 'bright', 'German', 'Ja, alles sehr lecker, danke. Bringen Sie mir bitte die Rechnung?', 'd06767ac618ba01a698272079f9159f4c0855040cc3ad53e95718b92b10941d2'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-005-todo-muy-rico', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Ya, semuanya sangat lezat, terima kasih. Bisakah Anda membawakan saya tagihan?', 'd06767ac618ba01a698272079f9159f4c0855040cc3ad53e95718b92b10941d2'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-005-todo-muy-rico', 'bright', 'Italian', 'Sì, tutto molto buono, grazie. Mi porta il conto?', 'd06767ac618ba01a698272079f9159f4c0855040cc3ad53e95718b92b10941d2'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-005-todo-muy-rico', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'はい、すべてとても美味しいです、ありがとうございます。お会計をお願いできますか？', 'd06767ac618ba01a698272079f9159f4c0855040cc3ad53e95718b92b10941d2'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-005-todo-muy-rico', 'bright', 'Korean', '네, 모든 것이 맛있습니다, 감사합니다. 계산서를 가져다주시겠어요?', 'd06767ac618ba01a698272079f9159f4c0855040cc3ad53e95718b92b10941d2'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-005-todo-muy-rico', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Tak, wszystko jest pyszne, dziękuję. Czy może mi Pan przynieść rachunek?', 'd06767ac618ba01a698272079f9159f4c0855040cc3ad53e95718b92b10941d2'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-005-todo-muy-rico', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Sim, tudo muito rico, obrigado. Você poderia me trazer a conta?', 'd06767ac618ba01a698272079f9159f4c0855040cc3ad53e95718b92b10941d2'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-005-todo-muy-rico', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Да, всё очень вкусно, спасибо. Не могли бы вы принести мне счёт?', 'd06767ac618ba01a698272079f9159f4c0855040cc3ad53e95718b92b10941d2'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-005-todo-muy-rico', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'Sí, todo muy rico, gracias. ¿Me trae la cuenta?', 'd06767ac618ba01a698272079f9159f4c0855040cc3ad53e95718b92b10941d2'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-006-a-nombre-de', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Oo, duna koy reserbasyon sa ngalan ni García.', '83b79e14860b6f651009fd7c1b42bd8228dda36350754768e5ab65058e2a6990'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-006-a-nombre-de', 'bright', 'English', 'Yes, I have a reservation under the name García.', '83b79e14860b6f651009fd7c1b42bd8228dda36350754768e5ab65058e2a6990'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-006-a-nombre-de', 'bright', 'French', 'Oui, j''ai une réservation au nom de García.', '83b79e14860b6f651009fd7c1b42bd8228dda36350754768e5ab65058e2a6990'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-006-a-nombre-de', 'bright', 'German', 'Ja, ich habe eine Reservierung auf den Namen García.', '83b79e14860b6f651009fd7c1b42bd8228dda36350754768e5ab65058e2a6990'),
