  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-007-algo-mas', 'bright', 'German', 'Nein, sonst nichts, danke. Wie viel schulde ich Ihnen?', 'bb3875efffb6b79a35324fb77da8d9f965841ee7bcd9de9a4724d38c84ebd7c0'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-007-algo-mas', 'bright', 'Indonesian', 'Tidak, tidak ada lagi, terima kasih. Berapa yang harus saya bayar?', 'bb3875efffb6b79a35324fb77da8d9f965841ee7bcd9de9a4724d38c84ebd7c0'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-007-algo-mas', 'bright', 'Italian', 'No, niente altro, grazie. Quanto le devo?', 'bb3875efffb6b79a35324fb77da8d9f965841ee7bcd9de9a4724d38c84ebd7c0'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-007-algo-mas', 'bright', 'Japanese', 'いいえ、他に何もありません、ありがとうございます。いくら払えばいいですか？', 'bb3875efffb6b79a35324fb77da8d9f965841ee7bcd9de9a4724d38c84ebd7c0'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-007-algo-mas', 'bright', 'Korean', '아니요, 다른 것은 없습니다, 감사합니다. 얼마를 내야 하나요?', 'bb3875efffb6b79a35324fb77da8d9f965841ee7bcd9de9a4724d38c84ebd7c0'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-007-algo-mas', 'bright', 'Polish', 'Nie, nic więcej, dziękuję. Ile jestem winien?', 'bb3875efffb6b79a35324fb77da8d9f965841ee7bcd9de9a4724d38c84ebd7c0'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-007-algo-mas', 'bright', 'Portuguese', 'Não, nada mais, obrigado. Quanto lhe devo?', 'bb3875efffb6b79a35324fb77da8d9f965841ee7bcd9de9a4724d38c84ebd7c0'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-007-algo-mas', 'bright', 'Russian', 'Нет, больше ничего, спасибо. Сколько я вам должен?', 'bb3875efffb6b79a35324fb77da8d9f965841ee7bcd9de9a4724d38c84ebd7c0'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-007-algo-mas', 'bright', 'Spanish', 'No, nada más, gracias. ¿Cuánto le debo?', 'bb3875efffb6b79a35324fb77da8d9f965841ee7bcd9de9a4724d38c84ebd7c0'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-008-al-final-de-la-calle', 'bright', 'Bisaya', 'Oo, siyempre. Anaa kini sa tumoy sa dalan.', '7db966c69325b1542eb6376a5be3ef185562040d84c6f9b10559f73f93f1194b'),
  ('spanish-a2-practical-1', 'spanish-a2-practical-1-008-al-final-de-la-calle', 'bright', 'English', 'Yes, of course. It is at the end of the street.', '7db966c69325b1542eb6376a5be3ef185562040d84c6f9b10559f73f93f1194b'),
